window.FWN_IMMORTALITY_THROUGH_ARRAY_FORMATIONS_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_IMMORTALITY_THROUGH_ARRAY_FORMATIONS_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1701,"title":"Chapter 1701 - 871: Expectations (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Of course, the most important thing is that his evil embryo is parasitic in the Divine Soul, sealed together with it.","His Divine Soul is now unable to leave the body.","Patriarch Dugu was unaware of Mo Hua’s inner thoughts and continued:","\"...Your Divine Sense is sufficient, but if you want to cultivate Divine Thought into sword, the biggest issue is not your Divine Thought, but rather that your foundation in Sword Dao is too narrow, your Sword Qi too weak, and your understanding of the sword too superficial.\"","Mo Hua whispered, \"Patriarch, if my Sword Qi is not well-trained, can I still learn Divine Thought into sword?\"","Patriarch Dugu retorted, \"Can a person learn to run without first learning to walk?\"","Mo Hua paused, pondered, and found it reasonable.","But his situation was somewhat special.","\"Then if...\" Mo Hua continued, \"someone truly learns Divine Thought into sword despite having a shallow understanding of Sword Dao and weak Sword Qi?\"","Patriarch Dugu frowned.","He wanted to say, \"impossible,\" but with his experience, he knew strict impossibility doesn’t exist in this world.","Foundation Building Middle Stage, Nineteen-Pattern Peak Divine Sense, this also seemed impossible to him before.","Yet now he witnessed it with his own eyes.","So, if someone truly mastered Divine Thought into sword with a superficial understanding of Sword Dao...","It wasn’t entirely out of the question.","Though he hadn’t seen that happen yet.","To not master the sword but learn Divine Thought into sword is like trying to fly without fully grown wings.","\"Even if someone truly learns Divine Thought into sword without refining their sword skills...\" Patriarch Dugu’s eyes blazed as he spoke, \"then the Sword Intent formed by their Divine Thought would be crude, the spell points in their Divine Thought Sword Dao superficial, unable to reach true mastery or wield the full power of Divine Thought into sword...\"","Mo Hua felt inexplicably guilty.","The Patriarch was indeed insightful, having described his predicament accurately.","He had indeed learned the Transforming Sword Skill.","But as the Patriarch said, the sword formed by his Divine Thought was quite crude.","He had also learned the Soul-Shocking Sword.","However, this Sword technique was borrowed from and mixed with the Gui Water Sect’s Pupil Skill, essentially cobbled together, with a certain element of \"blind luck,\" not necessarily genuinely profound.","Mo Hua sighed deeply.","The Formation path is vast and profound, and Sword Dao is no less so.","For any cultivator’s Great Dao, mastering and achieving true expertise is never easy, requiring immense effort and deep dedication.","It’s not something one can accomplish with random experimentation.","Mo Hua felt a newfound humility within.","But then he thought, even without mastering true Divine Thought into sword, with only a scattered understanding of its surface, he could unleash such power, killing fiercely within the Divine Way.","What if one day, he truly learned the Divine Thought into sword True Jue, how unparalleled would his power be?","With Daoist Divine Thought comparable to a deity, wielding the most orthodox Sword Transformation Technique from Taixu Gate, wouldn’t he...","Even be able to slay a true Evil God?","Mo Hua’s heart pounded violently.","He inexplicably thought of the evil embryo residing within his Life Soul...","Patriarch Dugu looked at Mo Hua, slightly frowning.","This child, sighing one moment, disappointed the next, then suddenly enthusiastic, full of expectation.","Children proving the Dao with Divine Sense, are their thoughts always this vibrant...","Is it because they cultivate Divine Sense, so their thoughts are abundant?","Patriarch Dugu remained silent for a moment.","Meanwhile, Mo Hua seemed to have an epiphany, nodded, his eyes sparkling, and said:","\"Patriarch, I understand now, please instruct me on what exactly I should study now?\"","Patriarch Dugu was silent for a moment, then said:","\"You should already know that true Divine Thought into sword is not merely the Divine Thought, but the union of sword, qi, and spirit, to unleash maximum power.\"","\"There are four existing styles of Divine Thought into sword: Transforming Sword Skill, Soul-Shocking Sword, God-breaking Skill, and God Slaying Technique.\"","\"But these Divine Thought Sword Forms are still too early for you.\"","\"Your biggest issue is a weak foundation in Sword Dao, so what you need to do now is fill in those gaps, deepen your understanding of Sword Dao, and lay a strong groundwork for Divine Thought into sword.\"","\"I have a book here, ’Introduction to Sword Dao,’ which contains my reflections and methods of focusing Sword Qi from over the years, ideal for beginners.\"","\"Take it, study it well, and try cultivating Sword Qi. After seven days, come back, and I’ll see how you’ve progressed...\"","Mo Hua received the ’Introduction to Sword Dao’ with care and respect, saying earnestly:","\"Thank you, Patriarch!\"","Patriarch Dugu nodded in acknowledgment, then tore open a rift in the void to send Mo Hua back to the Disciple’s Residence.","In the Forbidden Land, only Patriarch Dugu remained.","He pondered silently:","\"This child...his foundation in Sword Dao is weak, but his perception is high, and his understanding of the Divine Soul is profound, his Taoist Heart outstanding.\"","\"Is it possible that the hope for the Taixu Gate’s Divine Thought Sword Dao heritage lies within this child?\"","Even Patriarch Dugu, who had lost all hope, couldn’t help but feel a glimmer of it.","But that hope quickly dimmed.","Seven days later.","When he brought Mo Hua back to the Forbidden Land to check his Sword Dao cultivation progress, Patriarch Dugu’s face turned ashen.","Mo Hua answered fluently when questioned about his knowledge and understanding of Sword Dao.","Clearly, he had read ’Introduction to Sword Dao’ thoroughly and meticulously.","But conversely, the Sword Qi he cultivated was so weak it was appalling.","\"Did you really practice?\" Patriarch Dugu asked, frowning.","\"I did,\" Mo Hua confirmed.","\"How did you practice?\""]},{"number":1702,"title":"Chapter 1702 - 871: Expectations (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"It’s just like ’Initial Understanding of Sword Dao’ says, meticulous and disciplined, practiced every day, from morning till night, whenever there’s time.\"","\"Is that how you ended up like this?\"","Mo Hua looked serious: \"I only take responsibility for my efforts, the rest is up to fate. But clearly, fate has let me down...\"","These seven days of practice have been as if they were in vain.","No matter how he practices, the Sword Qi doesn’t strengthen much.","However, this seems normal too.","His foundation is already weak, his Sword Dao talent is lacking, he started halfway, and has only practiced for seven days, it would be odd to see any achievements...","Patriarch Dugu was silent for a moment, then sighed, \"Forget it, take it slow.\"","He knew that mastering swordsmanship and building a foundation in Sword Dao isn’t a matter of one day or night, and he was a bit too hasty.","At Taixu Gate before, those qualified to be taught to transform Divine Thought into a sword were all true Sword Dao geniuses, one in a thousand or even ten thousand.","These geniuses would learn swordsmanship extremely fast.","Patriarch Dugu had always been teaching these Sword Dao geniuses, so inevitably he misjudged the progress of ordinary Sword Cultivators learning the sword.","Needless to say, Mo Hua is even less than an ordinary Sword Cultivator.","As far as Spiritual Root Talent goes, he could even be considered a \"dunce\" in Sword Dao.","If Taixu Gate recruited disciples based on Sword Dao talent, with Mo Hua’s talent, he wouldn’t even be sweeping the streets in front of the Mountain Gate, learning just a few basic moves, let alone enjoying the privilege of personal teaching from the Ancestor in the Back Hill Forbidden Area.","Mo Hua felt a bit troubled too.","He learned and practiced, but swordsmanship, especially Sword Qi cultivation, is something that either you know or you don’t.","He couldn’t do anything about it either.","Patriarch Dugu silently glanced at Mo Hua, without making things difficult for him, but instead patiently gave a few more pointers, then said:","\"Go back and continue practicing, in seven days, I’ll bring you back.\"","\"Yes, Ancestor,\"","Mo Hua replied respectfully, though after listening to Patriarch Dugu’s explanation, his expression still showed some confusion.","Patriarch Dugu is in the Heaven Void Realm, with his mastery in Sword Dao refined to perfection, his skills reaching the pinnacle.","In comparison, Mo Hua’s understanding of swordsmanship seemed rather \"naive.\"","Even if Patriarch Dugu considered his explanations to be \"basic,\" it’s a Heaven Void Realm’s basic, which to Mo Hua, is still profound, and somewhat difficult to grasp.","Nevertheless, Mo Hua wasn’t discouraged.","No one is born knowing everything.","Any difficult thing needs to be learned.","You may not succeed in learning, but if you don’t learn, you definitely won’t succeed.","So, Mo Hua picked up the \"Initial Understanding of Sword Dao\" and went to study it on his own.","In the Back Hill Forbidden Area, only Patriarch Dugu remained alone.","He couldn’t help but sigh.","\"Can this child truly inherit the art of transforming Divine Thought into a sword...\"","...","During the subsequent spare time, apart from learning Formation, Mo Hua immersed himself in studying insights on Sword Dao while simultaneously cultivating Sword Qi.","His understanding of Sword Dao gradually deepened, but his control over Sword Qi still progressed slowly.","This day, after a Formation class, Mo Hua was pondering about swordsmanship, not noticing when Elder Master Xun had appeared behind him.","Elder Master Xun silently observed Mo Hua and suddenly asked, \"What are you thinking about?\"","Mo Hua was startled, looking up to see Elder Master Xun, finally letting out a breath of relief, shaking his head, \"Nothing much, I was considering something about formations...\"","Elder Master Xun’s gaze subtly sharpened.","He always felt that Mo Hua seemed a little different now.","Some kind of presence on him, be it \"energy\" or \"cause and effect,\" seemed to have quietly changed in some way.","Of course, Elder Master Xun didn’t think too much about it.","Especially seeing Mo Hua’s somewhat fatigued demeanor, as if he had been intently studying something, not resting well, he couldn’t help but feel a bit concerned.","So Elder Master Xun advised softly:","\"Studying formations with diligence is good, but also remember to balance work with rest, don’t overexert yourself to the point of exhausting your Divine Sense and harming your Sea of Consciousness.\"","Mo Hua felt touched, \"Thank you, Master Xun.\"","Elder Master Xun nodded and turned to leave; he had many matters to attend to, with tangled causes and effects.","Yet, after taking a few steps, Elder Master Xun seemed to remember something, turned back to Mo Hua and asked:","\"By the way, your Divine Sense...\"","Before he finished speaking, as if sensing the profound Divine Thought Aura within Mo Hua, Elder Master Xun’s expression changed.","Before Mo Hua could say anything, he said solemnly, \"Come with me.\"","Mo Hua followed Elder Xun, leaving the Tao Teaching Room, along the mountain path, into the Elder’s Residence.","Once inside the Elder’s Residence, Elder Master Xun closed the door, sealed the Formation, activated the Compass, isolating a portion of cause and effect, then asked cautiously:","\"Your Divine Sense...\"","His voice unconsciously carried a trace of anticipation.","Mo Hua didn’t hide it, nodding, \"It’s grown stronger again, already at the Peak of Nineteen Patterns...\"","Though his tone was humble, his eyebrows showed a hint of pride.","Upon hearing this, Elder Master Xun’s breath hitched, and his hand hidden within his sleeve trembled slightly.","Nineteen Patterns... Peak!","\"You...\" Elder Master Xun paused, trying to steady his emotions, \"Release your Divine Sense fully, let me see.\"","Mo Hua released his Divine Sense.","With a restless heart, Elder Master Xun verified it, then breathed a long sigh of relief, moments later his emotions surged, repeatedly exclaiming:","\"Good, good, marvelous...\"","He looked at Mo Hua with fervor, his weary eyes emitting a glimmer, all fatigue washed away.","Heaven has indeed granted Taixu Gate a treasure!","May the ancestors watch over...","A turning point has finally arrived.","In this chaotic game of cause and effect, Taixu Gate finally possesses a piece capable of reversing the heavens!","Elder Master Xun said, \"From now on, stay within the Sect, go nowhere else, cease the bounties, and the courses arranged by the Sect, attend if you wish, or you can skip if you don’t want to.\"","\"You need to do one thing: learn formations.\"","\"I will personally teach you; within a year, you must master all the Formation categories I can teach you within the second-grade, from elementary to advanced in all Five Elements and Eight Trigrams.\"","\"This task is of utmost importance.\"","\"Within a year, you must integrate all these formations, mastering the second-grade formations to the fullest extent! Become the supreme second-grade Array Master, proficient in all fields with profound knowledge as vast as the sea!\"","Elder Master Xun’s tone was immeasurably solemn.","Second-grade Array Master...","Mo Hua was somewhat dazed, also a bit shocked.","It was the first time he had heard Elder Master Xun express such expectations, and he had never seen such a serious expression on him before.","As if this matter truly concerned the survival and safety of the Sect’s legacy...","After deliberation, Mo Hua’s gaze turned solemn, nodding with determined seriousness.","\"Yes, Master Xun!\""]},{"number":1703,"title":"Chapter 1703 - 872: Divine Statue","paragraphs":["After this, besides sword training, Mo Hua had many formations to learn.","Elder Master Xun would tutor him on various Five Elements Eight Trigrams Formations at a set time and quantity each day.","In the beginning, it wasn’t too advanced but started from the Sixteen Patterns. According to a formation catalog Elder Master Xun had somehow compiled, they went through it one by one, filling in any gaps.","Elder Master Xun reviewed all the formations in the catalog that Mo Hua hadn’t learned, was unfamiliar with, or didn’t fully understand, to solidify Mo Hua’s foundational knowledge of formations.","The formations weren’t of high grade, nor were they difficult, and most were formations he had learned before. Thus, they weren’t very challenging, and the learning was somewhat tedious and dull.","But Mo Hua understood Elder Master Xun’s good intentions, so he settled down and studied earnestly.","Not accumulating small steps, one cannot reach a thousand miles.","Not accumulating small streams, one cannot form rivers and seas.","In learning anything, the foundation is the most important. The more solid the foundation, the higher one can climb in the future. Otherwise, if one aims too high, even if a tall building is built, it might collapse soon.","Mo Hua’s foundation in formations was already solid enough.","But since he had the opportunity, he wanted it to be even more solid.","Thus, during the day, he followed Elder Master Xun to learn formations.","In the evening, he would go to the Tao Teaching Room to practice Sword Qi.","After practicing Sword Qi, he returned to the Disciple’s Residence at night, further comprehending the \"Sword Dao Primary Solution\" given by Patriarch Dugu, deepening his understanding of Sword Dao.","At 1 a.m., he would immerse his Divine Sense into the Sea of Consciousness and continue practicing formations on the Taoist Stele repeatedly.","After the seven-day cycle, he would go to the back mountain to see Patriarch Dugu.","The days were busy and very fulfilling.","Within Taixu Gate, the most skilled ancestor in formations taught him formations. The most skilled ancestor in swordsmanship taught him swordsmanship.","Mo Hua felt that even the Sect Leader of Taixu Gate might not have such privileges.","Of course, he didn’t dare tell Elder Master Xun about the Divine Thought into sword True Jue taught by Patriarch Dugu.","Because Patriarch Dugu specifically reminded him to prohibit mentioning this to anyone.","Mo Hua naturally dared not be clever, lest he displeases Patriarch Dugu and the matter of Divine Thought into Sword would be ruined.","Thus Elder Master Xun and Patriarch Dugu both taught their own areas.","Neither was aware that they were teaching the same disciple.","And the attitudes of the two ancestors towards Mo Hua were vastly different.","Elder Master Xun was exceptionally fond of Mo Hua, considering him to be a unique \"genius\"; in formations, no matter what it was, he learned instantly and understood upon a touch. Every day he treated Mo Hua as if basking in spring breeze.","Patriarch Dugu, however, kept a stern face.","Because Mo’s skill level in Sword Dao hadn’t made significant progress.","Learning anything was like a turtle’s pace. The principles he understood, the rules he knew, but when it came to practice, it was like he hadn’t practiced at all.","He hadn’t taught such a dull-witted Sword Dao disciple in his life.","Therefore, Patriarch Dugu often doubted himself.","Were the anomalies of Sword Qi humming, Sword Intent condensing into smoke, and Sword Cloud vividly manifesting in the Forbidden Land merely his illusion?","Had he been too hasty in deciding to teach Divine Thought into Sword to this child Mo Hua?","Now it seemed that this child not only had a hard time mastering the Sword Technique but even learning it was challenging...","Patriarch Dugu sighed heavily.","But he was an ancestor, his words held weight, and having promised Mo Hua, he wouldn’t easily break his promise.","\"Let’s continue teaching and see...\"","After all, if he didn’t teach Mo Hua, he didn’t have other things to do.","Having such a lively child around to talk to occasionally was also a good thing.","And so, Mo Hua learned both formations and swordsmanship together.","However, while he learned one skill extraordinarily well, the other poorly, which made him quite helpless.","But no matter what, his foundation in formations was continuously being built up deeper.","His understanding of swordsmanship was also bit by bit being \"enlightened\" due to his day-and-night efforts and the grand insights of Patriarch Dugu...","Busy and rushed, he learned for more than a month; Mo Hua had no time for anything else. When he snapped back to reality, he suddenly remembered there were some matters he hadn’t yet had time to address.","Some tasks he also hadn’t managed to finish.","\"Indeed, when one is busy, they easily forget things...\"","Mo Hua sighed.","Two days later, it was time for a break; Mo Hua asked Elder Master Xun for leave to visit the Gu Family in Qingzhou City.","Although Elder Master Xun let him go nowhere and focus on learning formations, he hadn’t truly \"confined\" him.","In his leisure time, a simple stroll was permissible.","But situations like before, visiting places like River God Temple, Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, Rouge Boat, Dragon King Temple, arresting Sin Cultivators, seeking altars, asking for lengthy leaves, such scenarios couldn’t happen anymore.","Mo Hua arrived at the Gu Family, greeted Aunt Wan, and then went straight to Gu Changhuai’s study.","Gu Changhuai was reading and, seeing Mo Hua, was somewhat surprised. He frowned and said, \"Didn’t you say you were going to focus on learning formations and wouldn’t come out?\"","\"There’s something I need to do, I’ll go back once it’s done...\" Mo Hua said.","\"What is it?\" Gu Changhuai’s expression appeared somewhat wary, basing this on past experiences, Mo Hua’s interests typically didn’t bode well.","\"It’s nothing major, just...\" Mo Hua lowered his voice and asked, \"What has become of the Rouge Boat matter?\"","Gu Changhuai was silent for a moment.","He initially planned to brush it off with \"Taoist Court Affairs cannot be disclosed,\" but Mo Hua was clever and not so easily dismissed.","In this matter, Mo Hua wasn’t really an \"outsider\"; he probably knew more about the inside story than anyone else.","Moreover, back in the Dragon King Temple, Mo Hua had \"sacrificed himself for the greater good\" to save him..."]},{"number":1704,"title":"Chapter 1704 - 872: Divine Statue (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Gu Changhuai sighed, got up to close the doors and windows, sealed the Formation, and then frowned, \"This Rouge Boat affair... it’s very odd.\"","\"Odd?\" Mo Hua was somewhat confused.","Gu Changhuai said, \"The Rouge Boat has been destroyed, and most of its Disciples have been captured.\"","\"The Gui Water Sect has also been brought under control, subsequently taken over by the Taoist Court, primarily by the Xia family. Some deeply involved Elders, Instructors, and even Disciples within the Sect have been imprisoned in the Taoist Prison, punished according to their crimes, with the lighter ones being detained for decades, and the heavier ones facing execution by garrote, or even being dismembered by formation...\"","\"Families and influences connected to the Rouge Boat’s romantic industry, more severely, have been directly raided by the Court Official, with the rest stripped of power, demoted, their assets confiscated, and ordered to rectify, many of which cannot escape punishment.\"","\"Isn’t this quite good?\" Mo Hua said.","Gu Changhuai nodded slightly, \"On the surface, it seems so. The atmosphere has improved, and not just the Rouge Boat, but some other gray areas in the open and hidden have also become restrained. Every Family Sect uses it as a warning, strictly controlling their Disciples, not daring to act recklessly anymore, but...\"","Gu Changhuai frowned even more tightly, \"I always feel that all of this has been ’orchestrated’ by someone else.\"","\"Orchestrated...\"","Mo Hua’s brow also slightly furrowed, \"Uncle Gu, you mean someone knew in advance that the Rouge Boat couldn’t be preserved, so they cut off the tail to save the body, sacrificing the pawn to protect the king?\"","Gu Changhuai was startled, nodding, \"Yes, and possibly, it’s not just as straightforward as ’sacrificing the pawn to protect the king.’","Mo Hua nodded slightly.","After saying this, he also faintly sensed something strange.","Although the Rouge Boat affair had some twists, at least the previous plans regarding the Dragon King Temple went too smoothly.","The Dragon King Temple was designed by Mr. Tu to entrap his \"deity\" self.","He indeed fell into the trap.","The Evil Embryo got planted into the Life Soul.","Then... what about the Rouge Boat?","If the Dragon King Temple was used for scheming, how could the Rouge Boat not involve some plotting?","What was the Rouge Boat used for?","Mo Hua frowned, pondered for a moment, and suddenly thought of something, asked:","\"Uncle Gu, on the Rouge Boat, which sects do the Disciples belong to?\"","Gu Changhuai pondered for a moment and said, \"Within the Qian Learning State Boundary, many sects generally have, not to mention the Qian Learning Hundred Gates. Those who could board the boat were undoubtedly prominent Disciples from each sect, and the rest of the Twelve Streams, Eight Great Gates, also had people on board.\"","\"Oh, your Taixu Gate was not there. I heard that before setting sail, they refused to board all Taixu Gate Disciples due to some apprehensions.\"","Mo Hua’s expression was not of relief but rather solemn, \"What about the Tai’a Sect?\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"The Tai’a Sect had quite a few, and they were all Foundation Establishment Late Stage Heavenly Pride Disciples.\"","\"Rushing Void Sect?\"","\"The Rushing Void Sect was the same.\"","Afterwards, Mo Hua listed several more sects, without exception, all had Disciples who boarded the Rouge Boat.","And these Disciples had common characteristics.","Foundation Establishment Late Stage, with excellent talent, held high status within the Sect.","This originally was nothing, as the Rouge Boat, being a medium for beauty trading, connecting with nobles, mutually clinging, the Disciples coming and going naturally couldn’t be mediocre.","Most of them were Heaven’s Chosen Sons.","In normal times, this would seem normal.","But now it seems that these Heaven’s Chosen Sons are surely related to something extremely important:","The Dao Debate Conference!","These Tai’a Sect, Rushing Void Sect, and even some other sects, friendly with the Taixu Gate, yet keeping a distance from the Four Great Sects, their Heavenly Pride, are very likely candidates for this session of the Dao Debate Conference!","But now, they were all taken down in one fell swoop?!","A chill arose in Mo Hua’s heart.","He finally understood what the Hidden Hand behind the Rouge Boat, or rather Mr. Tu, intended to do.","He knew the Rouge Boat couldn’t be saved, so he set a trap, infiltrating the Tai’a Sect, Rushing Void Sect, these \"hostile\" sects.","And then, taking advantage of the Taoist Court’s investigation of the Rouge Boat, lured Disciples from these \"hostile\" sects onto the Rouge Boat.","Driving the tiger to swallow the wolf.","This way, those Disciples found by the Taoist Court to have been in and out of the Rouge Boat would definitely be recorded.","Either imprisoned in Taoist Prison or expelled from the sect, even if the sects manage to protect them, they absolutely couldn’t participate in the Dao Debate Conference anymore.","The core strength to participate in the Dao Debate Conference got siphoned.","The result is naturally obvious.","Mo Hua’s gaze was solemn, \"On the Rouge Boat, is there... not a single Disciple from the Four Great Sects?\"","Gu Changhuai nodded, \"No, the Four Great Sects have strict rules, with a thriving sect culture. This time, not having Disciples go to the Rouge Boat is a stroke of luck among misfortunes...\"","Gu Changhuai sighed, \"Otherwise, if the Disciples of the Four Great Sects also went to the Rouge Boat to seek pleasure, flirting and romancing, the face of my entire Qian Learning State Boundary would be gone...\"","Mo Hua’s heart sank slightly.","Perhaps they didn’t go to seek pleasure, flirting and romancing.","But what they did might be more excessive than this...","The so-called \"Young Masters’ Pavilion\", with immense power, those who enter the Pavilion are either respected or noble, certainly can’t have no connection with the Four Great Sects.","It’s just, he has no proof.","Moreover, in the eyes of most cultivators in the Qianxue State Boundary, the Four Great Sects hold a transcendent position, being truly prestigious academies, holy places of Dao pursuit.","The Disciples within the sect are all outstanding people.","Even Uncle Gu, not knowing the inside story, is very likely to think so.","But Mo Hua, dealing with all sorts of sect \"gentlemen\" more frequently now, realized that things are far from being that simple.","And this matter, is very likely the \"trick\" of the Four Great Sects.","Before the sect’s reform, directly making the Tai’a Sect, Rushing Void Sect, and those sects capable of coveting the Four Great Sects’ position lose their most core Disciples."]},{"number":1705,"title":"Chapter 1705 - 872: Divine Statue_3","paragraphs":["They were no longer able to resist the Four Great Sects.","As a result, the so-called Sect reform had already been settled before the true reform even began.","This scheme was over before it even started.","This is the true \"strategic planning\".","The conclusion was written beforehand, before anyone realized it.","Mo Hua sighed.","\"So young, why do you sigh every day?\" Gu Changhuai frowned and said.","The child, who knows what he’s thinking about, has already sighed three times in such a short time...","Mo Hua glanced at Gu Changhuai, shook his head, and said with some emotion, \"Uncle Gu, you don’t understand.\"","Gu Changhuai was so angry that his teeth itched, he wanted to pinch his cheek, but he held back in the end.","Mo Hua’s \"status\" in the Gu Family was higher than his.","Gu Changhuai waved his hand, \"Finished asking? If you’re done, then go back to the sect and cultivate well.\"","Mo Hua had indeed finished his questions, and not lingering any longer, he bid farewell, \"Then goodbye, Uncle Gu. I’ll come find you next time if needed.\"","Gu Changhuai felt a bit of a headache.","However, just as Mo Hua was about to step over the threshold and leave the study, Gu Changhuai suddenly remembered something and said:","\"Mo Hua...\"","Mo Hua turned back, looking at him with some confusion.","Gu Changhuai was silent for a moment, then slowly said, \"Xiao Tianquan is dead.\"","Mo Hua’s expression was calm, only after a moment did he react, shocked, \"What? The Howling Celestial Dog is dead?\"","Gu Changhuai just looked at him silently.","Thankfully, although Mo Hua’s face turned pale, he applied his thick skin and, with some acting flaws, continued pretending as if he didn’t know the Howling Celestial Dog had died.","\"How did he die?\" Mo Hua asked.","Gu Changhuai was a bit speechless, \"What do you think?\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then said solemnly, \"Could it really be that excessive wrongdoing leads to self-destruction, punished by ’Heaven’, sudden and unexpected death? The Heavenly Dao is indeed fair...\"","Gu Changhuai’s gaze slightly focused.","He was just asking to confirm, not really expecting Mo Hua to answer.","But at this moment, upon hearing Mo Hua’s words, Gu Changhuai’s feelings were momentarily complex, suddenly asking, \"Mo Hua, do you think... there really is a Heavenly Dao in this world?\"","Unexpectedly Mo Hua nodded and said confidently, \"Yes!\"","Gu Changhuai frowned, \"Do you know what kind of Heavenly Dao I’m talking about?\"","\"All kinds of Heavenly Dao exist.\" Mo Hua said.","Gu Changhuai’s expression was somewhat astonished.","Mo Hua pointed to the sky, \"There is Dao in the heavens.\"","He had seen it with his own eyes.","But this \"Dao\" manifested as a Large Formation, truly connecting heaven and earth, he still couldn’t understand or see through it.","Then Mo Hua pointed to his heart, \"The human heart also possesses Heavenly Dao.\"","\"In this world, there are those who seek fame, seek profit, seek the great power of Tao Cultivation, seek power and position, luxury and pleasure, they all exist.\"","\"Even those who rely on fame, profit, position, cultivation to oppress and exploit others are plentiful.\"","\"However, these have nothing to do with the Dao, nothing to do with becoming an Immortal. Those who can truly become Immortals must have the Heavenly Dao in their hearts and act on behalf of Heaven!\"","\"If there is no Dao in the heart, if one does not act on behalf of Heaven, even with cultivation reaching heaven and earth, with the highest fame, power, and status, they will turn to ashes in the face of a great catastrophe and end up as ants beneath the Great Dao, unable to become Immortals.\"","Upon hearing this, Gu Changhuai couldn’t help but be shocked.","But at the same time, he was a bit puzzled, \"These... how do you know?\"","Mo Hua said righteously, \"I guessed!\"","Gu Changhuai: \"...\"","Mo Hua mumbled, \"I haven’t become an Immortal, how would I know how to become one, but based on my experience and knowledge, I think it should be like this...\"","\"If guessed wrong, I’ll change it later...\"","Gu Changhuai didn’t know what to say.","He sighed, \"You should head back earlier.\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Goodbye, Uncle Gu.\"","Then Mo Hua left unperturbed.","But what he said was like a branding iron, etched in Gu Changhuai’s mind, unable to be forgotten for a long time.","\"Heavenly Dao in the heart, act on behalf of Heaven...\"","For some reason, due to the Xia family and various helpless matters within the Taoist Court, the originally confused and a bit dispirited mood of Gu Changhuai suddenly became much relieved.","His gaze became determined.","...","Leaving the Gu Family, Mo Hua took a slightly longer route and went to the small fishing village.","Old Yu’s family was still busy with the day’s livelihood, although it was a bit tough, the family gathered together, working hard and living harmoniously, looked enviable.","Mo Hua didn’t disturb them.","He directly became invisible, went to the Shrine at the back of the village.","On the Shrine, his \"Little Immortal Statue\" was being worshipped.","Behind the Little Immortal Statue, a Little Silver Fish, under his protection, was happily eating incense.","Seeing Mo Hua coming, the Little Silver Fish was overjoyed, wagging its tail and nodding, hurriedly calling \"Benefactor\".","Mo Hua had shown it \"great kindness\".","Thus the Little Silver Fish was very grateful to Mo Hua, having helped Mo Hua tirelessly before on the Mistwater River.","Mo Hua mysteriously said, \"I have a gift for you.\"","Saying this, he placed a package in front of the Little Silver Fish.","The Little Silver Fish was dazed for a moment, not noticing any gift, but since \"Benefactor\" wouldn’t deceive it, it used the origin of a deity to slightly sense it. Immediately, it trembled all over, its scales almost standing on end.","\"Dragon...\"","Dragon Bone Divine Statue!","It was then shocked and said in a trembling voice, \"Benefactor, this is too precious, I dare not take it, nor can I take it...\"","Mo Hua didn’t understand, \"Isn’t this a good thing?\"","\"It’s a good thing, but it’s too precious. A minor god’s good fortune is too thin, cannot bear it...\""]},{"number":1706,"title":"Chapter 1706 - 872: Divine Statue (Part 4)","paragraphs":["The Little Silver Fish was very self-aware, and then it said, \"Most of my memories of the Divine Way were lost in the Blood River God Temple. I don’t know the exact origin of this thing, but this Divine Statue, made from dragon bones, is absolutely extraordinary and might be even more important than you think, benefactor.\"","\"Benefactor, you must keep it well.\"","\"I will keep it...\"","Mo Hua felt a bit helpless.","The key is, he doesn’t know what use it is to keep it.","If he could put it in his storage bag or storage ring, he’d manage to keep it, but it can’t be put in at all.","Holding it so blatantly, who knows one day he might encounter a \"knowledgeable\" cultivator or some greedy deity and cause trouble.","Moreover, since he took this thing out of the Dragon King Temple, as time passed, the traces of \"divinity\" within it were gradually losing.","Mo Hua didn’t know much about it, but he guessed that this lifebound divine statue probably needed nurturing.","Nurturing the divine statue should naturally be the task of a \"deity.\"","After thinking for a while, he found the Little Silver Fish to be the most suitable.","Lord Yellow Mountain lived too far away, and it had many statues, mud and gold ones alike, went as far as crawling into a statue of a dog—it surely didn’t lack this one.","Moreover, Lord Yellow Mountain has lived long, with many thoughts and always speaks with partial truths.","Mo Hua found it difficult to fully trust it.","Unlike the Little Silver Fish, pure and adorable, calling him \"benefactor\" every day, always thinking of helping him when things arise.","But the Little Silver Fish dared not take it...","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then said, \"Then let’s say I ’lend’ it to you. You help me keep it well, nurture it with divinity, and return it to me someday when I need this divine statue.\"","The Little Silver Fish was still somewhat hesitant.","\"You should just take it as basking in my favor...\"","\"But my power is meager...\"","\"It’s alright,\" Mo Hua said, \"this divine statue cannot be seen by ordinary cultivators or even demon monsters and evil gods.\"","Otherwise, it wouldn’t be covered in dust in the corner of the Dragon King Hall.","\"Besides, I’ll set up some formations for you, covering this divine statue so it will hardly ever be discovered.\"","Seeing the Little Silver Fish still somewhat anxious.","Mo Hua thought for a while, then changed his approach, speaking very solemnly:","\"I’m entrusting this to you, keep the divine statue well for me, and at the same time, you can use it to nurture your divine soul and strengthen your divine body.\"","\"Don’t let me down...\"","Saying this, the Little Silver Fish indeed became full of spirit, nodding, \"Rest assured, benefactor, I will never fail your trust!\"","Mo Hua nodded satisfactorily.","Then he headed to a secluded and secretive desolate mountain near the Little Immortal statue and placed the Dragon Bone Divine Statue inside a deep cave.","Afterward, he began laying out divine Tao arrays around.","Ordinary formations wouldn’t work, even concealment formations are like covering one’s ears in front of higher-rank formation masters, revealing their flaws.","But Divine Tao arrays are different.","Divine Tao arrays are derivative of the divine thought, even some high-grade formation masters wouldn’t venture into it.","More importantly, they don’t have this inheritance.","Mo Hua referenced the array layout of the Great Wilderness Evil God, setting up a complete set of Divine Tao arrays, including the Divine Mist Array, Divine Barrier Array, and Divine Lock Array, around the cave.","Divine Barrier Array, locks the doors.","Divine Mist Array, obscures divine sense.","Divine Lock Array, seals the divine statue, and can also ward off external evil.","This way, everything is ready.","Even if the formation was broken, the Dragon Bone Divine Statue itself had sufficient concealment capabilities.","Mo Hua thought for a while and took out a piece of paper, drew a turtle, and placed it deep inside the cave.","In this way, if someone broke through his Divine Tao arrays with great difficulty, ventured deep into the cave, and found the divine array secluding just a turtle drawing, they’d certainly get furious.","In a fit of rage, they would be even less likely to discover the inherently obscure Divine Statue.","Mo Hua nodded satisfactorily.","Then he took his leave.","The Little Silver Fish was grateful and reluctant, keeping Mo Hua company till the village entrance, watching Mo Hua’s back disappear at the fork, before feeling lost and returning to the shrine, silently vowing in its heart:","\"I must protect the divine statue for the benefactor!\"","...","After leaving the small fishing village, Mo Hua did not delay and returned to Taixu Gate.","Afterwards, he stayed inside almost all the time, spending his days in the sect, learning formations from Elder Master Xun and swordsmanship from Patriarch Dugu.","His formations were steadily improving.","Even his swordsmanship also gradually became enlightened.","And two months later, it reached the year-end, marking the fifth year’s end for Mo Hua at Taixu Gate."]},{"number":1707,"title":"Chapter 1707 - 873: Opening the Box","paragraphs":["At the year-end Sect examination, Mo Hua performed consistently, with one A and six Cs, nothing surprising or disappointing.","The six ’Cs’ were because he could only get a C.","But that one ’A’ was different.","He got the ’A’ because the Formation assessment by the Taixu Gate could only grade up to ’A’.","This ’A’ was of high value, truly a \"single grace that masks a hundred flaws\", but unfortunately, it couldn’t be reflected on the paper.","Mo Hua felt regretful.","After the examination, as per usual, Mo Hua wrote a letter home.","The letter was long-winded, saying many things, but mostly about how peaceful the Sect was, how harmonious the same sect members were, how kind the teachers were, and how the people near the Qianxue State Boundary were good-hearted, reassuring words for his parents.","He didn’t mention any dangerous matters, to avoid worrying his parents.","After writing it, Mo Hua sent the letter out through the post station of the Taixu Gate.","But to his utmost surprise, at the post station, he actually received a letter.","It was sent by his parents.","To be far from home in a foreign land, a single letter from home is worth ten thousand gold.","Mo Hua was overjoyed and immediately returned to the Disciple’s Residence to read the letter.","The handwriting was neat, written by his mother.","But Mo Hua guessed that while his mother was writing, his father Mo Shan was probably watching by her side, quietly adding a few lines now and then.","The content of the letter was nothing special, only saying that everything at home was well and telling Mo Hua not to worry.","Mo Hua wasn’t even sure which year’s reply this was.","However, Mo Hua was already content.","The Nine State region was vast, and the distance between Li State and Qian State was too great, with mountains high and waters long, seemingly endless.","The Low Grade State Realm is restricted by cultivation, making communication very slow.","A letter from the Second Grade Big Black Mountain State Boundary of Li State to the Qianxue State Boundary only took a few years, probably due to him being a disciple of the Taixu Gate, using their message channels.","Otherwise, it might not have been received for decades.","Mo Hua carefully read the letter again and stored it away with care, then sat in the Disciple’s Residence, suddenly feeling a bit forlorn.","Memories gradually resurfaced.","When he was younger, in the streets and lanes of Tongxian City, bits and pieces of those days slowly came to mind.","These memories, like candied hawthorn, were sweet, yet also a bit sour.","It seemed as if a long time had passed, yet as if it were just yesterday.","He could still vaguely hear the voices of those little friends calling his name.","Calling him to practice cultivation at the Sect, to see the lantern festival, to go shopping, to see the little girls...","Among them, the voices of Da’hu and the other two were the most.","After all, they grew up together, spending the most time playing together.","\"I wonder how Da’hu and the others are doing now in Tongxian City...\"","Mo Hua silently pondered in his heart.","\"No... \"","Mo Hua was startled for a moment before he suddenly remembered that Da’hu and the other two seemed not to be in Tongxian City anymore.","Frowning, he recollected what Dazhu had told him.","The Qian Family had collapsed, the Big Demon had been killed, and through the Tao Cultivation industry, Tongxian City had become much more stable and prosperous.","There were more cultivators coming and going for business, stopping by, and seeking refuge...","And some very important ’big figures’ would occasionally pass through Tongxian City.","On that day, coincidentally, a towering Sect Elder passed through Tongxian City and accidentally saw Da’hu and the others. Seeing that, although their backgrounds were poor, their determination was strong and they had good Body Refinement constitutions, he took them as disciples and brought them to the Sect for cultivation...","The name of the Sect was said to be...","Great Wilderness Sect.","Thinking of this, Mo Hua’s gaze slightly sharpened.","The matter of the heavenly secret seems coincidental, yet contains cause and effect.","It wouldn’t be for no reason that he suddenly thought of these things.","Could it be... something happened to Da’hu and the others?","Mo Hua furrowed his brow.","Moreover, the Great Wilderness Sect...","Now, Mo Hua was extremely sensitive to the words \"Great Wilderness\", always feeling that as long as these words were involved, more or less, there was some unclear connection with the Evil God.","And the Great Wilderness Sect was located south of Li State, adjacent to the Barbaric Wilderness.","Calculating this, it was indeed close to the lair of the Great Wilderness Evil God.","But the mountains were high and the roads were far; there was nothing he could do about it, not even getting any information.","Mo Hua sighed, having no choice but to press this matter into the depths of his heart...","Afterwards, it was the New Year.","Mo Hua spent this New Year very busily, almost like usual, either practicing swordplay or learning formations.","However, Elder Master Xun did give him a day off, letting him go to the Gu Family for a New Year’s Eve dinner.","As Elder Master Xun said, \"The Gu Family is a refreshing stream, rare and valuable, and it’s good to have interactions normally...\"","And so, Mo Hua went to visit the Gu Family.","He had a big feast, and incidentally, \"couldn’t refuse in earnest\" and had to \"reluctantly\" accept many small festive gifts before returning fully loaded.","The next day, he returned to the Taixu Gate, prepared to focus on learning swordplay and formations.","But unexpectedly, during the grand festival, someone specifically came to give him gifts.","And the person who delivered the gifts was someone he never would have expected.","Wang Chen from the Gui Water Sect.","Mo Hua almost forgot about this person.","But Wang Chen couldn’t forget, as he was brought by Hao Xuan to Mo Hua’s presence, where he presented the prepared gifts one by one and then expressed his immense gratitude:","\"Thank you, Junior Brother, for enlightening me, otherwise my life would be over.\"","Mo Hua was slightly taken aback, \"What did I enlighten you about?\"","Wang Chen smiled bitterly, \"It was about the Rouge Boat. If it weren’t for Junior Brother you leading Hao Xuan and the others to beat me up, forcing me to leak information and make amends, I wouldn’t have been able to get off that thieving ship of the Gui Water Sect...\""]},{"number":1708,"title":"Chapter 1708 - 873: Opening the Casket (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"About this matter...\" Mo Hua suddenly realized, waved his hand, \"It’s just a trivial matter, no need to take it to heart.\"","Wang Chen said solemnly: \"It’s a small matter to you, but it’s different for me.\"","He is a son of the Wang family, although his bloodline is slightly off, his status in the clan is not high, and he is not favored on most days, but if he makes a mistake, he becomes the target of everyone’s criticism.","The clan will certainly not let him off lightly.","If the Rouge Boat affair brings shame to the clan, he doesn’t even dare to imagine the consequences.","At least his father, who finally secured the idle position of Elder, can forget about keeping that seat.","He would truly become the \"disgraceful son\" then.","Therefore, he specially asked his father to prepare an extra New Year’s gift to present to Mo Hua.","\"It’s not too valuable, please accept it with a smile, Junior Brother.\" Wang Chen laughed.","Mo Hua took a look and found they were some Formation Books, pastries, meat jerky, fruit wines and the like, obviously under Hao Xuan’s \"guidance.\"","Not too precious, but they were all things he liked, Mo Hua didn’t hesitate, nodded and accepted them.","Afterwards, Mo Hua chatted with Wang Chen for a while, asking about things related to Gui Water Sect.","Wang Chen spoke without reservation.","He quietly told Mo Hua, \"The Taoist Court Officials, no, to be precise, the Taoist Court, has reformed the Gui Water Sect from top to bottom, executing those to be executed, arresting those to be arrested, detaining those to be detained...\"","\"Now Gui Water Sect is no longer the original Gui Water Sect.\"","\"Now the Gui Water Sect, rather than being part of the Twelve Streams, it’s more like...\"","Wang Chen thought for a bit and described, \"More like, a sect directly under the Taoist Court, directly affiliated with the Taoist Court Officials. If one performs well in the sect, they can directly enter the Taoist Court Officials after graduation, and moreover, after entering the Taoist Court Officials, they directly fall under the upper management, which is the Taoist Court, not too influenced by local noble families...\"","Mo Hua was a bit surprised.","So, in a way, Gui Water Sect has \"reinvented itself\"?","In a sense, it changed from a subordinate sect of the Twelve Streams into a \"directly governed\" sect by the Taoist Court?","Of course, for the boundary of Qian Learning State, this should also be considered a \"infiltration\" by the Taoist Court.","And it’s likely this is just the first step.","However, Mo Hua also had some doubts, asking:","\"Aren’t most disciples in Gui Water Sect from noble families? If so, how come they’re not affected by noble families?\"","\"It’s different,\" Wang Chen explained, \"Noble families are divided into many kinds, there are great families, small families, local ones, and foreign ones.\"","\"Others mention noble families together, but the differences among noble families are bigger than those between humans and dogs, each has its own inner conflicts and intrigues. Some noble families are even naked enemies.\"","\"It’s the same within the boundary of Qian Learning, the specific situation is very complex.\"","\"And this reform of Gui Water Sect mainly reorganized around ’local noble families’ and great families of Fourth Grade and above.\"","\"After the Rouge Boat incident, the Elders and disciples of these noble families have been ’cleaned’ out, the rest are either suppressed, demoted, or advised to resign.\"","\"Now what remains in Gui Water Sect are mainly disciples from foreign noble families or local small families below Third Grade...\"","Mo Hua suddenly realized, slightly nodded.","This move by the Taoist Court aims to divide noble families.","To split the concept of \"noble families,\" with foreign great families and local small families targeting the local great families within the boundary of Qian Learning State.","Even if not targeted, it at least weakens the influence of great families over the Taoist Court Officials to a certain extent.","Indeed, there are contradictions in all things in life, one must learn to crumble the enemy from within.","Mo Hua learned something new again.","Then he asked Wang Chen, \"So doesn’t your situation look quite bleak? The Wang family is considered a local noble family, right?\"","Wang Chen replied: \"I’m okay, although the Wang family’s influence is large, my status is low, not a core disciple of the family, thus not favored.\"","\"Moreover, in the Rouge Boat incident, I actually made a contribution. Also, because of you, Junior Brother, pleading for me with the Taoist Court Official, even with the Gui Water Sect reform, its impact on me is not big.\"","\"Not only that...\"","Wang Chen smiled, \"Not to hide from you, Junior Brother, I’m actually doing better than before. Previously, when I showed my face at Supervisor Gu’s place, during the Gui Water Sect reform, many things were entrusted to me by the Taoist Court Officials, going back and forth made me a familiar face.\"","\"Now that the reform is complete, I have gained some ’prestige’ in the sect.\"","\"Those who are of lesser bloodline or born of distant noble families, if they wish to remain in Gui Water Sect, they will come to ask me to help plead for them.\"","\"And the outsiders, as well as small family disciples, knowing I can speak on their behalf with the Taoist Court Officials, also pay me respect.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","This Wang Chen has indeed \"benefited from misfortune.\"","He patted Wang Chen on the shoulder, encouraging:","\"Work hard, if you end up in the Taoist Court Officials, you might be favored. I’ll speak highly of you when I have the chance.\"","Uncle Gu and Xia Canonical Official are quite familiar to him.","Uncle Gu comes from the Gu family, with rich experience in criminal affairs.","Xia Canonical Official is from the summer family of the Central Dao Court.","Now that Xiao Zhenhai is dead, Uncle Gu and the two of them are the most powerful officials in the Taoist Court Officials within the boundary of Qian Learning State.","As for Wang Chen, who was originally from Gui Water Sect, if he can help Uncle Gu and them, it would be considered a good thing.","Wang Chen grinned from ear to ear and hurriedly said: \"Thank you, Junior Brother!\"","The opportunity in just one sentence from Junior Brother might be something he himself can’t even scramble for.","The two conversed for a while.","Wang Chen then said goodbye, yet before leaving, he hesitated for a moment and decided to remind: \"Junior Brother, do you know about one matter?\""]},{"number":1709,"title":"Chapter 1709 - 873: Opening the Casket (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"What is it?\"","\"It’s about the Taia Sect and the Rushing Void Sect...\"","Mo Hua’s gaze slightly narrowed.","Wang Chen said, \"On the Rouge Boat, there are quite a few disciples from the Taia Sect and the Rushing Void Sect. Once this matter is investigated, the problem becomes too significant.\"","\"The main issue is still the Dao Conference.\"","\"It seems the Taia Sect and the Rushing Void Sect are trying to manipulate the Taoist Court, but it seems not too smoothly. If the negotiation fails, then at this Dao Conference, these two sects are likely doomed...\"","Wang Chen shook his head, with some sighs.","\"And the Taixu Sect is in the same alliance with the Taia Sect and the Rushing Void Sect. If Taia and Rushing Void both fall, the Taixu Sect might also be unable to hold on...\"","Wang Chen felt some worry, so he particularly reminded Mo Hua.","Mo Hua nodded, \"I understand.\"","He thought for a moment, then instructed Wang Chen, \"There might be significant changes in the Qianxue state boundary, with unforeseen calamities and blessings. If you hear anything from the Gui Water Sect, secretly tell me.\"","\"Likewise, if you encounter any trouble, even life-and-death situations, you can come to me. I might be able to guide you to a way out...\"","If it were someone else, Wang Chen might not care.","But the one who spoke was Mo Hua.","Wang Chen solemnly saluted, \"Thank you, Junior Brother!\"","...","After Wang Chen left, Mo Hua returned to the Disciple’s Residence, with thoughts surging.","Gui Water Sect...","Mentioning the Gui Water Sect, Mo Hua thought of the Water Prison Sect.","And when he thought of the Water Prison Sect, Mo Hua suddenly remembered he still had an important item in his possession.","The Water Prison Forbidden Box!","He closed the doors and windows, secured the Formation, and then took out the Water Prison Forbidden Box from the Storage Ring.","This forbidden box is a Forbidden Item of the Water Prison Sect’s Sect Leader, sealed with the Water Prison Sect’s Forbidden Technique. The method to open the box is only known by Xiao Zhenhai.","Mo Hua guessed that it requires cultivating some secret Cultivation Technique, then using refined blood to nurture the forbidden box. Once the Cultivation Technique’s fire control is up to standard and the refined blood is well-nurtured, the box can be opened.","Of course, this is just a guess.","He had no idea about the specific technique, so he could only \"pick peaches,\" trying to snatch the box before the \"Water Yama\" opened it.","But he had underestimated it.","After getting the box, Mo Hua, for a time, could not open it.","So he threw it into the Storage Ring, thinking he would study it later when he had time.","However, with many things happening later, Mo Hua temporarily forgot about it, only recalling it now.","Afterward, Mo Hua specially took half a day, not practicing Formation, but staying in the Disciple’s Residence, focusing on studying the Water Prison Forbidden Box.","After half a day, he finally figured out the method to open the box.","The key was still the Pupil Skill.","But this Pupil Skill for opening the box was somewhat special.","It’s like having an embedded \"password,\" requiring the activation of a specific soul in the Life Soul to visualize the Water Prison Map to open the forbidden box.","Normally, this wouldn’t be difficult.","But Mo Hua’s Life Soul harbored an Evil Embryo, so he could only proceed cautiously, trying a bit at a time.","Fortunately, it was just \"unlocking\" and not really using the Pupil Skill.","Mo Hua made a subtle attempt and found no significant issues.","About two incense sticks later, a flash of Golden Light flared in Mo Hua’s eyes, the red glow on the forbidden box faded slightly, the entire box dazzlingly radiant, emitting a crystalline blue light like crystal.","A water mark emerged, splitting the forbidden box in half.","This seamless treasure of the Water Prison Sect was finally opened.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but feel a little excited.","He released his Divine Sense, confirming there was no danger, and then carefully opened the forbidden box. Looking inside, he found a few Jade Slips lying there.","These Jade Slips were polished extremely thin, exquisitely crafted, like jade paper, attached to the small forbidden box.","On the Jade Slips were engraved the forbidden markings of the Water Prison Sect.","It likely signified that they were exclusive to the Water Prison Sect, not to be shared outside.","But since the Water Prison Sect no longer existed, external sharing was no longer a concern.","Mo Hua went through the Jade Slips one by one and then appeared somewhat shocked.","The contents on these Jade Slips were indeed the supreme legacy of the Water Prison Sect, each priceless.","A movement technique called \"Water Shadow Illusion.\"","At a glance, this movement technique had an uncanny similarity with the Water Shadow Step, yet the two were entirely incomparable.","According to the Water Prison Sect’s \"grade\" of Taoist skills, this Water Shadow Illusion is the most core, top-tier movement technique.","It is more profound than the Water Shadow Step learned by Water Yama and Xiao Zhenhai.","The ghost-like \"Water Shadow\" that can be cultivated with this movement technique also has a much higher upper limit.","In other words, the Water Shadow Step learned by Water Yama and Xiao Zhenhai is essentially a \"castrated\" downgraded version derived from the Water Shadow Illusion in this Forbidden Box.","Moreover, there is also a \"Water Prison True Skill.\"","This refers to a cultivation technique, and its name seems simple.","However, any spell point with the words \"True Skill,\" whether it’s a cultivation technique, Taoist skill, or swordsmanship, holds a significant position in the sect’s legacy.","Mo Hua glanced at it with some envy.","But he is not a pure Water Spirit Root, his Spiritual Root grade is inadequate, and he is even less likely to give up Heaven Yan Jue to retrain this Water Prison True Skill.","Even if he really learned it, the amount of Spirit Stones and rare Heavenly Materials and Earthly Treasures required by such a \"Sect Leader\" level cultivation technique are countless, something he simply cannot afford to cultivate.","He only casually skimmed it, already discovering the cultivation technique required no fewer than seven or eight types of rare Spirit Grass and Pills that he had never heard of, but whose rarity was apparent at first glance.","Never mind...","Mo Hua shook his head.","Without a \"wealthy destiny,\" he simply can’t afford to cultivate such a technique.","Better stick to Heaven Yan Jue.","Mo Hua set aside the \"Water Prison True Skill\" and then began to look at the next Jade Slip.","As his Divine Sense immersed into it, a name both surprising and expected emerged:","\"Water Prison Skill.\"","Superior Taoist skill of the Water Prison Sect, rarely seen in the cultivation world, capable of bypassing Golden Body to exert strong control over cultivators!","Indeed, the classics of this Taoist skill were hidden in the Water Prison Forbidden Box.","Just that, there’s one problem...","Xiao Zhenhai didn’t open the Water Prison Forbidden Box, how did he learn this superior Water Prison Skill?","Does he have other methods, or was the Water Prison Skill he learned another \"castrated\" version?","Mo Hua was puzzled.","Unfortunately, Xiao Zhenhai is already dead, there’s no way to ask him.","Mo Hua shook his head, then turned to the next Jade Slip.","This was the last Jade Slip.","Mo Hua immersed his Divine Sense into the Jade Slip, only to find under his perception that it was completely blank.","\"Empty?\"","\"Impossible... How could a Forbidden Item as important as the Water Prison Forbidden Box contain an empty Jade Slip?\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brows.","\"Encrypted?\"","Fortunately, when it comes to encryption and decryption, he is rather familiar.","Mo Hua studied the seemingly ordinary \"blank\" Jade Slip up and down for a while and then sighed with relief.","It’s not Original Magnet encryption...","If it were truly Original Magnet encryption, with his current Yuan Magnetic Formation skills, he certainly couldn’t decipher it.","Considering Mo Hua’s understanding of the Water Prison Sect, this is probably \"Pupil Skill\" style encryption.","The Water Prison Sect has extremely strict lineage, differentiating high and low, and levels of respect and superiority.","The Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil Skill can practically be said to be one of the most core legacies of the Water Prison Sect, containing the Dao of Divine Soul, using this for \"encryption\" is naturally the safest.","But the Water Prison Sect Ancestor probably never thought the Water Prison Sect would one day be \"raided\" by the Taoist Court.","These legacies scattered out, and the rules he set all fell into chaos.","Thus, this \"treasure’s\" encryption, especially for Mo Hua, became \"virtually useless.\"","Mo Hua spent some more time, finally seeing through the mist of Divine Thought to the text within the Jade Slip.","Upon looking at it, Mo Hua frowned.","This is a very strange Jade Slip.","What it recorded seems to be a Taoist skill, but this Taoist skill is not complete.","It appears someone is continuously trying, deducing, improving, and iterating the skill patterns of a certain Taoist skill, and then recorded the different skill pattern results on the Jade Slip...","Mo Hua’s pupils narrowed, his heart shocked.","This is... a Forbidden Technique?","The true secret hidden within the Water Prison Forbidden Box, was it a manuscript for the development of a Forbidden Technique?","Mo Hua flipped to the end, where he saw a few scribbled and sinister blood-red characters at the end of the Jade Slip:","Forbidden Technique · Senluo Water Prison."]},{"number":1710,"title":"Chapter 1710 - 874: Water Shadow","paragraphs":["\"Senluo Water Prison...\"","These words, bloody and wild, terrifying, filled with a sense of madness, looked inexplicably shocking.","Mo Hua’s gaze slightly darkened.","His previous guess was indeed correct.","The Water Prison Forbidden Box, since it contained the word \"forbidden,\" in addition to being a \"forbidden item\" of the Sect Leader, actually hid a forbidden technique.","And this forbidden technique was not complete; it seemed to be only halfway developed.","The question is...","Mo Hua frowned.","Who exactly is researching this forbidden technique?","The successive Sect Leaders of the Water Prison Sect, or... the Ancestor of the Water Prison Sect?","What is the direction of the research?","What kind of forbidden technique does the Water Prison Sect want to develop?","Mo Hua’s divine sense immersed into the jade slip, selecting what could be understood, and skimmed through the forbidden technique’s development manuscript, his eyes gradually widening, becoming increasingly astonished as he read.","The contents of the jade slip were profound, only revealing the gist.","This seems to be...","An attempt to combine the superior controlling Taoist skill \"Water Prison Skill,\" with the top-secret \"Seven Souls Blood Prison Pupil Skill,\" in the development of a forbidden technique.","Deconstructing pupil technique compositions and Water Prison skill patterns, connecting divine soul thought techniques with spiritual power spells, thereby merging into a very unusual \"forbidden Taoist skill.\"","This is the underlying principle of this forbidden technique called \"Senluo Water Prison.\"","\"The Water Prison Sect, truly has tremendous daring...\"","Mo Hua was shocked in his heart and then silently contemplated.","The Blood Pupil Skill is powerful, and so is the Water Prison Skill, but both have their respective drawbacks.","Pupil skills require an element of surprise and must not be anticipated by others.","The situations where Xiao Zhenhai and the \"Water Yama\" used pupil skills were precisely like this.","The first time using the pupil skill, the opponent is caught off guard and great achievements can be made.","Every subsequent use has a diminishing effect.","After using it frequently, even a fool would be on guard against your pupil skill, easily making it \"an attempt to charm the blind,\" turning this killing move into an accessory.","Moreover, dealing with ordinary people is fine, but truly formidable enemies are invariably shrewd and cunning.","This pupil skill, if you use it once and fail to kill them,","it is no longer as effective for setting traps, at least it will be considerably restricted.","Similarly, the \"Water Prison Skill\" is strong, but however strong, it is still a superior Taoist skill, sharing the drawbacks of superior Taoist skills.","It’s slow to cast and takes a long time to gather strength.","Although the Water Prison Skill is not a traditional offensive superior Taoist skill, the time to gather energy is slightly shorter.","But this time is still too long compared to the hand speed of general spells, sufficient for others to counter.","Xiao Zhenhai was in such a situation.","The first time he used the Water Prison Technique, it was unexpected, catching Uncle Gu and the Xia Canonical Official off guard, resulting in both being hit.","But the second time he used it, it was not so easy.","Even though he deliberately used the Golden Body, he was still overpowered by the prepared Uncle Gu and the Xia Canonical Official working together to break the Golden Body.","His Water Prison Skill was cut off, and he suffered a severe rebound.","Therefore, these two spells, although powerful, have their restrictions.","However, if \"Pupil Skill\" and \"Water Prison Skill\" could be merged as one, that would be a bit... terrifying.","Starting with the pupil skill, it’s quick to activate, has a large range, ignores the golden body, and can strongly control both the divine soul and the flesh.","When casting this spell, others do not even dare to look at you.","Because once they look, they’ll never escape again.","Not only that, it is a dual control of divine thought and the physical body.","Any cultivator hit by the \"Senluo Water Prison\" would undoubtedly become a \"pig for slaughter,\" with no say over life or death.","Mo Hua took a slight breath of cold air.","Moreover, he faintly felt that the power of this \"Senluo Water Prison\" might not even stop there...","In the forbidden technique development manuscript, some sophisticated and esoteric skill pattern structures, that he couldn’t quite understand, seemed to hide some unknown laws.","As a result, Mo Hua had a conjecture:","Could it be that the Water Prison Sect a thousand years ago, was annihilated by the Taoist Court precisely because of the development of this forbidden technique...","Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart.","This was a bit terrifying.","\"It shouldn’t be that serious...\"","He pondered again, but these past events from a thousand years ago were too distant, and he knew little about them, making it difficult to verify even with speculation.","He didn’t even dare to calculate.","Because if it were true, the cause and effect sufficient to extinguish a Twelve Streams Sect would be too great, and he couldn’t bear it.","Then... can it be learned?","Mo Hua’s heart stirred, and he carefully reviewed this piece of forbidden technique manuscript again, but found that regarding the pupil skill and water prison skill content, he could understand a little.","But not much, only a little.","Apart from that, those profound, complex, convoluted skill pattern structures, were not within the realm of second-grade Foundation Establishment Realm Taoist skills.","Mo Hua was helpless.","\"Can’t understand...\"","He attempted to comprehend it several more times, but what couldn’t be understood, simply couldn’t be understood.","Mo Hua could only give up.","And besides, this is a forbidden technique after all, an undeveloped forbidden technique, one that is very profound and complex.","It absolutely cannot be casually learned.","The Meteor Fire Skill is an exception.","Mo Hua first comprehended a certain \"spiritual power underlying law,\" then with the advantage of divine sense, applied the skill pattern structure of the \"Meteor Fire Skill\" on this level of the spiritual power law, thus modifying it into a second-grade fire forbidden skill:","\"Mini Meteorite Skill.\"","But forbidden techniques cannot be compared among themselves.","He would never think that the things he comprehended could be compared with the forbidden techniques studied by the Sect Leader or even the Ancestor of a Twelve Streams Sect like the Water Prison Sect.","Learning the Mini Meteorite Skill, he made mistakes and got himself severely injured."]},{"number":1711,"title":"Chapter 1711 - 874: Water Shadow (Part 2)","paragraphs":["If one were to practice this unfinished and incredibly complex \"Senluo Water Prison\" forbidden technique, even a tiny mistake could lead to an unforeseen death.","Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart and shook his head.","\"I’ll keep it for now...\"","This forbidden technique manuscript, even if not learned, can be used for research and reference.","Moreover, its research and reference value are significant.","On the surface, it’s just an incomplete forbidden technique.","But in Mo Hua’s eyes, it contains the Water Prison Sect’s upper echelon’s most advanced studies and insights into spiritual power composition, spell principles, and skill pattern structure.","This forbidden technique development manuscript is indeed incredibly valuable.","And this thing must not be known by anyone...","After all, it likely contains the major cause and effect of the \"Water Prison Sect’s extermination\".","Without thinking, Mo Hua stored the Jade Slip into his Storage Ring.","The incomplete forbidden technique \"Senluo Water Prison\" can’t be learned, and Mo Hua turned his gaze to the other legacies.","The cultivation technique of \"Water Prison True Skill\" also can’t be learned.","Because it’s sect leader-exclusive and too expensive.","He’s like a \"poor kid\" who can’t afford to learn it.","Superior control technique \"Water Prison Skill\" also can’t be learned.","Mo Hua slightly assessed it; learning is possible, but it’s useless to learn.","His spiritual power foundation cannot sustain the consumption of such \"superior Daoist magic\".","Even if he forces himself to use it once, his spiritual power will nearly be depleted.","That’s because control-type superior Daoist magic consumes less spiritual power than offensive-type Daoist magic.","Other offensive-type superior Daoist magics don’t even need a glance from him.","Pouring effort into learning a control-type spell.","When casting, it nearly consumes all spiritual power; after use, the spiritual power is drained, and movement technique and concealment technique may both become unusable.","No matter how much he thinks about it, it seems too dumb...","Both \"Water Prison Skill\" and \"Water Prison True Skill\" were stored away by Mo Hua.","These two things are either unable to be learned or learned without any immediate use.","The only thing left is \"Water Shadow Illusion\".","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up.","This is a water system body skill, which he can learn, and it fits perfectly with his Daoist skill system.","Having already learned Water Passing Step in water system body skill.","But Water Shadow Illusion does not conflict with Water Passing Step; rather, they complement each other in some ways.","Water Passing Step excels in evasion and maneuvering during frontal confrontation.","While Water Shadow Illusion focuses on confusing the enemy, using water shadows to create openings to embrace kill opportunities.","He’s coveted this body skill for a long time.","Back when he saw Water Yama using Water Shadow Step, he paid close attention.","Now acquiring the superior \"Water Shadow Illusion\" compared to Water Shadow Step, naturally, there’s no reason not to learn it.","Mo Hua’s eyes sparkled.","Later, while learning formation and swordsmanship, Mo Hua also took time to start learning the highest body skill legacy of the Water Prison Sect—Water Shadow Illusion.","Having the foundation of Water Passing Step made this water shadow body skill relatively easy to start.","But Mo Hua found the actual effect to be somewhat poor.","To test this newly learned Water Shadow Illusion, he specially sought out Situ Jian for a simple spar in the Dao Room.","Resulting in being beaten with no ability to counter.","Either unable to distinguish water shadows, suffering hits for nothing;","or differentiating too slowly, failing to dodge;","or after dividing, finding no direction, accidentally bumping into Situ.","In summary, many problems.","Not to mention his original idea of flexibly switching and seamlessly integrating Water Shadow Illusion with Water Passing Step.","The idea is wonderful, but practical application is riddled with challenges.","Mo Hua felt a little down for a while, but didn’t mind much.","Old Kui taught him from childhood: any Daoist skill requires mastery and application.","The deeper mastered and more skillfully applied a Daoist skill is, the stronger it becomes.","A random cultivator carelessly picking up a high-grade Daoist skill won’t suddenly become powerful.","If there were, that Daoist skill must be a demon skill, eventually leading to rebound.","To reach a certain mastery in any Daoist skill, cultivators need persistent hard work and research over time.","His Water Passing Step is like this.","This body skill was acquired from Zhang Lan. Back in Tongxian City, Mo Hua began learning it early, during the Qi Refinement stage.","Continuously pondering, summarizing, applying in actual combat, and gradually achieving current accomplishments with growing Divine Thought and spiritual power control finesse.","Although the Water Shadow Illusion has a high grade and lofty legacy status in the Water Prison Sect.","Mo Hua has just learned it, with too low proficiency and too little effort and dedication poured into this body skill.","Hence, the current effect of Water Shadow Illusion is far inferior to Water Passing Step; to achieve a small success, truly apply in combat, and use it smoothly, it requires much effort and gradual honing.","It’s not a skill mastered overnight.","Mo Hua understood this, thus maintaining a calm mindset.","Furthermore, for now, Water Passing Step suffices.","Water Shadow Illusion is an enhancement, not urgent at this moment.","He has ample time for gradual polishing.","Once in the future, should he master Water Shadow Illusion deeply, using it as smoothly as directing an arm, reaching peerless heights, combined with the exquisitely nimble Water Passing Step, his body skill will undergo a formidable transformation.","Unseeable, untouchable.","Uncatchable, unable to be killed.","Concealed within the illusion lies deadly danger; once others are deceived by the illusion, they may not even know how they died.","A flash of sharpness glinted in Mo Hua’s eyes.","...","A month passed thereafter.","Mo Hua remained focused and diligent in his cultivation."]},{"number":1712,"title":"Chapter 1712 - 874: Water Shadow_3","paragraphs":["Tao Cultivation is like water drops wearing stone, accumulated and settled bit by bit in seemingly dry daily life.","Over time, Mo Hua’s Formation and movement techniques both solidly and steadily improved.","Although the Swordsmanship was moderate, it was also advancing slowly.","At the same time, there was an ominous heaviness looming over the higher echelons of the Taixu Gate, as if a storm was about to break.","Occasionally, Elders from the Tai’a Sect and the Rushing Void Sect would often be seen walking around inside the Taixu Gate, discussing something unknown.","Mo Hua secretly asked Elder Master Xun what was happening.","Elder Master Xun just shook his head and said, \"These matters are not for you to worry about; just focus on learning Formation.\"","Mo Hua hesitated, ultimately remained silent, and only responded, \"Yes...\"","But clearly, he couldn’t entirely set his mind at ease.","He was a disciple of the Taixu Gate. Though of little importance, at such times he wished to help somehow.","Elder Master Xun observed this, pondered for a moment, and then solemnly said, \"If you can master the Formation, learn it to its peak, that would be the greatest help for my Taixu Gate.\"","These words were weighty, and Elder Master Xun spoke them with utmost seriousness.","Mo Hua was taken aback; he understood and nodded earnestly, \"Elder, rest assured, I will learn well.\"","Elder Master Xun looked deeply at Mo Hua, nodding in satisfaction.","After this, Mo Hua kept Elder Master Xun’s instructions in mind, paying no attention to other matters and focusing solely on learning Formation.","He intended to continue cultivating steadily like this, but still, some unexpected occurrences happened...","That day, after finishing practicing Swordsmanship, Mo Hua read some Sword Dao heart principles, then read Formation Books for a while. As it was nearing 1 p.m, he lay on the bed early, and his Divine Sense sunk into the Sea of Consciousness.","In the Sea of Consciousness, Mo Hua sat in meditation for a while.","But shortly after, the originally silent Sea of Consciousness was suddenly filled with an eerie laughter.","It was Mo Hua himself laughing.","His face was pitch black, becoming extremely sinister.","Mo Hua raised his hand, covering his face.","The laughter stopped.","Mo Hua’s expression returned to normal, but his brows furrowed.","\"Are you happy?\"","Mo Hua asked aloud.","There was deathly silence around. After a while, Mo Hua’s expression again began to distort, transforming into the visage of an Evil Baby, with a sharp voice laughing:","\"I didn’t expect you to be such a perfect Divine Fetus, more ’perfect’ than I thought.\"","\"Your Sea of Consciousness is the best nursery; your Divine Sense is a supreme supplement; and your Divine Soul shows signs of transforming into Divine Marrow...\"","\"The most wonderful thing is the fusion of Divinity and humanity!\"","\"Such a Divine Soul, I’ve never seen; once I transform you, my true form will descend, equating to possessing a demigod body.\"","\"This is the true flesh and Divine presence!\"","\"Because of being flesh-bound, evil desires are naturally complete.\"","\"And because it’s an Evil God, Evil Thoughts are undying and imperishable.\"","\"In the Divine Authority status of the Great Wilderness, among the three thousand Divine Remains, hundreds of incarnations, and various Divine Fetuses, you will be the most special existence!\"","\"And you... will be me!\"","The Evil Baby was very excited.","Mo Hua frowned, \"You talk a lot. Are all Evil Gods such chatterboxes?\"","The Evil Baby’s face turned ugly instantly, but then it sneered sullenly:","\"Mere mortals, no matter how high your Cultivation, I disdain you. But you are different, you are qualified, you are worthy of me talking this much to you.\"","Mo Hua said, \"Why don’t you come out, and we talk?\"","The Evil Baby let out a mocking laugh, but didn’t respond.","Mo Hua was a bit disdainful, \"Coward.\"","The Evil Baby’s face turned ferocious, but suddenly calm, revealing a hint of madness:","\"I tolerate your rudeness, because sooner or later, you are me, and I am you. Therefore, my tolerance of you is also tolerance of myself.\"","Mo Hua’s gaze turned slightly dangerous, \"Aren’t you afraid that I will slaughter you?\"","The Evil Baby, using Mo Hua’s face, let out a sinister laugh:","\"You cannot kill me; Evil Thoughts are undying and imperishable. Even if you’re just half-step Taoist, half deity, even if you’re a true deity, you can’t do anything to me...\"","\"Sooner or later, you will be mine...\"","\"I look forward to that day...\"","The Evil Baby let out a final eerie laugh, then completely submerged into Mo Hua’s Life Soul, no longer revealing any trace of its presence.","And 1 p.m has arrived.","The Taoist Stele emerged.","The bright red Robbery Thunder on the Taoist Stele still exuded a dangerous aura, capable of obliterating everything.","Yet the Evil Baby was gone.","Or rather, it merged with Mo Hua, leaving not a trace of evidence.","It was like a venomous snake lurking in the shadows, ready to pounce anytime to bite someone.","Mo Hua was left frustrated and irritable.","This little bastard dared to sneak onto his face!","And taunt me?","What does it mean?","Mo Hua forced himself to calm down, pondering silently:","\"Is this little scoundrel trying to disturb my Taoist Heart?\"","\"Or is it trying to affect my state of mind, make me restless or fearful, so it can take advantage and occupy the nest?\"","After all, Evil Gods are best at manipulating the human heart.","And all weaknesses, greed, unease, fear, and anxiety in the human heart, could become unseen openings for an Evil God.","Mo Hua furrowed his brows tightly.","This Evil Embryo is a significant hidden danger.","No matter what, it cannot be allowed to continue unchecked.","Never has an Evil Spirit dared to be so arrogant in his presence.","Even if this Evil Spirit is an Evil God’s Divine Fetus, he cannot tolerate it.","He needs to find a way...","Mo Hua’s eyes turned a bit cold.","Afterward, he had no interest in drawing Formations and pondered this matter the entire night.","The next day, he calmed his mindset, continued to immerse himself in cultivation and studying Formation, not allowing the Evil Embryo’s matter to affect himself.","Three days later, it was once again the seven-day period.","In the Disciple’s Residence, the void shattered, cracks opened, and a withered hand reached in.","Mo Hua was again seized and taken to the Back Hill Forbidden Area.","Patriarch Dugu was still sitting in the Sword Tomb.","This time, he again lectured Mo Hua on Swordsmanship, conveniently checking Mo Hua’s progress in learning Swordsmanship.","Mo Hua’s Swordsmanship was still the same, moderate and steady.","Patriarch Dugu, as always, showed neither surprise nor joy.","After explaining his understanding of Sword Dao, and checking Mo Hua’s Swordsmanship progress, Patriarch Dugu raised his hand, preparing to send Mo Hua back to the Disciple’s Residence.","Mo Hua suddenly said, \"Patriarch, I have some questions I’d like to ask.\"","Patriarch Dugu paused, slowly lowering his raised hand, nodding, \"Ask.\"","Mo Hua pondered, \"Patriarch, you previously told me that in the existing sword moves of the Taixu Mind Transforming Sword True Jue, there are a total of four forms...\"","\"The Transforming Sword Skill is foundational, turning Divine Thought into Sword Intent...\"","\"The Shocking God Skill is an advanced moves, manifesting Sword Intent to intimidate enemies...\"","\"What about the other two? What Sword Dao principles and Divine Thought transformations do they contain? Ultimately, how can one cultivate the God-breaking Skill, and the final move...\"","Mo Hua’s gaze sharpened slightly:","\"...the God Slaying Technique!\""]},{"number":1713,"title":"Chapter 1713 - 875: God-slaying","paragraphs":["Patriarch Dugu frowned slightly, \"Sword cultivation must proceed step by step; one must not aim too high too soon.\"","Mo Hua nodded and said, \"Ancestor, you are right, but you also said that in Sword Dao, there must be a beginning and an end. Once there is a starting point, the endpoint becomes clear, and only then can there be direction.\"","\"I am now practicing Sword Qi daily, which is the starting point of Sword Dao. The sword moves of Divine Thought into sword is the endpoint. With a beginning and an end, I have a direction to strive toward learning swordsmanship.\"","Patriarch Dugu was taken aback.","This child speaks with eloquence, with reasoning one after another.","He is different from all the sword Dao disciples I taught before.","This child’s Taoist Heart is clear, he is sincere with people, and his character is natural. Though he respects me, he is not like other disciples, who are cautious and overly restrained.","Previous disciples, even Xuan Er, revered this Ancestor, and during teaching, did not dare to say too much.","Not to mention someone like Mo Hua, who often asks a bunch of peculiar questions and occasionally makes small requests...","However, what he said is also correct: although laying a good foundation in Sword Dao is important, so too is having a goal and direction.","Ultimately, one must let him know why he is learning it.","Patriarch Dugu nodded, \"Very well, I will explain it to you briefly.\"","Mo Hua’s spirit was lifted, he quickly said, \"Thank you, Ancestor!\"","Then he sat up straight, listening attentively.","Patriarch Dugu pondered for a moment, then slowly said, \"From Sword Weapon, to Sword Qi cultivation, to Sword Intent transformation, and then to Divine Thought Sword Form.\"","\"The sword forms of Divine Thought into sword currently have four moves: Sword Transformation, Soul-Shocking, God-breaking, and God Slaying. These four forms are not independent of each other; instead, they progress from shallow to deep, step by step...\"","\"Transforming Sword Skill is the foundation and also the entry point, it is a process of further manifesting Sword Intent, shaping the sword, turning the tangible into intangible, and then from intangible to tangible.\"","\"This sword form, seemingly fundamental, contains profound Sword Dao implications. From this point on, the intangible ’Sword Intent’ becomes tangible ’Sword Form.’\"","\"But this ’tangible’ sword form is essentially still the ’intangible’ Sword Intent.\"","\"Interchange of tangible and intangible, both tangible and intangible, you cannot comprehend this now, but in the future...\"","Saying this, Patriarch Dugu paused, suddenly realizing that he had not taught Foundation Establishment Disciples for a long time, and had inadvertently strayed too far.","The way of tangible and intangible is the realization of the Heaven Void Realm; it’s too early to be talking about it with this child...","However, he turned to look, and saw Mo Hua’s eyes bright, listening with relish, unsure if he truly understood it or was just pretending to understand.","\"These things... when your cultivation reaches a certain level, you will understand.\"","Patriarch Dugu then continued:","\"Transforming Sword Skill is a foundation, an entry, but it’s too weak. Even if it has been transformed into a sword, it must be carefully nurtured and not used lightly, let alone to kill...\"","\"Therefore, if Divine Thought into sword is to be used in actual combat, the next step is the Soul-Shocking form.\"","Upon hearing this, Mo Hua was taken aback.","When he first comprehended \"Transforming Sword Skill,\" he eagerly used it to kill demons far and wide.","Up to now, he has used \"Transforming Sword Skill\" to slay countless demon monsters and evil spirits, even cutting down Evil Gods.","But now the Ancestor told him that \"Transforming Sword Skill\" is not meant for cutting down people...","This thing is actually just a \"mold,\" meant to be carefully nurtured...","Mo Hua’s mood suddenly became complicated.","Patriarch Dugu, unaware of Mo Hua’s thoughts, continued to explain:","\"Soul-Shocking form is to further integrate the Sword Intent honed over decades or even hundreds of years into the ’Transforming Sword Skill,’ and then attempt ’Soul Emergence’ through the Divine Soul.\"","\"As long as your Sword Intent is strong enough, and honed to be sharp enough, then when the Sword Intent emerges, the intimidation on others becomes more terrifying.\"","\"Even with a pure Sword Heart, some cultivators who have perfected the ’Soul-Shocking Sword,’ can, during combat, make opponents tremble in fear with just a hint of Sword Intent, without even fighting.\"","\"Sword sheathed, killing intent contained; when unleashed, Ghost Gods tremble.\"","...","This is considered the proper training method for Soul-Shocking Sword.","Mo Hua nodded.","Although Divine Thought Sword Cultivators carry the \"Divine Thought\" in their name, in essence, all methods originate from the ’sword,’ entering Dao through the sword, and using powerful Sword Intent to intimidate opponents.","His own \"Soul-Shocking Sword,\" in contrast, seems a bit like \"taking shortcuts.\"","Since his Sword Dao skills were lacking, he borrowed the \"Refining Something Evil\" spell point from the Water Prison Sect, transforming and using it. Therefore, while casting a Pupil Skill to intimidate enemies, it’s not purely Sword Intent intimidation, but more about relying on the Taoist Prison Heart Image, and the pains of the Prison Punishment to intimidate and instill fear.","Mo Hua wasn’t sure which was superior but knew his Pupil Skill was certainly \"not proper.\"","But since he had already learned it, he couldn’t just abandon it halfway.","Moreover, the orthodox \"Soul-Shocking Sword\" does not conflict with his Seven Souls \"Sword Eyes\" skill.","On the contrary, if he learned the orthodox Soul-Shocking Sword well, his Pupil Skill would become stronger.","He now roughly had a roadmap in his mind for the advancement of the Soul-Shocking Sword.","Having heard about Transforming Sword Skill and Soul-Shocking form, Mo Hua roughly understood. So he asked again, \"Ancestor, what about the God-breaking Skill?\"","Patriarch Dugu said solemnly, \"The God-breaking Skill and God Slaying Technique are quite different. Transforming Sword Skill is the entry point, Soul-Shocking form is enlightenment. Reaching the God-breaking Skill means Divine Thought into sword is slightly accomplished. Mastering the God Slaying Technique is considered a major achievement, allowing you to take on the world, slaying demons and eliminating evil.\"","\"Oh, oh!\" Mo Hua’s gaze filled with anticipation.","Patriarch Dugu’s eyes focused: \"Breaking Sword Form concentrates Sword Intent, converging it at one point. Its killing power is not large, but its penetration is strong.\"","\"Some demon monsters and evil spirits in the world have innate abilities, naturally possessing evil thoughts, with Evil Evil forming armor, their skin hard as iron.\"","\"Only by breaking through their armor can you harm their soul.\""]},{"number":1714,"title":"Chapter 1714 - 875: God-slaying (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"On the contrary, if the armor cannot be broken, no amount of Sword Qi can harm it in the slightest...\"","\"The Breaking Sword Form, when cultivated to a high level, can break all evil spirits and Demon Armor.\"","Mo Hua was slightly stunned.","Breaking Sword Form... Armor-breaking?","Do Demon Monsters wear armor?","He thought back a little and finally remembered that among the countless Demon Monsters he had killed, there indeed seemed to be a small part that wore \"armor.\"","This kind of \"armor\" looked quite primitive.","Some resembled ordinary rough iron, while others looked more like the fur and scales of the Demon Monsters themselves.","And when he strangled these Demon Monsters, the feel of this \"armor\" was indeed quite hard.","But in the Dao of Divine Thought, he could \"break all techniques with brute force.\"","No matter how hard the Demon Armor, he could hammer it completely with a few more punches.","If it weren’t for the Patriarch’s mention, he wouldn’t have realized that this \"armor\" had another explanation.","The intricacies in the Dao of Divine Thought were indeed quite numerous...","At this time, Patriarch Dugu finally spoke of the last technique.","\"Godslaying Sword...\"","In Patriarch Dugu’s eyes, there was a hint of sharpness, \"It is the culmination of the Taixu Mind Transforming Sword True Jue, and also the most powerful move...\"","Mo Hua was mentally revitalized, his ears perked up.","Patriarch Dugu continued, \"Its power is the greatest, yet it is also the most difficult to learn.\"","\"The Godslaying Sword, whether to slay humans, slay demons, or even ultimately slay gods, the first thing to be slain is oneself.\"","\"Use Sword Intent to continually temper your Life Soul until, ultimately, they are united as one.\"","\"The sword is life, it is also the soul.\"","\"In this way, the Divine Soul will also take on the shape of a sword, capable of slaying all objects of Divine Thought.\"","\"This is a process for a Sword Cultivator to fully integrate their sword, their Dao, their life, and their soul.\"","\"This process will be exceptionally painful and requires extreme caution.\"","\"Especially during the process of tempering the soul with the sword, the harm sword intent can do to the Divine Soul is immense. A slight misstep, and instead of mastering the God Slaying Technique, one might cut their own Divine Soul...\"","Patriarch Dugu’s expression was supremely grave.","Evidently, such examples of self-slaying during God Slaying cultivation were not exceptions in the history of the Taixu Gate.","Mo Hua, however, was moved in his heart and couldn’t help but ask:","\"Patriarch, how exactly does one cultivate to temper the soul with the sword, to self-slay the Divine Soul?\"","Patriarch Dugu said silently:","\"This is the highest secret transmission of Divine Thought into swords. It can’t be told to you now, and telling you now would only harm you.\"","Mo Hua was unwilling to give up, pondered, and then said, \"Then will you teach me in the future?\"","Patriarch Dugu pondered for a while, then slowly nodded.","Since he promised to teach Mo Hua the Divine Thought into sword, he would naturally not break his promise.","When the conditions allowed, he would naturally teach it.","Even though the Divine Thought into sword is currently classified as a forbidden technique in the Taixu Gate.","And the soul tempering method of the God Slaying Technique is the most \"taboo\" of this forbidden technique.","\"You mean you’ll teach me sooner or later?\" Mo Hua asked again.","Patriarch Dugu thought for a moment, nodded, and said, \"Yes.\"","\"In that case,\" Mo Hua said, \"since you’ll teach me sooner or later, why not tell me now so I can be mentally prepared.\"","Patriarch Dugu frowned, \"What mental preparation is required?\"","Mo Hua said, \"It’s just that I’ll eventually learn the ’God Slaying Technique’ mental preparation!\"","Patriarch Dugu was a bit speechless.","This child, can’t even crawl yet, but thinking of flying.","\"Your Sword Qi is too weak, your foundation is too poor. You are still a long way from being able to learn the Godslaying Sword, so I can’t teach you now,\" Patriarch Dugu still refused.","Mo Hua tried persuading again and again, but no matter what he said, Patriarch Dugu remained unmoved.","Mo Hua sighed, feeling somewhat dejected.","Seeing Mo Hua dispirited, Patriarch Dugu suddenly felt a little guilty.","Despite Mo Hua’s poor Sword Dao aptitude, he was very diligent, eager to learn, and was currently the only \"sole progeny\" left in the Taixu Gate still cultivating Divine Thought into swords.","He shouldn’t suppress his enthusiasm too much.","Patriarch Dugu’s tone carried a hint of gentleness, even if he himself didn’t realize it:","\"You are still young now; it’s too early to learn this. Don’t be too hasty. Tempering the soul with the sword is extremely dangerous and too profound for you to learn now.\"","Seeing Patriarch Dugu soften a bit, Mo Hua immediately said, \"I won’t learn it, just study it.\"","\"Study?\" Patriarch Dugu was stunned.","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"My Sword Qi progresses too slowly. At this pace, who knows how many donkey’s years it will be before I can learn the real Divine Thought into swords. This can’t be helped, learning the sword isn’t accomplished in one fell swoop, but...\"","\"My Sword Dao foundation is weak, but my Divine Thought foundation is very strong.\"","\"So, why not first study it from the perspective of the Divine Sense, and figure out the principle of Divine Thought into swords at the Divine Thought level.\"","\"This way, Sword Qi and Divine Thought progress together without hindrance.\"","\"When my Sword Qi is accomplished, I will have also done some research into the changes of Divine Thought into swords in the Divine Thought, so learning it will surely be twice as effective with half the effort...\"","Mo Hua said confidently.","Patriarch Dugu was silent.","Mo Hua’s words were not without reason...","Moreover, it reminded him.","The reason why he was willing to teach Mo Hua Divine Thought into swords, besides the cause and effect with Xuan Er, was mainly because Mo Hua had strong Divine Thought and was on the path of \"Divine Sense Proving the Dao.\"","Sword Dao too weak, Divine Thought too strong.","In this way, perhaps it couldn’t be taught in the usual, gradual method.","Allowing him to get in touch with some Divine Thought Sword Dao techniques in advance might not be a bad thing either.","But...","Patriarch Dugu glanced at Mo Hua, \"Are you really just going to research, and not practice?\""]},{"number":1715,"title":"Chapter 1715 - 875: God-slaying_3","paragraphs":["Mo Hua nodded repeatedly, \"Of course! I’m not an idiot. How could I practice now.\"","\"Moreover, I can’t even cultivate Sword Intent, and I don’t know the basic Transforming Sword Skill. Even if I want to learn more advanced sword forms, I simply can’t... \"","Mo Hua’s eyes flickered slightly.","Patriarch Dugu immediately furrowed his brows.","By intuition, he felt there was something wrong with Mo Hua’s words, as if there was some dishonesty.","But where is the \"dishonesty\"?","If what he said was false, then it would mean he has cultivated Sword Intent, learned the \"Transforming Sword Skill\", and can also learn the more advanced Divine Thought Sword Form?","That’s even more impossible.","Patriarch Dugu looked at Mo Hua, and finally nodded slowly, \"Alright, if you just want to research, I can first give you... the secret of the God-breaking Skill.\"","\"What about the God Slaying Technique?\"","\"Only the God-breaking Skill, not the God Slaying Technique.\"","It’s too difficult, and extremely powerful, with a heavy murderous nature.","Mo Hua asked in a small voice, \"Can I have both?\"","Patriarch Dugu almost laughed from anger.","\"What are you thinking?\"","\"Then I want the God Slaying Technique!\" Mo Hua insisted.","The God-breaking Skill’s \"surprise victory\" approach is not something he particularly needs on the path of Divine Thought.","He needs one sword to cut through all techniques.","No matter the demon monster, evil embryo, or evil god, cut them all with one sword!","Since the ancestor compromised, he’ll persist, even if he has to thicken his skin.","Otherwise, he might miss this opportunity.","He must have the Godslaying Sword!","Patriarch Dugu saw Mo Hua’s stubbornness, helplessly said, \"Then it’s the God-slaying one...\"","Anyway, whether it’s God-breaking or God-slaying, there’s no difference.","Mo Hua was overjoyed.","Patriarch Dugu made a slash with his fingers, ripped through the void, took out three bamboo scrolls, but after thinking, he put back two, and handed the first one to Mo Hua.","\"This is the method to temper the soul with the sword.\"","Mo Hua solemnly received the bamboo scroll, finding that it was empty, with only an ancient knife-engraved sword on it.","Mo Hua appeared puzzled, \"Ancestor, what does this mean?\"","Patriarch Dugu simply said, \"The path of God-slaying is within it. You’ll have to comprehend it yourself. If you understand it, it means you can understand it. If not, it means you still don’t get it.\"","Mo Hua felt a slight tingle on his scalp.","As expected of the ancestor, this subtlety shot was like it without shooting...","But upon careful consideration, it seemed to make sense.","If he can understand it, then even if the ancestor doesn’t say, he could figure it out.","If he doesn’t get it, it shows that he doesn’t have deep enlightenment or enough control, so he shouldn’t even talk about \"God-breaking\" or \"God-slaying\"; he should continue practicing Sword Qi from the basics.","However...","Mo Hua asked again, \"Ancestor, weren’t there three bamboo scrolls?\"","He had sharp eyes and saw the ancestor take out three bamboo scrolls from an unknown void.","Patriarch Dugu’s face turned black, \"Only one.\"","Mo Hua stared at him.","Patriarch Dugu’s expression was as calm as water.","Fine, one is just one...","Getting something for free is not to be greedy.","The ancestor giving him this one bamboo scroll was already a great favor and shouldn’t be taken for granted.","\"Thank you, ancestor!\" Mo Hua said gratefully.","For some reason, Patriarch Dugu silently breathed a sigh of relief.","\"Remember what I told you, you can look and think, but don’t practice.\"","Then Patriarch Dugu instructed, \"Also, keep this bamboo scroll safe, don’t let outsiders see it, and never lose it. Return it after reading...\"","Mo Hua agreed wholeheartedly, \"Rest assured, ancestor, I’ve remembered it all!\"","The hour was late, and afterward, Patriarch Dugu sent Mo Hua back to the Disciple’s Residence.","Back at the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua couldn’t sleep at all; almost immediately, he took out the bamboo scroll that Patriarch Dugu gave, no, temporarily lent him.","The bamboo scroll was very rough, like someone picked a bamboo strip and casually carved it.","But the simplicity revealed a sense of Great Dao’s naturalness, returning to the original state.","On the bamboo scroll, there was a sword, the engravings ancient and profound.","Mo Hua stared at the sword scar.","After a long time, he saw nothing.","Turning Divine Thought into a sword is not only difficult to learn, even the legacy is so obscure.","Mo Hua shook his head.","Yet no matter how difficult, as long as it involves the Divine Sense, Mo Hua has enough confidence and experience to deduce and study it bit by bit.","After spending about two days without sleep or food, Mo Hua finally gained some insight.","This Sword Dao Bamboo Scroll, essentially has a remarkable similarity to the \"Water Prison Forbidden Box\" of the Gui Water Sect.","It’s a type of \"similar\" Contemplation Map.","Though not a Contemplation Map, it relies on a \"map\" to engrave the legacy, where the cultivator gains the inheritance through contemplation.","\"Should I try learning it?\"","Mo Hua was a bit conflicted.","The God Slaying Technique is very strong, but it requires tempering the soul with the sword, and the risk of self-slashing the Life Soul is equally great.","Moreover, he’s essentially \"skipping grades\" in learning.","Skipping the orthodox Taixu \"Soul-Shocking Sword,\" skipping the Sword Intent condensation, Evil-breaking \"God-breaking Sword,\" and directly starting to learn the final \"Godslaying Sword.\"","But not learning seems not an option either.","The evil embryo residing in the Life Soul is like a thorn in his back, a bone in his throat.","Mo Hua must get rid of it.","\"Try it first...\"","At midnight, Mo Hua burned incense and bathed, meditated and sat calmly, then took out the bamboo scroll, ready to temper the soul with the sword, practicing the God Slaying Sword Form.","He focused his eyes on the bamboo scroll, contemplating the ancient sword engraving on the scroll.","At first, nothing happened.","Mo Hua felt no different.","But gradually, the calmer his mindset, the longer he contemplated, the sword scar on the bamboo scroll began to change.","This sword scar seemed to slowly transform into a sword.","This sword, formless and intangible, contained an ancient, vast Sword Intent, with a vague power of Yin and Yang division, Taixu rotation.","And Mo Hua’s Divine Thought communicated with this sword.","The tip of this sword also pointed at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua was taken aback, then suddenly understood.","His eyes turned cold, gritting his teeth, hardening his heart, he silently chanted in his heart:","\"Slash!\"","Sword Intent instantly broke through the void, through Mo Hua’s eyes, directly into his Sea of Consciousness, slashing towards his Life Soul.","A burst of intense pain erupted.","A sharp, piercing scream followed.","This scream came from Mo Hua, but it wasn’t Mo Hua who screamed.","At the same time, Mo Hua’s face turned dark and sinister, transforming into the Evil Baby, shrieking:","\"Ignorant fool! What are you doing? Are you trying to die?!\""]},{"number":1716,"title":"Chapter 1716 - 876: Self-Severance","paragraphs":["Mo Hua realized that the Evil Embryo was getting anxious.","When an enemy is anxious, it means you’re doing the right thing.","If the enemy is anxious, it means you’re doing something right.","Mo Hua struck even harder.","The ancient Sword Intent within the Bamboo Sword transformed into a massive, substantial, and immensely heavy Giant Sword, as vast as the void, brutally slashing onto his Life Soul.","It felt like being cleaved in half by a single sword.","A wave of immense pain surged through.","Mo Hua gritted his teeth, frowned, enduring this \"self-slashing Life Soul\" ripping pain.","But the Evil Embryo felt even more pain.","Within Mo Hua’s Life Soul, seven souls were hidden.","He only slashed one soul, the Fushi Soul where the Evil Embryo resided.","While the Evil Embryo parasitized Mo Hua’s Life Soul, it only occupied one soul, so Mo Hua’s slash was only a seventh of himself.","Yet, it was the whole of the Evil Embryo.","The pain of the Evil Embryo was at least seven times his, with the injuries equally sevenfold.","With this thought, Mo Hua suddenly found it not so painful.","\"This little lamb dared to tread on my face, disturb my Taoist Heart; I will teach it a lesson!\"","Mo Hua steeled himself and slashed thrice more.","These three strikes, with immense force, made the Evil Baby howl in heart-rending agony, thereafter cursing:","\"You reckless little beast! Do you truly seek death?!\"","\"To slash your own Life Soul, aren’t you afraid of perishing completely?!\"","Mo Hua paid no heed to the Evil Baby.","His actions were straightforward; if he could move his hands, he would never move his mouth.","Once the other can’t act, only then would he speak.","Only if he’s utterly unable to beat others would he resort to speaking.","But now clearly, he held the upper hand, \"the advantage is mine,\" so to speak would be a waste of time.","Mo Hua slashed another sword.","The Evil Baby screamed in agony and knew Mo Hua was determined, then shrieked: \"Don’t forget, I am you and you are me. To slash me is to slash yourself.\"","\"Nonsense.\"","Mo Hua said coldly, then slashed again.","The heart-tearing pain spread to Mo Hua’s Divine Soul, sevenfold to the Evil Baby.","The Evil Baby, in torment, finally grinned madly, using all its might, forcefully broke through the Divine Seal Mo Hua set, emerging from the Fushi Soul, trying to gasp for breath.","The Evil Baby emerged.","Simultaneously, behind Mo Hua, another head \"grew\" out of nowhere, pitch-black and sinister, ugly and malicious.","It was the head of the Evil Baby.","And at the moment the Evil Baby emerged, Mo Hua’s eyes lit up.","His small hand darting like lightning, reached backward, directly grabbing the Evil Baby’s neck. Without a word, he dragged it by the neck towards the Taoist Stele.","On the Taoist Stele, the vivid red Robbery Thunder looked startling.","Suddenly, the Evil Baby, choked by Mo Hua, felt a chill in its heart, \"This brat got me!\"","Then it perceived the devastating aura on the Taoist Stele, overwhelming fear nesting in its heart.","The Evil Embryo unthinkingly, enduring pain, shed a layer of skin, turning into a puddle of black water, narrowly fusing back into Mo Hua’s Life Soul.","When Mo Hua’s hand approached the Robbery Thunder, the Evil Baby gripped in his hand had vanished.","Only some viscous black water remained.","It seemed to be the Evil Baby’s shed skin.","\"Molting?\"","Mo Hua frowned slightly.","Where did this little lamb learn such a trick? It didn’t know this move before?","Or is this also a part of its innate divine ability, slowly surfaced as memories awakened?","Mo Hua found it troublesome, yet felt a touch of pity.","\"So close...\"","Initially, by using the cultivation method of the Godslaying Sword, self-slashing the Life Soul, to cause the Evil Baby unbearable pain, forcing it out of the Fushi Soul.","Then, taking advantage of its furious distraction, captured it swiftly with the speed of lightning, planning to use the Robbery Thunder to annihilate it once and for all.","But sadly, the Evil Baby was too astute, learning the bizarre \"molting\" technique.","If it were slower in reaction.","Or if it couldn’t \"molt.\"","It would be dead this time for sure.","The \"duck\" he nearly caught flew away, leaving Mo Hua unhappy.","And after the Evil Baby merged back into Mo Hua’s Life Soul, it remained utterly silent, not daring to reveal a trace of presence.","Mo Hua said: \"Hey, come out.\"","\"Weren’t you quite arrogant before?\"","The Evil Baby was silent.","\"If you don’t come out, I’ll slash you again,\" Mo Hua said.","Even so, the Evil Baby remained curled in the Fushi Soul, afraid to stir.","Once an Evil Embryo, now a frightened bird.","Mo Hua clenched his teeth, channeled the ancient Sword Intent, slashing his Divine Soul once more.","This slash was immensely painful, the Evil Baby finally couldn’t bear it, saying viciously:","\"Fine, keep slashing... \"","\"Evil Thoughts linger, undying and eternal. I want to see who among us has a tougher life, see who dies first...\"","Thereafter, it completely went into hiding.","No matter how Mo Hua slashed, it made no sound.","Mo Hua could no longer afford to keep slashing because slashing the Life Soul was indeed extremely painful.","If the Evil Baby screamed from being slashed, he would have a comparison, feeling a bit more at ease.","But now the Evil Baby \"played dead,\" if he kept slashing, he would only feel his own suffering.","Mo Hua then stopped.","And once he stopped, the cracks slashed out by the ancient sword in his Life Soul ached as if being cut with knives.","Mo Hua clutched his head, his body trembling from the pain.","\"It’s over, slashed too much...\"","During the slashing, it wasn’t obvious, but afterward, the residual pain began to surf ace little by little.","The pain was intensifying.","Mo Hua hastily mobilized his Divine Thought, using the remaining Divine Marrow to mend the wounds on his Divine Soul."]},{"number":1717,"title":"Chapter 1717 - 876: Self-Severance (Part 2)","paragraphs":["The divine marrow slowly seeped into the body, like an all-powerful spiritual medicine, repairing the wounds on Mo Hua’s divine soul.","And just at this moment, as if sensing the aura of the divine marrow, the evil embryo showed some disturbance, with a hint of greed.","But ultimately it didn’t dare to show its head and snatch Mo Hua’s divine marrow.","\"Consider yourself lucky...\"","Mo Hua snorted coldly.","However, afterwards, his heart was not at ease.","This time he gave this little lamb a lesson, but the end result was somewhat a \"lose-lose\" situation.","Of course, the evil embryo had lost more.","Compared to the evil embryo, he was a \"small loss.\"","But continuing like this is not a solution either...","Although he suppressed the arrogance of the evil embryo, his own divine soul had also suffered a certain degree of damage.","With the sword tempering the soul, divine soul self-slashing, just as Patriarch Dugu said, is an extremely dangerous cultivation method.","Even he couldn’t endure it, let alone others.","Mo Hua sighed in his heart.","Those predecessors of Taixu Gate who did not walk the path of divine sense proving the Dao, nor had their divine thought transformed into Taoism, and managed to successful cultivate the \"God Slaying Technique\" through their own efforts, their talent was strong, their mind was firm, and their comprehension was high, all of which were admirable.","Slaying one’s own life soul is truly too difficult...","\"Then should I continue to learn this God Slaying Technique?\"","Mo Hua frowned slightly.","He sat cross-legged on the ground, pondered deeply for a while, and silently firmed his resolve.","I still have to persist in learning it.","Even if the divine soul is injured, I must learn it.","If this were usual times, it would be fine. He could learn it a bit later, or follow the teachings of Patriarch Dugu, proceed step by step, learn the God Slaying Technique steadily, learn it slower, without too much impact.","But now it is different.","The evil embryo is parasitic in his life soul, nourished by his sea of consciousness, still slowly awakening divine skills, regaining memory, from whichever angle one looks, it is a tremendous hidden danger.","This hidden danger must be eliminated.","This evil embryo is also forcing him to learn the God Slaying Technique.","If he doesn’t learn it, cannot slay this evil baby, in the future with just a bit of accident, letting this evil baby seize the opportunity, he could very likely be completely polluted, becoming a puppet of the Great Wilderness Evil God.","Therefore, the Godslaying Sword must be learned!","His opponent is the evil embryo, and even in the future could be the evil god.","The Taoist Stele and Robbery Thunder, although they are in his sea of consciousness, are considered \"external objects.\"","Whereas the \"Godslaying Sword,\" is the only technique he can actively control and can counter-kill the evil god.","His own life must be held in his own hands.","Mo Hua’s gaze was determined.","And now the only issue is the injury left behind after the life soul self-slashing.","The divine marrow can repair the injuries of the divine soul, but after these few damage experiences of the divine soul, the divine marrow in Mo Hua’s possession is not much left.","With less divine marrow, Mo Hua’s current divine thought taoism is also somewhat weaker.","The divine thought incarnation is far from being as golden and brilliant as before.","\"This is indeed a problem...\"","And currently, he has no means to replenish the divine marrow, and combined with being constrained by the evil embryo, needs to spend a lot of time learning formation and swordsmanship, it is even less possible to seek out altars everywhere.","Mo Hua frowned tightly.","Just then, he noticed his hands were dirty and sticky, lowered his head to see, only to find black sticky liquid on his palm.","It seemed to be the blood skin shed off forcibly by the evil embryo during its escape.","These black fluids were too dirty, Mo Hua felt a bit disgusted.","Moments later, he was suddenly taken aback, his eyes slightly lit up, and threw these filthy \"blood skins\" onto the Taoist Stele, the Robbery Thunder killed them.","A faint, terrifying howl that seemed like a demon monster rang out.","Afterwards the black gas was evaporated, evil thoughts were purified, and the originally filthy blood skin oozed out pure golden marrow liquid.","Moreover, this golden color was deeper and purer than any divine marrow he had acquired before, with a trace of luster.","Mo Hua wiped these divine marrow with his finger, licked it into his mouth, his eyes immediately brightened.","\"So pure!\"","Only a pity, the quantity was too small, he sucked it up a few times, and it was gone.","Mo Hua, still yearning, yet his mind was enlightened:","\"Almost forgot, the evil embryo is the embryo of the Great Wilderness Evil God, it naturally carries extremely rich divine marrow...\"","The evil embryo is parasitic in his life soul.","In other words, it’s like a \"divine marrow treasure trove,\" hidden within his divine soul.","It’s just that he needs to find a way to extract the divine marrow from this treasure trove...","Mo Hua’s eyes immediately sparkled.","This Godslaying Sword must be learned!","Slay the evil embryo, and there will be good things to savor!","But how to slay?","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, gradually forming a plan in his heart.","The Godslaying Sword, to some extent, is also an \"act of self-harm,\" hence it must not be rushed, slay one sword a day to avoid too much burden on the divine soul and too severe injury.","Just slay this one sword a day.","Use this \"one sword to temper the divine, self-slash life soul,\" to understand Godslaying Sword Intent, cultivate Godslaying Sword Forms.","Day after day, water drops stone wear.","Sooner or later, he can completely kill this evil embryo!","And if he can, relying on his own strength, with his divine thought, honor Taixu’s sword intent, and slay this evil embryo, it would in some sense mean...","His Godslaying Sword, if not fully accomplished, has at least achieved minor success!","This evil embryo is both his \"punching bag\" for practicing Godslaying Sword and his \"touchstone\" for testing the fire control of Godslaying Sword.","And once the evil embryo is completely slain, he can obtain a large amount of divine marrow.","With such pure, such rich divine marrow, it is enough to repair the accumulated damage from years of self-slashing life soul.","With disaster comes an opportunity."]},{"number":1718,"title":"Chapter 1718 - 876: Self-Decapitation_3","paragraphs":["This evil embryo is a calamity, but it’s also precisely the opportunity for me to cultivate the Godslaying Sword!","Mo Hua was momentarily filled with a mix of emotions but maintained a composed demeanor, even appearing troubled, and said painfully:","\"The backlash of this sword move was too severe. If I had known, I wouldn’t have used it...\"","This remark naturally reached the evil baby within his life soul.","The evil baby merely sneered as if mocking Mo Hua’s recklessness and ignorance.","Self-slashing the life soul, do you think you can escape the Five Decay of Heaven and Man, obtain Dao through corpse disintegration?","Truly, ignorance is fearless...","It initially believed that Mo Hua would stop once he felt the pain, but it never expected that this kid was undeterred and started slashing himself with a sword every day thereafter.","Not much, just one sword.","This single sword naturally couldn’t kill it, but it seemed more like a form of urging and humiliation.","The evil baby was angry but had to endure silently.","It was waiting, waiting for Mo Hua to continue this reckless behavior. Once he went too far with the self-slashing, he would undoubtedly experience a Dao transformation and face a major tribulation.","That would be its opportunity...","The evil baby grinned, but before it could finish, Mo Hua reprimanded:","\"Behave yourself!\"","\"Your expression is showing on my face. Don’t think I don’t know you’re sneering...\"","The evil baby’s face turned as black as ink.","...","Following this, Mo Hua continued slashing himself with a sword once a day.","A few days later, it was the seventh day when Patriarch Dugu broke open the void, grabbed Mo Hua, and took him to the back mountain to impart swordsmanship.","After imparting it, Patriarch Dugu glanced at Mo Hua and, seeing his somewhat weary expression, frowned and said:","\"You’ve injured your divine soul?\"","Mo Hua certainly couldn’t admit, so he just shook his head and said: \"Recently, I’ve been studying formations a lot, so my divine sense is excessively exhausted, making me a bit weary.\"","Patriarch Dugu was silent for a moment but didn’t suspect.","Mo Hua’s appearance could suggest either an injured divine soul or an excessively exhausted divine sense.","But generally, cultivators with wounded divine souls have vacant expressions, dull minds, a sea of consciousness often accompanied by sharp pain, symptoms much more severe than Mo Hua’s.","Although Mo Hua appeared somewhat weary, he was still quite spirited.","Patriarch Dugu didn’t pay much attention but made sure to remind, \"Cultivation emphasizes ’Water Drops Stone Wear,’ so don’t exhaust yourself overly.\"","\"Also, the sword marks on that bamboo scroll contain an ancient Tai Xu Gate sword intent, which is actually not something you can comprehend now, even if you can’t discern its secrets, don’t get discouraged.\"","\"Just by frequently contemplating it and being imbued by this sword intent will greatly benefit you when you truly learn the ’Godslaying Sword’ in the future.\"","Mo Hua expressed sincerely, \"Thank you, Ancestor, for your teachings!\"","Patriarch Dugu nodded, \"Go back.\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua bowed respectfully, \"Disciple takes leave.\"","Then he was sent back to the disciple’s residence by Patriarch Dugu.","Upon returning to the disciple residence, with some time before sunrise, Mo Hua seized the opportunity to immerse his divine sense into the sea of consciousness and practiced formation at the Taoist Stele.","After practicing formation, near dawn, Mo Hua finally withdrew from the sea of consciousness, took out the bamboo scroll, contemplated the sword form, and slashed himself with a sword.","This slash was very painful.","Mo Hua grinned through the pain, then mentally chanted, \"The evil embryo hurts more than me, the evil embryo hurts more than me...\"","Sure enough, the pain alleviated notably after a while.","But after slashing, Mo Hua suddenly recalled Patriarch Dugu’s guidance, especially regarding the ancient Tai Xu Sword intent on the bamboo scroll.","In his heart, he felt a slight sense of discord.","It seemed that the ancestor’s words were slightly conflicting with his own understanding.","But precisely where the conflict lay, Mo Hua couldn’t articulate.","A trace of concern emerged in Mo Hua’s mind:","\"Could I be... learning it wrong again?\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, thinking it impossible.","The Fireball Technique went awry because of his special divine sense.","The Transforming Sword Skill went wrong because of the lack of inheritance.","The Soul-Shocking Sword went amiss because no one taught it...","Now, Patriarch Dugu, sitting at the back mountain of the Tai Xu Gate and mastering the Divine Thought into Sword True Jue, had given him the Sword Dao Bamboo Scroll and taught him personally.","It was virtually impossible to learn it wrong again?","Mo Hua shook his head repeatedly.","Impossible, absolutely impossible!","Besides, I was clearly cultivating according to the eight words \"Refine the Mind with Sword, Self-slash Life Soul.\"","Not a single word was missing!","How could it be wrong?","Mo Hua completely put aside his worries.","The sun rose, and bright sunlight entered the disciple’s residence, marking the start of a new day.","After \"self-slashing a sword,\" invigorating and refreshing himself, Mo Hua revived his spirits and began a new cultivation.","He remembered Elder Master Xun’s instructions, disregarded other matters, focused on cultivation, and learning formations.","Yet during the days he was peacefully cultivating, the entire Qian Learning State Boundary was in turmoil.","Tai’a Sect.","In the Sect Leader Hall, the Tai’a Sect Leader and several elders were discussing.","\"Sect Leader, the negotiations have failed...\"","\"The Four Great Sects are exerting pressure, and the Taoist Court officials refuse to relent. The matter of the Rouge Boat can’t be suppressed; even if we want to delay, it’s impossible...\"","Another elder sighed: \"Our intention is to ’cut meat to feed eagles,’ give up some sect interests in exchange for some timing.\"","\"Those disciples who boarded the Rouge Boat and violated Taoist laws and sect rules are not unpunished but will be dealt with after this Dao Gathering.\"","\"After all, the sect reform is imminent, and this first Dao Gathering is too significant.\"","\"But... alas...\"","An elder said: \"It’s useless; this is obviously a setup, wiping out almost all the Heavenly Pride of our Tai’a Sect in it.\"","Immediately, Tai’a Sect Leader sneered: \"What Heavenly Pride? So young, they don’t focus on cultivation but learn to visit brothels, doing all sorts of improper things, do they deserve to be called Heavenly Pride?\""]},{"number":1719,"title":"Chapter 1719 - 876: Self-Severance_4","paragraphs":["He was tall and muscular, with slightly dark skin, square eyebrows and eyes, spoke directly, and didn’t have a very good temper.","The Tai’a Sect Leader got angrier the more he thought about it, then said furiously:","\"If it weren’t for the upcoming Dao Conference, I would have listened to your advice, considered the sect’s interests, and abolished the cultivation of these bastards one by one and expelled them from the Tai’a Sect. Why would I still need to maneuver all around and suffer the wrath of the Four Great Sects and the Court Officials?\"","The other elders didn’t dare to intervene.","However, an elderly, experienced elder sighed softly:","\"Worldly desires are colorful and tempting. They are young, their Taoist Hearts are unstable, and their Blood Qi is fervent. How could they withstand temptation?\"","\"Moreover, some disciples were evidently framed. They were threatened or coerced, and it was their first time going on that ship.\"","\"We elders were negligent and inattentive, failing to prevent it, and in the end, we aren’t without blame...\"","The Tai’a Sect Leader did not refute.","Not just the elders, but as the Sect Leader, he indeed also held responsibility.","He always thought about using this sect reform opportunity to further advance, but he didn’t realize while constantly looking upwards he failed to notice the trap laid below him, resulting in a bloody downfall.","An elder looked serious:","\"This time, things were too coincidental. If you say there is no calculation from the Four Great Sects, I absolutely would not believe it.\"","\"Even the Court Officials, or even the Central Dao Court, surely must be secretly aiding and abetting...\"","\"At this point, what use is there in saying these things?\"","\"Who doesn’t know they are scheming against us?\"","\"The important position of the Four Great Sects, how could it be handed over to others...\"","\"But this method is just too despicable...\"","\"If we win, this will be called strategy; if we lose, it will be called despicable.\"","\"We might not necessarily lose...\"","\"Don’t say such naive words; at this point, how can we win? Don’t even mention more progress, just keeping our current position is already incredibly fortunate...\"","\"You, rascal, how can you boost others’ spirit and diminish your own power?\"","\"What else can we do? Isn’t this the reality...\"","The crowd argued among themselves, their debates getting fiercer.","An elder coughed, and only then did the crowd gradually calm down.","The Tai’a Sect Leader’s face was dark as water, then sighed helplessly:","\"Let’s switch disciples; in the meantime, let them focus on cultivation, hone their Taoist Skills, that’s all we can do for this Dao Conference...\"","The elders nodded one after another, but their faces couldn’t help but show gloomy worry.","Even in the heart of the Tai’a Sect Leader, optimism wasn’t abundant.","Doing one’s utmost, leaving the rest to fate.","He silently thought in his heart: \"Hope the Ancestors bless us, let the Tai’a Sect overcome this hurdle...\"","...","Rushing Void Sect.","In the rear mountain cave residence.","The Chongxu Ancestor also spoke with the Chongxu Sect Leader:","\"Being what it is, meticulously scheming, under the fog of heavenly mystery, falling into the thoughtfully laid plan of others, we can only accept defeat.\"","\"We’ve done what can be done, the rest is up to fate.\"","The Chongxu Sect Leader sighed, \"Hope these alternate disciples can have some unexpectedly excellent performance.\"","The Chongxu Ancestor nodded, but didn’t hold much hope.","In matters like cultivation, weak is weak, strong is strong.","Occasionally defeating strong with weak is luck.","But in a Dao Conference with rounds of intense battle, there’s almost no room for such ’luck.’","The Chongxu Ancestor said: \"Try to get through this session, next time will be better, we have a ’trump card’ in our Rushing Void Sect.\"","The Chongxu Sect Leader’s spirits lifted, he nodded, and felt a little hopeful.","Ling Huxiao had outstanding talent, and remarkable Sword Dao.","If he leads the team, the next Sword Discussion Conference in the Rushing Void Sect would definitely shine brilliantly.","There’s even the potential to turn the tide.","But in the heart of the Chongxu Ancestor, dark clouds still remained.","He feared only that the Four Great Sects might cut things to the bone, leaving no breathing space for them...","...","Scenes like those in Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect were playing out among the upper echelons of many sects within the Qian Learning State Boundary.","Some rejoice, some worry.","Some have their schemes succeed, some look up to the sky and sigh.","The closer to the Dao Conference, the more frequent the changes.","The undercurrent was also constantly surging.","And these, Mo Hua, a ’plain and ordinary’ disciple of the Taixu Gate, knew little about and did not concern himself with.","He kept to his duties, focused on cultivation.","His cultivation was growing bit by bit.","His Sword Dao honing little by little.","And his Formation, under Elder Master Xun’s guidance and his own relentless effort day and night, was slowly reaching a state that ordinary cultivators hard to imagine...","Time passed like a white stallion.","Soon, more than six months went by.","Under the watchful eyes of the masses, the Dao Conference of the Qian Learning State Boundary began..."]},{"number":1720,"title":"Chapter 1720 - 877: Parting of the Dao","paragraphs":["Qian Learning State Boundary, Qian Taoist Sect.","In a grand hall resembling a jade palace.","Elder Shen, born in the Shen Family, in the Feather Transformation Realm, wielding real power, was discussing matters with a group of elders and instructors.","Soon, Elder Zheng, dressed in a Qian Taoist Sect robe, with half-white hair and a stern brow, pushed the door open with an angry face.","The hall fell silent for a moment.","Elder Shen glanced around, waved his hand, \"You all go out first, we will discuss this later.\"","\"Yes.\"","The group of elders and instructors then exited the hall.","When the hall doors closed, only Elder Shen and Elder Zheng remained inside.","Elder Zheng immediately spoke: \"What do you plan to do about the Rouge Boat incident?\"","Elder Shen frowned, \"What do you mean what to do? What does the Rouge Boat incident have to do with our Qian Taoist Sect?\"","Elder Zheng sneered, \"Don’t talk roundabout, don’t tell me you have no idea about it at all.\"","\"Is it really just the Gui Water Sect running that boat?\"","\"Those disciples gathered together are seeking fame, power, and profit. And in the Qian Learning State Boundary, who holds the greatest fame, power, and influence? Which families?\"","\"Your Shen Family, and the Qian Taoist Sect, how could you not have any involvement?\"","Elder Shen remained silent.","Elder Zheng, upon seeing this, sneered:","\"Not speaking is useless, I’ve investigated, behind that boat, there’s the shadow of your Shen Family. And many disciples of the Qian Taoist Sect have been on that boat...\"","\"Elder Zheng...\" Elder Shen’s face darkened, and he coldly said, \"Don’t make baseless accusations and speak irresponsibly.\"","Elder Zheng sneered, \"Whether it’s slander, you know in your heart. I used to think you were just a fame-seeking, profit-chasing, selfish, greedy person, but never imagined your Taoist Heart would be so corrupted, secretly engaging in such vile actions...\"","Elder Shen angrily slammed the table, sharply said, \"Enough!\"","Elder Zheng remained firm-faced.","Elder Shen took a breath, suppressing his anger, pointed at Elder Zheng and said:","\"Zheng, it’s only because of the courtesy to your Zheng Family that I am so tolerant with you, don’t push it!\"","\"What do you mean by pushing it?\" Elder Zheng retorted sarcastically, \"Not knowing right from wrong, being in league with your Shen Family, and serving your Shen Family as dogs and horses, isn’t pushing it? Is it the duty of a Qian Taoist Sect elder?\"","Elder Shen coldly said, \"Elder Zheng, please watch your words.\"","\"What if I don’t watch my words? Let me ask you, what exactly do you plan to do about the Rouge Boat incident?\" Elder Zheng said coldly.","Elder Shen originally did not want to discuss this matter, but seeing Elder Zheng being persistent and not backing down until his goal is achieved, he feared escalating the issue, so he said impatiently:","\"The Ancestor has already made a plan for this.\"","\"What plan?\" Elder Zheng asked.","Elder Shen’s expression changed, and he sighed slightly, \"The Rouge Boat incident was due to my Shen Family’s oversight. Originally, it was just to provide a little convenience for the Gui Water Sect, but I didn’t expect them to be so rampant and wanton...\"","\"Provide a little convenience?\" Elder Zheng’s gaze was sharp, \"The benefits your Shen Family gained from it are probably not small, are they? Did you turn a blind eye because you were too fattened by it?\"","Elder Shen did not answer but asked in return, \"Which family doesn’t seek profit? Does your Zheng Family not talk about benefits?\"","\"At least my Zheng Family would not seek such benefits.\"","\"Good, good, your Zheng Family is noble, and then? What do you intend to do, ask for the Shen Family’s crime?\" Elder Shen sneered.","Elder Zheng: \"I naturally can’t question the crime of your Shen Family. But as the Law Elder of Qian Taoist Sect, I must manage those disciples who have been on the Rouge Boat and violated the sect’s rules.\"","Elder Shen suppressed his anger, \"What do you want to do then?\"","Elder Zheng said, \"Abolish their cultivation and expel them from the sect!\"","Elder Shen slapped the table, angrily said, \"Absurd!\"","He was so angry his hands were trembling, \"Who are they? They are the Heavenly Pride from various Great Families, each with top-notch Spiritual Roots, the ’pearls’ among the world’s cultivators, how can they be abolished at will? Who gave you the courage?\"","\"Furthermore, do you know what time it is right now?\"","\"The Sword Discussion Conference is imminent, if you abolish them, who will fight for rankings for our Qian Taoist Sect? Fight for benefits? Compete for the share of Qianlong Spirit Mine?\"","Elder Shen frowned and criticized, \"You are short-sighted, do you not consider the bigger picture at all?\"","\"So?\" Elder Zheng sneered, \"You intend to protect them like this?\"","\"This isn’t protection...\" Elder Shen sighed, \"They are still young, who doesn’t make a few mistakes when they’re young? They always need a chance to correct themselves.\"","\"Moreover, the importance of this Sword Discussion Conference is something I think you should be clear about. Compared with the sect’s interests, these trivial matters are insignificant, aren’t they?\"","Elder Zheng’s eyes were sharp, \"This is trivial?\"","\"I said, compared with sect’s interests...\"","\"All you talk about are family interests, sect interests, it’s all about interests, where do you place the ’Daoist Ethics’ of cultivators?\"","\"Let’s put ’Daoist Ethics’ aside for now...\"","\"Why put it aside?\" Elder Zheng questioned, then coldly said, \"Once Daoist Ethics are put aside, can they be picked up again?\"","Elder Shen waved impatiently, \"I can’t communicate with a person like you.\"","Elder Zheng also looked as if playing music to a cow, \"So, is this matter settled like this?\"","Elder Shen said, \"Major matters don’t concern minor details. To keep the overall situation in mind, these matters won’t be pursued, and moreover...\"","Elder Shen originally didn’t want to say, but at this time had to lower his voice and warn Elder Zheng: \"The Ancestor has already approved this matter, don’t stir up trouble.\"","The Ancestor...","Elder Zheng’s eyes showed deep disappointment:","\"You are... losing more by gain...\"","Elder Shen impatiently: \"I said it was to keep the overall situation in mind, how is it losing more by gain?\"","Elder Zheng shook his head, slowly said, \"Focusing on profit and forgetting righteousness, in the long run, the Family Sect will be filled with profit-driven and righteousness-forgetting people...\""]},{"number":1721,"title":"Chapter 1721 - 877: Parting Ways of the Dao (2)","paragraphs":["\"Profiteering and exploitation, the Great Families and Great Sects will sooner or later monopolize all benefits and legacies, becoming colossal entities, causing the ties of the Cultivation World to be severed, leaving the people in despair.\"","\"This is a sign of the Heavenly Dao’s decay; it appears prosperous, but the grand edifice is about to collapse. It’s just a matter of time.\"","\"Here it comes again, here it comes again, what’s this about the grand edifice collapsing? Alarmist nonsense...\" Elder Shen said impatiently, shaking his arms with pride:","\"Look at this Qian Learning State Boundary, look at my Qian Taoist Sect, palatial pavilions soaring into the clouds, when has it not exuded the aura of celestial beings? Where could there be decay?\"","Elder Zheng responded indifferently: \"The facade is merely superficial, the clouds and fog hover in midair. The external splendor cannot conceal the rot of the human heart.\"","\"You’re still so...\" Elder Shen spat out four words, \"incomprehensible!\"","He waved his hand, \"I don’t have idle time to debate these matters with you. The Dao Conference has important issues to settle, Elder Zheng, if you have time, lend a hand; if not, stop causing trouble here, or else...\"","Elder Shen sneered, \"I’m afraid your elder position won’t last long...\"","\"No need.\" Elder Zheng directly threw a jade slip in front of Elder Shen, \"I’m done!\"","Elder Shen was stunned, \"What did you say?\"","Elder Zheng replied word by word, \"I said, I’m done with this useless elder position in your Qian Taoist Sect!\"","Elder Shen’s face was ashen as he picked up the jade slip thrown by Elder Zheng, seeing the bold words \"Resignation\" on it, he immediately had a shocked expression, and said angrily with disbelief:","\"Unbelievable, you... do you know how many cultivators outside are scrambling to join our Qian Taoist Sect, vying for a position, yet you... you...\"","Elder Zheng laughed coldly, \"Your Qian Taoist Sect is too grand a temple, I am but a small Buddha unworthy of it.\"","After speaking, he flicked his sleeves and left.","\"Stop!\"","Elder Shen immediately called out and then calmed his emotions, looking at Elder Zheng slowly, he said:","\"Don’t forget, my Qian Taoist Sect had made an agreement with your Zheng Family Ancestor. You may leave, but the formation techniques of your Zheng Family must be passed down.\"","Elder Zheng said solemnly, \"The Ancestor only agreed to consider it. Whether to pass it or not is still up to me.\"","\"Moreover, the Bagua Thunder Formation of my Zheng Family is extremely strong and upright, not tolerating any deceit; your Qian Taoist Sect’s disciples don’t have the mindset to learn it!\"","\"Ridiculous!\" Elder Shen pointed at Elder Zheng, \"Your Zheng Family should not be so arrogant. My Qian Taoist Sect is a giant in Qianxue, gathering the talents and geniuses from the Nine State, and you say my disciples are unworthy of learning? Who is worthy then?\"","Elder Zheng sneered, \"Heavenly Pride? Small-minded, forgetful of loyalty upon seeing profit, indulging in selfish desires, what does it matter if they possess Heavenly Grade Spiritual Roots? They’re nothing but highly cultivated tumors.\"","\"One day they will spread their poison across the world, causing the Heavenly Dao to become unbalanced and bring catastrophic disasters. Your Qian Taoist Sect will become a haven for breeding bandits! To such a Sect, I must respectfully decline to be involved!\"","\"Fine, fine,\" Elder Shen said angrily, \"My Qian Taoist Sect is one of the Four Great Sects of Qianxue, with thriving influence. Losing you is but a negligible loss but as for your...\"","Today’s decision, you must never regret it!\"","Elder Zheng gave Elder Shen a disdainful glance, without hesitation, flicked his sleeves and left.","Leaving Elder Shen alone in the grand hall, slamming the table in a fury.","Since becoming a True Transmission Elder of Qian Taoist Sect, no one had dared to disrespect him like this, nor had anyone discarded the revered elder position of Qian Taoist Sect so casually.","Elder Shen was extremely angry.","After a while, he suppressed his anger, composed himself, and called for the elders and instructors outside the hall to return and continue the meeting.","All the elders and instructors, seeing the mess inside the hall and Elder Shen’s lingering angry face, dared not speak a word.","The meeting proceeded as usual.","After the meeting ended, Elder Shen compiled all matters into the jade slip, placed it in his sleeve, and went alone to the highest pavilion of the Qian Taoist Sect.","This pavilion was made of white jade bricks and glazed tiles, more magnificent and noble than the palatial buildings outside.","At the center of the pavilion sat an old man.","The old man had white hair and beard, dressed in a robe embroidered with gold, exuding an aura of immortality.","Elder Shen approached respectfully, handed over the jade slip, and whispered:","\"Ancestor, everything has been settled, all sides have been arranged, the Dao Conference will proceed according to our plans without unexpected issues.\"","The old man closed his eyes and remained silent.","The high pavilion had become somewhat silent.","Elder Shen lowered his head, remained silent for a moment, then whispered: \"That one named Zheng, he turned uncooperative and has resigned...\"","The old man in the ornate robe suddenly opened his eyes, looking at Elder Shen, his eyes slightly narrowing.","Elder Shen felt the Ancestor’s gaze weighing heavily, filled with authority and dissatisfaction, causing him to lower his head even further, and defended:","\"This person is arrogant and cannot be restrained, so I occasionally use words to intimidate him, suppressing him slightly, unexpectedly...\"","Unexpectedly, he really gave up his position, discarding a Four Great Sects elder position so easily.","The old man in the robe slightly furrowed his brows, after a moment spoke with indifference, \"It’s fine, those who can stay will stay, those who wish to leave cannot be retained.\"","\"Ancestor,\" Elder Shen whispered, \"it doesn’t matter if this Zheng stays or leaves, but the formation techniques he carries...\"","The old man silently looked at Elder Shen.","Elder Shen then said, \"The Bagua Thunder Formation inheritance from the Zheng Family is rare in the cultivation world, even our Qian Taoist Sect, with its long history and deep formation heritage, has never possessed Thunder Dao Formation inheritance.\"","\"This Thunder Formation, if it can be brought into the Formation Pavilion, will surely enhance the formation techniques in our Taoist Repository greatly.\"","\"Ancestor, do you think we should find a way... to keep this Zheng?\""]},{"number":1722,"title":"Chapter 1722 - 877: Parting Paths (3)","paragraphs":["Elder Shen finished speaking and lowered his eyes, awaiting the Ancestor’s decision.","The elder in a splendid robe pondered silently for a moment, then shook his head, \"Let it be, the Bagua Thunder Formation is not lightly taught, nor can it be easily learned; if he is unwilling to teach, do not force him.\"","Elder Shen was puzzled, furrowed his brow, and said, \"Ancestor, is this formation truly about having an unyielding and upright character?\"","Seeing the Ancestor didn’t reply, he continued:","\"In my disciple’s opinion, talk of character is purely fictitious; if one’s Spiritual Root and bones are good, what can’t be learned? Why bother speaking about character?\"","\"The Zheng Family’s Thunder Formation, I see it as nothing more than smoke and mirrors; they just treasure it too much and are unwilling to share, using ’character and Taoist Heart’ as an excuse to prevaricate.\"","The elder in a splendid robe glanced at Elder Shen, shook his head, not wanting to say more, and simply instructed:","\"Let this matter rest, if the people of the Zheng Family wish to stay, let them stay, and consider previous events as non-existent.\"","\"If they wish to leave, do not give them trouble.\"","\"Although the Zheng Family resides in Zhen State, they are one of the few families that can pass down the Thunder Formation, and should not be underestimated.\"","\"Moreover...\"","The elder in a splendid robe paused, \"The Dao Discussion Conference ahead is the priority, do not cause unnecessary trouble.\"","\"Yes, Ancestor,\" Elder Shen replied.","Only then did the elder in a splendid robe pick up the Jade Slip offered by Elder Shen, glanced over it briefly, and nodded slightly.","\"Well done, just instruct as such...\"","\"Remember, either do nothing or be thorough, do not leave room for prolonged dreams.\"","Elder Shen promptly bowed deeply:","\"I will heed the Ancestor’s instructions.\"","...","Days later, at the Qianxue State boundary, in the Qianxue Pavilion.","Inside the grand and majestic hall, the Four Great Sects, Eight Great Gates, the Twelve Streams, and part of the leaders and Powerful Elders from each sect within the Qian Learning Hundred Gates gathered together to discuss the sect reform, as well as the specific agenda of the Dao Discussion Conference.","Most matters had already been discussed beforehand.","This meeting at the Qianxue Pavilion was meant to finalize these decisions.","However, before the meeting, the Qian Dao Sect leading the Four Great Sects issued a proposal.","Elder Tai’a Gate, upon seeing the Jade Slip, immediately stood up and slammed the table, saying, \"Absolutely not!\"","An elder from the Sever Gold Sect retorted with a peculiar tone, \"Why not?\"","Elder Tai’a Gate flipped through the Jade Slip and said, \"The changes are too drastic.\"","\"These are merely adjustments in schedule and minor changes in agenda, hardly anything...\"","\"Ridiculous!\"","Several sects echoed in agreement.","\"Indeed, things that have been passed down for hundreds of years, they say to change it as they wish.\"","\"Truly disregarding the ancestors’ teachings.\"","But those who disagreed were ultimately in the minority.","Most sects remained silent, while some clearly supported the proposal.","\"The ancestors’ teachings were originally meant to adapt to the times and constantly change.\"","\"I feel the Qian Dao Sect’s proposal is excellent.\"","...","Inside the Qianxue Pavilion, discussions were lively.","Sitting in a high position, Elder Shen coughed, waiting for the crowd to quiet down a bit, before speaking: \"Everyone has seen the Jade Slip; this meeting primarily discusses a few points, I hope you all bear them in mind:\"","\"Firstly, the Sword Discussion Conference will be prioritized; first discuss the sword, then discuss the Dao;\"","\"As everyone knows, the Sword Discussion Conference is a major event at the Qianxue State boundary, not only gathering sect disciples and families from across the Nine States, but also attracting cultivators from various state boundaries to attend, as has always been the case.\"","\"However, following the annual schedule of first discussing the Dao and then the sword, becomes too lengthy.\"","\"The Dao Discussion Conference covers talismans, formations, pills, and instruments, which is inherently complex, and once delayed, the Sword Discussion Conference must be postponed, making it difficult to prioritize.\"","\"Therefore, to ensure the Sword Discussion Conference is held on time and not delay the cultivators from various realms of the Nine States, the time for the Sword Discussion Conference must be moved forward!\"","\"All manpower and material power should be concentrated on the Sword Discussion Conference, ensuring each subsequent Sword Discussion Conference is held as scheduled, aiming to elevate this conference to become the top grand event in Qian State, and even the Nine States.\"","\"That’s first; secondly, the Sword Discussion Conference will expand its quotas.\"","\"The original intention of the Sword Discussion Conference is not to let a few disciples monopolize and lead, but rather to encourage more sect disciples to actively progress.\"","\"Expanding quotas allows more disciples to participate, encouraging disciples to compete and mutually improve, which is beneficial.\"","\"Thirdly, and most importantly...\"","Elder Shen paused, his expression solemn, \"From this session onward, the ranking of the Four Great Sects, Eight Great Gates, and even the Twelve Streams will be determined based on each sect’s ranking in the Dao Debate Conference!\"","As soon as these words were spoken, the room erupted in commotion.","Elder Shen paused for a moment before continuing to explain:","\"In the following three sessions, this ranking will change each time.\"","\"However, after three sessions, it will be finally determined, with the sect ranking remaining unchanged for a hundred years.\"","\"Sect reform, three sessions of Dao Debate, ten years of time, to determine the ranking for the next hundred years. This reform will take place every hundred years, allowing the capable to rise...\"","Elder Shen spoke earnestly:","\"The positions of the Four Great Sects and the Eight Great Gates are at the top of the thousands of sects in our Qian State Boundary, holding significant importance.\"","\"The teaching principle of a sect is to impart Dao and train students. Only by cultivating outstanding disciples and achieving superiority in the Dao Debate Conference can one qualify for this position.\"","\"Otherwise, it would be occupying the position without fulfilling the role, in name only, causing others to laugh.\"","\"To prevent some sects from relying on the achievements of their ancestors without striving for progress, this matter will be initiated and led by us, the Four Great Sects, setting an example.\"","\"This is also a form of motivation for us, the Four Great Sects.\"","\"Among the ’Four Great Sects’, whoever is capable can take the position.\"","\"If our disciples from the Four Great Sects are inferior in skills, we are willing to step down without hesitation.\"","\"The Qian Dao Sect, including the current Four Great Sects, will not complain!\"","\"Everyone, what do you think...\"","Within the Qianxue Pavilion, the hearts of the people immediately stirred.","The position of the Four Great Sects!","Within the Qian State Boundary, there is no sect that does not want to be among the forefront, to be ranked among the Four Great Sects, to occupy the largest share of the Qianlong Mountain Range, to devour this piece of fat meat.","Even the elders of the Tai’a Sect and the Rushing Void Sect, upon hearing Elder Shen’s words, felt their hearts stir.","If not for the matter of the Rouge Boat, they indeed would by all means wish to fight for this opportunity.","But now, they are forced to swallow their grievances in silence...","Several sects of the Tai’a Sect also tried to resist.","But the Qian Dao Sect, including the Four Great Sects, had already arranged everything in secret.","These matters were already predestined.","In the end, the vote of each sect almost unanimously agreed to the Qian Dao Sect’s proposal.","The sect reform, calculated and maneuvered by various parties, officially began to be implemented...","...","The Taixu Gate.","In the midst of the Elders’ Residence, Mo Hua was still learning formations with Elder Master Xun.","More accurately, Mo Hua was in the \"exam.\"","Elder Master Xun had set up a comprehensive array exam sheet, containing over ten second-grade nineteen-pattern and even peak nineteen-pattern formations, requiring Mo Hua to complete them all in one go within a limited time.","There could be breaks in between, but very little time was allotted.","Mo Hua began drawing from morning until evening.","When he handed over the \"exam sheet\" to Elder Master Xun, the incense in front of Elder Master Xun had only one-third left.","\"Finished?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Elder Master Xun took Mo Hua’s formation exam paper and reviewed each formation carefully.","Despite the limited time, despite the abundance of patterns, despite the high difficulty of the formations.","The formation patterns on the exam paper were meticulous and orderly, as if printed, without a single error!","Even the pen technique was consummate and flawless.","At this level of proficiency, completing such a top-level array exam is nearly impossible among second-grade Formation Masters.","Even for an ordinary third-grade Formation Master, it would never be achievable to this extent.","With a solid foundation, extensive knowledge, profound experience, and deep attainment.","The depth of divine thought, pen technique honed through countless practice.","Even an old monster who can perform Divine Soul Snatching to draw second-grade formations would only be equivalent to this...","Elder Master Xun took a deep breath of cold air, then gazed deeply at Mo Hua, finally relieving the heavy weight on his heart...","The turning point for Taixu Gate has arrived!"]},{"number":1723,"title":"Chapter 1723 - 878: Drawn Blade","paragraphs":["Elder Master Xun was just about to say something to Mo Hua when footsteps were heard outside. The Taixu Sect Master with his full head of black hair and a ruddy complexion entered, though his brow was furrowed with concern.","Upon seeing Mo Hua in the room, the Taixu Sect Master appeared somewhat surprised.","Mo Hua quickly stood up to pay respects, \"Greetings, Sect Master.\"","\"Mm, greetings.\" The Taixu Sect Master responded to Mo Hua with a gentle demeanor.","\"I returned Big Dog earlier, but you weren’t there, so I tied him up in front of the library for you,\" Mo Hua said.","The expression of the Taixu Sect Master became subtle.","He couldn’t quite understand.","A perfectly unruly exotic beast, yet in front of this child, Mo Hua, it behaved just like a guarding hound...","Is it really like the saying: ’Even tofu can be defeated by brine, as one thing overcomes another’?","\"Very well,\" the Taixu Sect Master hid his thoughts, only nodding slightly on the surface.","Elder Master Xun glanced at the Taixu Sect Master, then patted Mo Hua on the shoulder, \"That’s it for today, you may return first.\"","Mo Hua also understood that Elder Master Xun likely had matters to discuss with the Sect Master, so he respectfully bowed, \"Elder Master, Sect Master, this disciple takes leave now.\"","Afterwards, Mo Hua departed.","Elder Master Xun rose and carefully collected the formation drawings Mo Hua had completed, one by one, meticulously.","The Taixu Sect Master silently observed from the side, unable to resist thinking to himself:","\"Worthy of being called the ancestor, truly is composed, even at such a time, still has the leisure to teach the disciple formations...\"","The treatment Mo Hua receives could be likened to that of the ancestor’s own child.","Once Elder Master Xun tidied the desk, the two began discussing the main matters.","\"The Qianxue Pavilion conference has been set. The Sword Discussion Conference will be advanced, the quotas expanded, and the sect rankings will begin to shift starting from this conference...\"","\"I knew changes were coming, but I didn’t expect they’d really proceed now...\"","The Taixu Sect Master placed a Jade Slip on the table, offering it to Elder Master Xun.","\"For this Qianxue Pavilion meeting’s matters, the Four Great Sects have long been prepared, but for the Tai’a Sect, Rushing Void Sect, and our Taixu Sect, and some sects that do not get along with the Four Great Sects, we all found out at the last minute, caught completely off guard.\"","\"Nonetheless, the initiative is inherently in other’s hands, and even if we oppose, it won’t help...\"","Elder Master Xun picked up the Jade Slip, scanned it briefly, his expression unchanged, seemingly unsurprised. Then, he turned to the Taixu Sect Master:","\"What do you plan to do?\"","The Taixu Sect Master immediately felt great pressure, but since Elder Master Xun asked, he could only summon his courage to speak:","\"I’ve already done my best to make arrangements.\"","\"This time, the Debating Sword Conference is crucial, so the merit points for disciples have been increased by 40% compared to before.\"","\"Those who can participate in the Debate Sword have been arranged with Elders of Daoist Law, bringing them to Refining Demon Mountain to strategize their tactics.\"","\"As for the rest of the Dan Array Talismans, we’ve selected excellent disciples from this session, personally guided by the Sect Elder, to ensure they secure certain ranks in the Debating Conference, stabilizing Taixu Gate’s rank...\"","\"Other trivial matters of the sect have been temporarily halted, everything making way for this Debating Conference...\"","...","The Taixu Sect Master spoke orderly.","Elder Master Xun nodded slightly.","After finishing, the Taixu Sect Master sighed, \"However, this hurdle might not be so easy to pass.\"","He pointed to the Jade Slip, \"These few moves by the Four Great Sects seem like mere procedural changes, but each move hits right at our vital points.\"","\"The Taixu Gate is somewhat better off, but for the Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect, it is extremely perilous...\"","\"Bringing the Sword forward means there is less preparation time, and they lose the chance to mediate.\"","\"Expanding quotas, for those already short-handed, is even worse.\"","\"And this Debating Conference will start determining rankings.\"","\"Looking at the current situation, let alone the Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect, even for my Taixu Gate, maintaining our position among the ’Eight Great Gates’ is very challenging...\"","Mentioning the matter of \"rankings\", the Taixu Sect Master looked solemn.","\"If the Eight Great Gates cannot maintain their ranking, typically, it falls to the ’Twelve Streams’...\"","\"But thinking carefully, it’s not that simple.\"","\"Although the Eight Great Gates practically rank above the Twelve Streams, nominally, they are equals, with no distinction of high and low.\"","\"And joining the Twelve Streams requires having a Tao Cultivation ’specialty’, whether swordsmanship, Taoist skills, or sect inner alchemy array talisman, with deep attainment...\"","\"Our Taixu Gate has a decent foundation, but when it comes to ’specialties’, we may not match these existing Twelve Streams sects.\"","\"If falling from the Eight Great Gates, and no vacancy in the Twelve Streams, then...it’s possible to slip right into the Qian Learning Hundred Gates.\"","\"Cultivation is like rowing against the current, the cultivator is so, and the sect is no different.\"","\"Once fallen, it is a bottomless abyss. Future disciple recruitment, Qianlong quota shares, sect reputation, all would be significantly affected.\"","\"Faced with such a vicious cycle, trying to climb back up would be as difficult as ascending to heaven...\"","The Taixu Sect Master sighed deeply.","He had anticipated the worst-case scenario.","Should the Taixu Gate fail to maintain its rank under his leadership and fall from the \"Eight Great Gates\", ultimately merging into obscurity among thousands of Qianxue sects.","Then he would truly be the Sect Master who \"left a mark in history.\"","Being the \"founding figure\" of Taixu Gate’s decline.","Even if all this actually had little to do with him, he would have to bear the responsibility regardless.","The Taixu Sect Master felt bitter inside.","His initial thought was to lead a leisurely life in the tranquil Taixu Gate, nurturing body and mind, yet he hadn’t expected to encounter such an affair.","The sect’s peril, such a heavy burden, suddenly descended upon him.","Indeed, the world’s affairs are unpredictable, fortune and misfortune intertwined..."]},{"number":1724,"title":"Chapter 1724 - 878: Unsheathing the Sword (Part 2)","paragraphs":["The Taixu Sect Master was troubled in his mind, and after finishing speaking, he turned his head to see Elder Master Xun’s calm expression, without any special reaction, and couldn’t help but wonder:","\"Ancestor, you...\"","Elder Master Xun raised his gaze, glanced lightly at the Taixu Sect Master, and said: \"Leave a spot for me.\"","\"A spot?\" Taixu Sect Master was slightly stunned.","\"Yes, a spot in the Array Competition.\" Elder Master Xun said, then looked at the Taixu Sect Master again and said gently:","\"Rest assured, do your best, even if our Taixu Gate truly faces adverse circumstances and gradually falls behind, it is my plan as an ancestor that is inadequate, don’t blame yourself...\"","The Taixu Sect Master smiled bitterly.","The ancestor’s comfort made him feel grateful, but pushing this responsibility now seemed meaningless.","Yet in his heart, he was equally puzzled.","According to reasoning, the ancestor’s affairs should not be inquired, but the situation was special now, he couldn’t help but ask:","\"What do you want this spot for?\"","Elder Master Xun just said calmly:","\"You’ll know when the time comes...\"","Then Elder Master Xun said nothing more, and peacefully started drinking tea.","The Taixu Sect Master’s brows became even tighter.","...","Thereafter, the atmosphere in the Taixu Gate suddenly became tense.","It seemed everyone knew that this Sword Discussion Conference was of extraordinary significance.","Murong Caiyun and Shangguan Xu, the late-stage Foundation Establishment disciples of this generation, to prepare for the upcoming Sword Discussion Conference, were hunting monsters every day, honing tactics, and cultivating mutual understanding.","Mo Hua, this generation’s mid-stage Foundation Establishment disciple, didn’t need to attend the conference, hence wasn’t so busy, but the atmosphere among the disciples was still somewhat heavy.","Especially for those with good families and deep backgrounds who learned inside information from their clans, their hearts were anxious about Taixu Gate’s situation.","The sect’s interests were closely related to these disciples.","They didn’t want, after enduring much hardship to enter the \"Eight Great Gates,\"","only to end up as ordinary \"Qian Learning Hundred Gates\" disciples upon graduation.","But they were only at mid-stage Foundation Establishment, although anxious, they couldn’t help much.","Mo Hua was still practicing Formation.","However, the Sword Discussion Conference would start first, and its rankings weighted higher than other Daoist conferences.","After considering a bit, Mo Hua went to Elder Master Xun and asked:","\"Gentleman, may I participate in the Sword Discussion Conference?\"","He thought he could also lend a hand.","Elder Master Xun was startled, then immediately shook his head and said:","\"You’re only at mid-stage Foundation Establishment, what are you rushing into...\"","But before finishing the sentence, Elder Master Xun suddenly remembered, Mo Hua’s mid-stage Foundation Establishment seemed not in the ordinary sense.","Especially thinking of Mo Hua’s \"record\":","In the Taoist Court’s records, there’s a series of \"ferocious\" Sin Cultivators captured, and cruelly acting Evil Cultivators.","Also includes the \"Fire Buddha\" type Demons who killed mercilessly.","Not to mention, in Tongxian City, previously dispatched people discovered almost unbelievable \"great accomplishments\" of setting up large formations and killing Big Demons...","Elder Master Xun looked at Mo Hua, who was clean and well-behaved, difficult to connect these matters with him.","However, Tongxian City’s \"rumors\" were hard to say, but the Taoist Court’s records wouldn’t be false.","Most of these matters might truly be facts.","Elder Master Xun pondered for a moment, still shaking his head, said: \"The Sword Discussion Conference is not that simple.\"","Mo Hua was puzzled.","Elder Master Xun looked at Mo Hua and explained patiently:","\"Your spiritual root is poor, the grade of cultivation technique is limited, and the number of Spiritual Power Cycles practiced is naturally less than others, thus your Spiritual Power is weaker.\"","\"Additionally, your cultivation is only mid-phase Foundation Establishment; at least in terms of Spiritual Power, compared to those late-phase Foundation Establishment or even peak Foundation Establishment geniuses in Qianxue, you are far less.\"","\"And the Sword Discussion Conference requires many matches. Your meager Spiritual Power can’t withstand the consumption.\"","\"Once your Spiritual Power is exhausted, no matter how many skills you have, you can’t display them, and ultimately you’ll only be able to concede.\"","Elder Master Xun said these words with a slightly stern gaze:","\"I know, you can mix so well outside, dealing with those Sin Cultivators, Evil Cultivators, and Demon Cultivators, certainly holding many trump cards.\"","\"But you must be clear, the open and the hidden are different.\"","\"Working outside is hidden, your methods kept concealed, may have magical effects.\"","\"But the Sword Discussion Conference is open, under the public eye, with so many people watching, once you reveal a trump card, you’ll be noticed by everyone.\"","\"Others will prepare beforehand, turn to calculate against you.\"","\"Moreover, the Sword Discussion Conference requires many matches, no matter how many trump cards you have, revealing one in each match, sooner or later you’ll be stripped clean.\"","\"By the end, if all your methods are seen through, how can you fight?\"","Mo Hua’s expression was stern, but simultaneously puzzled, he asked: \"Gentleman, don’t other sects’ heavenly prides have trump cards too? Aren’t they afraid of exposure?\"","\"They’re not the same as you...\" Elder Master Xun said, \"Their trump cards, ultimately, are nothing but cultivation realms, superior Daoist skills...\"","\"This is hard strength; even if exposed, it’s not easy to defeat them head-on.\"","\"But you’re different, are your trump cards shown to others? Even dared to show me...\"","Elder Master Xun looked quietly at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua felt somewhat embarrassed and lowered his head.","Elder Master Xun didn’t pursue further but continued: \"Thus, although you have many methods, but the fundamental cultivation is weak, very afraid of being targeted. To achieve victory, you must hide your trump cards well. Unless absolutely necessary, don’t use them.\"","\"This Sword Discussion Conference, if you rashly participate, despite possibly helping a bit, the significance isn’t large, even very likely, a loss outweighs the gain...\""]},{"number":1725,"title":"Chapter 1725 - 878: Drawing the Sword (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Elder Master Xun spoke earnestly.","Mo Hua’s expression was serious as he nodded.","The Ancestor truly deserves the title, having deep and farsighted insights.","This also served as a reminder for him.","His spiritual power was low, making him afraid of depleting it.","He had many trump cards, but feared being targeted.","If, in the future, he were truly to stand in the eyes of ten thousand people, he would need to find ways to resolve these shortcomings.","His trump cards must also be properly arranged.","Not to be used lightly, but when used, it must be decisive, clinching victory.","Ideally, without others discerning the subtleties.","These considerations he had not pondered deeply beforehand.","\"Gentleman, I understand now.\" Mo Hua nodded.","With relief, Elder Master Xun nodded and said in a reassuring voice:","\"As I said, mastering the formation is the greatest help you can provide, other matters need not burden you, moreover...\"","Elder Master Xun patted Mo Hua on the shoulder, \"...do not underestimate your senior brothers and sisters. Although they might not match the top disciples of the Four Great Sects, they are still geniuses from various families and clans. Being able to join our Taixu Gate, their talents and abilities are among the best, so rest assured.\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Hmm!\"","...","About half a month later, at the Qianxue state boundary, after the sect’s restructuring, the first significant \"Sword Discussion Conference\" commenced.","This was a grand event.","The Four Great Sects and several major families behind them devoted considerable manpower and resources to organize this Sword Discussion Conference with unprecedented scale and grand arrangements. Even the cultivators who came to observe were more numerous than ever before.","In Qianxue state boundary, the Immortal Cities were teeming with people, carriages flowed ceaselessly, horses moved like wandering dragons, spirit beasts were as numerous as stars, flying boats soared through the sky, creating a spectacular scene.","Mo Hua was eager to witness it.","Cheng Mo and the others wanted to drag Mo Hua along to join the excitement.","However, Elder Master Xun disagreed, instructing Mo Hua to calm his restless mind and focus on learning formations.","Knowing the importance of priorities, Mo Hua sat alone in the Disciple’s Residence, silently drawing the most difficult formations among the second grade nineteen-pattern peaks, over and over again, during the bustling times in the Qianxue state boundary.","Amidst this interweaving of noise and tranquility.","The Sword Discussion Conference concluded.","As expected, Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect suffered a crushing defeat.","Their core disciples were swept aside almost completely by the Taoist Court’s investigation of the Rouge Boat.","The remaining disciples, with their solitary efforts, struggled to compete with the Four Great Sects, other Eight Great Gates, Twelve Streams, and even some top sects within the Qian Learning Hundred Gates.","Moreover, with the expansion of quotas in this Sword Discussion Conference, it added insult to injury for them.","This meant they were essentially using ’substitute’ and ’cannon fodder’ disciples to compete against the ’main force’ and ’substitutes’ of other sects.","This was simply a nightmare.","They barely stood a chance.","Thus, Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect became the biggest losers of this Sword Discussion Conference.","In contrast, Taixu Gate fared relatively well, ranking seventh among the Eight Great Gates in the sword rankings.","Originally, they were often at the bottom, and now they’ve slightly moved up a position.","Moreover, this was achieved under immense pressure following the sect’s restructuring and facing deliberate targeting and blockade by various major sects.","Murong Caiyun’s cohort of disciples nearly gritted their teeth and fought hard to reach this point.","Upon finishing the competition, several disciples, including Murong Caiyun, collapsed from spiritual power exhaustion and meridian depletion, being sent to the Pill Room for healing.","Taixu Sect Master felt both gratified and emotional.","\"They are all good children...\"","In the Elder’s Residence, Taixu Sect Master sat opposite Elder Master Xun.","Taixu Sect Master sighed, \"I come from a family and have seen many geniuses, and I know that sometimes, disciples with superior-grade spiritual roots aren’t necessarily that remarkable.\"","\"It’s sufficient that the spiritual root suffices, but it’s the heart and mind that are truly precious.\"","\"These disciples, in such critical moments, managed to withstand the pressure and gave their all to bring honor to our Taixu Gate and preserve the ranking. Regardless of their innate talent, they are all promising and could be of great use in the future...\"","Elder Master Xun nodded, \"Indeed, these children, if they wish to enter the Inner Gate in the future, should be given some leeway; if they have family ties and don’t wish to stay in the sect, they should be given an extra Inner Gate legacy; other situations should be given some special considerations based on circumstances...\"","Taixu Sect Master nodded, \"Alright, I will issue these instructions.\"","He then sighed deeply, \"This time, Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect truly suffered.\"","Due to their poor performance in the Sword Discussion Conference, their ranking had long since dropped unknown ranks.","Though this was anticipated, the actual occurrence still sent a chill down the spine.","The three sects shared an alliance, somewhat sharing the same fate.","By comparison, Taixu Gate’s current situation seemed slightly better.","But this is only relative, and it does not mean they can relax henceforth.","Both seventh and eighth positions are still at the bottom.","Furthermore, there are still the upcoming comparisons in Debating Devices, Debating Pills, Debating Talismans, and Debating Arrays.","If Taixu Gate holds its ground, perhaps they can maintain their current rank, even if it slips to eighth, it is still among the Eight Great Gates.","But any slight mishap and losing grip could mean a far worse ranking, one that is uncertain.","The situation is far from optimistic.","Taixu Sect Master remained somewhat uneasy.","While it’s true that the debates on dan array talisman devices do not weigh as heavily as Debating Sword and the time isn’t long, the scale isn’t as large.","But after all, it involves four debates, bringing too many variables.","It’s not the common probabilities that worry, but the rare possibilities...","Taixu Sect Master glanced at Elder Master Xun, only to find him calmly sipping tea.","A feeling of helplessness filled Taixu Sect Master.","This ancestor truly has the bearing of a vast ocean, reaching this point without a trace of anxiety.","How does he maintain such composure?","Seemingly perceiving Taixu Sect Master’s thoughts, Elder Master Xun poured him a cup of tea, saying calmly, \"We’ve done all we can, now we leave it to destiny, worrying is useless, have some tea.\"","Taixu Sect Master could only respectfully take the teacup and take a sip.","He couldn’t tell if it was bitter or sweet, it was tasteless.","Elder Master Xun kept sipping his tea silently, but in the deepest recesses of his eyes, there was a hint of barely detectable anticipation and brilliance.","No one knew he had forged a \"treasure sword.\"","He was now waiting.","Waiting for the day this brilliantly shining sword, enough to shock the entire Qian Learning state boundary, would be drawn from its sheath.","After this, the debates continued to proceed one after another, working towards the conclusion.","Finally, two days later, was the Array Discussion Conference.","This also signifies that the conclusion of this round of the Dao Discussion Conference is almost upon us..."]},{"number":1726,"title":"Chapter 1726 - 879: Elder Zheng","paragraphs":["Two days later, it will be the Array Discussion Conference, also the final event of the Dao Discussion Conference.","During these two days, Elder Master Xun didn’t assign Formation homework to Mo Hua, but instead allowed him to relax appropriately.","Because after such a long period of Formation training, what needed to be learned has been learned.","There’s no need to be overly tense in these couple of days.","With some spare time, Mo Hua went to the Gu Family for meals.","It wasn’t that he went proactively, but Aunt Wan specifically invited him.","Mo Hua has been busy these days and hasn’t visited the Gu Family, and Wenren Wan has been somewhat concerned.","Now knowing he has some spare time, she specially prepared a table of spiritual meals to supplement Mo Hua, lest he gets too thin from hunger.","Mo Hua, unable to refuse the gracious offer, went and had a hearty meal.","After dinner, Yu Er went to the courtyard to play and catch butterflies.","Wenren Wan then handed an invitation to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua was taken aback and asked, \"Aunt Wan, this is...?\"","\"This is the invitation for the Array Discussion Conference.\" Wenren Wan said.","\"Observation?\"","\"Yes,\" Wenren Wan said kindly, \"I know you like Formation; you’ll surely go to watch the Array Discussion Conference. But during such grand events, the crowd will be immense. Ordinary disciples can only stand far away, watching the commotion; you can’t see much otherwise.\"","\"With this invitation, it’s different. This is specially issued by the Four Great Sects to the major families, inviting us to observe, with seats quite close to the front, allowing you to watch the Dao competition clearly...\"","Mo Hua was surprised in his heart and then said, \"Isn’t this invitation quite precious?\"","Wenren Wan nodded, \"It’s quite rare. Unless you are a Sect Leader or Elder from a fourth or fifth-grade great family, ordinary cultivators can’t get one.\"","She received this invitation because she is both the legitimate daughter of the Wenren Family and the next Sect Leader Dao companion of the Shangguan Family.","Mo Hua then said, \"There is only one invitation; if I’m given it, Aunt Wan, won’t you go to watch?\"","Wenren Wan replied, \"I’m not going.\"","Mo Hua was curious.","Wenren Wan said, \"If I went, I would sit with people from the Shangguan Family. Those people are pretentious, which I don’t like, and it might cause trouble for Yu Er.\"","Mo Hua nodded.","Wenren Wan, fearing Mo Hua might mind, said, \"You’re different; you don’t need to mind them. Just take the invitation, find a seat, drink tea, eat fruits, and watch. No need to engage with the Shangguan Family.\"","\"They may be fussy about my manners, but you are a guest, with Elder Master Xun backing you up. The Shangguan Family, full of elders, will surely not have the audacity to trouble you.\"","\"The Array Discussion Conference happens once every three years; it’s a rare opportunity. You should be able to gain significant insights if you can watch up close...\"","Wenren Wan was very considerate of Mo Hua.","Mo Hua was grateful in his heart.","Previously, he would have accepted this invitation, but now the situation is a bit special...","Mo Hua declined, saying, \"Aunt Wan, I can’t accept this invitation.\"","Wenren Wan was somewhat surprised, \"Why?\"","Mo Hua, being candid and fond of Formation, made her think he would happily accept the invitation, but surprisingly he refused.","After some hesitation, Mo Hua finally confessed, \"Aunt Wan, I might... also need to participate in the Array Discussion Conference...\"","Elder Master Xun advised him not to tell outsiders about this.","But Mo Hua thought, Aunt Wan treats him so well, she doesn’t really count as an \"outsider.\"","Moreover, the day after tomorrow is the Conference, speaking now wouldn’t matter much.","Wenren Wan was stunned for a while, finally realizing Mo Hua meant to \"participate\" in the Array Discussion Conference, not just watch.","Wenren Wan was understandably shocked, \"You’re only at the Foundation Building Middle Stage, with insufficient years since entry; can you participate?\"","Mo Hua said, \"I don’t know either; Elder Master Xun asked me to go.\"","He himself was unclear if this was following regulations.","Anyway, since Elder Master Xun asked him to go, he would go.","Elder Master Xun’s arrangements would certainly not be wrong.","\"Elder Master Xun...\"","Wenren Wan was taken aback, then thought it was no wonder, but at the same time felt a sense of gratefulness.","Elder Master Xun indeed treasured Mo Hua dearly.","The Dao Discussion Conference, being a significant competition, can manage to make an exception for Mo Hua of Foundation Building Middle Stage to participate.","Presumably, to let Mo Hua gain experience in advance, adapt to such grand occasions...","This also implies Elder Master Xun holds high hopes for Mo Hua’s future.","Wenren Wan felt very comforted.","After pondering for a while, she decided, \"Since you have to compete too, I will come to watch the day after tomorrow.\"","Mo Hua, while wanting Aunt Wan to watch too, couldn’t help but ask, \"Aunt Wan, didn’t you dislike those people from the Shangguan Family?\"","Wenren Wan snorted lightly, \"How can they compare with you? I’m going to watch your competition; it’s nothing to do with them.\"","Mo Hua smiled.","Wenren Wan patted Mo Hua’s shoulder and said with some delight:","\"Anyway, at your age, being able to participate in the Dao Discussion Conference, regardless of the outcome, is already remarkable.\"","\"Your parents will certainly be proud of you; it’s just a pity they are far away in Li State and can’t be by your side.\"","\"If you don’t mind, Yu Er and I will count as half of your family; since you are participating in the Array Discussion Conference, I will come to watch no matter what...\"","Mo Hua felt warm in his heart and smiled, \"Thank you, Aunt Wan.\"","Seeing Mo Hua’s clear smile, Wenren Wan felt comforted and involuntarily smiled too.","...","After staying leisurely at the Gu Family for a while, Mo Hua bid farewell to return to the Sect.","Aunt Wan personally sent him to the door and offered encouraging words, urging Mo Hua not to worry and to do well in the competition, striving for glory for the Sect.","Mo Hua smiled and answered, \"Yes.\"","Afterward, Mo Hua took the Gu Family’s carriage, leaving Qingzhou City, heading towards Taixu Gate. Upon passing through Tai Xu City, as it was still early, he got off the carriage and, as usual, went to the Formation Pavilion to browse around, purchasing some rare and unusual Formation Books and Formation Diagrams to broaden his Formation knowledge."]},{"number":1727,"title":"Chapter 1727 - 879: Elder Zheng (Part 2)","paragraphs":["When leaving, Mo Hua accidentally bumped into a disciple from the Taixu Gate.","This disciple had a square face, with well-defined features, and Mo Hua was quite familiar with him.","\"Zheng Fang?\"","Seeing Mo Hua, Zheng Fang also looked delighted, \"Junior Brother, what a coincidence.\"","\"You’re out shopping?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Yes,\" Zheng Fang replied, \"I’ve run out of pen and ink, and I couldn’t bear to exchange my merit points for it, so I’m using spirit stones to buy some.\"","\"Oh.\" Mo Hua nodded.","He never seemed to run out of merits, so he usually exchanged them directly for pen and ink.","Zheng Fang glanced at Mo Hua and then asked, \"Junior Brother, are you free? I want to buy a few formation books and would like your advice.\"","When he first joined the sect, Zheng Fang, who had a profound family background, was quite dissatisfied with Mo Hua being chosen by Elder Master Xun as the \"Junior Brother\" of formations.","Yet after spending so much time together, Zheng Fang had long since accepted it both in heart and speech.","Since then, he almost always referred to him as \"Junior Brother,\" with an attitude of admiration.","Mo Hua happened to have some free time.","Moreover, being the \"Junior Brother,\" helping out a junior is part of the job.","Mo Hua nodded, \"Sure.\"","Then Mo Hua went back and browsed the Formation Pavilion with Zheng Fang, \"guiding\" him on what to buy.","With Mo Hua’s current formation foundation, he had almost reached a level of perfection within the second grade.","He had seen too much, learned too much, and practiced too much.","Not only formations, but for ordinary formation books’ authenticity, the quality of formation pens, and the color of spiritual ink, he could usually tell at a glance.","With Mo Hua’s guidance, Zheng Fang bought formation books and ink supplies, then they left together. When they reached the entrance, Mo Hua said:","\"I’m going back to the sect, do you want to come along?\"","Zheng Fang shook his head and said, \"No, I have an elder returning to the family today, and since he taught me since I was young, I should bid him farewell.\"","\"An elder? From the Zheng family?\"","\"Yes.\"","\"Are they skilled in formations?\"","Zheng Fang nodded, \"Very skilled! One of the most powerful True Transmission Elders in our family.\"","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up and he wanted to ask more, but he was afraid of delaying Zheng Fang’s farewell time.","Just at this time, a man with partially gray hair, a tall stature, with sharp, dignified features walked over.","\"Zheng Fang,\"","the man called out.","Zheng Fang turned back, immediately showing respect, \"Little Uncle Master.\"","Mo Hua was taken aback and looked up to scrutinize the man, noticing his commanding presence, deep gaze, with a hint of lightning flashing in his eyes, displaying an aura of authority without anger.","Moreover, his cultivation was profound, with a sense of Feather Transformation.","A Feather Transformation Realm True Man!","Zheng Fang quickly introduced Mo Hua:","\"This is the elder I mentioned to you, my Little Uncle Master, a Fourth Grade Formation Master, serving as an Elder in the Qian Taoist Sect.\"","Listening to the beginning, Mo Hua felt admiration, but when he heard the words \"Qian Taoist Sect,\" his expression cooled.","He never had good feelings about the Qian Taoist Sect, so he lost the interest in chatting further.","The man was none other than Elder Zheng.","He didn’t really pay attention to Mo Hua, a minor disciple, until Zheng Fang introduced Mo Hua, saying:","\"Little Uncle Master, this is the ’Junior Brother’ of our Taixu Gate, whom I mentioned to you.\"","Elder Zheng was a bit surprised.","When Zheng Fang talked about him, he thought the \"Junior Brother\" was \"junior\" in terms of seniority.","Since they were of the same generation, the word \"Junior\" was added.","But now, seeing him in person, he realized this \"Junior Brother\" was really quite young...","He appeared not much older, with youthful and fair looks, making it hard to believe, just from his appearance, that he was the \"Junior Brother\" of the Taixu Gate.","However, there’s no precedence in the Dao, and respect goes to the accomplished.","One shouldn’t judge by appearance.","If he could be the \"Junior Brother,\" it must mean he has exceptional talent in formations.","Elder Zheng’s expression became a bit more gentle, \"Young brother, what is your name?\"","\"Mo Hua,\" Mo Hua replied.","\"Mo Hua...\" Elder Zheng repeated, somewhat impressed, \"Using ink to draw formations, dotting ink like painting, what a great name.\"","Mo Hua felt complimented on his name and couldn’t help nodding.","He also thought his parents had given him a good name.","Because of this, his impression of Elder Zheng improved greatly.","He actually wanted to ask this True Transmission Elder of the Zheng family about formations, but he was somewhat mindful of his identity and asked,","\"You really are an elder of the Qian Taoist Sect?\"","Elder Zheng shook his head, \"I’m not anymore.\"","Mo Hua was surprised, \"Not anymore?\"","Elder Zheng said, \"I resigned.\"","Mo Hua felt a sense of relief, \"That’s good!\"","Elder Zheng was a bit puzzled, with a complex expression, saying:","\"That’s a position of elder in the Qian Taoist Sect, one of the leading Four Great Sects, something many cultivators dream of. Why would not doing it be good?\"","\"As I said, it’s something ordinary cultivators dream of. Those truly skilled wouldn’t put up with such constraints,\" Mo Hua replied.","From his understanding, in such a great sect, the hierarchy was strict, with clear distinctions between ranks.","If one wanted to do well, they’d have to act subservient upwards, and domineering downwards, otherwise, they’d face constant grievances.","What Mo Hua said resonated with Elder Zheng.","Elder Zheng then asked, \"If I were to offer you a place as a disciple of the Qian Taoist Sect, would you accept?\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"They wouldn’t accept me.\"","It was true they wouldn’t.","Back then, he carried the \"Sect-Entering Order\" given by his master, traveled a long distance to the Qian Taoist Sect, only to be rejected at the door due to perceived poor aptitude.","The bar of the Qian Taoist Sect was too high for him to reach.","He still remembered that grievance.","Elder Zheng, not knowing the details, asked again, \"If they were willing to accept you, would you go?\"","Mo Hua shook his head again, \"No, I wouldn’t care for it.\"","He was doing too well now in the Taixu Gate.","Elder Master Xun taught him formations, and the Ancestor taught him Divine Thought into sword."]},{"number":1728,"title":"Chapter 1728 - 879: Elder Zheng (Part 3)","paragraphs":["So many Sect Elders are all kind to him, and there is also a group of Junior Brothers who call him Junior Brother every day.","Compared to Taixu Gate, the mere Qian Taoist Sect is not worth mentioning.","Elder Zheng, seeing Mo Hua’s sincere demeanor, speaking without pretense, surprisingly, did not regard the Qian Taoist Sect, one of the top two among the Four Great Sects, and suddenly became interested:","\"Being strangers is still a bond of fate; let me treat you to some tea and snacks.\"","Beside him, Zheng Fang opened his mouth wide.","He had never seen his always serious and rigid little granduncle treat a Foundation Establishment disciple to tea.","Mo Hua was not polite, smiled and said, \"Thank you, Elder Zheng.\"","Elder Zheng then found a nearby teahouse, got a private room, and with Zheng Fang accompanying, he treated Mo Hua to tea and pastries.","During the gathering, the two chatted.","Mo Hua, undeterred by Elder Zheng’s Feather Transformation Realm status, spoke confidently and gracefully.","After all, he often mingled with the Heaven Void Ancestor in the sect.","Over time, he naturally developed a broader perspective and would not be nervous when interacting with other high-rank cultivators.","The pair mainly discussed formations.","The more they talked, the more shocked Elder Zheng became; he hadn’t expected that his nephew, who frequently mentioned Junior Brother, actually had such profound knowledge and foundation in formations. He asked:","\"My young friend, where is your family heritage, and whom do you inherit from?\"","Mo Hua shook his head and said, \"I am a Loose Cultivator, without any family heritage...\"","Although he has a mentor, it was not convenient to disclose.","\"Loose Cultivator...\"","Elder Zheng was even more surprised.","He never would have thought that in today’s Qianxue State boundary, they actually could accept a Loose Cultivator with poor Spiritual Root and no family background.","Families monopolize, sects set thresholds, leaving the poor with no place to stand, no place to learn.","Being a Loose Cultivator is indeed difficult.","Elder Zheng felt a surge of emotion in his heart.","He curiously asked, \"Since you are a Loose Cultivator, how could you join Taixu Gate and acquire such skills?\"","Mo Hua glossed over it lightly, speaking half-truthfully and briefly:","\"When I was young, I was guided by an expert Formation Master, which allowed me to enter the field. Later, joining Taixu Gate was also due to certain fortuitous circumstances...\"","\"Elder Master Xun of Taixu Gate, noble in virtue, teaches all without discrimination, doesn’t mind my status as a Loose Cultivator. Now I am learning formations beside him...\"","\"Elder Master Xun...\"","Mentioning this name, Elder Zheng stood in awe, involuntarily sighed:","\"Taixu Gate, indeed is the remnant of a grand sect, truly holding ancient customs. Elder Master Xun is truly admirable.\"","He never expected that the seemingly famous Qian Taoist Sect was internally corrupt, only beautiful on the surface.","Instead, the seemingly declining Taixu Gate surprisingly holds such unconstrained pursuit of Dao demeanor.","Indeed, under a grand reputation, the reality is hard to match.","The Ancestor was blind to judge too.","Elder Zheng was filled with complex emotions.","Mo Hua secretly glanced at him and whispered, \"Elder Zheng, I heard the Zheng family is renowned for Thunder Formation?\"","Elder Zheng was startled, nodded, \"Correct.\"","Mo Hua felt an itch in his heart, very much wanting to ask the principle of Thunder Formation, but feared speaking abruptly and querying about others’ heritage seemed impolite.","Elder Zheng seemed to have read Mo Hua’s thoughts, and said:","\"Thunder Formation stems from the Ancient Array Path, is Zheng family’s core formation heritage, must not be disclosed. Moreover, this formation demands high moral character from disciples; those with improper heart skills and unsteady Taoist Heart cannot learn easily.\"","Mo Hua nodded, deeply agreeing.","Elder Zheng curiously asked, \"Do you not feel I am stalling you?\"","\"Stalling?\"","\"The talk of Taoist Heart always seems vague...\" Elder Zheng said.","\"How could it be?\" Mo Hua shook his head.","Speaking of Taoist Heart and Divine Thought touches upon his ’profession’.","Mo Hua earnestly said, \"Taoist Heart is very important. A cultivator pursuing Dao must possess a righteous and steadfast heart.\"","\"Otherwise, amidst the long and difficult Dao path filled with myriad phenomena, demon monsters, evil thoughts proliferate... sooner or later one might lose oneself amidst various chaos, forgetting the true heart.\"","\"Or intoxicated by one’s power, indulged in fame and fortune, immersed in mundane desires, will eventually extinguish the Taoist Heart.\"","\"Once the Taoist Heart extinguishes, no matter how high the cultivation, how great the power, how famous one may be, they become a puppet of selfish desires, easily manipulated by others...\"","Mo Hua shared his experience and insights on Divine Thought methodology.","Elder Zheng was bewildered briefly, a sense of regret for meeting too late surged.","This child speaks so well!","Within Qian Taoist Sect, why had he not met such disciples?","He even personally poured a cup of tea for Mo Hua.","Afterwards, Elder Zheng quietly stayed for a moment, a sudden impulse grew within:","Such a good seedling, he must teach him something.","Yet the Zheng family’s Thunder Formation, without the Ancestor’s consent, cannot be taught...","Elder Zheng asked, \"Do you have any formations you wish to learn? Besides Thunder Formation, whatever I know, I will teach you.\"","Mo Hua’s expression filled with joy.","Unexpectedly, this seemingly stern Elder Zheng was actually a Great Good Person.","But...","What to learn?","Mo Hua pondered for a while.","Firstly, it must be Second Grade formation, even if taught the Third Grade, he won’t be able to master it.","Among Second Grade formations, especially universal Five Elements Eight Trigrams Array, Elder Master Xun had already taught him too much.","These foundational array skills, no matter how formidable Elder Zheng might be, should not surpass Elder Master Xun.","There are quite a few special formations.","But Thunder Formation can’t be taught, other special Qian Formation, Kun Formation, Elder Zheng should not be aware.","Ultimate Formation won’t work either.","Ultimate Formation is a secret, extremely precious, asking about such heritage would be thick-skinned.","Moreover, with his current limited Divine Sense, he can’t even learn Ultimate Formation."]},{"number":1729,"title":"Chapter 1729 - 879: Elder Zheng (Part 4)","paragraphs":["\"Then what else is there to ask?\"","Mo Hua quickly reviewed the Formations he could currently learn, and those that might be useful after learning them. Suddenly, his eyes lit up, and he asked:","\"Elder Zheng, are you familiar with the Yuan Magnetic Formation?\"","\"Yuan Magnetic Formation?\"","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded, \"I—this junior—am rather dull, and have only done a little research earlier, so I’m not proficient and have many questions...\"","\"The Yuan Magnetic Formation is actually more accurately known as the ’Thunder Magnetism’ Formation. Its core is the internal ’Secondary Thunder Pattern.’ The Secondary Thunder Pattern contains the character ’Thunder,’ so does it have a certain connection with the Bagua Thunder Formation? What similarities and differences would the Secondary Thunder Flow represented by the Secondary Thunder Pattern have with real lightning...\"","Elder Zheng’s expression gradually grew somewhat astonished.","So, the disciples nowadays have studied Formations to such an extent?","Thunder Magnetism, Secondary Thunder Pattern, Secondary Thunder Flow—these obscure Formation concepts are only things that Third or Fourth-grade Array Masters, after acquiring special inheritances, would study...","But having some difficulty is good too.","For a dignified Fourth-grade Array Master like himself, answering those too basic Formation questions would not be interesting.","Elder Zheng pondered for a moment, nodded, and said, \"The Secondary Thunder Pattern, along with the accompanying Secondary Thunder Flow, known among cultivators as ’Yuan Magnetic,’ is a very faint and subtle form of thunder and lightning. It is considered a derivative of a ’Thunder Formation,’ but its nature is different from a true Thunder Formation, and its uses are vastly distinct.\"","\"Although the Zheng Family inherits Thunder Formations, over the years, they have also dabbled somewhat in derivative and secondary Formations related to ’Thunder.’\"","\"The Yuan Magnetic Formation, Secondary Thunder Pattern—these are rare Formation inheritances, but unlike Thunder Formations, they aren’t truly classified secrets, nor are they prohibited from being passed down. I can tell you about them...\"","Mo Hua was overjoyed, \"Thank you, Elder Zheng.\"","Afterwards, Mo Hua asked Elder Zheng many questions regarding the Formation knowledge related to the Yuan Magnetic Formation, Secondary Thunder Pattern, and Secondary Thunder Flow.","Elder Zheng held nothing back in his explanations.","The two of them had a most satisfying conversation.","As the sky gradually darkened towards dusk, Elder Zheng was preparing to leave, and the greatly enriched Mo Hua still had some lingering enthusiasm.","He was a bit reluctant and asked, \"Elder Zheng, are you leaving for the clan today?\"","Elder Zheng nodded, \"There’s a farewell banquet this evening, and around 7:00 PM, I’ll take the Cloud Ferry to depart.\"","Burdened with the legacy of the Thunder Formation and having resigned from the Elder position at the Qian Dao Sect, he had in essence offended the Qian Dao Sect.","Leaving Qianxue State Boundary sooner was better to avoid complications.","Mo Hua was somewhat disappointed, \"What about the Array Discussion Conference? Aren’t you going to take a look?\"","Elder Zheng shook his head, \"No, I’m not.\"","It’s no longer important...","There was a complexity in his expression.","The Dao Discussion Conference seems like a grand event, but at its core, it’s just a \"gathering\" of big and prestigious families.","It has nothing to do with the vast majority of the common cultivators.","Even, future Dao Discussion Conferences would also be a \"game.\"","Played by those so-called Heaven’s Chosen Sons who don’t really \"care for the world,\" who use it to climb to higher positions and seek their own interests.","All of this would gradually become disconnected from the lowest-tier cultivators of this world.","The numerous unsung individuals would be gradually forgotten.","This is the trend, almost irreversible.","Especially for Formations, which have a high entry barrier by nature, the big families will intensify their monopoly, making the barriers increasingly high, leaving almost no room for luck.","This Array Discussion Conference is without suspense, and there’s nothing worth seeing anymore.","Mo Hua felt some regret but could only bid farewell, saying:","\"Then I wish you a smooth journey and a safe return to the clan. May you advance even further in Formations in the future.\"","Elder Zheng smiled slightly, \"I also wish you great accomplishments in your youth, with boundless prospects.\"","Mo Hua squinted his eyes and smiled.","Subsequently, they parted ways.","Mo Hua and Zheng Fang walked shoulder to shoulder back to Taixu Gate.","Elder Zheng watched them leave, particularly observing Mo Hua’s departing figure, and suddenly felt much of his gloom lift, feeling greatly comforted.","In this world, even if dust obscures the sky and confusion shrouds everything, there will always be a clear breeze and a bright moon to soothe the heart."]},{"number":1730,"title":"Chapter 1730 - 880: The Exam Question","paragraphs":["In the evening, Elder Zheng returned to Qiandao City, and several Taoist friends with whom he had a good relationship came to bid him farewell.","During the gathering, everyone was filled with emotion, some felt pity for Elder Zheng, while others, unable to bear his departure, invited him to join their family sects as a Guest Elder.","Elder Zheng politely declined each invitation.","After the banquet, they bid each other farewell.","Elder Zheng then returned to his residence, closed his eyes, and took a moment to rest.","When the hour arrived, he packed all treasures, formation books, and formation diagrams, and left the abode he had lived in for decades without looking back, heading out of the city.","Riding in a carriage, he left the city, and about two hours later, arrived at the Cloud Ferry at the state boundary of Qianxue.","Boarding the Cloud Ferry, with three transfers along the way, he’ll reach Zhen State in about a month.","Though Elder Zheng no longer felt attachment, as he took the step to leave, he suddenly felt some lingering sentiments.","The face and voice of the young brother he met during the day reappeared in his mind.","Elder Zheng felt a sense of reflection.","Amidst the bustling and profit-driven Qianxue state boundary, there truly existed such disciples who were born in poverty, yet showed genuine dedication and exceptional comprehension.","His previous judgment was indeed biased.","The Cloud Ferry’s whistle sounded, signaling its imminent departure.","Elder Zheng took a step forward but suddenly stopped.","\"Stepping onto the deck, leaving Qian State, I’m afraid I’ll never return in this lifetime...\"","Elder Zheng felt hesitated, his heart suddenly uneasy, as if he would miss something important upon departure.","He frowned, pondered for a long time, and finally sighed:","\"Well, I might as well stay a few more days, finish watching this round of the Array Discussion Conference then leave. The journey to Zhen State is far, it doesn’t matter these few days...\"","Thinking this, Elder Zheng felt much at ease.","He lifted his head, seeing a bright moon hanging in the sky, its clear glow illuminating the earth, occasionally accompanied by a gentle breeze.","...","Time passed, another day went by.","Tomorrow is the Array Discussion Conference.","At this moment, within a sealed grand hall on Mount of Tao.","A group of Elders of Formation Arts gathered together, deciding the topic for tomorrow’s \"Array Discussion Conference.\"","The elders present were all from various great sects within Qianxue state boundary, renowned as third and fourth-grade formation masters.","Even though there were open and covert fights between the sects, often with disputes.","Yet, the status of a formation master was rather transcendent, forming a unique circle, not too constrained by sect prejudices.","Furthermore, they were currently deciding the topic for the Array Discussion Conference.","This was of great importance, no one dared to slack off, nor would they let personal grudges surface.","Thus, the atmosphere within the hall was quite harmonious.","Everyone discussed, selecting appropriate formations as the \"exam questions\" for this year’s Array Discussion Conference.","To avoid bias, the chief examiner this time was a Feather Transformation Realm Array Master from the Dao Court Tian Shu Pavilion, known as \"Master Wen.\"","Though Tian Shu Pavilion belonged to the Dao Court, it only oversaw formation affairs, relatively neutral compared to the Central Dao Court’s power institutions.","Master Wen himself was also from Qianxue state boundary, his formation mastery was evident to all, thus his role as chief examiner neither raised suspicion nor lacked credibility.","At this moment, the task of deciding the array topics was also led by Master Wen, proceeding methodically...","\"This ’Yimu Gen Mountain Array’ is good, could be tested...\"","\"The various types of ’Li Fire Formation’ above sixteen patterns are too murderous, not suitable for encouragement. Moreover, if drawn incorrectly, it’s prone to backfire, causing chaos at the Array Discussion Conference.\"","\"True, they’re still sect disciples, it’s better to focus on cultivating one’s character, understanding Heavenly Dao, and primarily benefiting production, or testing defensive formations...\"","\"You’re mistaken, we must still test Killing Formations. Formation masters are inherently lacking in combat, if we don’t test more Killing Formations, they may be too weak when entering the cultivation world in the future, suffering great losses.\"","\"That’s for small battles, one-on-one, requiring time and effort to arrange formations, naturally cumbersome for formation masters.\"","\"But large battles are different; all great battles require strategic planning, forging armor and refining weapons, deploying formations—that’s where formation masters truly shine.\"","\"With hundreds, thousands, even tens of thousands, under the enhancement of formations, they march forth mightily, invincible...\"","\"Speaking of this is too soon; they are just young disciples, how could they command thousands in battle.\"","\"Indeed. Moreover, these disciples are treasures of their family sects; few would truly risk their lives on the battlefield.\"","\"Then why do they learn formations? Learn without application? Just to show off?\"","\"You’re being too radical...\"","\"How is this radical?\"","\"Alright, alright everyone, let’s focus on the important matters.\" Someone urged.","\"Yes, arguing about this is meaningless; we should focus on the topic at hand...\"","\"I think half and half...\" An elder balanced, \"Test half Killing Formations and half industrial arrays.\"","Someone shook their head: \"Too many, I think four or five is better, Kill Formations and Trapping Formations four-tenths, industrial arrays five-tenths, the remaining one-tenth for theoretical formations with deep elements.\"","\"Then... specifically which ones? These formation diagrams have been tested too much.\"","\"We have indeed flipped them over many times, but consider the disciples; many formations they are just learning.\"","\"That is true...\"","\"However, it is somewhat tiring to test the same ones repeatedly.\"","\"Should we try something new?\" suggested an elder.","\"What kind of new thing? Too beyond the curriculum may not be good; if those disciples can’t draw them under stress, we, the exam-setting elders, will be silently cursed by them, and the ancestors of those family sects might also have criticisms...\""]},{"number":1731,"title":"Chapter 1731 - 880: Proposition_2","paragraphs":["\"That’s true...\"","\"Add some variations to the Formation?\"","\"I don’t think it’s a good idea...\" An Elder said, \"We are all old folks, having studied for so many years. We’ve seen a lot and have dabbled in various Formation variations.\"","\"Those disciples are different; they are just little kids. Their years alive don’t even amount to a fraction of our ages. Altogether, they haven’t trained in Formations much, knowing only a few basic Formation Formations. Testing Formation variations would be too difficult for them.\"","\"But the Sect has reformed, we can’t leave the Array Discussion Conference completely unchanged. Let’s just change it a little and test one or two Formation variations.\"","\"Anyway, there’s room for error in this competition. Failing to create three arrays results in defeat, but failing to create one or two is no big deal.\"","\"I still think it’s a bit too difficult.\"","\"You’re overthinking it. Don’t forget, this is the Qian Learning State Boundary, which is never short of geniuses.\"","\"To win at the Array Discussion Conference, you need some real skills.\"","\"Then let’s proceed like this. We will pick some formations, then let Master Wen review them, and he will make the decision...\"","\"That sounds good.\"","...","They were merely expressing their opinions.","But regardless of the opinions, the final decision was entirely up to Master Wen, who served as the chief examiner.","Afterward, everyone began selecting questions according to the outlined rules and the ideas and directions they had discussed.","Starting from the Sixteen Patterns.","The Array Discussion Conference starts testing from the Sixteen Patterns.","This is a threshold meant for elimination.","If one cannot even reach the Sixteen Patterns, they wouldn’t qualify to compete against the Formations geniuses of various sects.","Having surpassed the Sixteen Patterns earns a certain ranking.","Though it might not be high, it is indeed a contribution to the Sect.","Beyond Sixteen Patterns, it gets harder with every single Pattern.","Every single Pattern is a major hurdle that can filter out a large number of people.","Especially at the end, the gap from Eighteen Patterns to Nineteen Patterns is a world of difference.","Disciples who can draw the Nineteen Patterns are exceedingly rare.","Within the Debate Hall, many Elders of Formation Arts were either pondering, flipping through records, making decisions, or struggling with one Formation after another.","According to the rules, they first listed the formations, then filtered them, and finally presented them collectively to the chief examiner, Master Wen.","Master Wen would then set the questions, sealing them in a Jade Slip.","Thus, the selection of questions was done by the elders while the setting of questions was done by Master Wen.","It was very fair for everyone.","All of this had to be finalized the night before the Array Discussion Conference ended. The Elders wouldn’t leave until the Conference truly concluded, which helped to prevent leaks.","Time slowly passed.","The selection and setting of questions started from Sixteen Patterns and became increasingly difficult...","No one knew how long had passed, but it finally approached the end.","Upon choosing the last question, which was meant to be an ordinary one above the Nineteen Patterns, nearing the Foundation Establishment Peak for the \"capping\" test.","Master Wen seemed somewhat undecided, being caught between several formations, looking left and right, unable to make a decision.","Everyone waited quietly.","No one knew how long had passed, but Master Wen still hadn’t decided.","An elder laughed and said, \"Master Wen, is this your first time as the chief examiner?\"","The middle-aged Master Wen, who was mild-mannered and always serious in his tasks, nodded, \"Indeed.\"","The elder continued, \"Master Wen, don’t trouble yourself with the last question. It’s essentially a contingency, a placeholder. Over the years, no one has been able to draw it...\"","\"Not to mention this last question; even several of the previous Nineteen-Pattern formations are rarely completed by disciples.\"","\"You must understand, most of them are at Foundation Establishment Late Stage, and few are at Foundation Establishment Peak.\"","\"Their Divine Sense at most reaches Eighteen Patterns or Nineteen Patterns; that’s already remarkable.\"","\"Moreover, this is a ’Final Exam’.\"","\"Starting from the initial Sixteen Patterns, drawing all the way up is a test of the Taoist Heart, Divine Sense, and perseverance. They must withstand the pressure of being the focus of attention; the further they go, the more tired and difficult it gets.\"","\"These disciples come from families of privilege, accustomed to comfort, unable to endure until then.\"","\"Disciples who last from start to finish, completing one or two Nineteen-Pattern formations, are few and far between.\"","\"Much less capable of drawing this final question.\"","Master Wen asked, \"Has it never happened?\"","\"Never.\" The elder replied.","Beside him, an older Elder of Formation Arts added, \"This ’capping’ formation involves principles.\"","\"This question isn’t really meant to be solved but to show disciples that beyond is beyond, heavens beyond heavens, that the formations are vast, with endless learning. They cannot draw all formations, nor can they learn many formations.\"","\"As Formation Masters, they must maintain humility, never have arrogance, and continually strive.\"","\"Therefore, as long as this final formation is difficult enough, just pick one and add it in without overthinking.\"","Master Wen humbly nodded in agreement.","But his meticulous nature, somewhat obsessive-compulsive about not doing things ’randomly,’ meant he had principles for every decision. Once tasked with choosing, he couldn’t help struggling.","His hesitation delayed things by another thirty minutes.","Everyone quietly watched him.","Master Wen came back to his senses, feeling somewhat embarrassed.","Still, he couldn’t just ’randomly’ pick, so he deliberated that since the final formation couldn’t be drawn by disciples and was meant for the ’capping,’ the standard should be ’difficulty.’","The hardest formations relate to Dao.","Following his heart, he chose the most profound, obscure formation, involving the fundamental changes of Spiritual Power, and put it in."]},{"number":1732,"title":"Chapter 1732 - 880: Proposition_3","paragraphs":["At this point, the propositions are complete.","Master Wen checked everything from beginning to end once more, then sealed all the \"propositions\" with a sealing pattern.","The creation of the propositions for the Array Discussion Conference was thus concluded.","Everyone was overjoyed.","\"Finally it’s all done...\"","\"Time to take a break.\"","\"Tomorrow is the final session of the Taoist Conference, after that, this event will conclude.\"","\"Formations are indeed the most reliable, either you know it or you don’t.\"","\"Tomorrow, as long as everything goes smoothly in the competition, everything will be settled, and there’s no need to be anxious anymore.\"","\"Actually, things are pretty much done now anyway.\"","...","Everyone chatted while they headed outside.","As the chief examiner, Master Wen said: \"Thank you all for your hard work. I brought some wines from Taoist State and also arranged a table of superior spiritual meals. I invite all of you to enjoy these fine wines and dishes to relieve your fatigue.\"","Though it was his first time as the chief examiner, he understood the importance of social etiquette.","And no one present would disregard the prestige of the Formation Master of Heaven Shu Pavilion.","During ordinary times, they wouldn’t have had the opportunity to get acquainted with Master Wen.","Moreover, after a busy day, having some drinks to relax was more than welcome.","Everyone cupped their fists and said:","\"Master Wen, you’re too kind.\"","\"This is excellent, thank you for your efforts, Master Wen.\"","\"To be respectful is better than to comply.\"","\"Master Wen’s graciousness is something to be eagerly accepted...\"","Consequently, Master Wen called for someone to set up wine and a feast in the side hall, where everyone exchanged cups and discussed Formation insights and anecdotes.","After the banquet, everyone returned to their rooms to rest.","The night was tranquil, and the moonlight serene.","Everyone slept soundly, unaware of what they would experience the next day...","...","After a night passed, the next day, just before dawn.","A streak of fish-white light shone into Taixu Mountain.","In the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua, who had practiced Formation painting all night as usual, opened his eyes, reflecting the brilliance of the morning glow.","Today is the day of the Taoist Conference.","And he must set out to participate in the formation competition.","Before departing, he specially went to the Elder’s Residence to visit Elder Master Xun and asked for advice:","\"Elder Master, is there anything in particular I should pay attention to?\"","\"There’s no need.\" Elder Master Xun replied.","At this point, there’s really nothing more to be concerned about.","However, Mo Hua felt somewhat nervous inside.","After all, it’s such a large-scale Array Discussion Conference, and it’s his first time participating, so naturally, some apprehension would remain.","Seeing this, Elder Master Xun said: \"Just keep your composure, don’t be overly complacent with victory or saddened by defeat, show some maturity, and don’t worry too much about other aspects, just focus on the formation painting.\"","\"Just focus on formation painting?\"","\"Yes,\" Elder Master Xun nodded, \"Just keep painting to the end.\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then nodded, \"Alright, Elder Master, I understand.\"","\"Go now.\" Elder Master Xun said.","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua bowed before departing.","Elder Master Xun watched Mo Hua’s departing figure, a gleam emerging from his clouded eyes.","This day has finally come...","...","Mo Hua left Taixu Gate and headed directly toward Mount of Tao.","This was also Elder Master Xun’s instruction, to let him go quietly by himself.","Upon reaching Mount of Tao, a grand spectacle met his eyes, with people as numerous as tidewaters and horses like Wandering Dragons.","Many cultivators were gathered at Mount of Tao, making it a grand affair.","Yet, compared to the Sword Discussion Conference, this scene was considered somewhat smaller.","The Sword Discussion Conference is all about real sword fighting and magic battles, with blade winds, sword rain, fire and water spells, superior Taoist skills, clashes of power, and thrilling encounters.","It is exceedingly entertaining.","No matter one’s level of cultivation, whether watching for the spectacle or seeking to understand deeper meanings, everyone finds it enjoyable.","However, the Taoist Conference events like Dan, Array, and Talisman are different, often perceived as dull if one doesn’t understand the nuances, failing to capture any excitement.","Especially formations.","Formations are obscure and profound.","Most cultivators who don’t understand formations get headaches in the face of abstract patterns, and watching cultivators draw formations seems extremely tedious to them.","Yet here at Qian Learning State Boundary, the heritage runs deep, and disciples between sects have some understanding of formations.","And this is the final session of the Taoist Conference, affecting the sect’s position, hence it bears significant importance.","Thus, many cultivators came to watch, but they were initially blocked from entering.","They couldn’t enter immediately.","The disciples participating in the Array Discussion Conference were prioritized to enter Mount of Tao.","Mo Hua was among these disciples.","In his hand was the Debating Jade Slip given by Elder Master Xun, representing a spot in the Array Discussion.","Moreover, it was a direct invitation bypassing qualifying trials.","This spot was quite precious.","Since the Array Discussion Conference tends to be dull and not greatly entertaining, the process was streamlined for this iteration.","Various selection criteria were prepared beforehand.","Selections involved multiple thresholds, such as cultivation level, formation master’s assessment, elder’s recommendation, preliminary assessments, etc.","To ensure that those participating were elite members from each sect.","Mo Hua’s \"spot\" allowed him to skip these tedious processes and directly participate in the final \"formation grand examination.\"","This spot was limited to only a few for each sect.","The lower-ranked sects might not have any at all.","Mo Hua grasped this weighty Jade Slip and entered Mount of Tao with the crowd.","At the entrance stood elders conducting checks, passing only after confirming all was correct.","The long queue moved solemnly and quietly forward.","When Mo Hua’s turn came, he stepped forward and handed the Debating Jade Slip to the verifying elder.","The elder hesitated visibly upon seeing Mo Hua, suspiciously taking the Jade Slip, verifying it multiple times, even calling for further checking, still somewhat perplexed.","Ultimately shaking his head, he allowed Mo Hua to pass, though internally he couldn’t help but grumble:","\"What is Taixu Gate doing, completely giving up? Just throwing any disciple into the Taoist Conference...\"","Mo Hua, however, didn’t think much of it, wore a calm expression, and walked into Mount of Tao.","Two hours later, all the disciples participating in the Array Discussion Conference had entered the Taoist Field.","Only then did the gates of Dao Mountain fully open.","The families and sect officials who came to observe, along with cultivators and disciples from various sects, densely packed like tidewaters, began entering Mount of Tao in droves."]},{"number":1733,"title":"Chapter 1733 - 881: Grand Event","paragraphs":["The Shangguan Family, Wenren Family, and Gu Family all came to observe the ceremony.","Wenren Wan held Yu Er’s little hand, walking among the Shangguan Family crowd.","Gu Changhuai was also present.","The Taoist Court is busy with affairs, and he’s not particularly interested in the Mount of Tao Conference, but Wenren Wan told him Mo Hua is also participating and pulled him along, so he had no choice.","Moreover, he shares a \"profound friendship\" with Mo Hua, so it wouldn’t be right not to come and see.","Additionally, representing the Taoist Court, Master Xia also came to observe.","Xia Canonical Official followed behind Master Xia, with a somewhat indifferent expression.","After the Xiao Tianquan incident, Xia Canonical Official’s status in the Xia family became somewhat distant, and her relationship with Uncle Master Xia also became somewhat estranged.","In the crowd, Master Xia and Gu Changhuai exchanged a glance, without saying anything.","After the noble families, came the sect elders.","The elders of the Four Great Sects, the Eight Great Gates, the Twelve Streams, and various other sects below them, all came to observe in significant numbers.","Among them, of course, are the elders from the Tai’a Sect, Rushing Void Sect, and Taixu Gate.","The Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect, having lost the Sword Debate, are essentially disheartened, so few people came.","But Taixu Gate is different.","This Array Discussion Conference is rather crucial for Taixu Gate.","Their current ranking is eighth.","Originally seventh in Sword Debate, but after the Tool Discussion, Pill Discussion, and Talisman Discussion, evidently, the Four Great Sects and Twelve Streams—projects where they hold the advantage—have slipped to eighth.","Though not yet on the verge of collapse, they are pretty close to the death line.","If they can hold on in this last round, they can preserve their position among the Eight Great Gates.","If not, then they’ll likely end up like the Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect.","Thus, most of the elders from Taixu Gate came.","Including the elders Xun Ziyou and Xun Zixian with whom Mo Hua was very familiar.","After the sect elders, come the regular disciples.","Many disciples from Taixu Gate came.","Including Cheng Mo, Situ Jian, Hao Xuan, Zheng Fang the junior brothers, Murong Caiyun, and Shangguan Xu the senior brothers and sisters of the previous batch also came.","Murong Caiyun and the others fought too fiercely during the Sword Discussion Conference, with almost everyone depleted of energy, their faces somewhat pale.","But this grand competition concerns the sect’s fate, so they had to come.","Finally, when the crowd surged like a tide, all converging onto the Mount of Tao, under the gaze of the masses, this last Mount of Tao Conference finally unfolded its curtain.","...","Mount of Tao, Great Dojo.","Between the enormous dojo, more than a thousand desks and meditation mats were set.","This is the venue for the Formation Grand Exam.","Near the Great Dojo, some high platforms were erected.","These high platforms are for the \"honored guests\" among the Taoist Court and various great families and sect leaders to observe.","Outside the high platforms are ordinary seating, densely packed, surrounding the area, numbering in tens of thousands.","Beyond the seating is Mount of Tao.","At this time, amidst the mountains, even on some trees, there are many disciples surrounding to watch.","The entire Mount of Tao, hill and dale, is full of cultivators—an illustrious spectacle.","After a moment, the disciples participating in the Array Discussion Conference gradually entered the Great Dojo, preparing themselves at their places for the Formation Grand Exam.","Everyone was watching these disciples, their gazes either filled with admiration or envy.","The ones who made it in are all talented in formations from various sects.","To represent their sect in this most prestigious debating event in the Qian Learning State Boundary is undoubtedly the cream of the crop.","And these disciples, without exception, are all in the Foundation Establishment Late Stage or even at the Peak.","Each one either stands tall or moves gracefully, with a demeanor either polite and courteous, or gentle and wise, making others envious and longing.","This group of formation genius disciples thus stepped into the dojo under thousands of gazes.","Until a distinctly out-of-place Mo Hua walked into the crowd.","With a fair youthful appearance and noticeably shorter stature, he walked among this group of disciples like a little lamb mingling with a pack of wolves...","The observing cultivators paused for a moment, then started whispering to each other:","\"Something’s off... this disciple looks so young?\"","\"His cultivation isn’t sufficient either.\"","\"Why do I feel like he’s only at the Foundation Building Middle Stage?\"","\"It’s not a feeling; he is at the Foundation Building Middle Stage!\"","\"What does this mean... Even a Middle Stage can participate in the Array Discussion Competition?\"","\"Cheating?\"","\"What cheating? I guess he got a spot and is participating as an exception...\"","\"An exception? Which sect does he belong to?\"","Someone said, \"Judging by the Taoist Robe, looks like he’s from Taixu Gate.\"","\"Taixu Gate?\"","Someone sighed: \"Is Taixu Gate out of people? Bringing a Foundation Building Middle Stage disciple to make up numbers? Is this a joke?\"","\"Probably has an unusual background, either a relative of the Sect Leader or backed by an Ancestor...\"","\"Most likely a noble offspring, snatching someone else’s spot.\"","Someone said unhappily: \"This kind of nepotism and backdoor dealings, I reckon Taixu Gate is done for.\"","This kind of criticism was happening across many places in the large seating area.","And the disciples from Taixu Gate also saw Mo Hua among the crowd.","They were stunned.","\"Junior Brother?\"","\"No wonder we couldn’t find Junior Brother, turns out he participated in the Array Discussion Competition, but how come we knew nothing about it?\"","One disciple said: \"Junior Brother acts in profound and mysterious ways, how could he let you know?\"","\"You’re flattering him now, but Junior Brother can’t hear you.\"","\"You don’t understand? He must always be kept in mind, so he can feel my admiration. Then, any formations he’ll have will be used for me first.\"","\"You’re dreaming.\"","\"I’ve verified this. Last time, I gifted Junior Brother...\""]},{"number":1734,"title":"Chapter 1734 - 881: Grand Event","paragraphs":["\"Let’s get back to the matter at hand, don’t get sidetracked...\"","\"Oh, by the way, why can Junior Brother participate? Is it a spot given by Elder Master Xun?\"","\"I guess so.\"","\"Why?\"","\"Junior Brother is good at Formation, isn’t he.\"","\"No kidding, do you really need to say that? But...\" the disciple hesitated, \"This is a Foundation Establishment Late Stage competition, and the opponents are a tier above us, all of them are the top Formation geniuses from the entire Qian Learning State Boundary, even the Four Great Sects are involved, how can we compete?\"","His words silenced everyone.","Even if they believed Junior Brother’s Formation skills were extraordinary, they wouldn’t be so arrogant as to think he was better than all the Formation geniuses in the Qian Learning State Boundary.","Moreover, these are Formation geniuses who are a tier above them.","This is in the Qian Learning State Boundary, where families gather and sects are numerous, with exceptional Superior-Grade Heavenly Prides as numerous as fish crossing the river.","Everyone felt a bit worried.","Cheng Mo, however, didn’t care about that much, \"Since Elder Master Xun allowed Junior Brother to participate, he must have already considered it, we don’t need to worry.\"","\"Besides, in my opinion, with Junior Brother’s abilities, he’s not much worse than the so-called geniuses from other sects.\"","Cheng Mo had been mingling with Mo Hua for a long time, and had a \"mysterious confidence\" in Mo Hua.","He then added, \"Of course, if Junior Brother wins, it means he’s impressive, and if he loses, it’s just because he’s disadvantaged by his young age and low cultivation, not because he’s less skilled!\"","Anyway, according to him, Mo Hua, being a tier younger, loses but still wins, and winning is an even greater win.","A group of disciples nodded in agreement, \"Exactly, exactly!\"","On the other side, Murong Caiyun and Shangguan Xu, who were familiar with Mo Hua, looked a bit stunned.","\"Is that... Mo Hua?\"","\"Seems like it...\"","\"How did Mo Hua participate in the competition?\"","Everyone looked at each other in confusion.","\"Did he sneak in himself?\"","\"How could that be? The Array Discussion Conference is no child’s play, and the identity checks are very strict.\"","\"Was it... the Sect Leader or Ancestor who made an exception and gave him a spot?\"","\"Why?\"","Shangguan Xu seemed thoughtful.","Murong Caiyun’s heart skipped a beat.","She could almost conclude that this must be Ancestor Xun’s intention.","And the Ancestor wouldn’t do anything without meaning.","Allowing Mo Hua to participate means that in his heart, Mo Hua has the strength to compete for a place for Taixu Gate.","Murong Caiyun tightly clenched her fists.","The Murong family and Taixu Gate share weal and woe, and she is also Taixu Gate’s \"senior sister\" of this generation, bearing heavy responsibility.","Yet even if she fought with all her might, she could only achieve this much at the moment.","In this final round, it’s about Formation, and she is powerless, only able to watch.","But if Mo Hua takes action...","In Murong Caiyun’s heart, an inexplicable sense of relief was born, along with an inexplicable anticipation...","...","On the high stage.","Wenren Wan also saw Mo Hua.","She was direct in her purpose, originally not looking at anyone but staring at Mo Hua.","As soon as Mo Hua appeared, Wenren Wan’s expression brightened, immediately pointing it out to Yu Er, \"Yu Er, look, Brother Mo is there.\"","Yu Er saw Mo Hua, his eyes sparkled, and he couldn’t help but clap his hands happily, wanting to cheer Mo Hua on.","At this moment, a cold and biting voice rang out:","\"Standing improperly, sitting improperly, so young with no manners, how can you possibly take on the Family Head’s responsibilities in the future?\"","The speaker was a female Elder dressed in green, heavily made-up.","She was also of the Shen Family, married into the Shangguan Family, and was the same female Elder who repeatedly made things difficult for Wenren Wan at the last banquet.","Such difficulties were within Wenren Wan’s expectations.","Since she came to observe with the Shangguan Family, she knew such things were inevitable, so she treated the harsh words as wind passing by, paying them no mind.","This female Elder, already petty, felt even more resentful after being ignored.","Seeing that Wenren Wan didn’t acknowledge her, she then turned her attention to Yu Er.","When Yu Er caught her gaze, it was as if he’d been stung by a venomous bee, immediately retreating in fear.","But soon Yu Er remembered Mo Hua’s advice:","A real man should stand tall and be righteous, as long as you have a clear conscience, you should fear no one!","Courage was born again in Yu Er’s heart, and he quietly peeked out, imitating Mo Hua by making a mocking face at the female Elder.","This unexpected move shocked the female Elder.","Just as she was about to glare at Yu Er, Yu Er had already wisely retracted, burying his face in his mother’s embrace, giggling.","Wenren Wan was momentarily stunned but couldn’t help but smile with pursed lips afterward.","Only the female Elder was trembling with rage, her powder-coated face turning pale.","In her heart, the families of Shangguan Yi and Shangguan Yu were weak in temperament, unfit to inherit the position of Shangguan Family Head.","Only after Shangguan Yi’s family is finished would this position be vacant, and then her own children would have more opportunities in the future.","But who would have thought, this formerly timid little brat actually dared to show off in front of her now!","The green-clad female Elder was filled with hatred, but at this moment, she could only silently fume, not daring to really do anything to Yu Er.","And all of this was observed by Shang Che from his seat.","He didn’t care about the actions of this female Elder from the Shen Family.","Instead, it was Yu Er, this child, who was so lively, even appearing somewhat \"naughty,\" almost like a \"normal child.\"","Shang Che frowned slightly.","Could the Ancestor’s prophecy be wrong...","Has Yu Er’s great tribulation already dissipated?","Shang Che was deep in thought."]},{"number":1735,"title":"Chapter 1735 - 881: Grand Event","paragraphs":["\"Brother Shangguan?\"","The Gu Family Master beside called out.","Shang Che turned his head, smiled apologetically, and continued his conversation with the Gu Family Master.","Before this, both of their gazes had swept over Mo Hua; although surprised, they did not care much.","On the other side of the high platform, the elders of the Four Great Sects sat in a circle.","The elders of the Four Great Sects hold higher status than ordinary sect elders, and their seating is also better.","At this moment, several elders were drinking tea and chatting leisurely.","\"This Array Discussion Conference can be considered a success...\"","\"Indeed, once today’s Array Competition concludes, everything will be settled, and the sect reforms will begin to show results, allowing our Four Great Sects to elevate our power even further.\"","\"In the future, under the leadership of our Four Great Sects, the Qianxue State Boundary will surely prosper!\"","\"Let us toast with tea for our Four Sects to advance together and seek great ambitions.\"","\"Excellent!\"","Many elders drank their tea, but in their eyes flickered different thoughts.","After a moment, an elder from the Heavenly Sword Sect, in a Taoist robe embroidered with sword patterns, glanced at the myriad heavenly prides below the stage, especially the disciples of the Qian Taoist Sect, and couldn’t help but sigh:","\"This Array Discussion Conference, unsurprisingly, the leader should still fall to the Qian Taoist Sect...\"","Elder Shen waved his hands repeatedly: \"Oh, not at all, the previous session was my Qian Taoist Sect’s fortunate luck to get first place, we won’t have such good fortune this time...\"","\"Moreover, from what I saw just now,\" Elder Shen said, \"Elder Xiaoo, your Heavenly Sword Sect also has a disciple with incredible talent in formations. In my opinion, this time the array leader will belong to your Heavenly Sword Sect!\"","The elder from the Heavenly Sword Sect said discontentedly: \"Elder Shen, you are speaking nonsense with your eyes open. If we talk about the depth of formation study, how can my Heavenly Sword Sect compare to your Qian Taoist Sect.\"","\"The disciples we teach are a bit weaker in formation inheritance.\"","\"After all, tracing back the formation inheritance of your Qian Taoist Sect, you can nearly reach that sect full of evil monsters...\"","Elder Shen now truly felt displeased, shook his head, and said:","\"Elder Xiaoo’s words are mistaken. My Qian Taoist Sect’s success today is due to the unity of the sect, toiling arduously step by step. Other so-called sources and inheritances are mostly rumors, not to be easily believed.\"","\"That makes it even more commendable!\" The Heavenly Sword Sect elder felt disdain in his heart, but praised aloud, \"Elder Shen need not be modest; this time’s array leader surely belongs to your Qian Taoist Sect!\"","Elder Shen declined: \"I don’t dare harbor such extravagant hopes. I’ve looked over; my Qian Taoist Sect’s disciples this time are not as good as yours from Heavenly Sword Sect.\"","The Heavenly Sword Sect elder’s eyes shifted, and he said: \"When you put it like that, I also think Longding Sect has a great chance; I just glanced at their disciples, their divine thoughts are profound, their formation study is profound, they should not be underestimated.\"","The elder from Longding Sect said: \"You all pretend to be humble, don’t drag me into it. I know my own situation; if it’s about martial arts we’re okay, but in formations, we’re worth mentioning...\"","Elder Xiaoo of the Heavenly Sword Sect then turned his gaze to the Wanxiao Sect elder beside him. Before he could speak, the Wanxiao Sect elder smiled and said:","\"My Wanxiao Sect is just here to accompany the run. If we can get the last place, it’s already blessed, no more lofty hopes.\"","\"Too modest...\"","\"Let’s not talk about this, let’s have some tea...\"","\"This is good tea I specially prepared...\"","\"Please.\"","\"Please...\"","The elders exchanged pleasantries again and then politely partook in tea.","However, as they raised their teacups, the smiles on their faces faded, their eyes varied, filled with unknown intentions.","The four great sect elders, engaged in idle chatter with their own thoughts, almost nobody noticed the quiet and nameless Mo Hua.","At this moment, below the high platform.","No longer an elder of the Qian Taoist Sect, Elder Zheng sat among the crowd, his expression indifferent as he scanned the disciples in the Great Dojo.","Then he saw a familiar and refined silhouette.","Elder Zheng was startled.","\"Mo Hua...\"","He was initially a little incredulous; after a moment, the always stoic elder couldn’t help but smile slightly.","\"Indeed, sometimes the world surprises you if you hold expectation...\"","Elder Zheng slowly sat upright, anticipating the upcoming tournament.","...","Outside the Great Dojo, the scene was noisy and bustling, showing all sorts of appearances.","Within the Great Dojo, the affairs of the Array Discussion Conference proceeded orderly.","Under the guidance of an instructor, Mo Hua entered the Taoist Field, found his place according to order.","It was a small, secluded corner seat of the Taoist Field.","A table, a cushion.","Ordinary and unremarkable.","Moreover, it was far from the center of the Taoist Field, where the core disciples of the Four Great Sects and other sects were located.","Mo Hua remained calm, remembering Elder Master Xun’s instructions, neither sad nor joyful, restraining emotions, simply focusing on formation painting.","Just keep drawing...","Thanks to daily cultivation, Mo Hua quickly secluded his mind from external distractions, achieving inner calmness; his heart no longer held tension or unease.","Quietly, he sat on the cushion.","Even with all eyes on him, his mind was like a clear mirror, undisturbed.","No one around affected him anymore.","After thirty minutes, the chief examiner, with stern demeanor, ascended the stage to declare formation principles and array competition rules, repeatedly forbidding cheating.","Then he personally rang the Debating Bell.","As its ancient sound lingered, echoing in every corner of the Mount of Tao.","The Array Discussion Conference officially began.","Examiners distributed test questions in turn.","Mo Hua unveiled the questions, glanced at them.","Out of politeness, caution, and respect for the Array Discussion Conference, he looked over a few more times, confirming the simplicity before beginning to write.","Just a mere Sixteen Patterns formation.","He could draw it with his eyes closed.","Mo Hua wielded his pen, within a few breaths left a trail of flowing, yet dragon-like formation patterns on the paper..."]},{"number":1736,"title":"Chapter 1736 - 882: Super Rank","paragraphs":["The Array Discussion Conference adopts the format of a formation assessment, with a three-defeat elimination.","Accumulating three formation failures, either unable to paint or painting incorrectly, is considered a defeat and results in leaving the examination hall.","This grants the disciples a certain degree of tolerance.","After all, formations are vast and profound, with diverse categories, varied styles, and myriad legacies.","No matter how excellent a disciple is, it is impossible to ensure painting every formation correctly without any errors.","If a disciple with nineteen-pattern strength fails due to a flaw in inheritance or a momentary mistake, painting a sixteen-pattern formation incorrectly, it would be too unfortunate if they had to leave.","While the Array Discussion Array is a competition, its essence is still \"selection\".","To select the truly exceptional Array Dao geniuses.","Thus, efforts are made to avoid some \"blunder\" situations.","With the ability to test disciples’ formation experience, formation foundation, formation painting ability, Divine Thought depth, will strength, and other strengths, while also providing a certain degree of tolerance, the \"three-defeat\" formation assessment has gradually been adopted, becoming the mainstream format of the Array Competition.","The Array Competition starts from sixteen patterns, testing one pattern upward.","Each pattern is a checkpoint, requiring the painting of a certain number of formations.","Participating disciples who accumulate three formation failures are considered defeated in the Array Discussion.","Rankings are determined based on the order of defeat.","The individual who persists to the end is the Array Leader of this Array Dao Conference.","At this time, the first formations tested are the sixteen patterns.","The sixteen-pattern formation is only a Second Grade Middle Stage Array, and under Mo Hua’s pen flows like clouds and water, completing several sixteen-pattern formations in no time.","After completion, he glanced over with inspection, confirmed no errors, and relaxed mindfully.","Then he sat upright, resting with closed eyes.","Elder Master Xun said the formation assessment is a lengthy process, a significant test of Divine Thought, a tug-of-war.","Therefore, one must seize every moment to recover Divine Sense.","Soon, many other disciples in the hall also completed the formations and were meditating for rest.","This is the Qian Learning State Boundary’s Array Discussion Conference for the Foundation Establishment Late Stage and above, with countless geniuses.","The formation questions painted easily by Mo Hua are, for most people, not difficult.","To reach this stage, one would not be unable to paint a sixteen-pattern formation.","Of course, exceptions exist in any assessment.","Some disciples in the hall began scratching their heads, regretting, face turning pale, or sighing with hands covering their faces.","Some have sufficient Divine Thought but not enough formation strength; they fail on formations they cannot paint, the painted formations are not tested, leading to defeat with a darkened face.","Others have adequate formation strength but insufficient Divine Thought, unable to withstand such continuous consumption, making mistakes.","Others have no issue with formation strength or Divine Thought but lack psychological resilience, tense during major assessments.","At this time, under the gaze of all, the pressure intensifies, unable to unleash more than twenty percent strength.","Scarcely painting a few strokes, hands begin trembling, mind goes blank.","Quickly, after completing three formations and using up all three tolerances, they can only retreat with a defeated expression.","The mentors of these disciples also stood by, beating their chests and stamping their feet, sighing with regret.","Thus, the sixteen-pattern formation assessment cleared out a small batch of disciples.","Some have already made mistakes on one or even two formations, with little tolerance left, and can only brace themselves for the last stand.","Approximately one-third of cultivators have not made a single mistake.","Among them is Mo Hua.","By his side, one or two people have already retreated; Mo Hua remains seated steadily.","This scene is noticed by everyone familiar with Mo Hua.","Junior Brothers of Taixu Gate, the senior brothers and sisters from the higher level, the closely acquainted Elders, as well as Wenren Wan and Gu Changhuai, all breathed a sigh of relief.","Fortunately, he held up...","Though they know Mo Hua’s formation level is good.","This is, after all, a formation assessment, with so many people watching, the on-site pressure is immense, and all his opponents are naturally older and more cultivated geniuses from various sects.","They feared Mo Hua would not endure the pressure and make a mistake, ending with an early exit.","Thankfully, indeed...","Getting past sixteen patterns is fine; after all, securing at least some ranking, it wouldn’t be disgraceful to mention.","Many silently thought this.","With the sixteen patterns done, next is the seventeen patterns.","There is a rest period of about an hour in between.","This schedule is ample for Mo Hua, his Divine Sense has fully recovered during this time.","After an hour, the seventeen-pattern assessment begins.","Suddenly, the difficulty increases sharply.","Sixteen patterns belong to Second Grade Middle Stage formations; seventeen patterns advance into Second Grade High-Level formations.","This serves as a major threshold, which is \"genius\" territory for typical Foundation Establishment disciples.","The true formation masters who can learn the Second Grade High-Level formations at the Foundation Establishment Realm are scarce throughout the cultivation world.","Among the examination hall, the eliminated cultivators visibly increase.","Many ponder repeatedly, scratching their heads, unable to solve the problem.","But formations are such that no matter the effort, if one cannot paint, they simply cannot, especially under exam conditions, with no time to think.","Finally, these disciples can only sigh deeply, giving up helplessly.","Some painted wrongly, exhausted their three chances, could only regret sadly, blaming themselves for not working harder or painting a few more times in normal times.","So close yet so far...","Moreover, some disciples, while painting, had their Divine Sense entirely depleted, covering their heads and collapsing as the invigilator took them down for rescue..."]},{"number":1737,"title":"Chapter 1737 - 882: Super Rank (Part 2)","paragraphs":["...","The situation became slightly tense.","The assessment of the Seventeen Patterns Formation, compared to the Sixteen Patterns, was much longer.","Tension and suppression gradually permeated the examination hall, and more and more disciples couldn’t hold on and retreated.","But Mo Hua was still silently painting as if there was no one else around...","Cheng Mo, Situ Jian, Murong Caiyun, Wenren Wan, all who knew Mo Hua, were secretly sweating.","\"Come on, Junior Brother...\"","\"Mo Hua...\"","\"Just hold on...\"","These people were on tenterhooks for Mo Hua, their hearts extremely tense.","But many of the onlookers were not concerned about the formation, nor were there any Heavenly Prides from their sects participating, they were just there to enjoy the commotion, and at this moment, they all found it tedious.","\"Formations are indeed boring...\"","\"I don’t know what they’re drawing.\"","\"It’s too oppressive, just watching it gives me goosebumps.\"","\"Those people, while drawing, start holding their heads with pale faces, is it really that painful?\" someone didn’t understand.","\"If you draw formations, not much, three pieces a day, you’ll know how painful it is after one.\"","\"I’m too lazy to draw.\"","\"So boring, how long does this have to take?\"","\"I don’t know, probably a whole day...\"","\"So long... really hard for them, one brush, one inkstone, a pile of formations drawn for a whole day...\"","\"What do you know?\"","\"I’m too lazy to know...\"","Outside the Great Dojo, some simple onlookers, those who came just for the fun, gradually left.","Those who remained were mostly cultivators who truly understood formations and were determined to walk the path of a Formation Master.","Or those who were concerned about the honor of their sect, having fellow or senior sect disciples competing on stage.","Those who understood often watched with admiration. Those concerned for their sect watched anxiously.","Time slowly passed.","Inside the Great Dojo, each sect’s formation geniuses bore enormous pressure, arduously drawing formation after formation.","The process was quite torturous and long.","Outside the Great Dojo, some felt it was dull and left, while some outside cultivators entered again to observe.","Wenren Wan was holding Yu Er, mother and child, watching Mo Hua in the field intently.","At this moment, a deep but gentle voice sounded:","\"Wan’er.\"","Wenren Wan was startled, raised her head, and saw a tall and handsome middle-aged man standing next to her, delightfully saying:","\"Father.\"","This man, with a stern air about his brows and eyes, had several high-cultivated elders following behind him. He was Wenren Wan’s father, the current head of the Wenren Family, Wenren Jingxuan.","Yu Er peeked out from Wenren Wan’s arms, his eyes bright and twinkling, crisply saying: \"Grandpa.\"","Wenren Jingxuan smiled at Yu Er, but in his heart, there was also a slight surprise.","Yu Er’s gaze was too lively and had become much more cheerful and open, but the more it was so, the more there was an obscure unease in his heart.","On the high platform, the Shangguan Family Master Shang Che and the Gu Family Master Gu Shouyan, both got up and came down to greet him out of respect:","\"Brother Wenren.\"","\"Brother Shangguan, Brother Gu,\" Wenren Jingxuan cupped his hands and said, \"I came late, apologies.\"","\"Brother Wenren, you’re too polite, please take the seat of honor.\"","\"Please.\"","Wenren Jingxuan then proceeded with the two to the seats of honor.","After sitting down, they exchanged a few polite words.","Wenren Jingxuan then cast his gaze toward the Taoist field, looking around at the sect disciples who were diligently writing.","And what these people painstakingly drew were the Seventeen Patterns of the Second Grade High-Level Formation.","Even as the head of a family, he couldn’t help but feel a sense of awe:","\"The Qianxue State Boundary truly deserves to be the holy land for cultivators across the world to seek learning.\"","\"Among each family and clan, those who can draw Second Grade Middle Stage Formations in the Foundation Establishment Realm are few and far between, yet in the Qianxue State Boundary, such talented disciples can indeed fill such a vast Taoist field, truly... breathtaking.\"","\"The Qian Dao never ceases, the land being spiritually rich and people talented, the reputation is well-deserved...\"","Shang Che and Gu Shouyan also nodded.","They were all family heads, and could comprehend even more the value of talent.","In the various branches of Tao cultivation, formations are crucial.","If not for this, these family leaders, entangled in various affairs, wouldn’t possibly take time out of their busy schedules to specially come to the Tao Discussion Convention to watch these disciples compete in formations.","Second Grade Formations might not mean much.","But it depends on whom is drawing them.","Drawing Second Grade Formations with a Golden Core compared to a Foundation Establishment is entirely different.","Drawing a Second Grade High-Level Formation in the Foundation Establishment Realm, this is a bona fide genius.","A genius signifies the future.","These genius disciples filling the arena, perhaps they are not yet well-known.","But in the near future, someone might achieve mastery in formations, ascend into the Heaven Shu Pavilion, and be revered as a Formation Master.","Perhaps one day, among the disciples present, someone could accumulate knowledge and make an amazing leap, comprehending the Taoist Meaning, and become a grand master of formations, standing in command for ages, revered by millions, which is not impossible.","If one doesn’t make connections now and build good rapport, it might soon become unreachable.","After all, this is the cultivation world, where the Heavenly Dao is unfathomable, and nothing is impossible.","At this moment, the three of Wenren Jingxuan were sipping tea, casually chatting, while lowering their gaze, scrutinizing the disciples who stood out in formations in the field.","Their focus was mostly on those few disciples in the forefront of the field.","These few disciples all belonged to the Four Great Sects.","The one at the foremost was a handsome heir with careful thinking and a stable temperament, from the Shen Family of the Qian Daoist Sect.","One with prominent sword-like brows and a dashing aura, from the Xiaoo Family of the Heavenly Sword Sect, his formation drawing technique like a sharp blade and sword.","Longding Sect also had a genius, from the Ao Family. With thick eyebrows and large eyes, a rugged appearance, he hardly looked like a Formation Master, but his formation talents could not be underestimated."]},{"number":1738,"title":"Chapter 1738 - 882: Super Rank_3","paragraphs":["The last person is a female disciple named Duanmu Xue, from the Wanxiao Sect. Her appearance is simple yet elegant, and her demeanor is stern, not good at speaking, but her Divine Sense is rather profound.","In the hearts of several Family Heads, they have long been aware of these disciples.","After all, disciples with a specialty in Formations cannot be unknown; they are the \"hot cakes\" in the eyes of various forces.","But truly wanting to establish some connection with these Heaven’s Chosen Sons is not that easy.","After all, \"wolves are many and meat is scant,\" and unknown numbers of families, like Hungry Wolves, fix their eyes on these dazzling Heavenly Prides.","Though Wenren and Shangguan are fifth-grade families, they do not have much competitiveness either.","And the Gu Family, even less so.","Gu Shouyan could only sit and watch.","Such Formation geniuses from the Four Great Sects are related to him, a fourth-grade family barely scratching the fifth-grade threshold, with a network of a \"clear stream\" Gu Family, almost not at all.","Outside the Four Great Sects, there are also some disciples with good Formation talents.","But comparing them with the top Heavenly Prides of the Four Great Sects, they clearly pale in comparison.","Nevertheless, they are not the top but still first-rate.","First-rate genius is also a genius, not to be underestimated.","Wenren Jingxuan and Shang Che both silently selected candidates in their hearts, planning to have someone bring some gifts to these Formation Heavenly Prides afterward, establishing a good relationship, and forging a favorable connection.","Both are Feather Transformation, with powerful Divine Sense, after scanning the area slightly, they already have a rough idea.","And the assessment of Seventeen Patterns is still ongoing, unable to end shortly.","Several Family Heads slightly relaxed, starting to drink tea and chat.","Wenren Jingxuan glanced and saw his daughter Wenren Wan, sitting with Yu Er at the far edge of the high platform, seemingly somewhat estranged from the other members of the Shangguan Family, and immediately felt uncomfortable in his heart.","This daughter has been treated preciously by him from a young age.","But after marrying into the Shangguan Family, clearly she is not living happily.","Wenren Jingxuan slightly squinted his eyes and said, \"Brother Shangguan, my little daughter married into the Shangguan Family, I wonder if she has caused any trouble?\"","Shang Che replied indifferently, \"Wan’er is compliant and gentle, she has not caused any trouble.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, a chuckle sounded.","The laughter was from the green-clothed female Elder from the Shen Family.","Wenren Jingxuan frowned.","Yet before he could say anything, an Elder Feathered Immortal from the Shangguan Family reprimanded that female elder:","\"Family Head meeting, silence is required.\"","This Elder Feathered Immortal, named Shangguan Wang, had deep law-pattern lines and was the Powerful Elders of the Shangguan Family, even had once competed with Shang Che for the position of Family Head.","Even in failure, his lineage’s influence in the Shangguan Family remains significant.","Shangguan Wang feigned reprimand, actually with a pointed hint saying: \"Mind the occasion, say what you have to say back later.\"","The female Elder whispered, \"Yes...\"","Wenren Jingxuan raised an eyebrow, couldn’t fail to see their intentions, \"Elder Wang, did my daughter commit any mistake?\"","Shangguan Wang looked troubled.","Wenren Jingxuan said, \"Elder Wang, just speak freely.\"","Shangguan Wang’s gaze slightly deepened, then said, \"If talking about serious mistakes, not really, but the Young Madam, a bit self-willed indeed...\"","\"As a daughter-in-law of the Shangguan Family, she spends all her time at the Gu Family. She indulges the direct lineage Young Master Yu too much, not sure what her intentions are, she even raised him in the Taixu Gate.\"","\"In managing businesses, there are quite a few bad debts under her charge.\"","\"Privately embezzled quite a few Spirit Stones.\"","\"Her actions are not very steady, also failed to fulfill her duties as a wife to Mr. Yi...\"","He then recited Wenren Wan’s misconducts, exaggerating them.","Some are indeed true, but most of them, like managing businesses, embezzling Spirit Stones, are merely a distortion of common occurrences of temporary profit and loss, Spirit Stone turnover into faults.","Occasional discord between spouses also became others’ gossip fodder.","Other Shangguan Family members, especially those close to Shangguan Wang, joined in agreement.","Wenren Wan couldn’t defend herself, her face went pale.","Wenren Jingxuan furrowed his brow tightly.","\"Those are not the most severe...\" Shangguan Wang remained calm, sighed, but his gaze harbored sharpness, saying:","\"The most outrageous, is a few years back, she coaxed Mr. Yi to use a great deal of the Shangguan Family’s connections, to forcibly insert an unrelated disciple into the Eight Great Gates.\"","\"These connections belong to the Shangguan Family, but the person inserted into the Eight Great Gates, not only had no relation to the Shangguan Family, but also to the Wenren Family and even the Gu Family.\"","\"This matter is really indefensible.\"","The slot in the Eight Great Gates is extremely precious.","Wenren Wan put Mo Hua into the Eight Great Gates, the favor expended, the benefits paid, were actually more than Mo Hua imagined.","More importantly, Mo Hua’s talents actually fell far short of the threshold to enter the Taixu Gate.","This outcome resulted in spending even more favors.","And these, Wenren Wan, fearing Mo Hua would have psychological burdens, never mentioned before him.","But these benefits were sliced from the Shangguan Family.","Originally, with proper maneuvering, relying on these favors, two, even three disciples of slightly lesser talents in the Shangguan Family could have been sent into the Eight Great Gates.","Now all those slots are gone.","That is the Eight Great Gates! It is a first-rate sect of the Qian Learning State Boundary, an opportunity many cultivators could long for throughout their lifetimes, yet untouchable.","Thus, it was handed over like this.","This matter secretly offended too many members of the Shangguan Family.","Thereafter, Wenren Wan was even less favored by the Shangguan Family.","These events, Wenren Jingxuan only heard of briefly, but did not understand.","He is the Family Head, managing many affairs.","Furthermore, Wan’er married into the Shangguan Family, and the Wenren Family always had strained relations with the Shangguan Family, making it inconvenient for him to inquire further."]},{"number":1739,"title":"Chapter 1739 - 882: Super Rank 4","paragraphs":["Wenren Jingxuan looked at Wenren Wan and asked in a deep voice: \"Wan’er, is this true?\"","\"Yes...\" Wenren Wan kept her head down, biting her lip hard, but still insisted, \"Mo Hua saved Yu’er, that’s why I...\"","Mo Hua?","Wenren Jingxuan was slightly startled, thinking this must be the disciple Wan’er inserted into the Eight Great Gates...","Meanwhile, Shangguan Wang retorted:","\"How could a mere little cultivator at the Foundation Establishment Early Stage save Young Master Yu’er, whom even the Gu Family and the Taoist Court couldn’t rescue?\"","Wenren Wan was taken aback, \"It’s... a coincidence...\"","\"A coincidence?\" Shangguan Wang said indifferently, \"Miss Wan, do you believe that?\"","Wenren Wan couldn’t speak.","Because she indeed didn’t know.","Regarding Mo Hua’s matters, she had always been tolerant, never asking deeply.","Shangguan Wang sighed, expressing disappointment: \"Do you know what they’re saying outside?\"","\"Outside, the rumors say, our Shangguan family’s direct lineage Young Madam, found a ’wild child’ from somewhere, and treats him as her own, even sparing no effort to send him into the Eight Great Gates...\"","This suspicion was extremely malicious.","Wenren Wan’s face turned deathly pale, and then flushed blood red.","Beside her, Gu Changhuai finally couldn’t hold back, slammed the table, and angrily shouted at Shangguan Wang: \"You’re talking nonsense!\"","Shangguan Wang’s gaze instantly turned icy.","Gu Shouyan immediately reprimanded: \"Changhuai, be polite!\"","\"Family Head...\"","Gu Changhuai wanted to say more, but seeing Gu Shouyan slightly shake his head at him, he could only swallow his words.","Yet, he couldn’t stand seeing his cousin suffer such injustice, so he cupped his hands to Wenren Jingxuan and said: \"Regarding Yu’er’s matter, I was investigating it at the time, and although there were some coincidental factors, Mo Hua indeed saved Yu’er.\"","\"And my cousin sent Mo Hua to the Taixu Gate not only to repay kindness but also because Mo Hua has an extraordinary talent in formations...\"","Shangguan Wang asked: \"How extraordinary?\"","Gu Changhuai replied: \"The ancestor of the Taixu Gate personally taught him formations...\"","Shangguan Wang sneered, \"Don’t think I don’t know that most disciples who enter the Taixu Gate have been personally taught formations by the respected and morally upright ancestor of the Taixu Gate, adhering to the sect’s teachings.\"","Gu Changhuai paused, falling silent momentarily.","\"Moreover, formation talent isn’t spoken of, but competed with,\" Shangguan Wang sneered, pointing downwards, \"The disciples here in the Taoist Field are the ones with truly remarkable talent in formations. Can you guarantee that this Mo Hua will be qualified to participate in the Array Discussion Conference in three years?\"","Gu Changhuai was stunned for a moment, then relaxed, his gaze sharp: \"No need for three years...\"","He also pointed downward, \"He’s already competing this year!\"","Everyone followed his direction of pointing and indeed saw in the corner of the Taoist Field, a young and handsome little disciple earnestly drawing formations.","The crowd was somewhat astonished.","Some in the crowd already knew about this, but most of the Shangguan family, Wenren family, and some Gu Family cultivators had no idea and couldn’t even fathom it.","\"Mid-stage Foundation Establishment, participating in the Array Discussion Conference?\"","\"Is this child’s talent really that exceptional?\"","\"Must be under the ancestor’s care; otherwise, he wouldn’t get this opportunity...\"","\"Even so, it’s still remarkable...\"","Even Wenren Jingxuan was somewhat surprised, deliberately taking a closer look at Mo Hua, his gaze slightly tense.","Shangguan Wang felt a sudden jolt in his heart.","He immediately realized he had miscalculated.","Unexpectedly, he had handed the \"spearhead\" over to others, stabbing himself.","He mainly hadn’t realized such an absurd thing as a mid-stage Foundation Establishment participating in the Array Discussion Conference would occur.","But having lived many years among families plotting against each other, he was incredibly experienced, long achieving the ability to remain calm and collected.","At this moment, his expression unchanged, he sneered:","\"His formation talent is good, but so what? Participating in the Array Discussion Conference now is rushing growth, lucky if he manages to complete a formation of sixteen patterns.\"","\"Moreover, that’s not the point at all.\"","\"No matter how good his talent, is his surname Shangguan? Wenren? Or is it Gu?\"","\"Not at all! No one knows where this child is from.\"","\"There are many geniuses, so why did the Young Madam go all out just for this child to be sent into the Eight Great Gates?\"","\"Fine, let’s say it’s to repay kindness, I believe it, but does anyone else?\"","\"Can this explanation silence the public’s opinions? Can it stop others’ gossip? Protect the Shangguan family’s reputation?\"","Shangguan Wang looked around, and boldly said even more bluntly, \"Some families are even spreading...","\"The young madam of the Shangguan Family, unmarried, gave birth...\"","Bang!","Wenren Jingxuan slammed the table into pieces, his gaze cold as frost, \"Elder Wang, watch your words.\"","After all, Shangguan Wang was someone who almost became the Family Head; he still harbored that ambition now, so he was not afraid. Instead, he feigned a sigh:","\"These words damage the reputation of the Shangguan Family; I find them unpleasant to hear, but there’s nothing I can do, as people’s mouths are their own...\"","Wenren Jingxuan gave a cold glance at Shang Che.","Shang Che then slowly spoke: \"Enough, let the clear be clear, and the murky be murky, let’s not bring this matter up again.\"","Gu Shouyan also said: \"We are here to observe the Array Discussion Conference, so don’t talk about these trivial matters.\"","Wenren Jingxuan did not speak, but his face did not look good.","Shangguan Wang also wisely chose to let it go.","Although there were some unexpected issues, his goals were essentially achieved.","He had tarnished the daughter-in-law of Shang Che, and more so, planted a thorn in the minds of Shang Che and Wenren Jingxuan.","Only Wenren Wan, who suffered cold sarcasm and rumors, looked pale as she held Yu Er tightly in her arms, her expression forlorn, and remained silent.","Yu Er wanted to comfort her mother, but after wiping her tears, she did not know what to say.","Gu Changhuai felt heartache but was helpless.","...","There was intrigue among the families.","Meanwhile, in the Taoist Field, the Seventeen Patterns competition was gradually coming to an end.","Mo Hua put down the brush, checked several times, and continued to meditate to restore Divine Sense.","Around him, many disciples had already failed and left the stage.","Another hour went by, and time was up.","The Seventeen Patterns exam ended.","A multitude of examiners came down to the field, starting to review scripts one by one to judge right from wrong and determine who would stay or leave.","Those who didn’t complete their drawing, drew it incorrectly, or made mistakes without realizing them were pointed out by the examiners and cleared off the field.","Some disciples, despite losing, still refused to leave their spots.","The examiners then ordered someone to forcibly drag them away.","As a result, even more people left the stage.","Soon after, an examiner walked up to Mo Hua.","Seeing Mo Hua’s young age and shallow cultivation, yet pretending to sit there calmly, he assumed he must have been defeated and was lingering unwilling to depart.","Until he saw the flawless, perfectly executed formation test paper in front of Mo Hua, the examiner was stunned.","The examiner couldn’t help but rub his eyes, frowning, and carefully verified the paper once more to confirm that there was nothing wrong with the handwriting, the questions, or the formation drawn before he could shake his head in amazement.","\"This child drew so well...\"","\"Passed.\"","The examiner left a red mark, signifying Mo Hua’s advancement, then continued onward.","But after taking just a few steps, he suddenly sensed something was amiss.","\"Something’s not right...\"","Not right, not right, not right...","The examiner’s frown deepened, his thoughts momentarily in disarray, until he finally realized what was wrong after pondering carefully.","\"Seventeen Patterns Formation?\"","\"Mid-stage Foundation Establishment, drawing Seventeen Patterns Formation?\"","\"Seventeen Patterns...\"","Sev... Seventeen Patterns, is...","The examiner’s eyes widened abruptly.","Isn’t this... a formation that can only be drawn at the Foundation Establishment Late Stage, being drawn by someone at the mid-stage cultivation?!","This means...","This child’s Divine Sense, has surpassed the rank?!","Surpassed rank...","Without being a Formation Master, one wouldn’t understand what this implies.","The examiner was stunned for a moment, feeling a chill rush to his heart, and couldn’t stop trembling all over.","Damn, without noticing, a prodigy emerged..."]},{"number":1740,"title":"Chapter 1740 - 883: Monster","paragraphs":["Taixu Mountain, Elder’s Residence.","Ever since the bell of the Mount of Tao rang, piercing through the mist, crossing numerous mountain ranges, and reaching Taixu Mountain, the Taixu Sect Master felt a sense of inexplicable restlessness.","He cultivated himself, and his temperament had always been calm and collected.","But ever since the sect reform started and the Dao conference was held, his mood had rarely been at ease, constantly fluctuating with Taixu Gate’s ranking, feeling uneasy and anxious.","The rise and fall of Taixu Gate hinge on a thin line.","No matter how calm his nature, he cannot be indifferent.","He certainly does not want to carry the infamy of being the \"sinner\" who led Taixu Gate from flourishing to declining.","Now, he understood that only when there is nothing to do, can one remain calm.","When there is truly something at stake, even an Immortal cannot remain calm.","In the Elder’s Residence, Elder Master Xun was drinking tea.","He was the Heaven Void Ancestor, and he must guard the mountain gate, which meant he would not usually go out, even for significant events like the Dao conference.","At this moment, Elder Master Xun was sipping his tea, calm as an old Buddha.","The Taixu Sect Master sighed.","At such a time, still drinking tea, how on earth could the Ancestor drink so calmly...","Is it possible...","The Taixu Sect Master was suddenly moved and asked, \"Ancestor, have you made some arrangements?\"","Elder Master Xun slightly raised his eyebrows but said nothing.","The Taixu Sect Master pondered for a moment and frowned, \"Did you give that quota... to that child?\"","Although Elder Master Xun hid it well, as the Sect Master, it was impossible not to know who the quota ended up with.","Mo Hua...","Although the Taixu Sect Master knew this child was extraordinary, this was the Array Discussion Conference, concerning the future of the entire Taixu Gate.","Was the Ancestor so confident?","The Taixu Sect Master frowned, glanced at Elder Master Xun.","Elder Master Xun showed no emotion, merely looked up at the sky.","\"The time is about right...\"","He calmly picked up the teacup, skimmed the tea leaves, took a gentle sip, and said indifferently:","\"Today, I want to open the eyes of the entire Qian Learning State Boundary...\"","The Taixu Sect Master’s pupils flickered slightly.","...","Mount of Tao, Great Dojo.","An examiner with a goatee, after reviewing the papers, immediately went to the main examination hall of the Taoist Field and expressed emotion to the Formation Master Elders present.","\"Gentlemen, I’ve truly been enlightened.\"","\"What do you mean?\"","The examiner pointed at Mo Hua sitting in the corner of the examination area and exclaimed, \"That child, his Divine Sense surpassed by one pattern...\"","Everyone was stunned.","Even the chief examiner, Master Wen, turned his head to look.","\"Surpassed by one pattern?\"","Someone said, \"Are you saying... his Divine Sense is Super Rank?\"","\"Impossible...\"","\"He...\"","The crowd released their Divine Sense, glanced at Mo Hua, and their expressions grew stern.","\"Could it be...\"","\"But he did indeed draw a Seventeen Patterns Formation, there’s no falsehood, with so many Formation Master Elders watching...\"","\"Really surpassed?\"","The hall suddenly fell silent.","People looked at each other, and then someone exclaimed:","\"Incredible...\"","\"Unprecedented...\"","\"It’s truly enlightening...\"","\"In this world, there really exists a genius with Super Divine Sense... I thought it was just a legend in the Tao Cultivation Canon.\"","\"In the vast world, there’s nothing strange, when there’re many people, any type of genius might appear.\"","\"But this... Super Divine Sense...\" someone shook their head.","Also, an elder sighed, \"Super Divine Sense, mid-stage Foundation Establishment Cultivation, to think he drew a Seventeen Patterns Formation, this young one’s future prospects, are probably limitless...\"","All present were Formation Master Elders, all understood what formidable Divine Sense meant for a Formation Master.","What’s more, he has already entered the gateway.","Being so young and able to draw a Seventeen Patterns Formation, he must have undergone a lot of hard work.","As long as he progresses step by step, he will certainly achieve something in the future.","\"But, his Spiritual Root is a bit lacking...\"","\"With such Divine Sense, who needs a Spiritual Root?\"","\"That’s what you think, for a cultivator of Tao, it’s still important to have flawless Circulation, having a shortcoming makes it tough later on.\"","\"Even a Formation Master needs cultivation as a foundation.\"","\"That’s true too...\"","The examiners present were engaged in a heated discussion.","Master Wen surveyed the surroundings, slowly spoke, and cautioned, \"Gentlemen, the main business is still important.\"","The Dao conference is not over yet.","Everyone snapped back to reality and said one after another, \"Master Wen speaks the truth, we were momentarily negligent.\"","\"After all, such a genius disciple is indeed rare.\"","\"It’s a pity...\" one examiner said regretfully, \"The cultivation is really too low, otherwise this Array Discussion Conference would have a great show to watch.\"","\"Next time would be the same.\"","\"With such potential, there will definitely be another chance next time, and by then, he might indeed compete with the top Array Dao geniuses of the Four Great Sects.\"","\"That’s interesting.\"","\"Stop thinking so much, let’s finish this conference first...\"","\"Right...\"","The elders, one after another, continued with their monitoring duties.","Only Master Wen, gazing at Mo Hua who sat calmly in the field, eyes closed and resting, had a hint of indescribable light in his eyes.","...","The Array Discussion continued.","The defeated disciples were cleared out of the field like a tide.","After the tide receded, those who remained were all true prodigies.","Soon, the onlookers noticed something unusual.","\"How is that mid-stage Foundation Establishment kid still in there?\"","\"Aren’t the examiners going to kick him out?\"","\"Don’t tell me, he even drew a Seventeen Patterns Formation?\"","After a while, during the intermission, Mo Hua still sat quietly, preparing for the next exam.","Only then did the crowd’s expressions change.","\"He... really drew a Seventeen Patterns Formation?\"","\"Impressive...\"","After the exclamations, a disciple quickly realized.","\"No way!\"","\"He’s at mid-stage Foundation Establishment and can draw a Seventeen Patterns Formation, this kid... his Divine Sense is Super Rank!\""]},{"number":1741,"title":"Chapter 1741 - 883: Monster","paragraphs":["Everyone paused, then immediately burst into an uproar.","Like a drop of water falling into a pot of oil, with a \"buzz,\" the area around the Great Dojo stirred into commotion.","\"Super Divine Sense!\"","The Taixu Sect disciples were even more excited.","\"I knew it all along, Junior Brother’s divine sense is ridiculously strong, definitely not simple!\" Cheng Mo said with pride.","\"You knew it all along and didn’t say anything?\"","\"How can I casually talk about something like this?\"","Cheng Mo replied righteously.","In truth, he wasn’t entirely sure. He had only vaguely speculated that Mo Hua’s divine sense was definitely stronger than average cultivators, but he hadn’t expected it to be this strong.","The higher-level disciple, Murong Caiyun, was shocked but also delighted.","Never did she imagine that this junior brother, who had been tagging along with her for merit points since joining, actually possessed such talent and skill.","If that’s the case, the Taixu Sect’s ranking might be secure.","On the side of the Taixu Sect elders.","Xun Ziyou shook his head and sighed:","\"This child truly knows how to endure, and the ancestor is really good at hiding things. If not for the Array Discussion Conference being so significant, the matter of having a Super Divine Sense might still be kept under wraps.\"","Xun Zixian nodded as well.","\"Those with extraordinary talent are bound to be envied. If one doesn’t hide their light and protect themselves, it’s easy to get entrapped. On principle, the deeper the concealment, the better.\"","\"But given the current special situation, whether we can maintain our place among the Eight Great Gates hangs by a thread, leaving no room for error. At such a time, we have no choice but to draw our precious sword and let Mo Hua shine...\"","\"Indeed,\" Xun Ziyou sighed, \"Our Taixu Sect, is indeed blessed by the ancestors, turning the tides in our favor...\"","If Mo Hua hadn’t fallen from the sky, this hurdle of the Dao Conference would be hard to overcome.","...","And at this moment, on the high platform of the families.","The cultivators of the Shangguan Family, Wenren Family, and Gu Family were all silent.","Even Wenren Wan, who was holding Yu Er with a pale face, was momentarily in a daze.","Super Divine Sense?","Mo Hua?","Wenren Wan found it hard to believe.","The hearts of everyone from the families were particularly tumultuous at this moment.","Does it mean... the child whom the Young Madam of the Shangguan Family painstakingly, through many connections, managed to get into the Taixu Sect through the backdoor, is truly a genuine Super Divine Sense formation genius?","Could such a thing be possible?","Shangguan Wang’s face changed, realizing that the situation was not good.","Gu Shouyan furrowed his brow. He wasn’t very skilled in formations, so he was a bit unsure and looked at Gu Changhuai for input.","Gu Changhuai, who was close to Mo Hua, had already vaguely speculated about Mo Hua’s extraordinary divine sense, but discovering his Super Divine Sense publicly, with undeniable evidence, was still shocking.","Seeing the Family Head look toward him, Gu Changhuai pondered for a moment and nodded.","Implying that it is likely true.","Gu Shouyan took a slight breath, sighing:","\"Truly... young people are to be feared...\"","This child, who often came to the Gu Family, eating, drinking, and receiving gifts, indeed possessed such an incredible Divine Sense talent.","No wonder Elder Master Xun would be so fond of this child.","This also validated that last time the child went to the Gu Family, taking unsigned Heaven Void scripts, saying it was a \"gift\" on behalf of Elder Master Xun...","It was very likely not just borrowing Ancestor Xun’s name to bail out Wan’er.","But genuinely, it was actually at the behest of Elder Master Xun.","Wenren Jingxuan was also stunned.","He never expected that in a short moment, the situation would change so drastically.","And this child’s talent was indeed unbelievably ridiculous...","Shang Che was visibly stunned for a moment, then his gaze flickered, and he spoke gently to Wenren Wan:","\"Wan’er, your position is a bit off, making it inconvenient to observe the ceremony. I’ll have someone change it for you.\"","The seating order of the families was strictly hierarchical.","Once determined, it generally wouldn’t be altered under normal circumstances.","Of course, this was for normal circumstances.","Clearly, the current situation was not normal.","Soon, attending disciples changed the seats for Wenren Wan and Yu Er.","This seat was no longer on the edge, but closer to the high platform.","The seating height was also elevated, ranked above all regular Golden Core Elders, just below the Feather Transformation Elders.","Shang Che nodded slightly.","In any case, with a Super Divine Sense, the future is promising.","He couldn’t possibly be oblivious to this.","...","Meanwhile, at the seating of the Four Great Sects.","The atmosphere was a bit heavy.","\"The Taixu Sect still had this card hidden?\" The Elder from the Heavenly Sword Sect frowned.","\"Super Divine Sense... it’s impressive that Taixu Sect could find such a talent...\" Elder Shen shook his head.","\"There is no cultivation technique for Divine Sense; it’s either innately generated, postnatally mutated, or due to some great opportunity. How exactly did he surpass to Super Divine Sense?\"","\"Unclear...\"","\"The world is vast and full of wonders.\"","\"It’s a pity his spiritual root is too poor, otherwise with this divine sense aptitude, joining our Qian Taoist Sect would be more than sufficient...\"","\"Such a talent, instead of hiding and grooming him properly, the Taixu Sect showcased him so early?\"","The Longding Sect Elder chuckled softly, \"Feeling cornered, maybe they had no other tricks, and without revealing their trump card, they risk dropping out of the Eight Great Gates.\"","\"That’s a good thing.\"","\"Such a disciple, after nurturing for three more years, might indeed become a major threat, perhaps taking a bite of fat meat from our Four Great Sects.\"","\"Now that they’re exposed early, we have a full three years to find ways to counteract.\"","\"Taking advantage of the sect reform, we can modify the Array Competition system in the next term, adding some cultivation level or spiritual root restrictions, or lengthening the assessment items...\"","\"Yes, knowing beforehand makes it easier to handle. The real fear is being caught off guard when completely unaware.\""]},{"number":1742,"title":"Chapter 1742 - 883: Monster","paragraphs":["\"The Taixu Gate seems to have made a blunder...\"","...","\"Alright, it’s almost time. This Array Discussion Conference will soon reveal the truth, and we’ll see which sect will claim the top honor in this competition...\"","The elders of the Four Sects exchanged glances, displaying courtesy on the surface while harboring a competitive spirit within.","Praising each other verbally was as far as it went.","\"Lifting each other’s sedan chairs,\" you look good, I look good too.","However, when real interests and the ranking in the array discussion were involved, who would not want to strive for first place and distinguish themselves?","Not a single step could be conceded.","The four people silently drank tea, casting their gaze towards the Taoist Field.","In the Taoist Field, the commotion caused by Mo Hua gradually subsided.","Apart from genuine Formation Masters, most people were just momentarily surprised, and then it passed.","After all, the Cultivation World is filled with countless geniuses.","The Qian Learning State Boundary is a place of pursuit for the Dao, gathering talents from all over the world, where extraordinary \"prodigies\" appear almost every year, and they are mostly ephemeral.","But those with discerning eyes know that having a Super Divine Sense is different.","One of the Twelve Streams, an elder of the Ten Thousand Formations Sect, sighed in admiration: \"Super Divine Sense, these ordinary people simply don’t understand what it truly means...\"","\"Why is it that our Ten Thousand Formations Sect couldn’t have the fortune to take in such a disciple?\"","\"If our sect had such a disciple, we would spare no effort, pouring the heart and soul of the entire sect into nurturing them to become a new generation of Array Masters, to honor and revive the glory of our Formation Dao!\"","\"Alas, the fate is unkind... letting the Taixu Gate, where Formations don’t shine, take such a great advantage for nothing!\"","The elder of the Ten Thousand Formations Sect became more envious and unwilling as he thought.","The young instructor of the Ten Thousand Formations Sect beside him nodded repeatedly, but he frowned while looking at Mo Hua’s figure sitting in the Taoist Field.","He kept feeling that this young boy looked somewhat familiar...","As if he... had seen him somewhere before?","...","As time passed, the assessment of the Eighteen Patterns soon began.","The difficulty of the Eighteen Pattern Array was another level higher than the Seventeen Patterns.","Originally, many disciples had been eliminated, and Heavenly Prides in the Taoist Field had become quite sparse.","Now, the Eighteen Pattern assessment was like a sieve, filtering through the Taoist Field repeatedly.","Disciples were continually being sifted out.","Those who were filtered out wore expressions ranging from pale faces, shaking their heads and sighing, looking up to the sky in despair, to being as if mourning their parents, leaving defeated.","Mo Hua remained unperturbed.","His face showed no sadness or joy, his expression as calm as ever, without a ripple.","The Eighteen Pattern Array assessment was also a lengthy process.","The atmosphere was dry and somewhat anxious.","After an unknown period, the bell rang, marking the end of the Eighteen Pattern assessment.","The examiners descended to review the scripts, identifying errors, and \"cleared out\" a large batch of disciples.","Amidst all the hustle and bustle, the Eighteen Pattern assessment concluded.","Very quickly, everyone discovered an unbelievable fact:","Mo Hua was still seated.","He had not been defeated.","This meant that he had drawn the Eighteen Pattern Array as well!","Eighteen Pattern Array!","The crowd was silent for a moment, then a series of gasps followed.","Foundation Building Middle Stage, Super Divine Sense, drawing a Seventeen Pattern Array was a bit outrageous, but still barely acceptable.","But Foundation Building Middle Stage drawing an Eighteen Pattern Array... was indeed otherworldly.","The people of the Taixu Gate were also shocked.","\"Junior Brother is actually this powerful?\"","\"No kidding.\"","\"I knew Junior Brother was skilled, but I never imagined he could be... this powerful...\"","\"This is the Array Discussion Conference...\"","\"Being in the Foundation Building Middle Stage and reaching this level, perhaps there’s never been anyone like him before.\"","\"Hard to say, but at least I’ve never heard of it...\"","A group of people shook their heads in awe.","Cheng Mo also gaped.","No matter how confident he was in Mo Hua, he was clearly feeling that Mo Hua was astonishingly beyond imagination, and even somewhat \"abstract\"...","Murong Caiyun and other senior brothers and sisters of the Taixu Gate looked at each other, collectively speechless.","No one could have anticipated that Mo Hua could indeed draw at this level.","On the high platform, the entire Shangguan Family fell silent.","Foundation Building Middle Stage, Super Divine Sense.","If it were just one rank above, it could still be said that the \"potential\" is great.","But going beyond two ranks and drawing the Eighteen Pattern Array is not just \"potential,\" it’s real talent and \"strength.\"","Shangguan Strategies sat in deep thought, his expression gentler, and said to Wenren Wan:","\"Yu Er is still young, at a growing age and needs to eat well to nourish himself. Today’s Dragon Fish spiritual meal is just perfect for him to taste.\"","The Dragon Fish spiritual meal, cooked by renowned chefs, is indeed a superior meal.","But this spiritual meal was not on the table in front of Wenren Wan.","In the Family Banquet, seating arrangements are hierarchical, and the spiritual meals on the table are also particular.","Some spiritual meals are not accessible to everyone.","The Dragon Fish spiritual meal is the sort of thing only found at the table of Feather Transformation Realm elders.","The words of Shangguan Strategy were very subtle.","But everyone understood.","If you can’t eat it now, then sit at a place where you can.","Subsequently, Wenren Wan had another promotion in seat.","This time, he was already equal to the Shangguan Family’s Feather Transformation Realm Powerful Elders.","But no one dared to say a single \"no,\" including Elder Wang, whose face was extremely unpleasant.","Wenren Wan felt like in a dream.","As for Yu Er, he picked up a piece of fish and put it in his mouth, smiling happily.","...","The Array Discussion Conference continued.","After the Eighteen Patterns, it was the Nineteen Patterns.","Nineteen Patterns is the limit of Divine Sense for ordinary Foundation Building Cultivators.","Divine Sense is something that becomes increasingly difficult to advance as it goes.","Nineteen Pattern Divine Sense is not just a bit stronger than Eighteen Patterns.","The Nineteen Pattern Array is also not just a bit more difficult than the Eighteen Pattern Array.","The first assessment problem alone eliminated almost all array masters. Those who persisted until now and successfully drew the Nineteen Pattern Array were few and far between, as rare as phoenix feathers.","But soon, everyone noticed.","Mo Hua was still there, he could still draw...","Nineteen Patterns...","The vast Taoist Field was dead silent, not a sound could be heard.","At this point, the expressions of the crowd were no longer just shock but horror.","Foundation Building Middle Stage, drawing... the Nineteen Pattern Array, the limit of the Foundation Establishment Realm...","At this moment, everyone realized the severity of the situation.","Almost everyone realized...","This quiet young boy sitting in the corner, continuously drawing arrays, was not a merely promising future Array Dao Demon, but indeed, a genuine, arguably terrifying, array master with talents far exceeding ordinary understanding..."]},{"number":1743,"title":"Chapter 1743 - 884: First Place","paragraphs":["The entire arena was silent.","The elders of the Four Great Sects felt a chill in their hearts.","Sitting in the corner of the Taoist Field, this originally unknown little disciple suddenly emanated an aura that was shocking.","Within his frail body, it seemed as if a monster was hidden.","The cultivators at the edge of the arena could not feel it deeply yet.","But those competing alongside Mo Hua, from the Sixteen Patterns until now, all the major sects, including the Heavenly Prides of the Four Great Sects, clearly felt an enormous sense of oppression.","Qian Taoist Sect, Shen Juncai.","Peak Foundation Establishment cultivation, Nineteen Patterns Divine Sense.","He was the Heaven’s Chosen Son among all the disciples of this generation’s Qian Taoist Sect with the highest attainments in formations.","Since young, he was praised as a formation genius within the family, and viewed by the ancestor as a promising Great Formation Master prospect.","And he proved it.","Compared with the disciples of the Shen Family, with the disciples of the surrounding Great Families, and even with the geniuses from various parts of the Nine State, he ranked among the very best.","He only needed to prove it once more.","At the much-anticipated Dao Discussion Conference, he aimed to seize the Array Competition leadership to reward himself for his years of dedication to formations, to validate his unique talent in formations, and to embark on his first step towards reaching the peak of the Array Dao.","His future was destined to be limitless like a dragon in transformation.","But he knew who his toughest rivals were:","Heavenly Sword Sect’s Xiao Yi, with exceptional talent, coming from a sword-casting family, possessing Nineteen Patterns Divine Sense, skilled in killing formations, particularly adept at sword-related killing formations.","Longding Sect’s Ao Li, with Nineteen Patterns Divine Sense, tall and strong, looked rugged but was a formation master earning his living through formations, skilled in defensive formations used in body cultivation combat.","Wanxiao Sect’s Duanmu Xue, with plain elegance and few words, possessing the strongest Divine Sense among them all, with a sense above Nineteen Patterns, although not extremely strong, it was a massive advantage, particularly skilled in deep and complex formations with intricate formation principles.","These three were the stumbling blocks in his path to claiming the Array Leader title.","And Shen Juncai also knew in his heart, when it came to killing formations, defense formations, or difficult formations, he was slightly weaker than the disciples of the other three sects.","But his strength lay in having no weaknesses.","His experience in formations, the depth of his Divine Sense, and the scope of his knowledge far exceeded his peers.","Perhaps compared to the top disciples in every aspect, he was slightly inferior, but not by much.","Overall, his formation strength was like an impregnable fortress.","Besides, he was a member of the Shen Family.","The Shen Family values strategy and is known for being calculating.","Therefore, he had simulated and calculated countless times in his mind on how to seize the Array Dao leadership this time.","He could fully utilize \"three mistakes tolerance,\" to leverage his solid foundation in formations and his profound formation expertise to the fullest.","Considering the actual performance of the other three sects’ disciples, he selectively and strategically abandoned some overly difficult formations, to conserve energy and focus on conquering those formations with a better grasp.","It’s okay if some formations were not mastered, and even if drawn incorrectly, it’s alright, as long as he controlled the errors and learned to plan reasonably, persisting till the end.","As long as the disciples of the other three sects were defeated before him, he would become the Array Dao leader!","But now, everything had been disrupted.","Because a perplexing \"powerful adversary\" suddenly emerged.","Without needing to turn around, Shen Juncai could distinctly perceive the cold and powerful pressure.","This pressure was not apparent at first.","But then, it slowly began to ferment at some unknown point.","By the time he realized it, it was too late, and he himself seemed to be shrouded in a massive shadow, his back chilled.","The Taixu Sect disciple sitting in the corner did not seem like a \"person,\" but like a formation \"monster.\"","He was just, with cold indifference, devoid of any emotion, drawing any formation with egalitarian ease.","Moreover, up until now, he had not made a single mistake in any formation.","In such a situation, calculating interrupt allowance was no longer meaningful.","Calculating choice was no longer possible.","To claim the first place, he had no choice but to brace himself and draw all the upcoming Nineteen Patterns formations.","Even if not, he must draw. Even if wrong, he must draw.","Otherwise, there would only be the path to \"defeat.\"","A huge pressure descended like a mountain.","The Heavenly Prides of the Four Great Sects were forced to go all-out, with no means of retreat.","It wasn’t just Qian Taoist Sect’s Shen Juncai.","Heavenly Sword Sect’s Xiao Yi, Longding Sect’s Ao Li, Wanxiao Sect’s Duanmu Xue...","These top Array Dao geniuses from the Four Great Sects now appeared to be under an immense shadow, their minds tense, faces turning pale.","Under the enormous and strange pressure subtly emitted by Mo Hua, the geniuses of the Four Sects couldn’t even spare a thought, having to focus all their attention, Divine Sense, and thoughts entirely on formations.","This was the clash among geniuses, in which even a slight indiscretion could result in exiting the stage.","Yet this was essentially a \"monster\" exerting \"pressure\" on other geniuses.","...","The elders of the Four Great Sects all wore extremely ugly expressions.","The situation took a sharp turn, and by the time they realized it, it was already too late.","Only two Nineteen Patterns formations had been assessed, and now, the only ones left on the field were the Heavenly Prides of the Four Great Sects, along with that Taixu Sect’s evil monster...","Moreover, the situation seemed to be turning increasingly against them..."]},{"number":1744,"title":"Chapter 1744 - 884: First Place","paragraphs":["At this moment, everyone outside the Taoist Field held their breath, not daring to make a sound.","The disciples of the Taixu Gate were both excited and nervous.","Only now did they realize that their Junior Brother was indeed capable of competing with the top Formation prodigies of the Four Great Sects.","And he was only at the Foundation Building Middle Stage.","At the same time, an almost absurd thought surfaced in everyone’s minds.","Could Junior Brother possibly still win?","If he wins again, wouldn’t he become...","The first in the Array Competition, the Array Leader?","Since the founding of the Taixu Gate, no disciple had ever received the honor of being first in Formations.","The heartbeats of all the Taixu disciples skipped a beat, and their breathing slowed down.","Murong Caiyun bit her lip tightly, her fingers clenching until they turned white.","Xun Ziyou and Elder Xun Zixian sat up straight, and the other Elders stared intensely at the Great Dojo, not daring to breathe.","Not to mention the ordinary disciples of the Taixu Gate, even these hundreds-year-old Taixu Elders felt their hearts almost leap out of their throats.","...","The assessment of the Nineteen Patterns in the Taoist Field was still ongoing.","The formation topics varied, including Killing Formations, Trapping Formations, Defense Formations, and deeply complex formations.","The prodigies of the Four Great Sects and Mo Hua, sitting in the corner, were all silently drawing formations.","But the prodigies of the Four Great Sects were suffering silently.","The cultivators outside had no idea how much pressure it was to sit in the arena, matching formations with this \"monster\" Mo Hua.","It felt suffocating, like drowning.","Formations that could have been abandoned before could no longer be; the fault tolerance that could have been maintained before was gone.","Regardless of the formation, whether it was a Killing Formation or a Trapping Formation, whether familiar or not, they had to draw with all their might.","And they couldn’t afford to make mistakes...","While Mo Hua stood like a dark rock amid giant waves, fearlessly steadfast.","Under the guidance of Elder Master Xun, he had meticulously simulated the \"Great Formation Exam\" several times from start to finish before.","Thanks to prior preparation, he seized every bit of time during the competition breaks to recover his Divine Sense.","So even now, his Divine Sense remained abundant.","Drawing the Nineteen Patterns formations was something he did with ease.","In recent days, under the personal guidance of Elder Master Xun, he had built an extremely solid foundation in the Formations.","He also practiced tirelessly, honing this foundation to become indestructible.","This kind of profound foundation was almost unimaginable for ordinary people.","Such a profound foundation was enough to handle the array of formation questions covered in the Great Formation Exam, including the Five Elements and Eight Trigrams, Killing and Trapping formations, various types, and all kinds of forms.","One force conquers all techniques.","He didn’t need to spare a thought, calculate, make choices, or evade; he just needed to draw formations.","If there was a topic, he’d take the exam; if there was a formation, he’d draw it.","By drawing all the formations, he would be the number one in Formations!","The competition was still ongoing.","Mo Hua continued drawing, from Sixteen Patterns to Nineteen Patterns, and so far, he hadn’t missed a single formation, not even a slight error in a single Formation Pattern.","No matter how difficult the Nineteen Patterns formations were, he welcomed them all.","And his Divine Sense remained generously sufficient.","The prodigies of the Four Great Sects went from being astonished to acknowledging, from acknowledging to feeling cold, from feeling cold to feeling scared.","Now, they were even feeling terrified, leading to some despair.","This young \"monster\" of the Taixu Gate, even younger by a year than them...","No matter the formation, he could draw it.","No matter what he drew, he wouldn’t make a mistake.","Not a single formation would be missed, not a single Formation Pattern would have an error!","And drawing to this point, his Divine Sense was still full, vast as the sea, seemingly endless, and unfathomable.","Like a terrifying, unconquerable enemy.","A peak too high to climb.","And this peak towered into the clouds.","They couldn’t even figure out how tall the mountain really was.","The pride, which had accompanied them as Heaven’s Chosen Sons since childhood, was gradually crumbling in their hearts.","Their Taoist Hearts were slowly collapsing.","A layer of an inexorable, terrifying shadow was slowly covering it.","Shen Juncai from the Qian Taoist Sect had a face pale as paper.","Xiao Yi from the Heavenly Sword Sect had lost all elegance and composure, his hand holding the Formation Pen was trembling uncontrollably.","Ao Li from the Longding Sect was dripping with cold sweat, his head splitting with pain.","Duanmu Xue from the Wanxiao Sect was also pale as frost, her expression hopeless.","...","Under such terrifying extreme pressure, Longding Sect was the first to be defeated.","He drew the wrong formation three times in total and was ousted.","Heavenly Sword Sect was the second.","The Nineteen Patterns Cloud Mountain Rain Formation was somewhat obscure, and he couldn’t draw it, having no confidence to persist further.","Duanmu Xue from Wanxiao Sect was the third to be defeated.","And Shen Juncai from the Qian Taoist Sect persisted to the end.","But that’s all he managed to achieve.","His Divine Sense was almost completely depleted, and he had no strength left to continue drawing.","Before admitting defeat, he mustered the courage to turn around and glance at Mo Hua, sitting in the corner.","Mo Hua’s expression was very calm.","Moreover, remembering Elder Master Xun’s admonishment, he restrained his emotions, displaying a sense of depth, so he wore a stern face, with cold eyes, appearing indifferent.","In Shen Juncai’s eyes, he seemed truly like a formation \"monster\" indifferent and emotionless, treating the common folk as straw dogs.","The shadow in Shen Juncai’s heart took on a tangible form.","He trembled, slowly put down the pen in his hand, and sighed."]},{"number":1745,"title":"Chapter 1745 - 884: First Place","paragraphs":["\"I...lost.\"","From then on, the formation geniuses of the Four Great Sects were all defeated.","In the entire Great Dojo, only Mo Hua remained.","At first, there was a deathly silence around, then it was like oil on a raging fire, the noise reached a peak, and the entire Mount of Tao erupted like a mountain collapse and tsunami.","\"Is it over?\"","\"Damn him, what did I see today?\"","\"Foundation Establishment Middle Stage, first in the Array Competition?\"","\"Overpowered the Four Great Sects?!\"","\"Out of this world?\"","\"Is Qian Learning State Boundary something unprecedented...\"","\"I seem to have witnessed the entire history of Qian Learning State Boundary unknowingly, suddenly?\"","\"My life has been worth it...\"","The entire Mount of Tao was in complete turmoil.","The elders of the Four Great Sects sat motionless as if they were mud-carved statues, their hands trembling uncontrollably.","The atmosphere outside was fiery, but their hearts, like the harsh winter of September, were ice-cold.","The disciples of the Taixu Gate were in disbelief.","\"Really...won?\"","\"Our Taixu Gate...first in the Array Competition?\"","\"Our junior brother...is the Array Leader?\"","\"Our junior brother, who loves chicken legs and is at the Foundation Establishment Middle Stage, stands at the pinnacle of all formation geniuses in the entire Qian Learning State Boundary, the uniquely unmatched Array Leader?!\"","\"Am I dreaming?\"","\"Someone slap me...no, don’t, I’m afraid I’ll wake up...\"","All the high-ranking family members attending the ceremony were shocked into silence.","Wenren Jingxuan, Shang Che, and Gu Shouyan, three Family Heads, despite their centuries of experience, were also shocked to the core.","Could someone actually wrest this piece of fat from the mouths of the Four Great Sects?","No, it wasn’t just a piece of fat; it was as if they swallowed the Four Great Sects whole, claiming the first in formations by crushing victory...","...","The hall above the Taoist Field.","All the examiners looked at each other, clearly seeing the shock and confusion on each other’s faces.","After a moment, someone shook their head and sighed:","\"Truly...a ghost sighting...\"","\"Unbelievable...\"","\"In Qian Learning State Boundary, geniuses abound, but now I truly understand what a real genius is.\"","\"Eye-opening...\"","\"Foundation Establishment Middle Stage, is he still human...\"","\"Array Leader of the Foundation Establishment Middle Stage...\"","Someone exclaimed, \"Indeed, in this world, any incredible thing can happen...\"","Even Master Wen, an Array Master from the Heaven Shu Pavilion, was speechless and lost in thought.","While chatting, everyone was amazed.","Suddenly, an examiner said:","\"Why is that kid still sitting there?\"","Everyone turned to look in the direction of the voice, realizing that the victorious Mo Hua remained calmly seated, indifferent and unmoving.","He guessed that he should have won.","But since it was his first time attending the Array Discussion Conference, he was not too sure about the rules, nor did he know if there was more to compete in.","What if it wasn’t over, and he left the field, and the examiner declared he lost?","Elder Master Xun had instructed him on many things, but did not tell him what to do if he won and got first.","So he waited for the examiners to announce the end.","What he didn’t know was that his incredible formation mastery, coupled with his indifferent demeanor, put immense pressure on others, leading to a certain degree of \"misunderstanding.\"","Causing the examiners to start whispering:","\"He won, but he’s not coming over, what does he mean?\"","Over the years, every disciple who won first in formations came to this hall full of joy and honor, to accept the chief examiner’s award.","He’s not coming up, is he expecting the examiner to go down?","That’s against etiquette.","\"He wouldn’t...feel like he hasn’t drawn enough, and wants to continue drawing, would he?\" an examiner said.","\"No way...is he really so self-satisfied?\"","\"Such a heavenly pride, his mentality must be different from ordinary people, and any incomprehensible thoughts are within reason.\"","\"People who are extraordinary often have quirky thoughts, beyond common reasoning.\"","\"Should we...continue testing him?\"","All the examiners looked at one another, finally directing their gaze towards Chief Examiner Master Wen.","Master Wen looked at Mo Hua, eyes showing contemplation, and then slowly spoke:","\"Though the Array Competition is a contest among disciples, its essence is not to contend and defeat other disciples.\"","\"It is to see oneself, to see the challenges in formations as lifelong opponents.\"","\"Constantly overcoming difficulties, surpassing oneself, climbing the pinnacle of formations.\"","\"Therefore, the true Array Competition is not about being stronger than others, but about being stronger than oneself.\"","\"As long as there’s one disciple still competing, the Array Competition is not over.\"","All the examiners felt emotional and nodded, saying: \"What Master Wen said is very true.\"","\"In that case, let him compete!\"","\"I want to see how many more formations this kid can draw, from Sixteen Patterns, to Nineteen Patterns, to now. Can his Divine Sense really be unbreakable?\"","\"Indeed, beyond the mountains, there are higher mountains, beyond the heavens, there are greater heavens. Even the most talented genius should understand this, or they will not go far in the future...\"","\"Then let’s continue testing him.\"","\"Good!\"","So the Array Competition continued, and the examiners continued to present challenges.","Only this time, the competing disciple was Mo Hua alone.","The observing cultivators were all bewildered.","\"Wasn’t it over? Why is it still going on?\"","\"Did the rules change? Is this a bonus round?\"","\"Don’t know...\"","Everyone was unclear, but could only continue watching in confusion.","Mo Hua was also somewhat surprised."]},{"number":1746,"title":"Chapter 1746 - 884: First Place","paragraphs":["He also thought he had finished drawing, but then he found out there was more.","However, he wouldn’t refuse anyone.","Since there were more formations, he continued drawing.","Elder Master Xun had said, don’t worry about anything else, just keep drawing until the end.","And what he was best at was drawing formations.","Thus, Mo Hua continued to draw one formation after another.","The Array Discussion Conference continued in this somewhat peculiar manner.","Soon, the examiners’ expressions changed.","Mo Hua could still draw, and he was still drawing!","These Nineteen-Pattern Arrays already encompassed almost all the formation types of sect inheritance, with nearly top-level difficulty, yet Mo Hua could paint them effortlessly, without any mistake.","If it weren’t for being in the Qian Learning State Boundary, on the Mount of Tao, with so many True Man Great Powers watching.","They would almost think this was some \"old monster\" above Heaven Void from the Demon Path, possessing a young disciple’s body to stir trouble at the Array Competition...","But clearly, it wasn’t.","This young boy, though like a \"monster,\" had a pure and upright aura, truly a legitimate cultivator.","And at this moment, he was meticulously and seriously drawing formations.","Three Nineteen-Pattern Formations were thus completed by him.","And it seemed that Mo Hua could keep drawing.","The examiners looked grave.","The disciples of the Four Great Sects had failed, and now, unknowingly, this genius pressure fell upon them, the examiners.","As time slowly passed, just like this, unexpectedly yet almost unpredictably, Mo Hua drew one formation after another, reaching the final \"Ceiling\" Formation.","At this point, everyone’s hearts were on edge.","\"Ceiling,\" as the name suggests, is meant to \"seal the top,\" surely this monstrous boy couldn’t even lift the top...","All the examiners looked at Master Wen, waiting for Master Wen to unveil the \"Ceiling\" question.","This question was personally set by Master Wen, and only he knew what it was about.","No one present had known in advance.","At the same time, they regretted it in their hearts.","\"Had I known, I wouldn’t have rushed Master Wen last night, letting him choose carefully, pick the hardest one.\"","\"Who said to ’randomly’ choose? Damn it, what a bad idea...\"","\"How could I have predicted such a situation would occur?\"","An elder couldn’t help but curse.","But it’s too late now for regret.","Master Wen looked serious as he slowly opened the last question.","This final \"Ceiling\" question was carved on a jade slip adorned with gold, stately and grand.","And this ceiling jade slip was actually a \"symbol,\" in almost all previous Array Discussion Conferences, it had never been \"unsealed.\"","Today was its first time seeing the light of day.","The examiners, with anxious hearts, closely examined the jade slip and, seeing the question on it, their suspended hearts slowly settled down.","\"As expected of Master Wen, meticulous and thorough.\"","\"Indeed, fortunately, Master Wen is overseeing it...\"","\"This Ceiling Array is brilliantly chosen.\"","\"This formation isn’t taught by any sect in the entire Qian Learning State Boundary, this monster surely hasn’t learned it, and definitely can’t draw it...\"","Everyone was relieved.","When this question was presented to Mo Hua, he indeed paused.","This was a Second-grade Array he had never seen before, not taught by Elder Master Xun, exceeding his current formation knowledge.","Mo Hua’s pen stopped.","For the first time since the Array Competition began, he put down his pen.","This formation indeed stumped him, and he couldn’t draw it.","But he had encountered many tricky, obscure, and profound formations, gaining much experience.","Mo Hua began to carefully examine the Formation Diagram on the \"Ceiling\" jade slip.","This was a Second-grade Formation meticulously chosen by Master Wen using \"difficulty\" as the criterion, meant for the ceiling.","It required Divine Sense at the peak of Nineteen Patterns.","Besides, the formation patterns were very complex and their meanings obscure.","The overall structure was relatively unfamiliar, differing greatly from the current orthodox formation legacy in the Qian Learning State Boundary—at least the kind that could be taught to disciples.","The formation also contained some laws of spiritual power changes.","This even had a hint of the \"Ultimate Formation\"...","Spiritual power changes, half-step Absolute Formation...","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up slightly, then his pupils deepened, as he began to analyze and deconstruct the formation patterns, formation pivot, and formation eye one by one...","A moment later, Mo Hua, bit by bit, actually deduced the essence of this spiritual power change from the underlying structure of the Ceiling Array:","Spiritual power...","Reverse Transformation!"]},{"number":1747,"title":"Chapter 1747 - 885: Four Factions Shaken","paragraphs":["Mo Hua put down the pen and ink, sat calmly, and stared at the gold-inlaid jade quality of the capped Jade Slip, the final formation examination question, his expression silent, without any movement for a long time.","It seemed that he was indeed stumped.","The examiners observed this and all breathed a sigh of relief.","\"Finally stumped...\"","\"He should be stumped...\"","\"He can’t keep drawing.\"","\"If he’s not stumped, then it’s unjustifiable.\"","\"To be fair, anyone would be stumped by this.\"","\"He’s at the peak of nineteen patterns, but the key is this spiritual power reverse transformation law. Even an ordinary Third Grade Golden Core Formation Master might not understand it fully...\"","\"At most, they can imitate, draw something similar, but can’t grasp the essence.\"","\"Dao Laws are something unexplainable, indescribable, you can only comprehend them personally, they can’t be taught...\"","\"Honestly, before, I thought, doing this ’capping’ formation was somewhat unnecessary. Now it seems the Ancestor was wise, we younger generations really have less experience, don’t understand the painstaking intention behind this...\"","\"Yeah, if today, this ’cap’ was to be lifted, that would be really disgraceful...\"","\"It would seem we examiners didn’t set the questions well; it would suggest the Array Discussion Conference lacked difficulty; it would seem our Qian Learning State Boundary’s formation mastery lacked depth...\"","\"Exactly exactly...\"","\"The Ancestor was wise.\"","The examiners exclaimed one after another.","Master Wen also silently breathed a sigh of relief.","Being meticulous in work sometimes indeed has its advantages.","This was his first time as the chief examiner; he didn’t want his first chief examination and the first time setting questions for the Array Discussion Conference to be effortlessly solved.","The first in Qian Learning State Boundary.","Spreading the word would make it somewhat embarrassing.","Might even have others suspect him of favoritism and secretly leaking questions; it’s possible.","Fortunately, this final hurdle managed to block the ’Evil Monster’ from Taixu Gate.","Master Wen moved his fingers, only to find his palms full of sweat.","Previously, he only knew disciples felt great pressure during exams.","Yet he didn’t expect that one day as an examiner, the pressure would be this immense...","Time was slowly slipping away.","Mo Hua still sat in the arena, staring at the formation on the Jade Slip, motionless.","The examiners’ moods, with the passage of time, grew increasingly relaxed.","\"Once time is up, if this Evil Monster can’t draw, then he will be ’defeated’.\"","\"Of course, even if defeated, he is still first, but he can only achieve a simple first.\"","\"No, what are you saying? What do you mean by ’only achieve a simple first’?\" An elder remarked indignantly.","\"Exactly, is achieving first easy?\"","\"So many sects, so many years, not once getting first.","\"Let alone first, even getting second or third is a luxury.\"","\"Are you mocking us?\"","The speaking elder repeatedly apologized, \"It’s my fault, my fault, the pressure was too great, made me babble...\"","...","A group of Formation Masters was chatting idly.","Yet as time passed, Master Wen frowned without speaking.","He silently watched Mo Hua sitting in the Taoist Field, and as he watched, a sudden unease grew in his heart.","\"This isn’t right!\"","This little disciple from Taixu Gate seems stumped by the formation, unable to start drawing, so remains still.","But his expression is too calm, plus there’s a brilliance flowing in his eyes, as if he is...","Calculating something?","\"Calculating?!\"","Master Wen slowly took a cold breath.","He’s calculating?!","He’s calculating, he’s learning!","In the Array Discussion Conference, using calculation, to learn the capped formation containing profound spiritual power laws, at the peak of nineteen patterns?!","Calculating and learning?!","Master Wen’s pupils trembled, his heart horrified.","Who taught him calculation?","Taixu Gate?","At this occasion, with such a complex formation, he can still learn?","How to learn?","Master Wen’s heart suddenly clenched tight again.","\"It shouldn’t be...\"","...","In the Great Dojo.","Mo Hua was indeed learning.","He observed, the formation in front was an unknown spirit formation containing an entry-level Second Grade spiritual power reverse transformation law.","Spiritual power reverse transformation...","Reversed Spirit Formation!","Mo Hua’s heart skipped.","The first Ultimate Formation he learned was the ’Reversed Spirit Formation’ taught by his master, a First Grade Ten Pattern.","Now he had established the Foundation and his Divine Sense reached Foundation Establishment Peak, his Second Grade formation was thoroughly refined, yet hadn’t expected by coincidence, to encounter this ’reversed spirit’ formation again in the ’capped’ exam question of the Array Discussion Conference.","The formation in front, though only at the peak of nineteen patterns, not the ’Ultimate Formation’, but its contained spiritual power transformation clearly mirrored the principle of spiritual power reverse transformation triggering formation collapse found in the First-grade Ten-pattern Reversed Spirit Ultimate Formation.","Moreover, this spiritual power reverse transformation was that of the Foundation Establishment Realm.","The First-grade Ten-pattern Reversed Spirit Formation collapsed the spiritual power of the Qi-refining Realm.","While the Second Grade Reverse Transformation Formation reversed the condensed-as-mercury Foundation Establishment spiritual power, its power naturally incomparable.","It’s just, the ’spiritual power reverse transformation’ laws contained in this formation weren’t complete, also appeared somewhat shallow, hence couldn’t reach ’Ultimate Formation’ level.","Yet this was just right for Mo Hua.","A true Second Grade Ultimate Formation he couldn’t learn now.","The peak of nineteen-pattern ’half-step absolute formation’ just served as initiation, through which to preliminary comprehend the laws of Second Grade spiritual power reverse transformation.","Initially Mr. Zhuang taught him the Reversed Spirit Formation, also breaking it down, teaching from the nine-pattern half onwards.","Now with Mr. Zhuang absent, no one to teach him.","But at this moment, Mo Hua could already learn by himself.","The master leads into the door, cultivation lies within oneself."]},{"number":1748,"title":"Chapter 1748 - 885: Fourfold Zhen Shock","paragraphs":["During his travels, what Mr. Zhuang imparted to him was \"Dao\" rather than \"tool,\" it was the heart of seeking Formations that allowed him to observe independently, to comprehend, to perceive, and to completely master all the arduous and challenging Formations in this world—even the Ultimate Formations of superior grade.","Although Mo Hua did not inherit Mr. Zhuang’s Immortal Sky Formation Flow, he inherited the initial heart of seeking the Dao of Formations, as well as the experience and methods for perceiving Ultimate Formations.","Now, he can calculate on his own, he can learn any Formation in this world himself.","This is the most precious wealth Mr. Zhuang taught him.","In his eyes, Mo Hua’s pupils shine brightly, as Heavenly secret Calculation, Heavenly secret Tricky Calculation, and golden glimmers of the Divine Way intertwine into a whole.","All the phenomena of the world are dissected and deconstructed in his eyes.","The Formation Patterns of reversed Spiritual Power are also gradually perceived by him.","The trajectory of Spiritual Power change is revealed in detail.","Under Mo Hua’s calculations, the form of Reversed Transformation, with extremely complex yet subtly aligning with the divine charm of the Great Dao, presents itself one by one, intertwined and flickering in his Sea of Consciousness...","In the eyes of others, Mo Hua was just sitting there in a daze.","Only a very few perceptive Formation Masters could see that Mo Hua was doing \"Calculations,\" in \"Perception.\"","He was \"learning\" on the spot this set of Formation diagrams, which would be deeply obscure and difficult for a Second Grade Array Master.","To others, this Formation might be a tricky, weird, and insurmountable \"challenge.\"","But to Mo Hua, this \"Evil Monster,\" it was actually a huge \"opportunity.\"","It was his chance to perceive the reversed transformation of Spiritual Power.","The Array Discussion Conference was not about being stronger than others.","But to be stronger than oneself.","\"Constantly learning more difficult Formations, constantly comprehending deeper Formation principles, constantly surpassing oneself, constantly seeking the Dao of Formations.\"","\"Perhaps this is the greatest significance of the Array Discussion Competition...\"","At this moment, Mo Hua experienced a sudden enlightenment, his heart and mind were clear.","Everything around him dissipates in his perception.","In his eyes, there was only Formation Patterns, only Formation principles, and only the reversed transformation Law left behind after Spiritual Power evolves.","These Laws were chaotic and variegated, resembling the void after fragmentation, black intertwining, accompanying Spiritual Power, constantly extinguishing, constantly breaking down, ultimately decomposing into void...","Containing a sense of \"extinction\" that provokes terror within.","Yet Mo Hua felt entirely familiar.","For he had sensed these Laws before.","All in front of him now was but an expanded range of changes based on the decomposition of Spiritual Power within the First Grade Reversing Spirit Array.","The First Grade Reversing Spirit Array, he was most familiar with it.","He had even used the First Grade Reversing Spirit Array to decompose large formations, and have killed a Daoist Demon.","He deeply understood and personally practiced this trace of Law.","A sense of clarity surfaced in Mo Hua’s eyes.","The law of decomposition imprinted itself in his heart.","And around him, there emerged an aura of \"extinction\" that provoked an indistinct fear.","This was a faint phenomenological change brought about in an instant after understanding certain Laws...","Not only Master Wen, but other examiners were aware of something amiss at this moment too.","Their initially relaxed hearts unknowingly became tense again.","\"Isn’t it, somewhat not right...\"","\"Why is there a trace of eeriness with this youth from Taixu Gate...\"","\"He seems... to have realized something?\"","\"Realized... what?\"","Everyone glanced at each other in confusion.","A somewhat frightening idea slowly rose in their minds.","\"It shouldn’t be... really that ’Evil Monster’ status, right?\"","No one spoke.","At this very moment, Mo Hua, who had been silently seated, suddenly moved, reaching out his pale hand to pick up the Formation Pen.","The examiners’ hearts tensed intensely.","Then they watched as Mo Hua, with an expression calm and indifferent, neither joy nor sorrow, began to make strokes on the Formation Paper before him, calmly drawing the Formation.","It appeared the same as before.","Yet the examiners all knew, this was completely different!","This Formation compared to the previous one is in an entirely different category!","This is the peak of Nineteen Patterns, a profoundly difficult Formation representing the pinnacle of deliberations, containing the reversed transformation Law of Spiritual Power!","Not the Formation he had seen a short time ago, nor even one he could draw before.","Among the examiners, there was an outburst of astonishment.","Even Master Wen’s pupils trembled.","From the spectator stands, all cultivators, whether they could draw Formations or not, whether skilled in Formations knowing what Mo Hua was doing, or not too familiar but faintly realizing Mo Hua was doing something extraordinary, were completely silent, hardly daring to breathe.","On the Formation Paper, line after line of Formation Patterns were drawn by Mo Hua.","A trace of meaning flowed within the Formation Patterns...","This process was somewhat arduous, yet it encountered no obstruction.","No one knew how long had passed; Mo Hua stopped his pen.","Before him, there was now a complete, obscure and profound Formation Diagram, extraordinary enough to surpass the understanding of usual Second Grade Array Masters.","Because this was his first drawing, the strokes inevitably appeared somewhat unpracticed; there was hesitation in transitions, showing a hint of caution, unlike previous silver hook and iron strokes, neat and forceful, perfect and flawless.","Yet seen overall, it was seamlessly integrated, beginning to end correspond, executed all at once.","An examiner came down, glanced at this Formation Diagram, initially shocked, then with furrowed brows, somewhat hesitant.","He carefully presented this Formation Diagram to Chief Examiner Master Wen.","As soon as Master Wen laid eyes on it, waves of astonishment surged in his mind, murmuring incredulously:","\"Indeed, it was... drawn out...\"","He appeared serious again, thoroughly examining this Formation from beginning to end, increasingly finding it hard to believe as he looked."]},{"number":1749,"title":"Chapter 1749 - 885: Four Factions Shaken","paragraphs":["\"A bit unfamiliar, but not a single stroke wrong, and moreover...\"","Moreover, there’s a flow of artistic charm above.","This is not merely \"painting a calabash,\" only depicting its form, but truly comprehending certain laws within the Formation and integrating them into the Formation Patterns, hence the presence of such \"artistic charm.\"","This Formation contains rules.","Although weak, there’s indeed a sign of rules.","\"Master Wen, this...\"","The group of examiners were uneasy, couldn’t help but all turned to look at Master Wen.","Master Wen took a deep breath, then shook his head and sighed:","\"Not a single stroke wrong, painted it out...\"","As soon as these words were spoken, the hearts of the people were finally at peace.","\"Painted it out?!\"","\"This can... how, this, this...\" Someone stammered, unable to believe.","The shock in the hearts of most examiners was indescribable with words.","Painted through!","In their lifetime, they unexpectedly really saw a disciple thoroughly paint through the exam paper for the Array Discussion Conference at Qian Learning State Boundary!","Moreover, from start to finish, not a single piece missing, not a single detail wrong, not even a single stroke missed?!","Such a difficult peak Formation, cannot even seal the top.","Moreover, he learned it on the spot!","Just by looking once, spending a few cups of tea time, he comprehended the entire Formation Diagram and the laws.","He knew all the Formations being tested.","The Formations he didn’t know, he learned on the spot?!","What the hell, how could just an \"Evil Monster\" even describe this?","Is there truly such a genius in this world?","The group of examiners were stunned and lost in thought.","They had spent a lifetime learning Formations, lived till now, only to realize at this moment, not only were their experiences shallow, but even their imagination was somewhat impoverished.","Even if they were to daydream, they would definitely not dare to think like this...","A turmoil in the hall.","And at this point, Mo Hua finally spoke, uttering the first words since the Array Discussion Exam began:","\"Is there more?\"","He was quite calm.","This was already the peak of Nineteen Patterns, also contained Spiritual Power Reverse Transformation Laws, very difficult indeed.","If there were more difficult ones, he wouldn’t be able to paint them.","Furthermore, he started from Sixteen Patterns, painted all the way till now.","This last one consumed a lot of Divine Sense Calculation, painting it completely cost him all his divine sense, even with his strong divine sense, now it was exhausted.","If there are more Formations, he wouldn’t paint them.","Doing within one’s power, was also taught by Elder Master Xun.","But these simple three words caused all the examiners to fall silent.","In this crisp voice, was contained a heavy oppressive power, and exceptionally strong destructive force, making these examiners who are Elders of Formation Arts from various sects, rich in experience and highly respected, almost lose control.","Is there more?","Is there more?!","Is there...","A few Elders’ necks turned red, almost spitting blood out of anger.","But no one dared to speak.","Because, there really was no more...","It really was painted through.","The peak Formation was also painted through...","Not a single piece left...","They couldn’t shamelessly create a Third Grade Array on the spot to test this little Evil Monster, could they?","Master Wen sighed.","He was the chief examiner, despite his heavy mood, he had to speak: \"All painted through.\"","\"Then...\" Mo Hua said.","\"You win.\" Master Wen said.","Mo Hua’s expression filled with joy, a smile appeared, but he suddenly remembered Elder Master Xun’s reminder to control his emotions, show neither joy nor anger, and maintained a composed demeanor, calmly stood up, and respectfully saluted the examiners above in the hall:","\"Thank you, all esteemed masters and elders.\"","The examiners in the hall were a bit surprised.","They expected this \"Evil Monster\" with such incredible talent to be cold-attitude, arrogant and rebellious, and disregardful.","But surprisingly, he was quite polite...","The examiners, who were almost spitting blood out of frustration earlier, accepted Mo Hua’s salute from afar, and unexpectedly felt much comforted.","Master Wen was also slightly relieved, then restored his mood, and solemnly supported his cultivation, loudly announcing:","\"Qian Learning State Boundary, Array Discussion Conference, concludes hereby.\"","\"The leader of this Array Discussion, Array Leader...\"","\"Taixu Gate’s, Mo Hua!\"","Master Wen’s dignified and stern voice, under the Feather Transformation Realm Spiritual Power’s support, was like a great bell, breaking through the air, instantly spreading across the entire Mount of Tao, resonating endlessly.","Taixu Gate’s, Mo Hua!","Array Discussion leader, Array Leader!","The whole Mount of Tao was boiling with voices, extraordinarily lively.","The disciples of Taixu Gate were cheering their hearts out.","Some disciples even had tears in their eyes, overwhelmed with emotions.","Before this, almost no one could imagine that the Taixu Gate, which was at the end of the Eight Great Gates, almost hanging by a thread, and with an unremarkable Array Dao, could actually... claim the first place in the Array Discussion Conference?!","Even at this moment, they felt like dreaming, unbelievable.","Some normally dignified and serious Elders were now like ordinary disciples, shocked, cheering out loud.","Some Elders, in their excitement, even pulled out their beards.","The high pavilion of the Taoist Court Officials.","Master Xia of the Feather Transformation Realm was shocked and lost in thought.","He took several glances at Mo Hua, even after a long time, was still unable to conceal his inner shock.","\"I actually... misjudged...\"","This inconspicuous lad, unexpectedly, unexpectedly...","He too was speechless for the moment.","Xia Canonical Official sitting not far away, was also dumbfounded.","She was only routinely attending the Tao Discussion Meeting in Qian Learning State Boundary, but didn’t expect to witness such a scene.","Before this, she knew Mo Hua was proficient in Formation arts, but never completely expected him to be proficient to this extent.","On the Taoist Field, this array \"Evil Monster\" with an indifferent face, overlooking the group of Heavenly Prides, was this really the familiar, often smiling, kind and adorable Mo Hua she knew?"]},{"number":1750,"title":"Chapter 1750 - 885: Four Factions Shaken","paragraphs":["Master Xia’s thoughts were somewhat sluggish, unable to regain composure for a long time.","Master Xia silently glanced at Master Xia, sighing inwardly.","Indeed, a person’s fortune and fate are hard to predict...","...","On the high platform of the families.","Wenren Wan couldn’t help but cover her mouth, her eyes filled with disbelief.","The Array Leader is... Mo Hua?!","Even though expectation is just expectation, when the anticipated scene becomes reality, it still feels unbelievable to her.","Yu Er didn’t care much about these details.","Of course, he didn’t know what the Array Discussion Conference meant, only feeling happy for Mo Hua, clapping joyfully:","\"Brother Mo won, Brother Mo is first!\"","\"No one is as amazing as Brother Mo!\"","The family heads of the Shang, Wenren, and Gu families, including all senior elders, were stunned, shaken to the core.","\"He really... came first...\"","Even if they were beaten to death, they wouldn’t have thought the Array Discussion Conference would end with this result.","But the Gu family was the first to feel joy.","Because many elders of the Gu family knew Mo Hua.","Some even treated him to meals, gave him small gifts, and chatted or had tea with him.","Recalling these moments now, they seemed gilded with a golden edge, shimmering brightly, making one feel proud...","This was the Array Leader.","Qianxue’s first!","Something to boast about!","Gu Shouyan, always silent and rigid, not quite understanding formations, couldn’t help but feel deeply comforted.","Their Gu family was the place Mo Hua freeloaded meals.","This was a great fortunate connection.","Shang Che also started to reflect inwardly on whether he had been impolite or too cold towards Mo Hua.","How should he subtly show favor in the future...","Wenren Jingxuan hesitated for a moment, his expression a bit odd, glancing at Shangguan Wang, he couldn’t help but confirm aloud:","\"Are you saying... my daughter exerted connections and spent great favors to forcefully introduce the Array Leader, ranking first in Qianxue’s state boundary among thousands of sects, into Taixu Gate?\"","\"Are you saying, after Taixu Gate finds out about this, shouldn’t they treat my daughter as a highly esteemed guest?\"","Shangguan Wang’s face flushed crimson, looking as ugly as a pork kidney.","...","In the Taoist Field of Array Competition, at the Hundred Flower Valley’s location.","Hua Qianqian looked at Mo Hua, covering her mouth, her beautiful eyes filled with shock.","Above, a Hundred Flower Valley Master, dressed in an elaborate robe, face icy and exceedingly beautiful, also gazed at Mo Hua’s figure with a dazed expression.","\"This child seems to be...\"","A moment later, a peculiar expression appeared on her exceedingly beautiful face.","On the other side, the elder of Ten Thousand Formations Sect had reddened eyes.","Now his heart was truly filled with jealousy, bitterly exclaiming:","\"Pressure of the Four Sects, winning the first in formations, such an astonishing formation genius, why would he be in Taixu Gate? Our Ten Thousand Formations Sect, besides the Four Great Sects, ranks first in formations, he should have been our disciple!\"","Beside him, the instructor of Ten Thousand Formations Sect hesitated for a moment, then softly said: \"Originally he was...\"","The elder of Ten Thousand Formations Sect froze, \"What?\"","The instructor whispered: \"Elder, have you forgotten, a few years ago, a little disciple from another region wanted to join our Ten Thousand Formations Sect, had great formation talent, but poor Spiritual Root.\"","\"Sect rules say no. But I later thought about it, felt it was a pity, and I confirmed with you again.\"","Afterward, he was scolded by the elder out of habit.","The instructor said: \"You said back then, it’s hard to find a frog with only two legs, are two-legged Formation Masters rare? Rules are rules, a Second Grade Formation Master, one more or one less, has little impact, not worth breaking the rules...\"","\"The disciple rejected...,\" the instructor quietly pointed, \"is this one here, the one who won first place, the youth from Taixu Gate...\"","The elder of Ten Thousand Formations Sect’s expression changed dramatically, as if struck by lightning.","\"I... rejected?\"","A Qianxue first, Array Leader, once wanted to join his Ten Thousand Formations Sect, but... was rejected by him?","The elder of Ten Thousand Formations Sect’s eyes darkened, Blood Qi surged into his head, and his intestines turned green.","The bitterness from his stomach couldn’t help but rise.","...","Among the crowd, Elder Zheng also stood shocked and dazed.","Others may not understand, even typical elders of formations might not see clearly.","But he was different, he was once an elder of the Qian Taoist Sect, one of the Qianxue’s Four Great Sects, bearing the Zheng family’s Thunder Formation legacy, knows the terrifying strength Mo Hua displayed in this competition.","Divine Thought was unfathomable.","Formation Study was profound and erudite.","Super Divine Sense, exceeding by at least three ranks!","With a Foundation Building Middle Stage, overshadowing the Four Sects, even mastering Calculation, capable of comprehending Spiritual Power rules in an extremely short time...","If he hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, he wouldn’t dare imagine it.","This Evil Monster, was indeed the child he had previously seen, born from Loose Cultivation, with a steadfast Taoist Heart and grand vision...","Elder Zheng stood in place, stunned and dazed.","Simultaneously, a spark of hope lit up in his eyes, like a blazing thunderous fire...","...","With a burst of commotion, amidst countless exclamations and disbelief, the Array Discussion Conference ended completely.","Everything settled.","Foundation Building Middle Stage, the first in formations.","Overshadowing the Four Sects, winning the Leader position.","The name \"Mo Hua\" of Taixu Gate, resonating like the bell of Dao Discussion, completely shook the entire Qianxue state boundary.","For a moment, the winds and clouds shifted, four directions trembled."]},{"number":1751,"title":"Chapter 1751 - 886: Yin Yang Lock","paragraphs":["The Array Discussion Conference concluded.","Within the Qianxue State Boundary, the once obscure name \"Mo Hua\" suddenly presented itself before major families, sects, and even some family ancestors.","Previously, they knew nothing about Mo Hua.","But out of the blue, this \"Evil Monster\" emerged, overwhelming the Four Great Sects. With mid-stage Foundation Establishment cultivation, he drew the peak of a Nineteen-Pattern Formation, broke the Array Discussion Conference’s record, claimed first place, and won the Array Leader title.","This record alone is shocking, unimaginable.","If this event hadn’t occurred publicly during the conference, it would surely be dismissed as an absurd \"rumor.\"","Major families and various sects immediately began investigating the origins and background of Mo Hua.","However, the Taixu Gate sealed Mo Hua’s origins and background the moment he won the Array Leader, labeling it as a sect core secret, accessible only to individuals of the Sect Leader and Ancestor level.","Those who had interactions with Mo Hua were mostly closely associated with him and kept his information strictly confidential.","Of course, Mo Hua was very secretive, and they didn’t know much either.","The Taoist Court, following some unknown indication, quickly sealed Mo Hua’s records.","All traces of his background, origin, and any activity within the Qianxue State Boundary, including cases handled, captured Sin Cultivators, slain Evil Cultivators, and merit points earned, were sealed away.","The seal on the archived file bore the stamp of the Central Dao Court.","No cultivator from the local Taoist Court, not even a local Court Leader, had the authority to access it.","Thus, the information available to the outside world was sparse.","All the major families and sects could uncover was just some \"overly common\" information.","It was said that this \"Mo Hua\" was a cultivator from the Li State.","But the Li State is a large state, filled with countless state boundaries, with no idea where specifically.","It was said that he was of Loose Cultivator origin.","Yet the \"Loose Cultivator\" identity itself was questionable.","Regular Loose Cultivators struggle to make a living and find it hard to cultivate; how could one dedicate such great effort to studying Formation and reach such an unbelievable level?","Some even speculated that Mo Hua was the Taixu Sect Master’s illegitimate child.","Others said he was the Taixu Ancestor’s own grandson.","These stories, of course, were rumors. While they sounded more plausible than being of Loose Cultivator origin, there was no evidence, and most people were skeptical.","If he truly held such an identity, there wouldn’t be a need to keep it hidden.","The Array Leader, within any family, is an exceptionally radiant jewel, a genius sufficient to overlook family inheritance rules.","As long as he is the Leader, even if he is from a collateral branch of the family, he could henceforth stand out as part of the family’s core direct lineage.","In Qianxue State Boundary, where families converge, and sects abound, talents are as common as fish crossing a river.","To stand out among these already outstanding geniuses, bringing great honor and benefit to the family and sect, the weight of being the \"Leader\" is colossal.","Yet despite everyone’s inquiries, the information gathered was scarce.","After Mo Hua became the Array Leader, he joined Taixu Gate, like a fish diving into the deep sea, leaving not a ripple, nor a hint of information exposed.","For a long time, no one even saw Mo Hua leave the Taixu Mountain Gate.","Thus, some people began to wonder...","If \"Mo Hua\" indeed existed?","A genius is not cultivated in a single day.","Could someone truly emerge out of nowhere, claim the Array Leader title in such an extraordinary manner, and then disappear without a trace?","Could this entire matter from beginning to end be a hoax?","Is Taixu Gate orchestrating a setup?","Or did the examiners unlawfully reveal the questions beforehand?","Was all this just to fabricate an \"unparalleled Formation genius,\" to captivate attention and elevate the reputation of the Array Discussion Conference?","To create topics for the conference after sect reforms?","In the eyes of informed persons, these rumors are not worth a laugh.","But among uninformed outsiders, they ran rampant.","For even those untrained in Formation knew that a \"mid-stage Foundation Establishment, first in the Array\" was utterly preposterous.","Even exaggerations should respect basic common sense.","One shouldn’t boast recklessly, treating others as fools.","Some with dark hearts and envious minds slandered with malicious intent.","Thus, public opinion shifted from shock at the genius to skepticism.","The name \"Mo Hua\" was met with mixed opinions.","Some called him a fraud, some a genius, others a coward, a fame-stealing impostor, and some even a real monster, an elusive \"Evil Monster\"...","Such mixed reviews also affected the reputation of Taixu Gate.","After all, Mo Hua had no family, only himself.","People would say whatever they wished, as the words came from their mouths.","The good thing is, the rankings were real, and Taixu Gate truly benefited.","Due to Mo Hua’s \"first in the Array,\" Taixu Gate’s overall ranking surged directly from eighth among the Eight Great Gates to third.","This was almost the best ranking Taixu Gate had achieved since the decline of the Divine Thought into sword inheritance and the waning of sect heritage.","Top three among the Eight Great Gates.","While outsiders had various doubts, those truly informed knew Mo Hua’s terrifying talent.","Major families and sects, especially the ancestors behind them, the ruling Sect Leaders, and high-ranking Elders didn’t truly believe Mo Hua was \"famous for nothing.\""]},{"number":1752,"title":"Chapter 1752 - 886: Yin Yang Lock (Part 2)","paragraphs":["The stronger the cultivation, the higher the status, the broader the vision, the deeper the understanding, one realizes the \"terror\" of the divine sense that surpasses third-rank formations talent.","The families refuse to give up and continue investigating Mo Hua.","But on the Taoist Court side, after their restructuring, the situation has completely changed, and they can’t get involved.","Meanwhile, the Taixu Gate treats Mo Hua like a \"treasure,\" protecting him very well.","Thus, almost all the families have only one choice:","To calculate.","Using the Heavenly Mechanism Skill to calculate Mo Hua’s cause and effect.","This act goes against the taboos of the Qianxue Sect.","But the title of \"Leader\" of the Array Discussion Conference is truly extraordinary, and even if it breaches the taboo, they can’t resist probing for a bit.","Thus, within the Qian Learning State Boundary, various families and sects began secretly calculating Mo Hua’s cause and effect.","Some family ancestors, who understood a bit of the Heavenly Mechanism Technique, did the calculations themselves.","But the heavenly secrets are elusive, and the cause and effect are hard to follow.","Such profound things are not believed by all, and even if believed, not everyone can learn them. Even if learned, not everyone can master them, and mastery does not guarantee proficiency.","Even within the Heaven Void Realm, those who have a passing understanding of the Heavenly Mechanism Technique are still the minority.","Most of the families still can only rely on connections, asking familiar Taoist Friends or allied families, or sects like the Mystery Valley, which, though reclusive, are renowned, to help calculate Mo Hua’s cause and effect.","Yet, when they truly attempted the calculations, without exception, they all encountered a profound fog.","Within the fog, there seemed to be Yin and Yang, stars like the sea, the Taixu flowing.","These phenomena locked the heavenly secrets, shrouding the cause and effect.","Additionally, there was a Heaven Void shadow, with deep eyes, holding all the cause and effect in his hands, not allowing others to spy.","\"Is this... the Heavenly Mechanism Lock? Did the Taixu Gate lock the heavenly secrets?\"","\"Heaven Void in charge, cause and effect is set, which ancestor of the Taixu Gate is this figure?\"","\"Such a grand gesture...\"","\"Truly willing to put in the effort.\"","\"They are indeed holding him dear, not allowing outsiders to peek...\"","\"Is it necessary for just a Foundation Establishment Disciple?\"","\"Nonsense, if you were to gain the title of Array Leader, your sect’s ancestor would also hold you in high regard...\"","...","Some families and hired Heavenly Mechanism Cultivators gathered together and discussed:","\"Since it’s this way, should we still calculate?\"","\"It’s not impossible to calculate...\"","\"Join forces with a few other families, find more Heavenly Mechanism Cultivators, use Heavenly Mechanism Treasures, and with united effort, we might just be able to break this Taixu Gate’s Heavenly Mechanism Lock...\"","\"But after breaking it, then what?\" someone mocked.","\"Well...\"","\"Don’t say I didn’t warn you... This Heavenly Mechanism Lock, rather than saying it’s protection, it’s more of an ’attitude.’ It means this child is under the Taixu Gate’s protection, the ancestor is watching over him, sparing no effort, at all costs.\"","\"Sneakily calculating is one thing, but if you were to seriously go and break another sect’s Heavenly Mechanism Lock, spying on their core disciple’s secrets, it’s as if you’re picking a fight, leading to a life-or-death situation.\"","\"Do you wish to incur the wrath of a Heaven Void Ancestor?\"","\"Or do you intend to declare war on one of the Eight Great Gates, the Taixu Gate?\"","The group fell silent.","The speaker was from the Mystery Valley and understood the Heavenly Mechanism Technique more than the average cultivator.","Hence, his words carried some weight.","But the group was still unwilling to accept.","Someone said, \"Make it quick, combine our efforts, break the Heavenly Mechanism Lock, take one look at the cause and effect, and withdraw. This way, Taixu Gate may not be able to react in time.\"","\"Moreover, the law does not punish the masses, even if Taixu Gate pursues the matter afterward, as long as we stand united, Taixu Gate may not dare to really pursue it.\"","\"This has merit...\"","\"Worth a try...\"","The Mystery Valley cultivator couldn’t help but mock:","\"What are you thinking? Do you really think the Taixu Gate’s Heavenly Mechanism Lock is that easy to break?\"","\"Taixu Gate is one of the three-lane offshoots, with ancient heritage.\"","Someone disagreed, \"Three-lane offshoot, even if there’s heritage, it’s likely in decline...\"","\"If not for this Array Grand Competition, the unexpected success of Taixu Gate, with their strength, they might not be able to hold on to the Eight Great Gates.\"","The Mystery Valley cultivator shook his head, \"You truly do not understand...\"","\"The ranking of the Dao competition is based on the strength of sect disciples, and this strength does not include the ’Heavenly Mechanism Technique.’","\"At the present time, the heavenly secrets inheritance within Qianxue State Boundary is in decline.\"","\"Taixu Gate may not be what it once was, but they still have one or two Heaven Void Ancestors, dedicated to studying the heavenly secrets and cause and effect.\"","\"Other sects, even the Four Great Sects, have grown complacent, too absorbed in fame and fortune, losing most of their foundations. In terms of Calculation Power, they are not much stronger than Taixu Gate.\"","\"Given this, why do you think you can easily break Taixu Gate’s Heavenly Mechanism Lock?\"","These words were somewhat piercing.","Most family cultivators within Qianxue State Boundary were not convinced.","\"Praising others while belittling ourselves, you’re overestimating Taixu Gate. How do you know if it won’t work unless you try?\"","The Mystery Valley cultivator sneered, \"Did you forget, Taixu Gate also has that swordsmanship.\"","With these words, the cultivators in the know all changed their expressions.","The Mystery Valley cultivator said, \"Though that swordsmanship has lost its heritage, there’s no guarantee that some old relics who have mastered the true technique aren’t protecting the Taixu Mountain Gate, risking their bodies.\"","\"If you break the Taixu Gate’s Heavenly Mechanism Lock and truly provoke such old relics, and they trace the cause and effect to strike you all down with one sword, your Divine Soul will be annihilated immediately.\"","\"And, dying would be in vain.\""]},{"number":1753,"title":"Chapter 1753 - 886: Yin Yang Lock (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"Having violated the major taboo, probing the cause and effect, and having your Divine Soul obliterated, who dares to go up to Taixu Mountain for you to demand justice?\"","Their words felt like sharp swords stabbing the throats of the crowd, turning their faces pale.","A cultivator from Mystery Valley spoke with a softened tone:","\"All of you are considered insiders, even if you haven’t experienced it personally, you should have heard this saying: Heavenly secrets are perilous, and cause and effect are unfathomable.\"","\"Sometimes, being cautious is a good thing, never take risks to probe the unknowable cause and effect.\"","\"To be honest,\" the Mystery Valley cultivator sighed, with a look of lamentation, \"years ago, one of our ’Elder Mei’ was invited by the Shangguan Family to Qian Learning State Boundary to calculate a cause and effect.\"","\"The result...\"","The Mystery Valley cultivator was apprehensive, \"Elder Mei couldn’t refuse the kind invitation and reluctantly calculated the uncalculable, thus witnessed a great terror, his expression turned fearful, spat blood, his body became cold, and he is still lying in Mystery Valley, recuperating...\"","\"Although these are two separate matters, the principle is the same. Matters of cause and effect, I ask you all to be careful.\"","The Mystery Valley cultivator said with a grave expression.","With him speaking from personal experience, the many family cultivators showed solemn expressions, no longer daring to be reckless.","They would secretly make calculations, but couldn’t break the Tai Xu Heavenly Mechanism Lock at all.","Out of fear of the Taixu Gate, they didn’t dare to go too far, eventually having to give up.","This invisibly saved their lives.","...","Inside the Taixu Gate.","Elder Master Xun advised Mo Hua: \"Keep the item I gave you hung around your neck, do not take it off.\"","Mo Hua touched a Jade Lock around his neck.","This Jade Lock’s material was unknown, with Eight Trigrams engraved on the outside, divided into Yin and Yang, imbued with starlight, exuding an enigmatic mystery like Taixu.","According to Elder Master Xun, it’s called the \"Tai Xu Yin Yang Lock,\" and it can seal cause and effect.","\"Elder Master, what exactly is this lock used for?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Don’t ask, just wear it, and don’t lose it,\" Elder Master Xun replied.","Mo Hua obediently nodded.","What Elder Master Xun gave him must be a good thing, since the Elder Master instructed him to wear it, he should keep it on at all times.","Seeing Mo Hua wearing the Jade Lock close to his body, Elder Master Xun felt relieved.","This Tai Xu Yin Yang Lock, was peerless, considered the Heavenly Mechanism Treasure passed down by the Taixu Gate; even he couldn’t bear to take it out and look at it usually.","But given the circumstances, he had no choice but to give it to Mo Hua to wear, as a Long Life Lock.","Whatever happens, Mo Hua’s cause and effect must be well protected.","In Qian Learning State Boundary, so many family cultivators were eyeing him like wolves, he couldn’t help but use this Yin Yang Lock to seal cause and effect, intimidate vile people, and prevent others from spying.","There was no other way, Foundation Building Middle Stage, Super Divine Sense, first in Array Competition, these combined were truly too shocking.","People fear fame like pigs fear fattening, it’s best to stay low-key when necessary.","Elder Master Xun’s original intent was to protect Mo Hua.","But he didn’t realize, inadvertently, using the Tai Xu Yin Yang Lock, he saved countless families and sects in the Qian Learning State Boundary from disaster.","Without the seal of cause and effect, letting Mo Hua expose it for others to calculate.","If the cause and effect of the Evil God and Taoist Demon spread, countless cultivators would be corrupted.","The entire Qian Learning State Boundary might instantly fall into chaos.","And Mo Hua would truly become the \"Chaos Seed\"...","\"From now on, stay in the sect, don’t go anywhere else, cultivate in peace, at least until the turmoil passes,\" Elder Master Xun said.","Mo Hua earnestly nodded, \"Alright, Elder Master Xun.\"","He indeed had many things he needed to do.","Taking advantage of his remaining impressions, he wanted to ponder the final peak diagram of the Array Discussion Conference, the Peak of Nineteen-Pattern Reversed Spirit Formation, and comprehend it several times.","He still needed to learn the Godslaying Sword.","He needed to practice the Water Shadow Illusion more.","Of course, the most important thing was, having participated in the Array Discussion Conference, the precarious rank of the Taixu Gate was secured, he could now focus on matters of breaking through to Foundation Establishment Late Stage.","Afterward, Mo Hua peacefully cultivated within the Taixu Gate.","But the tree desires stillness, yet the wind does not cease.","Many sects were still restless because of him, unable to eat or sit in peace.","Especially the Four Great Sects.","Inside the discussion hall of Qian Taoist Sect.","Several Powerful Elders from the Heavenly Sword Sect, Longding Sect, Wanxiao Sect, were discussing with Elder Shen of Qian Taoist Sect.","\"Can’t calculate...\"","\"Taixu Gate is apprehensive, not daring to let people spy on this one’s cause and effect.\"","\"Aren’t you stating the obvious, if it were you, would you willingly let others spy?\"","\"The Ancestor of Taixu Gate, such deep tactics, unexpectedly hiding such a card, this is truly unbelievable...\"","\"Originally, Taixu Gate was supposed to perish alongside Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect, yet now it has come back to life, not only is it living better, it’s ranked third...\"","\"What should we do now?\"","\"What else can we do? It’s a done deal, the leader of the Array Competition has been decided, and can’t be changed...\"","\"My point is, the next round...\" Elder from Heavenly Sword Sect said with a frowned face.","Elder from Longding Sect was startled, \"Next round?\"","Elder from Heavenly Sword Sect solemnly said: \"This round is over, we were caught off guard and schemed by Taixu Gate, losing the leader’s position. Although it’s regrettable, being entangled with it now is pointless, the key is the next round...\"","Elder from Heavenly Sword Sect’s expression turned increasingly grave, even a bit fearful:","\"This one’s talent is terrifying. Foundation Building Middle Stage can suppress the Heavenly Pride of my Four Great Sects’ Foundation Establishment Late Stage, even Foundation Establishment Peak, to seize the first place in the Array Competition, so what about the next round?\"","\"By the next round, if he reaches Foundation Establishment Late Stage, further hones his Formation skills, rises to a new level, what can our Four Great Sects use to compete with him?\""]},{"number":1754,"title":"Chapter 1754 - 886: Yin Yang Lock (Part 4)","paragraphs":["\"He could take first place even with his eyes closed!\"","The faces of all the Elders looked extremely grim.","\"This so-called ’Mo Hua’ evil prodigy, don’t you all have an inkling of his current level in Formation?\"","The Elder of the Heavenly Sword Sect felt a chill surge through him:","\"With Mid-stage Foundation Establishment cultivation, he tramples the third generation, towers over the Four Sects, unrivaled among the Eight Gates, sweeping through the Twelve Streams, suppressing disciples from the countless gates of Qian Learning Hundred Gates and beyond...\"","\"He’s a once-in-a-millennium, ’cliff-like’ peerless evil prodigy!\"","\"As long as he exists, within the Qianxue state boundary, all Formation disciples must bow to him, living in the shadow of this ’prodigy’, forever unable to lift their heads.\"","\"From now on, at the Array Competition, we Four Great Sects can only vie for second place; even getting a glance at the ’Leader’ position is a mere luxury.\"","The tone of the Elder from the Heavenly Sword Sect was filled with shock, his heart filled with dread.","Elder Shen, along with the Elders from the Longding Sect and the Wanxiao Sect, also had faces as cold as frost.","It was just their bad luck that such a naturally gifted prodigy, unparalleled, impossibly matched, happened to join the Taixu Gate.","So unlucky...","\"So, should we?\" The Elder of the Longding Sect had a slightly cold gaze.","The Elder of the Wanxiao Sect frowned, \"Don’t act rashly, a natural prodigy, do you truly dare to make a move? Be careful not to damage your luck...\"","The Elder of the Longding Sect said, \"I’m not really going to make a move against him, what I mean is, try to win him over, get him to join our Four Great Sects.\"","\"If we can’t, then find a way to lead him astray, lure him.\"","\"Wine, women, wealth, since he is human, he must like one or two. Once he indulges in pleasure, lost in women, his life will be over...\"","\"Geniuses often flourish in ’talent’, but fail in ’heart’.\"","\"Taixu Gate isn’t foolish, how could they possibly let you do as you wish?\"","\"It’s worth a try, there’s nothing to lose; otherwise, where could I find another figure to rival him in Formations?\"","\"I still think it’s not quite right...\"","...","The crowd discussed eagerly, but couldn’t come to any conclusion for quite a while.","Two hours later, having reached no decision, they each left with their own thoughts.","In the great hall, only Elder Shen was left.","Elder Shen frowned.","No matter how much he thought, he couldn’t come up with any method to contend with this ’prodigy’ from the Taixu Gate.","Let alone winning, balancing the scales was even a luxury.","His Divine Sense surpassing third-rank was too defying of the heavens...","Not to mention his solid and terrifying Formation skills.","Elder Shen shook his head and sighed.","\"Mo Hua...\"","Now, just hearing this name sent chills down his spine, and sometimes even nightmares.","Elder Shen slowly walked out of the great hall, but after a few steps, his pupils contracted, his steps faltering.","\"No, this name... why does it sound so familiar?\"","\"Is it because I’ve been mentioning it too much lately? Or had I heard it somewhere before?\"","Elder Shen’s frown deepened.","Mo Hua.","Mo Hua...","Mo...","Elder Shen’s eyes suddenly widened, the bits and pieces of memories he had once forgotten slowly floated to the surface.","Chills continuously surged to his heart.","His body trembled, and he rushed back to his elder room, hands shaking, searching one by one through the many scrolls on one side.","He was looking for a registry.","The ease with which he discarded it then matched the difficulty he had in finding it now.","Finally, after an unknown amount of time passed, Elder Shen found a dusty, ordinary \"registry\" book at the bottom of a stack of files in a corner.","His hands trembling, Elder Shen slowly opened the registry.","On the registry was written \"Although there is a Sect-Entering Order, the qualifications do not match, pending discussion.\"","And the name on the registry was...","\"Mo Hua, a Loose Cultivator from Li State.\"","Elder Shen’s face went pale.","The words he spoke when he rejected this Loose Cultivator’s Sect-Entering Order echoed in his ears again.","\"A Loose Cultivator from the remote lands of Li State...\"","\"Mid and Lower Grade Five Elements Spirit Root...\"","\"Unsightly...\"","\"Under ’Specialty’, wrote... Formations?\"","\"He’s bold... Ignorance is fearless...\"","\"Cultivators from small places, perhaps learning a few formations makes them feel superior, not knowing the vastness of the world...\"","\"This is Qian State, the Qian Learning State Boundary, where geniuses from the Cultivation World gather, his ’genius in formations’ is dispensable...\"","\"Fortune is one thing, but... a great opportunity like this from the Qian Taoist Sect, he couldn’t bear it!\"","\"Such great fortune isn’t necessarily a good thing...\"","\"Those with little fortune can’t handle such extraordinary wealth...\"","...","Elder Shen only felt a burning pain on his face, bitterness in his heart.","\"This disciple, holding a Sect-Entering Order, wanted to join my Qian Taoist Sect, but I... rejected him...\"","This prodigy, dominating three generations, unrivaled by the Four Sects, a solitary figure, was someone I personally... handed over to the Taixu Gate?","Elder Shen’s heart was as cold as an ice cellar.","And even more... the \"Sect-Entering Order\".","Now it seemed clear that this ancient Sect-Entering Order had significant cause and effect.","This child, holding the Sect-Entering Order, wanted to join the Qian Taoist Sect; it was likely a gift from an expert, who remembered past causes and effects, granting my Qian Taoist Sect a chance.","And I personally extinguished this monumental opportunity, severing this cause and effect...","Elder Shen looked ashen, in an instant feeling as if heaven and earth had collapsed, \"buzzing\" in his head, eyes darkened, he slumped to the ground."]},{"number":1755,"title":"Chapter 1755 - 887: Return to Truth","paragraphs":["At the same time, in the Qian Taoist Sect, elder room.","Mr. Tu, wearing the guise of \"Elder Shen,\" finished a day of teaching, returned to the room, and activated the Divine Tao Array, shielding others’ perceptions, then sat alone at the desk, staring devoutly at a horn on the table.","The dim candlelight cast on his somber face, making it appear eerie and frightening.","\"Mo Hua...\"","Mr. Tu muttered the name softly, furrowing his brows.","\"Just where exactly did this person emerge from?\"","\"Why? Although I heard this name for the first time, why does it feel so familiar?\"","\"Just what is the origin of this young man?\"","Mr. Tu took out a short sword, cut his finger, and dripped blood onto the ram’s bone, silently praying in his heart.","A moment later, from the Cause and Effect emerged a blood shadow of a horn, tracing back through the past of the name \"Mo Hua.\"","His real name, his origin, his parents, his past...","But before uncovering the truth, the Tai Xu essence flowed completely, Yin and Yang merged like interlocking fish, sealed the cycle of Cause and Effect, blocking the blood shadow from penetrating it, sealing all truths away.","Mr. Tu frowned.","\"Such strong Yin Yang Heavenly Mechanism Power...\"","\"The Taixu Gate still possesses such ancient Heavenly Mechanism Treasures...\"","He considered trying to forcibly break through the Yin Yang Lock, but after a moment of hesitation, he gave up.","\"Without borrowing the power of the Divine Lord, setting up an altar and performing rituals with numerous offerings as media, it is impossible to break this Heavenly Mechanism Lock...\"","\"Moreover, it is not yet the time when matters come to a head, can’t afford to make a big show.\"","Mr. Tu gave up the thought of further probing.","But he had a constant feeling that this Array Dao Demon named \"Mo Hua\" was certainly no ordinary person.","It was very likely, related to the Tai Xu Vicious God of the Taixu Gate.","Mr. Tu wiped the blood off his fingers, pondered for a moment, and then his pupils suddenly trembled.","\"Yes... Super Divine Sense!\"","\"Ordinary cultivators, their Divine Sense is restricted by the Great Dao, without a cultivation method, it’s impossible to be Super Rank.\"","\"This demon, must have received the blessings from that ’Vicious God’, borrowing the Divine Thought of the Vicious God, thus making his own Divine Sense advance over three full ranks, able to draw formations at Foundation Establishment Peak during the Foundation Establishment Middle Stage...\"","\"These Divine Senses are not his own, but received through blessings prayed for from the ’Vicious God’!\"","\"In other words, this kid, like myself, is a ’Divine Protege’.\"","\"No, his level of divine favor exceeds mine, perhaps he is one of the chosen ’companions’ of the Tai Xu Vicious God from a young age, qualified to walk alongside the deities, a true ’Divine Servant’.\"","In Mr. Tu’s heart, there was both envy and jealousy.","His status in the pantheon he worshiped, the Master of the Great Wilderness, far inferior to this young man named Mo Hua.","Though he was favored by the Divine Lord, it was merely the most ordinary blessing.","Unlike this youngster, whose Divine Sense surpassed three ranks, almost equivalent to having received the highest level of \"Divine Blessing\" by the deities.","However, because of this, his talent in formations didn’t seem so earth-shattering.","\"Just a lucky kid granted favor by ’deities’, borrowing Vicious God’s blessing to boost his own divine thought, gaining first place in Array Tao...\"","Mr. Tu sneered.","Moreover, in some sense, this was also a good thing.","This feared Tai Xu Vicious God finally moved \"from darkness to light\" and began to reveal his tracks.","His core \"followers\" also began to be exposed.","\"Must hasten the pace now...\"","Taking advantage of the period when the Tai Xu Vicious God was parasitized by the Divine Lord’s Divine Fetus, all plans needed to be expedited...","Thinking of this made Mr. Tu’s heart ache again.","The cost of scheming against these Vicious Gods was simply too great...","A vast number of meticulously raised demon monsters had their powers usurped by this Vicious God, directed to their deaths, with none returning.","On the blood-sworn list, those Divine Lord’s henchmen nurtured for so long were unknown what methods were used by this Vicious God to wipe them all out.","These henchmen were Mr. Tu’s painstaking efforts.","Relying on the title of Elder of Qian Taoist Sect, he engaged all quarters, sought candidates, secretly developed for so many years, growing such a large batch deeply rooted in Qianxue State Boundary, interlinked, not only with Sect origins but with protection from the Taoist Court and able to roam in the shadows committing various sins as ’Evil God’s henchmen’.","These henchmen could provide offerings for the Divine Lord.","Their own sins were also the best offerings for the Divine Lord.","Originally, everything was proceeding according to plan, but within the recent few years, these henchmen were either captured or killed, losing a large part.","Now, more fundamentally, all have been obliterated, not a single one left.","Mr. Tu felt his heart bleeding, along with a strong sense of trepidation.","The Taixu Gate, and this Vicious God, were likely the biggest obstacles in the great plan of Divine Lord’s revival.","Mr. Tu’s gaze slightly focused, appearing somewhat sinister and distorted in the night.","\"But, it doesn’t matter...\"","\"The game of Foundation Establishment has few pieces left, so consider it lost.\"","\"Since that’s the case, let’s play the game above Golden Core...\"","\"To plot great strategies, one must not fear for one’s life. It’s time to use these family’s resources...\"","\"The day of Divine Lord’s awakening is near...\"","Mr. Tu’s figure gradually became shrouded in shadows, like a demon monster about to devour someone.","...","Within Qian Taoist Sect, Heavenly secrets are covertly decaying.","Within the Qianxue State Boundary, shadows continually shift.","The waves stirred by Mo Hua at the Dao Debate Assembly have far from subsided.","Thousands of miles away.","Taoist State, Heaven Shu Pavilion.","A Pavilion Elder with a hoary beard and hair, sat high on the pavilion, dozing off against a chessboard, seemingly asleep yet awake, neither awake nor asleep."]},{"number":1756,"title":"Chapter 1756 - 887: Returning to Truth (Part 2)","paragraphs":["It seemed like an ordinary old man, worn out from age, often drowsy and listless.","A disciple quietly entered the room, not daring to disturb the Pavilion Elder, and respectfully placed a jade slip on the table, then bowed and retreated silently.","The jade slip lay on the table.","All around was silent.","Amidst the lingering fragrance, the Pavilion Elder continued to doze.","It is unclear how long had passed, but the Pavilion Elder slowly opened his eyes, seemingly awakened, glanced sideways, and saw the jade slip on the table, picking it up to take a look.","With just a glance, the Pavilion Elder paused.","\"Qian Learning State Boundary, Array Competition Leader, Taixu Gate Mo Hua, Foundation Building Middle Stage, Divine Sense Nineteen Patterns...\"","The Pavilion Elder’s drowsiness vanished instantly, his spirit lifted, and he pondered slowly:","\"Foundation Building Middle Stage, Nineteen Patterns, this is quite peculiar...\"","\"Did he cultivate it himself? Or did he borrow it from some ’thing’?\"","\"If self-cultivated, how did he do it? If borrowed, from where did he borrow it?\"","The Pavilion Elder suddenly became interested.","Qianxue’s Array Competition, held once every three years, had a \"leader\" every time.","Such a leader might be held in high regard by ordinary cultivators.","But in the Taoist State, in the Heaven Shu Pavilion, and especially in the eyes of a Pavilion Elder who had lived for an unknown number of years, it seemed somewhat \"tasteless.\"","Though considered a genius, such geniuses appeared year after year.","Their talents were truly one in a million, but their self-serving nature was no different from ordinary people.","Having seen too many, it became boring.","Even so, a divine sense exceeding three levels was indeed extraordinary.","He, as the Pavilion Elder, seemed to have never seen anything like this before.","\"Let me calculate...\"","The Pavilion Elder eagerly extended his hand, just as his fingers moved to form a gesture, he paused, then frowned in displeasure and said:","\"Tai Xu Yin Yang Lock? Since when have they been so generous...\"","\"They were reluctant to lend it to me for even a glance...\"","The Pavilion Elder felt a tinge of jealousy.","Soon his curiosity increased.","\"To be willing to part with the Yin Yang Lock, there must be no small reason behind it.\"","Without probing into the details, just sensing the Heavenly Mechanism Lock a bit, Taixu Gate wouldn’t know.","The Pavilion Elder then formed a more formal hand gesture, but after a moment of computation, he paused again, with a look of astonishment on his weathered face:","\"Just how many layers of ’disguise’ are there?\"","Why is the heavenly secret component so complex?","Moreover, there were hints of cause and effect within that felt familiar to him?","Some causes and effects even made him, as the Pavilion Elder, somewhat apprehensive...","The Pavilion Elder’s expression was one of surprise, finding it hard to believe.","After a moment, he slowly set down the half-completed hand gesture, stopping his calculations, and instead looked at the name on the jade slip, his eyes growing brighter.","\"Mo Hua...\"","\"I remember it.\"","He then murmured:","\"However, Array Leader... in this case...\"","The Pavilion Elder’s aged gaze turned again toward the chessboard before him.","On the chessboard, a large area of intertwined pieces, black and white, were in a deadlock.","\"...Has the situation changed again?\"","The Pavilion Elder gazed at the chessboard, and as he looked, he suddenly saw three fragile great dragons on the board, vaguely showing signs of merging, causing him to pause and sit up straight, murmuring:","\"Could it be...?\"","...","Inside the Taixu Gate.","In the Elder’s Residence, the Taixu Sect Master said to Elder Master Xun, \"Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect have already been confirmed to fall from the Eight Great Gates.\"","\"Our previous concerns were correct; Tai’a Sect’s ’Sword Casting’ and Rushing Void Sect’s ’Sword Qi’ are not pure enough and do not meet the standards of the Twelve Streams, plus interference from the Four Great Sects, hence there is no place for them in the Twelve Streams either.\"","\"The Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect are likely to fall into the Qian Learning Hundred Gates...\"","The Taixu Sect Master sighed inwardly, then felt a bit fortunate.","If not for Mo Hua’s sudden emergence, achieving first in the Array Competition like an evil monster, Taixu Gate’s situation might not be much better.","Moreover, it was not just that.","The Taixu Sect Master sighed and said, \"Already, quite a few noble family’s sons who joined Tai’a and Chongxu Sects are preparing to withdraw.\"","Elder Master Xun frowned, \"Withdraw?\"","\"Yes,\" the Taixu Sect Master replied, \"Noble family’s sons joined Tai’a and Chongxu sects aiming for the ’Eight Great Gates’ reputation. Now that these two sects’ rankings have fallen and they are about to fade into the Qian Learning Hundred Gates, these descendants from notable backgrounds naturally look for a higher status...\"","Such is the way of noble families, cold and calculating.","Even if these descendants are unwilling to leave, their family elders will force them to leave the sect.","Elder Master Xun nodded, then asked, \"What about the elders? None want to withdraw?\"","The Taixu Sect Master said, \"At the elder level, things are still stable for now, as they rely on the sect for their livelihood and salary. Moreover, some are so tightly bound to the sect’s interests that jumping ship is not easy.\"","\"But that’s just for now, things might change later.\"","\"At least among the Guest Elders, there will be a significant number resigning. Some neutral elders are probably already looking for alternatives in secret...\"","The Taixu Sect Master shook his head, \"The sect’s restructuring is like rowing upstream; if we don’t advance, we will retreat. Taking a step back now, trying to climb back up amidst these turbulent waves will be as hard as ascending to the heavens.\"","\"Moreover, with a batch of core disciples leaving, and a batch of elders leaving, without the title of the Eight Great Gates, the quality of recruited disciples will also decline, creating a nearly unsolvable deadlock. Tai’a Sect and Chongxu Sect may never rise again in the future...\"","The Taixu Sect Master’s tone was one of sentiment, mixed with some sympathy.","Elder Master Xun nodded and said, \"Good.\"","The Taixu Sect Master almost thought he had heard wrong, \"Good?\"","Elder Master Xun nodded, \"Very good.\"","The Taixu Sect Master was stunned.","Weren’t the three sects the same origin, in the same alliance?"]},{"number":1757,"title":"Chapter 1757 - 887: Return to Truth (Part 3)","paragraphs":["Ancestor, why are you still gloating?","Elder Master Xun pondered and said, \"I thought they would suffer, but I didn’t expect it to be this bad. In this case, things will be easier to handle...\"","\"These two, they’re quite stubborn. As long as they can breathe, they’re not easy to deal with.\"","The Taixu Sect Master contemplated for a moment, his heart suddenly jumping, \"Ancestor, you wouldn’t...\"","Elder Master Xun shook his head, \"Let’s observe the situation first, don’t speak of it yet.\"","The Taixu Sect Master could only nod, and then couldn’t help but admire; the Ancestor truly deserves the title, not only far-sighted and deeply scheming, but also unimaginably bold...","Of course, this matter isn’t that simple either.","There are tremendous obstacles from all sides, and much planning is needed.","Elder Master Xun furrowed his brows in thought for a moment, looked up, and seeing the Taixu Sect Master still there, asked, \"Is there anything else?\"","The Taixu Sect Master nodded, \"It’s about Mo Hua.\"","\"Mo Hua? What’s going on with him?\" Elder Master Xun’s expression turned serious.","The Taixu Sect Master was silent for a moment, then asked, \"Ancestor, do you know how many merit points the child has now?\"","Elder Master Xun was taken aback, \"How many? Tens of thousands?\"","\"Four hundred eighty-six thousand nine hundred and twelve...\"","The Taixu Sect Master reported an extremely staggering number.","Elder Master Xun was also shocked, \"How many? Four hundred eighty thousand? How can it be that much?\"","The Taixu Sect Master said bitterly, \"Previously, I promised that if he achieved a ranking in the Dao Discussion Conference, he would receive a fourfold merit reward.\"","\"At that time, Taixu Gate was on the brink, and we had to go all out. But I didn’t expect this child Mo Hua to suddenly emerge and achieve a first place that shocked the world...\"","\"The merit for leading the Dao Discussion is already extremely abundant. With it multiplied by four, and considering he already had quite a lot of merit, this totals to a frightening amount...\"","When he went to check the merit, seeing Mo Hua’s number almost made him think he was seeing things.","Which sect disciple, at only the Foundation Building Middle Stage, could earn four hundred eighty thousand merit?","Four hundred eighty thousand...","The Taixu Sect Master muttered, \"Based on his current merit, if he saved up for another one or two years, he could directly enter the Inner Gate and become an ’Elder’ before graduating.\"","Even Elder Master Xun took a deep breath.","His thoughts had been entirely on formations, completely forgetting the balance of \"merit points.\"","Without noticing, he gave too much to this child.","The key issue was, it couldn’t be taken back.","What Ancestor would deduct their own disciple’s merit points?","Elder Master Xun pondered for a moment and said slowly, \"It’s okay, just don’t show it to him.\"","The Taixu Sect Master was startled, \"Don’t show it to him?\"","The Taixu Token was in his hand, how could he not show it?","Elder Master Xun said, \"Don’t display that many, hide several digits, show only up to ninety-nine thousand nine hundred ninety-nine.\"","\"Don’t deduct it, just don’t show it to him. If he asks, just say his merit points exceed the sect’s limit, and don’t tell him the exact amount.\"","\"Say some good words, praise him a bit. Once he’s happy, he surely won’t dig deeper.\"","\"After all, he always has plenty of merit, and he can’t use it all up, so he won’t be troubled.\"","The Taixu Sect Master nodded blankly, still feeling a little uneasy, \"Is this... really going to work?\"","\"Don’t worry.\" Elder Master Xun said.","As if he wouldn’t know Mo Hua’s disposition.","Besides, this wasn’t a bad thing.","They weren’t cutting his merit, just not telling him temporarily, to prevent pride and negligence from having too much merit.","The Taixu Sect Master nodded.","Though he felt somewhat complicated inside.","Both an Ancestor and a Sect Master, teaming up to deceive this Junior Disciple Mo Hua, somehow felt a bit wrong...","...","In the Disciple’s Residence.","Mo Hua also frowned.","He had a vague premonition:","\"Is someone scheming against me?\"","But after pondering for a moment, he didn’t sense any malice, nor did it seem dangerous, so he didn’t mind.","The main thing was, during this period, his premonitions in Cause and Effect were frequently stirred.","As if many people were secretly plotting against him.","He even sensed a mysterious \"grandfather\" with an untraceable aura and fearful cause and effect, looking at him with interest.","Of course, this premonition only lasted for an instant before vanishing.","After that, nothing else happened.","Over time, Mo Hua didn’t pay much attention.","But because there were so many who peeked at him, Mo Hua inevitably became vigilant.","So during this period, he strictly followed Elder Master Xun’s instructions, staying in Taixu Gate, calmly cultivating and studying formations, without going anywhere.","At the moment, he was writing a letter.","This letter was intended for Elder Zheng.","Elder Zheng had asked Zheng Fang to convey a message to Mo Hua, saying his Cloud Ferry was delayed, and he might have to stay in the Qian Learning State Boundary for a few more months.","In terms of formations, if Mo Hua had any questions or things he wanted to learn, he could approach him.","Mo Hua was overjoyed.","But he couldn’t leave or visit Elder Zheng to ask in person, so he could only write a letter, noting his doubts about \"Original Magnet,\" or the orthodox \"Thunder Magnetism\" formations, and ask Elder Zheng for guidance.","A renowned teacher doesn’t come by often.","Having a teacher willing to teach you is even more precious.","Mo Hua cherished this opportunity greatly.","After finishing the letter, Mo Hua handed it to Zheng Fang, asking him to pass it on to Elder Zheng.","Afterward, he attended class as usual.","Every Taixu Sect Disciple he encountered on the way, upon seeing Mo Hua, was both surprised and delighted, some calling him \"Junior Brother,\" others \"Junior Brother Mo,\" greeting him one after another.","Now the entire Taixu Gate, from top to bottom, truly had almost no one who didn’t recognize Mo Hua."]},{"number":1758,"title":"Chapter 1758 - 887: Return to Simplicity (Part 4)","paragraphs":["Array Competition First, Array Leader.","Not to mention the Foundation Building Middle Stage and the Super Divine Sense conditions, just the identity of an Array Leader in the Taixu Gate’s history is indeed unprecedented.","—Because the Taixu Gate does not excel in \"Formations\".","Moreover, because of Mo Hua’s achievement in the Formation category, the Taixu Gate directly ascended to the top three of the \"Eight Great Gates\", increasing the worth of all Taixu disciples.","Even when bragging outside, their faces shine with radiance.","Mo Hua now is like a \"Money Cat\", everyone who sees him beams with joy.","And that’s not all.","Since Mo Hua’s fame spread like wildfire, even staying inside Taixu Gate, every day there is an uninterrupted flow of \"visitation cards\" and \"gifts\" sent to Taixu Gate.","These cards and gifts are sent by other families and sects.","There are those who want to visit, those who want to invite him to gatherings, those who seek friendship, and even those wishing to form alliances, or trying to poach him.","Most of these, Mo Hua declined.","Courtesy demands reciprocity.","In this world, there is no such thing as taking benefits without reciprocation.","Accepting others’ gifts now means owing favors, and these must be returned in the future.","Mo Hua neither covets nor is foolish.","However, even so, he did accept gifts from a few families.","For example, the Gu Family.","He often went to the Gu Family for meals and had good relationships with many of their elders and disciples, so he had to give the Gu Family face.","The Shangguan Family and the Wenren Family also sent gifts.","Mo Hua thought about it and declined to accept them.","As expected, a few days later, Wenren Wan personally came on behalf of the family heads of the two families to present gifts to Mo Hua at Taixu Gate.","Only then did Mo Hua accept the gifts.","Wenren Wan herself also gifted Mo Hua many things and showed great care towards him.","Afterwards, she silently watched Mo Hua, her beautiful eyes filled with both relief and gratitude.","She truly hadn’t expected that this child Mo Hua would offer her such a great blessing of goodwill.","Now, her position in the Shangguan Family was almost on par with Elder Shangguan Wang of the Feather Transformation Realm.","Wenren Wan was overwhelmed with emotions.","Then she gave meticulous instructions to Mo Hua and reluctantly left the Taixu Gate.","Mo Hua also personally escorted Wenren Wan to the Mountain Gate.","Some gifts from other influences were accepted by Mo Hua based on circumstances.","And even though Mo Hua did not accept gifts from many family sects, they still repeatedly showed goodwill, sending gifts to him and Taixu Gate.","Such clamor for fame and fortune, wealth arriving at the door.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but feel a bit of youthful arrogance.","But after a while, he realized this was not quite right.","These were not truly what he wanted.","Cultivators cultivate the \"truth\", seek the \"Dao\".","One shouldn’t lose a steady heart because of fame and fortune, allowing restlessness and complacency to erode one’s Taoist Heart.","What he ultimately wants to pursue is the mystery of the Formation, the Law of heaven and earth, the insight into all illusory truths, the quest for the Great Dao of eternal life.","Only in this way can one change Yin and Yang, reverse life and death, pierce the heavenly secret, grasp cause and effect, experience countless tribulations without death, and become immortal through the Dao.","Fame and fortune may not necessarily be good things.","If he becomes intoxicated by them, he will certainly become lazy, step by step distancing himself from the true \"Great Dao\".","From another perspective, this is also a kind of test.","Not only hardship can temper the Taoist Heart, the lure of fame and fortune itself is also a refinement of the Taoist Heart.","Neither sinking in hardship, nor getting lost in fame and fortune.","Do not lose, do not forget, uphold the true self.","Without tranquility, one cannot clarify their aim; without calmness, one cannot reach afar.","No matter how external things change, whether circumstances are favorable or adverse, oneself remains oneself.","Mo Hua froze, then his expression showed sudden enlightenment.","He only felt that his previously slightly restless mindset slowly settled down.","His Taoist Heart washed away some superficiality, becoming more clear and firm.","\"The mere first place in the Array Competition, Array Leader, are all past events, not worth mentioning. What cultivators should pursue is a higher Great Dao!\"","Mo Hua nodded slightly, silently said in his heart.","Then he calmed down and continued, as always, to cultivate the art of Arrays and comprehend the Dao.","Elder Master Xun had been watching all this.","He originally thought to let Mo Hua \"indulge\" for a while, then urge him to study formations.","After all, being so young, winning the leadership, having fame spread like wildfire, being flattered by all sides, he should have some indulgent carefree days.","But unexpectedly, it didn’t take long before Mo Hua resumed studying formations day and night, as usual.","With a clear gaze and calm demeanor, almost identical to usual.","As if he had never participated in any Array Discussion Conference, never overpowered the Four Great Sects, never won the Array Leader title, without so much fame.","From beginning to end, he was just an ordinary sect disciple, passionate about formations, wholeheartedly seeking the Dao...","Elder Master Xun was stunned for a long time, his pupils trembling slightly, suddenly recalling the eight words left by the ancestors of Taixu Gate:","\"Dao Heart becomes natural, returning to simplicity...\"","Elder Master Xun silently recited these eight words, looking at the unperturbed, child-like innocent Mo Hua, feeling a surge of inexplicable shock."]},{"number":1759,"title":"Chapter 1759 - 888: Convergence","paragraphs":["After more than a month, Mo Hua focused on his cultivation as usual.","One afternoon, while eating at the dining hall in the Disciple’s Residence, Cheng Mo kept staring at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua was puzzled, \"What are you looking at?\"","Cheng Mo touched his chin, \"Nothing, it’s just that, Junior Brother, you won first place in the Formation, and yet there’s no difference as before, nothing has changed.\"","He still remembered, back at the Array Discussion Arena, Mo Hua was cold and aloof, effortlessly crushing opposition, with an unmatched demeanor, breezing through the Formation exam.","The final words \"Anything else?\" were three simple, plain words that made the entire panel of examiners tremble.","That cold and invincible look was so striking that it made one’s scalp tingling.","Now though...","Cheng Mo silently glanced at Mo Hua.","He acted like nothing happened, gnawing on a chicken leg again in the dining hall...","Cheng Mo felt that there was a bit of a disconnect between these two personas of the Junior Brother.","\"Junior Brother, you’re the first in the Array, the Array Leader, shouldn’t you show a bit more poise?\" Cheng Mo said.","Mo Hua shrugged, \"Being first in the Array, the Leader, so what? Formations are vast and profound; I can’t let this little achievement hinder my progress.\"","Array Leader, so what...","A little achievement...","Not just Cheng Mo, but all the surrounding disciples were completely shocked.","However, since these words came from Mo Hua, they were unable to refute.","Cheng Mo sighed, \"Junior Brother, you’d better not say this outside, or else someone might just lose their mind and fight you...\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Don’t worry, I’m very humble outside.\"","Cheng Mo couldn’t quite grasp Mo Hua’s standard of \"humility\" for the moment...","After that, everyone continued eating silently.","Mo Hua gnawed on the chicken leg for a while, then suddenly sensed something, paused, looked at Cheng Mo, and said, \"You reached the Foundation Establishment Late Stage?\"","Cheng Mo nodded, \"Yeah, just these past two days, I made a breakthrough.\"","He then turned his head, asking Situ Jian and them, \"Are you all about to break through too?\"","Situ Jian nodded, \"Yeah, I have about seven or eight days...\"","Hao Xuan also said, \"Junior Brother, me too, quickly in three days, slowly in ten days, I can also break through to the Foundation Establishment Late Stage...\"","Mo Hua suddenly felt the pressure.","He still hadn’t sensed the bottleneck of the Foundation Establishment Late Stage...","Sensing the bottleneck, breaking the bottleneck, breaking through to the Foundation Establishment Late Stage, increasing spiritual power, consolidating cultivation, all these take a lot of time.","And this academic year, not much time is left.","\"I need to hurry up!\"","Mo Hua’s heart tightened.","After this, he focused more on cultivation, but the progress was still slow.","Especially watching Cheng Mo and these \"Junior Brothers\" break through to the Foundation Establishment Late Stage one after another, the sense of urgency in Mo Hua’s heart grew stronger.","In theory, Foundation Establishment isn’t difficult—at least for the disciples of the Eight Great Gates.","Qi Refining Foundation, solidifying the path in Foundation Establishment, the real watershed is reaching the Golden Core.","Before the Golden Core, it actually relies on the Spiritual Root, inheritance, and cultivation resources.","Even if one is dull, as long as one persists in cultivation, with a famous teacher’s guidance, and the support of various Heavenly Materials and Earthly Treasures and Spirit Stones, achieving the Foundation Establishment Late Stage is possible.","After the Golden Core, variables increase a lot.","Apart from Spiritual Roots, Spiritual Objects, these hard conditions of inheritance, factors like insight, affinity, and even luck are considered, which are intangible and elusive.","Therefore, generally, sects only teach Qi Refinement and Foundation Establishment courses before the Golden Core.","These can be taught together in large classes, and the progress is easy to control.","When it comes to the Golden Core, the changes are profound, situations are complex, and Daoist cultivation methods are more esoteric, so one must enter the Inner Gate, take on a one-on-one master for specialized cultivation guidance.","Within the Qianxue State Boundary, the disciples of various sects mostly have superior Spiritual Roots, and most are from family backgrounds, with familial support, sect rewards, resources are never lacking.","Although families are also divided into different levels, those who can enter the Qian Learning Hundred Gates, even if the worst, with fewer cultivation resources, they still have much more than the vast majority of Loose Cultivators in this world.","So, until the Foundation Establishment Late Stage and before the Golden Core, it’s not considered difficult.","The challenge lies in reaching perfection, achieving excellence, building an extraordinary foundation surpassing others.","But Mo Hua is different.","Strictly speaking, he’s not considered a \"genius.\"","His Spiritual Root is poor, and his physical body is weak.","During Qi Refinement, he was very poor, lacking Heavenly Materials and Earthly Treasures for nourishment, without Daoist inheritance to hone Blood Qi or Spiritual Power foundation.","His Qi Refinement speed wasn’t slow because the true prodigies were polishing their foundation, strengthening their essence.","By skipping this step, just focusing on pace, he cultivated quickly.","But in Foundation Establishment, the situation changed.","Poor Spiritual Root meant fewer Spiritual Power Cycles, and slower cultivation progress.","During the Foundation Establishment Initial Stage, it wasn’t quite noticeable.","By the Late Middle Stage of Foundation Establishment, Mo Hua’s cultivation speed noticeably slowed down, the deeper he went, the more so.","Additionally, he spent a lot of time and energy on the Array Discussion Conference.","Practicing the Soul-Shocking Sword, nurturing the Evil Embryo, self-severing the Life Soul, consumed a lot of his Divine Marrow, and his realm of Divine Thought Taoism also experienced a certain lapse.","Mo Hua estimated that this year, he probably wouldn’t reach the Foundation Establishment Late Stage.","And not reaching the Foundation Establishment Late Stage within the year meant...","\"Failing the grade?\"","Mo Hua’s heart chilled at once.","Done for... His dignity as the Taixu Gate Junior Brother, and Qian Learning State’s Array Discussion Leader, might truly fail the grade?","That would be really embarrassing.","After that, Mo Hua became even more diligent in his cultivation.","But cultivation is about consistency, not something achieved overnight."]},{"number":1760,"title":"Chapter 1760 - 888: Confluence_2","paragraphs":["And the Spiritual Root is poor, it cannot be changed.","His cultivation progress remains not too optimistic, not only has his cultivation increased little, but he’s also far from touching the bottleneck of Foundation Establishment Late Stage...","Mo Hua’s heart was completely chilled.","But since the problem has occurred, it is a fact that must be faced. There is no point in deceiving oneself.","Mo Hua thought for a while and went to find Elder Master Xun.","In the Elder’s Residence, Elder Master Xun was chatting with the Taixu Sect Master. Seeing Mo Hua, he was a bit surprised.","Mo Hua then tactfully explained the concern that his focus on studying Formations for the upcoming Array Discussion Conference had delayed his cultivation progress, possibly preventing him from breaking through to Foundation Establishment Late Stage by the end of the year, to Elder Master Xun.","Elder Master Xun paused for a moment and said: \"No worries, do your best, whatever you achieve is what it is, don’t overthink the rest.\"","He didn’t say it explicitly, but Mo Hua understood.","The meaning was that you should strive to cultivate. Even if you can’t break through to Foundation Establishment Late Stage, you won’t be held back a year.","Mo Hua breathed a sigh of relief and then silently looked at the Taixu Sect Master nearby.","The Sect Master hesitated for a moment, glanced at Elder Master Xun, and also nodded, saying: \"Rest assured, I will vouch for you.\"","Even if it breaks the rules, it doesn’t matter.","The Array Leader, deserves such a privilege.","Mo Hua was thoroughly relieved, thanked them politely, and then took his leave.","After Mo Hua left, the Taixu Sect Master appeared thoughtful.","Elder Master Xun asked him: \"What are you thinking?\"","The Taixu Sect Master pondered and said:","\"Ancestor, I suddenly have an idea...\"","\"If Mo Hua, this child, remains in the Foundation Building Middle Stage, unable to break through, unable to graduate his whole life, wouldn’t that mean... he can keep attending the Array Discussion Conference forever?\"","\"As long as Mo Hua is around, whether it’s the Four Great Sects, the other Eight Great Gates, or the Twelve Streams, they can only look at his face and compete for the second place?\"","\"In this way, wouldn’t our Taixu Gate be able to always take first place in the Array Competition, winning the Array Leader until we are numb to it?\"","Elder Master Xun snapped: \"What nonsense is this!\"","Yet, after he said this, he was stunned for a moment and pondered deeply, only to find...","It seems feasible...","As long as Mo Hua is there, he is number one.","And he is only in the Foundation Building Middle Stage, as long as he does not reach Foundation Establishment Late Stage, he does not have to graduate.","In this way, always taking first place in the Array Competition, wouldn’t the Taixu Gate be able to monopolize the Array Leader?","This temptation is so great that Elder Master Xun’s heart momentarily succumbed to greed, thinking if Mo Hua remained \"held back\" forever, it would not be so bad...","Then Elder Master Xun immediately shook his head, suppressing the greed in his heart, and hurriedly said:","\"No, no, in this way, it would actually harm this child, absolutely not...\"","The Taixu Sect Master also knew this was bad, so they were just saying it casually.","Moreover, if he actually did this, the Four Great Sects would undoubtedly be pushed to the edge and might employ underhanded moves.","Other sects would curse Taixu Gate for being shameless.","Elder Master Xun said: \"Let’s not mention this again, we should make the child focus on cultivation, enhance his cultivation, and learn higher-rank Formations. Even if he doesn’t reach Foundation Establishment Late Stage, he can’t be held back, otherwise, what would become of the Array Leader...\"","\"Yes.\" The Taixu Sect Master said.","After discussing Mo Hua’s matter, they continued their serious conversation.","\"About that matter...\" Elder Master Xun’s gaze became slightly focused, \"Have you prepared everything?\"","The Taixu Sect Master restrained his expression and said solemnly: \"I’ve started liaising, revealed a bit of intention to them, but...\"","The Taixu Sect Master frowned, \"...the other side is very resistant.\"","\"Just resistant?\"","\"Not only...\" The Taixu Sect Master said helplessly, \"They feel that Taixu Gate is taking advantage of their misfortune, mocking them.\"","\"Hmm.\" Elder Master Xun was not surprised.","This is quite common, if positions were switched, the Taixu Gate would think the same.","The Taixu Sect Master frowned and said: \"It seems quite hopeless, with heavy resistance, Ancestor, should we persist?\"","\"Of course.\" Elder Master Xun nodded and said, \"This is not a matter of one family, and when planning and doing things, don’t pay too much attention to what others say, but look at their specific circumstances, gains and losses, life and death, and interests.\"","\"The words spoken are often not true.\"","\"Most of the opinions you hear may be like duckweed on water, far from the actual reality.\"","The Taixu Sect Master suddenly realized, nodded and said: \"Yes.\"","\"You now just release some hints, let their Ancestors catch wind of it, have some psychological preparation, but the true decision-making still lies in their Ancestors’ hands.\" Elder Master Xun said.","The Taixu Sect Master felt slightly relieved upon hearing this and cupped his hands, saying:","\"I will follow the Ancestor’s words.\"","...","All the plans are being pushed forward methodically.","Several days later, at Rushing Void Sect.","In the cave residence on the back mountain.","Ancient pine screens, hiding cause and effect, the surroundings silent and uninhabited.","Linghu Ancestor of Rushing Void Sect, sat alone in the cave residence.","In front of him, there was an ancient stone table with three teacups on it, the tea’s steam lingering in the air.","The table was old, the teacups were old, and the custom was old as well.","This was an ancient tea meeting that had been held for a long time, but it hadn’t been hosted for a long time as well.","At this time, Linghu Ancestor was both drinking tea and quietly waiting.","After a while, in a void, the space suddenly cracked, and Sword Qi overflowed.","An elderly man with a tall Divine Body and slightly dark face emerged, stepping as if wind, straight to the table, lifting a teacup to drink.","This person wore the highest-ranking Taoist Robe of Tai’a Sect, the behind-the-scenes Elder Ouyang of Tai’a Sect.","Elder Ouyang sat down and drank tea without speaking.","Because both people present knew the person hosting had not yet arrived.","After another thirty minutes, the void crack opened once more, stable and calm, with faint traces."]},{"number":1761,"title":"Chapter 1761 - 888: Confluence_3","paragraphs":["Elder Master Xun, with a head full of white hair, emerged and came straight to the table, picked up a teacup, gestured to the Ancestors of Tai’a and Rushing Void Sect, and drank it in one gulp.","Elder Ouyang, who had been angry, became somewhat sympathetic upon seeing Elder Master Xun’s aged appearance and sighed:","\"Brother Xun, among the three of us, you certainly age the fastest.\"","Elder Master Xun responded calmly: \"There’s no choice; too many worries and too much labor.\"","Elder Ouyang shook his head, \"I told you, you’re already an Ancestor, why do you still personally teach and preach? It’s a needless waste of energy...\"","Elder Master Xun said: \"It’s the ancestral rules, a habit, and moreover...\"","Elder Master Xun paused slightly, \"Personally teaching occasionally can also discover one or two good seedlings, enhancing our Taixu Gate.\"","This statement made the Ancestors of Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect somewhat uncomfortable in their hearts.","If not for Taixu Gate having a prodigy, their current situation might really not be better than the other two sects.","After a while, Ancestor Linghu of Rushing Void Sect said:","\"Alright, let’s discuss the matter at hand...\"","He did not beat around the bush, and directly said: \"Regarding this matter, I’ve heard some rumors, I assume it was you, Brother Xun, who deliberately spread it through the Elders and Sect Leaders to probe the reactions.\"","\"Let me first state a stance: regarding this matter, Rushing Void Sect disagrees.\"","Elder Ouyang also nodded and said: \"Tai’a Sect also disagrees.\"","The three sects, although originally from the same lineage, have separated and now live their own lives.","Now each has its own foundation, how can it be discussed and decided to merge just like that?","The entangled interests and personnel conflicts are too numerous, too complicated, causing these Ancestors headaches just by thinking about it.","Moreover, once the Three Sects United, there must be a \"leader.\"","Who will be the head?","Given the current situation, it would surely be Taixu Gate.","Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect would certainly not agree.","It sounds nice to call it \"Three Sects Unification,\" but unpleasantly, it would be called \"annexation,\" where Taixu Gate takes advantage and swallows Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect!","Thinking of this, Elder Ouyang felt resentful and addressed Elder Master Xun:","\"Brother Xun, the three sects are the same alliance, I don’t expect you to help us in times of crisis, but don’t add insult to injury...\"","Ancestor Linghu also nodded: \"It is indeed disheartening.\"","Elder Master Xun silently drank tea without speaking.","Elder Ouyang and Ancestor Linghu remained indifferent but did not urge him, waiting for Elder Master Xun’s response.","After a while, Elder Master Xun slowly began and asked the other two Ancestors a question: \"Do you think our three sects’ foundation can still be preserved?\"","Upon hearing this, the two Elder remarked somewhat apprehensively.","Elder Ouyang said: \"Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect might not be in a favorable position, but your Taixu Gate, blessed with great fortune and with a prodigy disciple, has already ranked third among the Eight Great Gates, coinciding with the sect’s reform, thriving afterward. How would you not be able to preserve your foundation?\"","Elder Master Xun shook his head, \"Don’t mention the top three of the Eight Great Gates. Even if Taixu Gate really mixes into the Four Great Sects, it may not truly be able to maintain its foundation.\"","Elder Ouyang and Ancestor Linghu exchanged puzzled glances:","\"Brother Xun, please clarify.\"","Elder Master Xun hesitated for a moment and then slowly revealed two words:","\"Evil God...\"","Elder Ouyang and Ancestor Linghu’s expressions changed, and then they frowned.","Elder Master Xun said: \"These two words should be familiar to you.\"","\"You mean...\" Ancestor Linghu said.","Elder Master Xun sighed: \"An Evil God has already infiltrated the Qian Learning State Boundary deeply, much more seriously than we predicted...\"","Elder Ouyang and Ancestor Linghu remained silent.","Elder Master Xun quietly studied them, and slowly said:","\"I know you may have sensed it, but not studying the Heavenly Mechanism Causality, you don’t know how serious this problem is.\"","\"Not just you, other seniors are probably the same.\"","\"Either secluded and oblivious, or merely focusing on sect interests, paying attention to sect development, as long as disciples’ missteps don’t affect the sect foundation, they turn a blind eye.\"","\"This is wrong...\"","Elder Master Xun said solemnly: \"The corruption of the Taoist Heart is more terrifying than anything.\"","\"Once the Taoist Heart is corrupted, the Evil God will take advantage of it. No matter how powerful the influence or thriving the sect, once corrupted, will eventually decay and even rot completely.\"","\"And the Evil God resides in the human heart, its means are treacherous and unpredictable.\"","\"Those cultivators focusing on Power Cultivation and neglecting Cultivating Heart, no matter how high their cultivation, are no match for the Evil God.\"","Elder Ouyang frowned, shaking his head: \"Brother Xun, you tend to exaggerate...\"","Elder Master Xun said: \"The lesson from the Rouge Boat is profound enough, isn’t it?\"","This matter is rather pointed.","Elder Ouyang and Ancestor Linghu both showed displeased expressions.","\"This matter is due to poor discipline by Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect, I do not deny it. But to say it’s caused by the Evil God, seems somewhat far-fetched...\"","Elder Master Xun raised an eyebrow:","\"Don’t you curious? Why this matter could be concealed until now? Why, you Ancestors could fail to notice? Why, such sordid affairs happened on Mistwater River?\"","\"The Dragon King Temple on Mistwater River has a history.\"","\"Why did this Dragon King Temple later vanish? Who hid it? What happened inside exactly?\"","\"Now in this Dragon King Temple, relying on pirates killing people as offerings, what exactly are they worshipping?\"","\"Is anyone bewitching sect disciples to commit sins to nourish that thing?\""]},{"number":1762,"title":"Chapter 1762 - 888: Convergence_4","paragraphs":["Ouyang and Linghu Ancestor both had a change in their expressions.","They were all Ancestors, needing to cultivate while also plotting the grand strategy, occasionally they had to go into seclusion to comprehend, and for these \"trivial matters\" among Second Grade state boundary and Foundation Establishment cultivators, they generally wouldn’t intervene.","Furthermore, the evil fog was shrouding, obscuring the cause and effect.","If Elder Master Xun had not mentioned it at this time, they would have been completely unaware of the hidden mysteries within.","No, or rather, they once became aware, had a little guess, but deliberately or unintentionally, they all forgot later...","Forgot...","These Heaven Void Ancestors, forgot...","Thinking about it now, the two Ancestors were suddenly shocked, feeling a chill deep in their hearts.","What kind of existence can make them, Heaven Void, forget about something?","Linghu Ancestor pondered for a moment and said, \"I will look into this matter...\"","Elder Master Xun shook his head, \"It’s useless, even if you investigate now, you won’t find anything. Even if you do find something, it would be half-truths. Moreover, after a period, if you go into seclusion or lose your focus, you might just forget about this matter altogether...\"","Ouyang Ancestor and Linghu Ancestor frowned even deeper.","A moment later, Ouyang Ancestor said, \"Brother Xun, among the three of us, you are the one who has studied the Dao of heavenly secret the deepest, I don’t believe you’d lie. But without solid evidence, it would be too hasty to fully trust you.\"","\"Not to mention, matters involving the sect fate are all grand affairs.\"","\"We understand your meaning as well.\"","\"But we can’t possibly agree to this so-called ’Sect unification’ which is actually a ’Sect annexation’ due to some unwarranted fear of this ’Evil God’...\"","Linghu Ancestor also said, \"Listening is illusive, seeing is believing, we need to verify before we can make a decision.\"","Elder Master Xun said, \"If the Evil God were to be born, it would mean human hearts are in chaos, the Dao of Heaven and Earth is beginning to decline, and by the time you realize it, it would be too late...\"","Ouyang Ancestor and Linghu Ancestor were clearly somewhat skeptical.","Elder Master Xun sighed slightly.","The difficulty of this matter lies here.","People can only realize the things they can realize.","The longer people live, the more it is so.","Evil God, this kind of existence born from between the Divine Thought is ethereal.","Even cultivators with high cultivation may not necessarily see it.","Even if they see it, they may not understand, if they understand it, they may not truly grasp it, even if they truly grasp it, they may not know what to do.","If they know what to do, truly doing it may be full of concerns and difficulties, making it hard to steadfastly push forward.","This is also a flaw in human nature.","To \"know\" is already hard enough, if one seeks to \"unify knowledge and action,\" it is even harder.","Opportunities won’t wait for people, they pass in a flash.","Once you miss the opportune moment, when the situation worsens, it would be beyond remedy.","Elder Master Xun calculated many times, the more he calculated, the more he felt, if not for the Three Sects unification to advance and retreat together, it would be hard to stay unaffected in the upcoming changes in Qian Learning state boundary.","And if the Three Sects can unify, it would instead be a grand opportunity.","However, to convince these two stubborn elders living for so long is not easy.","Elder Master Xun paused for a moment and slowly said, \"Did you forget the ’Heavenly Demon Catastrophe’ in the history of the Three Sects?\"","As soon as this was said, Ouyang and Linghu Ancestor’s pupils shrank, and their hearts shook.","Elder Master Xun continued with, \"All ancient secrets like this, all texts have long been erased, except for us Ancestors who have lived long, not even the current Sect Leader knows.\"","\"However, I think you wouldn’t forget either.\"","\"Back then, the Heavenly Demon Catastrophe lasted forever, our Taixu Lineage suffered endless losses, how many people died, how many swords were broken?\"","\"My Elder Brother, with such cultivation, and his swordsmanship reaching the pinnacle, yet unable to advance further, could only seal his Divine Thought, guarding forever in the Tai Xu Sword Tomb, using the tomb as a prison, never able to leave a step.\"","\"Throughout Three Sects, the heavenly secrets, cause and effect adversities, Divine Thought’s killing intents, were all silently guarded by Taixu Gate.\"","\"The current Sword Tomb has further buried countless remains.\"","\"These include both predecessors who perished in the Heavenly Demon Catastrophe and geniuses who met untimely deaths while slaying Demon Wraiths and Evil Demons...\"","\"Perhaps this is the fate of Sword Transformation from Divine Thought, I won’t say anything, I also don’t want to bargain, but you should know you indeed, owe Taixu Gate somewhat.\"","Elder Master Xun’s gaze was profound.","Ouyang Ancestor and Linghu Ancestor’s expressions were silent, yet their hearts were guilty.","People are selfish.","On regular days, they only consider themselves, but this doesn’t mean there are things they don’t understand.","Taia Refining Spirit Sword, Chongxu Cultivates Sword Qi, these are tangible, visible, their sect’s contribution is visible.","But intangible things are the most perilous.","Over these years, what Taixu Gate has secretly given and sacrificed is the greatest.","If a Sect Leader, Elder-level person is not deeply knowledgeable of heavenly secrets, maybe they can argue a bit, but they are Ancestors, deeply understanding the terror of Divine Thought World being unpredictable.","They have visited the Sword Tomb of Taixu Gate before.","How many people are buried there, they know clearly in their hearts.","Elder Master Xun finally looked at the two of them silently and said solemnly:","\"Three Sects unification is advancing and retreating together to cope with the grand catastrophe, preserving the foundation of our Three Sects.\"","\"To put it bluntly, it can also be seen as compensation for what Taixu Gate has lost over the years in the Dao of Divine Thought.\"","\"Moreover, how precarious your two sects’ current situation is, I don’t need to say more. Do you really want to watch your foundation decline?\"","\"And Taixu Gate is different, without mentioning anything else, at least in formation, having Mo Hua is a stroke that averts a hundred ugliness.\"","\"My words are here, the next first in formation will definitely be my Taixu Gate’s!\"","\"The situation is like this, there is only one opportunity.\"","\"Now I can still help you, but if you miss this chance, encounter the catastrophe, I might want to pull, but will have the heart and lack the power.\"","\"You should understand how to choose...\"","Elder Master Xun’s expression was stern and his tone decisive.","Ouyang Ancestor and Linghu Ancestor pondered silently, speechless for a long time, until they could only sigh deeply.","...","Two hours later, Elder Master Xun returned to Taixu Gate, and the heavy stone in his heart slowly settled.","No matter what, a beginning had been made at last.","The planning over these days had not been in vain.","Elder Master Xun let out a breath.","Another two hours later, Mo Hua came to find Elder Master Xun, routinely seeking advice on formation studies.","Elder Master Xun saw Mo Hua had not slackened, still so diligent, and nodded in approval.","After seeking advice, Mo Hua hesitated before speaking.","\"What’s wrong?\" Elder Master Xun asked.","\"I...\" Mo Hua said softly, \"I really won’t be held back a grade?\"","Although he had asked before, he still wanted to confirm.","Elder Master Xun naturally wouldn’t let him be held back a grade, but at this moment, he happened to be a bit free, so he curiously asked:","\"You don’t want to be held back a grade that much?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Being held back a grade was somewhat embarrassing, mainly because...","\"If I’m held back a grade, those Junior Brothers would become my ’Senior Brother’.\"","The title of \"Junior Brother\" wasn’t gained easily, Mo Hua still valued it greatly.","Elder Master Xun smiled faintly and said, \"Rest assured...\"","He pondered for a moment, suddenly a thought came, and with a slight smile, he said:","\"A Junior Brother for a day, a Junior Brother for life, it won’t change, and maybe after a while, you might become even more people’s Junior Brother...\"","\"More people’s Junior Brother?\"","Mo Hua was startled, a bit confused, not understanding Elder Master Xun’s meaning.","Where would he find more people to become his Junior Brother?"]},{"number":1763,"title":"Chapter 1763 - 889: Taixu","paragraphs":["Sect affairs of great importance are typically decided by the Ancestors from behind the scenes.","After the decision, the Sect Leader and the powerful Elders will methodically discuss details and carry out specific implementations.","The Ancestors of Tai’a, Chongxu, and Taixu have already reached a secret agreement.","Subsequently, the matter of \"Three Sects Unification\" began to truly advance.","This matter is too significant, and within the three sects, including the Sect Leaders and Elders of each sect, many people are somewhat unwilling.","But this is the wish of the Ancestors, and they cannot disobey.","The Ancestors have high cultivation, stand high, and see far.","Without standing in the position of the Ancestors, one cannot know the Ancestor’s concerns, nor understand the planning of the overall situation.","The Sect Leaders and Elders of each sect understand this.","Therefore, although many people have quite a few grievances about this, the \"Three Sects Unification\" is still secretly advancing little by little.","Once a series of trivial matters were mostly discussed, the Sect Leaders of Tai’a, Chongxu, and Taixu gathered together to finally decide on the specific matters of the \"Unification\".","These matters need not bother the Ancestors and will be bargained by these Sect Leaders.","Once the regulations are finalized, they will be submitted for the Ancestor’s review, and once they nod in approval, the matter will be finalized.","In a sealed great hall of the Taixu Gate.","The Sect Leaders of Tai’a, Chongxu, and Taixu gathered together to discuss affairs.","\"In the unification of the three sects, nominally, the three gates are unified, but the positions of the individual Sect Leaders, as well as the positions of the Elders and Instructors, remain unchanged.\"","\"Disciples remain unchanged.\"","\"The privileges of each sect remain unchanged.\"","\"Each sect’s Ancestors, Sect Leaders, still have independent decision-making authority over their respective sect affairs,\" said the Taixu Sect Master.","This is also a compromise.","Otherwise, erasing the powers of the Tai’a and Chongxu sects would truly be a \"merger.\"","This would also go against the original intention of Taixu Gate’s \"mutual assistance.\"","\"However,\" said the Taixu Sect Master, \"if there are major matters, the three sects must gather to convene a meeting. Only decisions agreed upon by the majority may be implemented.\"","\"And our Taixu Gate has the right of veto.\"","This is the right of Taixu Gate.","Taixu Gate is now powerful, and holds the highest position among the three sects, and asking only for a \"veto right,\" without requiring absolute authority, is already a significant concession.","The Tai’a Sect Leader and Chongxu Sect Leader both nodded in agreement.","These matters are well understood by all.","The Taixu Sect Master continued, \"Next, here are some specific matters of mutual communication...\"","\"Sect Tokens are interchangeable, and disciples of the three gates can visit each other’s sect gates without restriction, using their respective Sect Tokens.\"","\"The Tai’a Token, Chongxu Token, and Taixu Token are all treated equally and can be recognized as the Sect Token after the unification of the three sects.\"","The Sect Token is of utmost importance and also symbolizes the disciples’ belonging to the Sect.","But now, at the initial stage of unification, it’s not suitable to unify them to prevent disciples from Tai’a and Chongxu from feeling exclusion.","Moreover, the construction of the Sect Token is complex and costly, requiring the Thunder Magnetism Large Formation as the foundation, altering the formation’s base, expanding the Formation Pivot, adding sequences and embedding the two main systems of Bounty Scroll and Merit Scroll, which cannot be easily unified in a short period.","Especially the Merit System, which is directly related to the inheritance systems of each sect, cannot be rashly modified and can only be done gradually.","The Taixu Sect Master said, \"The Merit Scrolls of the Three Sects Tokens will be gradually interconnected in the future, sharing merits and rewards.\"","\"Part of the rewards from the Merit Scrolls of each sect will be shared first, and subsequently expanded as situations permit, ultimately merging into one sect.\"","\"But the core heritage of each sect can be retained...\"","\"After the unification of the three sects, the teaching for disciples will also be mutually beneficial.\"","\"The Elders and Instructors of Tai’a, Chongxu, and Taixu Three Gates will each exchange and jointly teach disciples Daoist cultivation methods.\"","\"Hereafter, sword casting will be taught by Tai’a Sect, Sword Qi by Chongxu Sect, and Formation will be taught by our Taixu Gate.\"","\"This can gradually enhance the connection and feelings between the three gates...\"","\"Furthermore...\"","...","The integration and reformation of the Three Sects Unification is very complex.","The three Sect Leaders discussed from morning to evening, covering all the general matters, and the drafted regulations were all recorded into the Jade Slip.","Afterward, they all sighed with relief and each drank a sip of tea.","However, the atmosphere did not become much relaxed, but instead grew more serious.","Because they all knew that what follows is the most important, most core, and also the sharpest issue.","After a moment, the Tai’a Sect Leader first spoke:","\"After the unification of the three sects...what shall it be called?\"","The \"name\" of the Sect is of utmost importance.","If the name is not proper, then the words will not be smooth.","Furthermore, a good name concerns the fortune of the sect, even the rise and fall for hundreds or thousands of years thereafter.","Moreover, now that it’s the unification of the three sects, this name concerns the dignity and honor of each sect.","This is a major event, and all three were hesitant to speak lightly.","The Chongxu Sect Leader pondered for a moment and said slowly, \"Or... should we use that previous Ancient Sect name?\"","The Tai’a Sect Leader shook his head and said, \"Would you really dare to use it?\"","The Taixu Sect Master also sighed, \"That name is no longer allowed to be mentioned.\"","\"Yes, all records have also been destroyed.\"","\"Moreover, its fortune was too grand to bear. Our three gates were forced to split once already; to use that name again, it’s likely the unification won’t last long before we have to split again.\"","\"The Taoist Court will never agree...\"","\"Without mentioning that name, merely by uniting our sects it’s already seen as the weak clustering together out of necessity. But if we use that name, it will clearly show ambition, and is sure to anger the Taoist Court.\"","\"Under such circumstances, being able to bypass the Four Great Sects and withstand pressure from all sides to successfully unite is already quite good. If we additionally arouse the Taoist Court’s suspicion, all the current plans might end prematurely.\""]},{"number":1764,"title":"Chapter 1764 - 889: Taixu (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"We cannot use that name.\"","\"Yes, we absolutely cannot use...\"","The three Sect Leaders looked solemn.","\"Then...\" Chongxu Sect Leader said, \"What name would be good?\"","The atmosphere was a bit heavy.","The Taia Sect Leader, tall and resolute, had a steady gaze.","The Chongxu Sect Leader, with a demeanor like a sword and bones like Dao, had eyes full of brilliance.","The Taixu Sect Master maintained a calm expression, with a demeanor of tranquility and cultivation, like a Buddhist.","Each had their own thoughts in mind, but none spoke up.","After a moment, seeing that everyone had fallen silent, the Taia Sect Leader could not hold back and spoke first:","\"How about this, before the Three Sects Unification, my Tai’a Sect was the most famous, ranked first among the Eight Great Gates. I think it should be called ’Tai’a Sect,’ as the name is the most resounding.\"","The Chongxu Sect Leader disagreed at once:","\"What are you thinking? That was before; your Tai’a Sect isn’t even ranked among the Eight Great Gates now...\"","\"In my opinion, the three Sects should adhere to the teachings of our ancestors, focusing on Sword Cultivation. The Sword Qi of my Rushing Void Sect is comparable to that of the Four Great Sects, though slightly inferior, but not by much. Therefore, after the Three Sects Unification, it would be most fitting to use the name of Rushing Void Sect.\"","\"No, no,\" said the Taia Sect Leader, \"My Tai’a Sect has the most disciples; more people mean more power, so it should be called ’Tai’a Sect’...\"","\"Didn’t a batch of disciples leave the Sect?\" the Chongxu Sect Leader questioned.","\"Even with disciples leaving, we still have the largest number,\" replied the Taia Sect Leader, then dismissively added, \"And those who left were just fair-weather followers, willing to share the good times but not the hardships. It’s better they’ve left, for it brings unity within my Tai’a Sect...\"","\"But those who stayed aren’t top qualifiers, right?\" challenged the Chongxu Sect Leader, not giving an inch.","The Taia Sect Leader was displeased:","\"What do you mean not top? Isn’t a Spiritual Root of Top-Grade enough? Does it have to be Superior-Grade?\"","\"Moreover, how good must qualifications be to be considered good? No matter how good the qualifications, without a sense of belonging to the Sect, without working as one, and running at the first sign of trouble, they’re just bad apples! What use is it to teach such ingrates?\"","\"That’s true, but at the Sword Discussion Conference, what matters are qualifications, cultivation, and ability!\" the Chongxu Sect Leader raised an eyebrow, \"It’s different for my Rushing Void Sect.\"","\"In my Rushing Void Sect, there’s a Sword Dao Genius, a rarity in five hundred years, most commendable because he maintains his devotion to my Rushing Void Sect, unwavering even now.\"","\"At the next Sword Discussion Conference, this disciple will surely shine, becoming the foremost in Sword Dao among our Three Sects, able to compete with the Four Great Sects!\"","\"And a Sect is proud of its disciples; my Rushing Void Sect’s disciples have the highest talent. In my view, the name should be ’Chongxu.’\"","\"No! It should still be Tai’a.\"","\"Chongxu.\"","\"Tai’a!\"","\"As long as we name it Chongxu, I can open up the Sword Qi method of my Rushing Void Sect, teaching it to all disciples of the Three Sects.\"","\"Then my Tai’a Sect can broadly pass on the Sword Casting methods as well...\"","...","The two continued to dispute, back and forth.","Yet after a long time arguing, they found that the Taixu Sect Master beside them remained silent, causing confusion in their hearts.","\"Doesn’t your Taixu Gate have any opinion?\"","With a serene face, the Taixu Sect Master waved a hand, \"It’s just a name, Taixu Gate doesn’t care; as long as you come to a plan that satisfies both sides, it’s fine.\"","This made both the Taia Sect Leader and the Chongxu Sect Leader unable to contain their astonishment.","Could it be the Taixu Gate was so magnanimous?","They thought the Taixu Sect Master was joking, but observing his calm demeanor, seemingly detached from worldly affairs, they nodded, their hearts at ease.","Taia Sect Leader decided, \"Then it’s settled, we’ll call it ’Tai’a Sect.’","\"How presumptuous, what’s with ’settled’?\" the Chongxu Sect Leader was displeased.","\"The Taixu Gate agreed.\"","\"What nonsense? When did Taixu Gate agree? They just aren’t fighting over it, nor did they say they’d concede to you. Besides, my Rushing Void Sect hasn’t agreed yet.\"","\"You’re being unreasonable!\"","\"You’re the one who’s unreasonable!\"","The two argued for a while longer, nearly to the point of anger.","Seeing this, the Taixu Sect Master sighed, becoming the mediator, sincerely saying:","\"The original intention of the Three Sects Unification was for the Three Gates to work as one, achieving great success. If we argue endlessly over a name, aren’t we thwarting our own purposes...\"","Upon hearing this, the Taia Sect Leader and Chongxu Sect Leader felt some shame.","It wasn’t that they insisted on arguing, but the Sect’s interests were at stake.","As Sect Leaders, even if it became a bit embarrassing, they had to argue.","But continuing like this indeed seemed unseemly...","The Taixu Sect Master pondered for a moment and sighed:","\"How about this, since you two cannot agree and can’t make up your minds, why not each take a step back. For the name of the Sect after the Three Sects Unification, take one character from each of your Sect names to form a new name. This way, it would be fair to everyone.\"","\"Take one character each?\"","\"Precisely.\"","The Taia Sect Leader and Chongxu Sect Leader looked at each other, then after some thought, they both nodded.","They didn’t think it through thoroughly, but felt that this was indeed the fairest and acceptable to both parties.","\"Good!\" said the Taia Sect Leader, \"Then let the Taixu Gate choose the two characters.\"","This would also be fair to the Taixu Gate.","The Chongxu Sect Leader also nodded, \"This is best.\"","But as soon as he finished speaking, a subtle sense of discomfort arose, as though something was amiss...","But it was too late.","The Taixu Sect Master’s eyes shone, and he said:","\"In that case, it would be an honor to comply. Here’s what I’ve considered: after the Three Sects Unification, we take the ’Tai’ character from the Tai’a Sect and the ’Xu’ character from the Rushing Void Sect, putting them together as the Sect name.\""]},{"number":1765,"title":"Chapter 1765 - 889: Taixu (Part 3)","paragraphs":["\"Take a ’Tai’ character from Tai’a Sect and take a ’Xu’ character from Rushing Void Sect to make up...\"","Taia Sect Leader turned back to the future, immediately widened his eyes, and slammed the table, saying:","\"Isn’t this Taixu?! Well, I wondered why you kept silent, you’ve been waiting for this moment, haven’t you?\"","He was deceived by this seemingly calm demeanor.","He thought, regarding the sect’s name, how could anyone truly be indifferent?","After all this time, this seemingly Zen-like guy was the most insidious!","Taixu Sect Master smiled slightly and said:","\"You agreed to take characters from your two sects’ names, it’s you who agreed; it’s you who agreed that I choose.\"","\"Since you’ve all agreed, how about this: after the Three Sects Unification, it will be called ’Taixu Gate’.\"","\"All of us are Sect Leaders, leading a sect, our words carry the weight of Mount Tai, surely we can’t go back on our words...\"","Taia Sect Leader’s face turned red.","Chongxu Sect Leader was also speechless.","But the words were already spoken, the initiative was given by them, to backtrack now would be akin to slapping their own faces.","Chongxu Sect Leader sighed: \"Then let it be.\"","Taia Sect Leader also said unwillingly: \"Then use ’Taixu’ for the name...\"","Taixu Sect Master smiled calmly.","Of course, all three of them knew in their hearts.","Though they debated for a while, the name of the new sect would ultimately be decided by Taixu Gate.","The power is greater than people, and the power dynamics between sects ultimately depend on strength.","Currently, Taixu Gate ranks third among the Eight Great Gates, its reputation the most prominent.","In terms of heritage, the Three Sects share the same lineage, complementing each other, making it hard to truly distinguish superiority.","But in sword-casting or Sword Qi, no matter how strong, they aren’t unique.","The most unique is indeed Taixu Gate’s Divine Thought Sword Skill.","Even if the Divine Thought Sword Skill can’t be transmitted, improving upon it to iterate the Sword Intent Technique would be a profound Sword Dao heritage.","Sword Intent, while weak during Foundation Building, appearing insignificant, once cultivated to Golden Core, when Divine Sense reaches a certain depth, Sword Intent reveals its sharpness.","Feather Transformation is even stronger, and thereafter, the higher the cultivation, the more terrifying the Sword Intent.","Such profound material only exists in sects with deep foundations.","Calculating this way, in terms of heritage, Taixu Gate’s foundation is actually the deepest.","And if it’s about disciples, it’s even more apparent.","Taia Sect has the most disciples, but after this ordeal, few excel.","Rushing Void Sect indeed has a Sword Dao Genius, but after all, that’s for the future, hasn’t participated in Debating Sword, actual combat power unknown.","But even if really strong, at most, they can just rival top geniuses of the Four Great Sects.","But Taixu Gate is different.","Taixu Gate has a \"monster.\"","Foundation Building Middle Stage, first in Array Competition, Array Leader, this is almost crushing, cliff-like genius, virtually \"pre-appointed\" as next Array Leader.","This is reality, an unprecedented genius.","Thus counting all factors, Taixu Gate is the strongest.","Sect’s name carries great significance, they are the Sect Leaders of their sects, no matter what, must strive for it, exert the utmost effort.","But if can’t achieve, there’s nothing to be done.","In this matter, Taixu Sect Master seemed to toy with small schemes, but in reality, gave everyone a way to step down.","Manipulated by Taixu Gate, only then lost the sect’s name.","Better than admitting that they truly aren’t as good as Taixu Gate, hence compelled to compromise, using \"Taixu Gate\" as the name is preferred.","Moreover, Taixu Sect Master’s reasoning is actually correct.","Taixu does indeed contain Taia Sect’s \"Tai\" and Rushing Void Sect’s \"Xu,\" truly suitable as the name for the newly merged sect.","Thus, this matter was settled.","Taixu Sect Master changed from his leisurely manner, gave a formal salute to the other two Sect Leaders, solemnly said:","\"Rest assured, the Three Sects Unification won’t be biased. The names of each sect won’t be discarded.\"","\"From now on, the Three Gates merge into one, collectively known as ’Taixu Gate,’ each sect’s disciples will be referred to by their Mountain Gate.\"","\"Taia Mountain, Mount Chongxu, Taixu Mountain, three mountain disciples, merge into one lineage.\"","\"Three mountains one lineage, same alliance, sharing a boat, united heart!\"","Taia Sect Leader and Chongxu Sect Leader also gave salutes and said:","\"Three mountains one lineage, united heart!\"","The voices of the three Sect Leaders echoed within Taixu Mountain.","From this point, the greatest sect at the Qian Learning State Boundary, after establishing their own sect, enduring a thousand years of trials and tribulations, have come together again.","...","The decision of Three Sects Unification immediately caused an uproar within the Qian Learning State Boundary.","Especially among the Four Great Sects, from top to bottom, there was a great disturbance.","\"Such... shamelessness!\"","\"Too thick-skinned!\"","\"How could they do this? Don’t they want their sect foundation anymore? To agree just like this?\"","\"What a joke! Established their own sect for so many years, why play ’Long-unity will divide, long-division will unite’?\"","Some were puzzled: \"Why was there no rumor earlier?\"","\"Cause and Effect was concealed...\"","\"It’s the handiwork of Taixu Gate Ancestor...\"","\"No, it’s not that simple... it’s because of Taixu Gate’s monster.\"","\"We’ve been distracted by Taixu Gate’s Array Demon, consuming too much time and Heavenly Mechanism Calculation Power, everyone calculating that shocking monster, resulting in a lack of awareness of Taixu Gate’s schemes.\"","\"Using the sudden emergence of the Array ’monster’ to confuse, conceal Cause and Effect, thus secretly advancing the Three Sects Unification...\"","\"With thunderous means, a blitz, by the time we realized, it was too late...\""]},{"number":1766,"title":"Chapter 1766 - 889: Taixu (Part 4)","paragraphs":["\"Is this also part of their calculations?\"","\"The mind of the Heaven Void Ancestor... truly unfathomable...\"","\"Silent, Heaven Void Ancestor, how could you and I arbitrarily criticize?\"","...","The Four Great Sects were either shocked, emotional, angry, or worried, a whirlwind of emotions stirred above and below.","Qian Taoist Sect, high above the pavilion.","The Old Ancestor of Shen Family, dressed in splendid robes, looked at the jade slip before him, his brows furrowed tightly.","Elder Shen knelt below, daring not to raise his head:","\"On Heavenly Mechanism Causality, strike east to launch west, secretly move into the warehouse...\"","\"Moreover, the Tai Xu Gate moved too quickly, all operations were settled, and there was no mandatory requirement in Qianxue Sect’s reform to prohibit sect mergers, thus allowing a loophole.\"","Primarily, none of them anticipated that the divided sects could truly forsake their own gates and merge once more.","This was difficult to comprehend in the eyes of the cultivators of Qian Taoist Sect.","\"The Taoist Court has also completed the procedures, seemingly a certain Pavilion Elder personally issued the statement, handling it as a special case...\"","\"It’s too late for us to use connections to obstruct now.\"","\"This matter, is my negligence as a junior...\"","Elder Shen buried his head in the ground.","The Old Ancestor of Shen Family glanced at the jade slip, after a moment, his furrowed brows slightly relaxed, casually tossing the jade slip aside.","\"Forget it, three grasshoppers tied to one string, saves us the trouble.\"","\"Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect are now severely weakened. Tai Xu Gate is slightly better, yet only by relying on fortune did they produce a formations genius and craftily enter the top three of the Eight Great Gates.\"","\"Even if the three strands are twisted together, they cannot compare to any one of the Four Great Sects.\"","\"Besides, Array Discussion Conference, Debating Sword is the main focus, they cannot overturn the sky in Debating Sword, thus can only survive in such a lingering manner.\"","\"This matter is not your fault, rise...\"","Elder Shen exhaled a long breath, shouted \"Old Ancestor sees clearly,\" and then slowly stood up.","But before he could straighten himself entirely, the Old Ancestor of Shen Family focused his eyes again and asked him:","\"This matter is not your fault, but are you... hiding something from me?\"","Elder Shen trembled, his voice hoarse: \"Old Ancestor, I do not understand what you say...\"","\"Are you perhaps...\" The Old Ancestor of Shen Family said indifferently, \"Hiding from me, ruining a record?\"","These words were like a bolt from the blue.","Elder Shen shook like a leaf and immediately prostrated to admit his guilt, \"Old Ancestor, I, I was careless, I...\"","The Old Ancestor of Shen Family glanced at him contemptuously, slightly shook his head, and said:","\"Enough.\"","Elder Shen remained afraid at heart, not daring to speak.","\"This is not some major issue,\" the Old Ancestor of Shen Family said, \"after all, it’s merely a genius disciple.\"","\"The cultivation world is vast, genius marvels occur frequently.\"","\"But ’genius’ is something extremely fragile, hard to develop.\"","\"Tao cultivation is long and arduous, anything can happen...\"","\"So-called geniuses, some fall into despair due to setbacks; some amaze in youth but fade into ordinary with age; some falter in the long path and lose heart; some are seduced by worldly desires and willingly fall; some are envied and persecuted; some are arrogant and court disaster...\"","\"Few young geniuses grow up to succeed in Tao cultivation and suppress one side.\"","\"Most giants in one region, their talents were not apparent in youth, only through trials and perseverance did they mature late and become powerful cultivators.\"","\"That ’Mo Hua’ evil monster, after all, is merely in Foundation Establishment, do not be startled by a fleeting reputation and disrupt your own formations.\"","\"Yes, Old Ancestor’s insight.\" Elder Shen bowed his hand.","The Old Ancestor of Shen Family pondered slightly, his eyes showing thought, then said:","\"Furthermore, I do not believe that his divine sense was truly cultivated by himself. Surely it must have been borrowed or snatched from somewhere else, not truly his own.\"","Then he snorted coldly, \"Foundation Building Middle Stage, can truly take the Peak of Nineteen-Pattern and win Array Leader? The exaggeration is too much. Do you really think the cultivators of the world have not seen the world?\"","Elder Shen, hearing the Old Ancestor speak so, felt settled in his heart.","He also found the matter somewhat absurd.","However, previously at the Array Competition, he saw with his own eyes, shook to the core, thus he did not think carefully at that moment.","He continued: \"Old Ancestor, I’m afraid this child possesses the ancient Sect-Entering Order to visit the mountain gate, perhaps carrying some fate and causality...\"","The Old Ancestor of Shen Family shook his head, \"You don’t know the origin of ancient causality; as of now, where is there still any opportunity?\"","\"Great Dao is fifty, Heavenly evolution forty-nine, it has already reached the number forty-nine; those destined to die have died, those destined to end have ended, what opportunity is there to discuss, is it not a joke?\"","These words Elder Shen did not quite understand, but he also respectfully bowed:","\"Yes, Old Ancestor is wise.\"","The Old Ancestor of Shen Family glanced at Elder Shen silently, coldly said:","\"Your greatest fault in this matter is not failing to accept this disciple, but when trouble arose, you did not report upwards and instead thought to conceal it.\"","\"According to usual rules, your position as Elder should be erased, but I give you an opportunity...\"","\"Find a way yourself, by any means necessary, to seize the Array Leader title at the next Array Discussion Conference.\"","\"I only look at results; as long as the Array Leader belongs to my Qian Taoist Sect, I will overlook the past, and you may still be heavily used. Otherwise, you will be demoted to an ordinary elder, spend decades or even a hundred years, and climb back up step by step.\"","Cold sweat trickled down Elder Shen’s forehead, but the Old Ancestor’s orders left him no room to refuse, only capable of bowing repeatedly saying:","\"Thank you Old Ancestor for forgiveness, I will do my utmost, sparing no efforts!\"","The Old Ancestor of Shen Family waved his hand.","Elder Shen dared not speak further, respectfully withdrew.","After Elder Shen left, the Old Ancestor of Shen Family sat alone within the white jade pavilion, silently contemplating.","Half an hour later, he shook his head and sneered:","\"Are all people dead, thinking to entrust their orphan?\"","\"What do they take my Qian Taoist Sect for?\"","\"Things are different now, do they still regard my Qian Taoist Sect as a subordinate sect, needing to bow and scrape, bearing their causality?\"","The Old Ancestor of Shen Family snorted coldly.","...","The matter of the Three Sects Unification has already settled into dust.","At this time, the news was already spread out.","Not only outside, even disciples of Tai’a, Rushing Void, and Tai Xu Gate, upon learning this news, were also in an uproar.","They never expected that originally each sect was doing its own thing, merely possessing some ancestral ties, but in the blink of an eye, they were to merge.","Mo Hua was also very surprised.","He had thought that the three gates might reunite, but never anticipated such a day would truly come.","Moreover, this day arrived so swiftly, somewhat suddenly.","He recalled the words Elder Master Xun had spoken to him a few days prior:","\"Once a Junior Brother, always a Junior Brother, it cannot change. And perhaps after some time you might become more people’s Junior Brother...\"","Mo Hua was somewhat stunned.","Elder Master Xun’s words turned out to be true...","Moreover, Three Sects Unification...","Mo Hua rubbed his chin.","This \"Junior Brother\" inadvertently seemed to have \"grown bigger and stronger\"..."]},{"number":1767,"title":"Chapter 1767 - 890: Paying Respects to the Junior Brother","paragraphs":["The unification of the Three Sects has become a foregone conclusion, but due to the massive scale, specific measures still need to be implemented step by step.","The fusion between Sects must also proceed gradually.","Initially, it was just Elders teaching each other.","Afterwards, Disciples visited one another to enhance cultural exchange.","Disciples from Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect visited Taixu Gate for sightseeing and Dao discussion.","Moreover, Disciples from Taixu Gate could visit Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect without any hindrance.","Mo Hua naturally went along as well.","Though Elder Master Xun advised him to avoid leaving Taixu Gate to prevent standing out too much.","Now with the unification of the Three Sects, Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect should strictly count as ’Taixu Gate’, so technically speaking, visiting these two Sects doesn’t count as leaving Taixu Gate.","Moreover, Mo Hua had never entered Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect before, only occasionally passing by for a glance.","He was eager to see the scenery within these two Sects.","Thus, Mo Hua accompanied the Disciples from Taixu Gate and toured the two mountains of Tai’a Chongxu.","Only after this tour did he realize that regardless of whether it was Tai’a Sect or Rushing Void Sect, they both seemed somewhat larger than Taixu Gate.","Especially Tai’a Sect, towering and majestic, the mountains resembled an Azure Dragon, with extraordinary grandeur.","Rushing Void Sect wasn’t as grand, but tall towers stood abound, cloud eaves peaked like ridges, green porcelain and glazed tiles paved the roofs, Sword Qi entered the mist and clouds, presenting a magnificent spectacle.","Along with the antique charm of Taixu Gate.","The Three Sects inherited the same lineage but each had their own distinctive characteristics.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but feel deeply moved.","He even couldn’t help but ponder, divided into Three Sects, they were still capable of having such a foundation and all could rank among the Eight Great Gates.","The Ancient Sect before the division into Three Sects, what kind of grandeur must it have possessed?","It was likely a colossal force that was enough to make the Taoist Court apprehensive...","Mo Hua thought with yearnings in his heart.","Thus, he toured the Mountain Gate while pondering in his heart.","During that time, Mo Hua also encountered Ling Huxiao and Ouyang Mu.","The two were not averse to the unification of the Three Sects.","Due to Mo Hua’s connections, Ling Huxiao and company were already quite familiar with the Disciples from Taixu Gate, more so than their own Sect’s Disciples.","Additionally, Mo Hua, regarded as Taixu Gate’s ’Junior Brother’, had saved their lives in the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons. The three shared a life-and-death friendship.","Once the Sects were unified, they would be able to follow Mo Hua more openly in the future.","Mo Hua was naturally delighted.","The few of them exchanged greetings and chatted for a long time together.","After chatting, Mo Hua strolled around again. Just when he was about to leave Tai’a Sect and return to Taixu Mountain, he ran into Ouyang Feng.","The two naturally chatted for a while again.","After a brief conversation, and having learned some information from Ouyang Feng, Mo Hua asked in surprise:","\"Senior Brother Feng, are you going to leave the mountain for a journey?\"","Ouyang Feng nodded, somewhat ashamed, \"In the Sword Discussion Conference, I failed to maintain the ranking of the Eight Great Gates for Tai’a Sect, and I feel ashamed for letting down my teacher’s expectations.\"","Mo Hua shook his head and said, \"How can you be blamed, Senior Brother Feng?\"","A single fence needs three posts, a single hero requires three helpers.","Debating Sword is different from Array Competition, it’s not something that one person can single-handedly overturn.","In the Rouge Boat incident, Tai’a Sect nearly lost most of its elite Disciples and had to face the siege from the Four Great Sects, in such a desperate situation, Senior Brother Feng, even if he bet his life on it, would be of no avail.","In any case, it was an unavoidable situation.","Moreover, Senior Brother Feng himself didn’t follow the path of extreme aggression.","His cultivation is profound, steady, and reliable, with comprehensive abilities.","He can attack and defend, advance and retreat, he can assist in containment, or be responsible for cover, advance to act as vanguard, or retreat to guard the rear.","Although he isn’t outstanding in any aspect, not the most top-notch, he is a ’versatile’ teammate who can handle various situations and fill any gap.","Precisely because of this, he relies more on suitable teammates.","He needs a suitable tea lineup and a specially tailored tactic to fully utilize Senior Brother Feng’s specialty.","Unfortunately, Tai’a Sect lost its elite Disciples, lacking those conditions.","The result is apparent, in the Sword Discussion Conference, Senior Brother Feng had to both lead the attack and lead the defense by himself, and it was naturally difficult to do everything well.","Mo Hua felt regretful in his heart.","If Senior Brother Feng followed me in, no, if he teamed up with me in the Sword Discussion Conference.","If I used my Formations, I could have enhanced all his abilities a notch, and then had some teammates to help, he would have become a ’hexagonal’ warrior, absolutely able to compete with the top talents of the Four Great Sects.","But alas...","The unification of the Three Sects happened too late.","Moreover, Senior Brother Feng is a year ahead of me, and cannot be grouped in the same team.","Mo Hua felt great regret in his heart.","\"Senior Brother Feng, are you leaving the mountain now?\"","Ouyang Feng shook his head, \"In a while, there’s still some matters to handle, but...\"","He glanced at Mo Hua again and sincerely praised:","\"I never thought that you could surpass the Four Great Sects to win the title of Array Leader. I often thought I knew you, Junior Brother Mo, as outstanding, but never imagined you to be even more incredible than I expected...\"","Mo Hua felt a bit embarrassed by the praise, waving his hands repeatedly, modestly saying:","\"Just lucky, just by chance, it’s nothing special.\"","Ouyang Feng chuckled.","He pondered for a moment, then exhaled deeply, sighing: \"Yes, there’s always someone better, limited by Qianxue, one’s vision and knowledge are never broadened enough.\"","\"It’s also time for me to practice and witness this vast world.\""]},{"number":1768,"title":"Chapter 1768 - 890: Greeting Junior Brother (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1768 -890: Greeting Junior Brother (2)","“Mm-hmm!” Mo Hua nodded.","Back when he travelled with his master, he learned many things.","Cultivate for a hundred years, read ten thousand books, travel ten thousand miles.","Sometimes, if you don’t go outside, don’t open your eyes, don’t look at this vast world, your perspective will inevitably be narrow, and you won’t recognize the true Dao.","He also wanted to take more walks and see more things when he had the time.","But...","Mo Hua asked, “Senior Brother Feng, won’t you wait until forming a Golden Core before traveling?”","“Traveling after forming a Golden Core would be a bit late,” Ouyang Feng said, “Whether it’s a family or sect, once a Golden Core is formed, it counts as a ‘main pillar,’ and you’ll be assigned duties or guard a place, with less free time.”","“Moreover, whether it’s Foundation Establishment Late Stage or Golden Core traveling, it’s actually similar, you can only mix in Second Grade state boundaries.”","“Just after advancing to Golden Core, going to a Third-Grade state boundary especially one where the Taoist Court’s control is lax, laws are relaxed, and evil cultivators are rampant, it is actually more dangerous.”","“Furthermore, forming a Golden Core is not that easy, most cultivators fail many times before succeeding.”","“And, to form a Golden Core with good quality, one must not rush, comprehensive preparation, and a solid foundation is necessary...”","“Just like during Qi Refinement, laying the Taoist Foundation?” Mo Hua asked.","Ouyang Feng shook his head and said, “It’s harder than Qi Refinement, after all, this is Core Formation. Even in Great Families and Great Sects, Core Formation is a watershed, a major threshold in Tao cultivation.”","“Advance, and the sea is boundless; retreat, and you may be trapped your whole life...”","“Oh...” Mo Hua nodded solemnly.","Ouyang Feng looked at Mo Hua with some concern, then said, “Junior Brother Mo, I have a few words, they may sound a bit abrupt...”","Mo Hua nodded, “Please, speak, Senior Brother.”","Ouyang Feng earnestly said, “Junior Brother Mo, regarding cultivation, you need to pay more attention to your spiritual power foundation.”","“Your various techniques are endless; even I watch in amazement, but your spiritual power is too weak, ultimately it’s a disadvantage.”","“The more you progress, the more this becomes evident.”","“Not to mention participating in the Sword Discussion Conference, which requires enduring numerous fierce battles, greatly consuming spiritual power. If the spiritual power is weak, innately deficient, you will deplete after just one or two rounds.”","“In cultivator magic battles, sometimes, dragging to the end, it often depends not on the superiority of Taoist skills, but purely on whose spiritual power foundation is deeper. If it’s deep, you can sustain until the end and win; otherwise, even if the Taoist skill is strong, you can’t outlast others and can only be defeated.”","This point Ouyang Feng deeply understood.","This time at the Sword Discussion Conference, the Tai’a Sect was at a disadvantage in terms of manpower, and many times he was forced to exhaust his spiritual power, leading to defeat.","“Also, have you considered your own Magical Treasure yet?” Ouyang Feng further asked.","Mo Hua shook his head and frankly said, “I haven’t had much thought on that yet.”","Choosing an own Magical Treasure, this issue was indeed tricky.","He had no inheritance, no top-grade Spiritual Artifact, and did not have the opportunity to nurture it from a young age.","Even his cultivation technique was unique, carving out a separate path in the system of Taoist skills, some spell points were even learned by trial and error, without any precedent to refer to.","As a result, Taixu Gate’s existing own Magical Treasure inheritances mostly do not fit his cultivation and abilities.","Mo Hua had considered this issue in his spare time, but after thinking it over, he found no good solutions.","In addition, he had many other things to learn, like swordsmanship, formations, movement techniques, leaving little spare time, so the matter of his own Magical Treasure had to be postponed for now.","Ouyang Feng earnestly said, “Golden Core Cultivators rely heavily on their own Magical Treasures; crafting one that aligns life and spirit, melding with spiritual meat, with superior quality, is as crucial as forming a superior-grade Golden Core.”","“It’s best to plan early...”","Ouyang Feng laughed, “I might be talking too much, please don’t take offense, Junior Brother.”","Mo Hua shook his head, “Not at all, thank you, Senior Brother Feng.”","These words indeed reminded him of something.","Some things need to be scheduled earlier, at least start preparing in advance.","Forewarned is forearmed, unprepared means failure.","Don’t wait until you’re about to form a Golden Core to think about your own Magical Treasure.","The two chatted for a while longer, then Ouyang Feng bid farewell, before leaving, he requested Mo Hua:","“Little Wood is my only brother, he is reserved, not very adaptable, in the future, I must ask Junior Brother Mo to take care of him a lot.”","Mo Hua confidently said, “Little Wood can stick with me, don’t worry, Senior Brother Feng!”","Ouyang Feng couldn’t help but smile, then solemnly clasped his hands towards Mo Hua:","“Off to travel, the road is long and uncertain, Junior Brother Mo, farewell in the Jianghu.”","Mo Hua felt reluctant, also clasped his hands and said, “Senior Brother Feng, farewell in the Jianghu!”","The two parted.","In the following years, Mo Hua had not seen Senior Brother Ouyang Feng in Taixu Gate.","Senior Brother Feng should be traveling alone, wandering through various places.","Mo Hua felt melancholy in his heart and could only silently wish him a safe journey...","...","After some time, through numerous disciple exchanges, elder teachings, three-way communication, merit sharing... and a series of methodical measures, the Three Sects Unification plan was gradually being implemented.","And the procedures at the Taoist Court finally reached the last stage.","As long as the Heavenly Right Pavilion of the Taoist Court central approves it, this matter will be conclusive.","By then, there will no longer be separate Tai’a, Chongxu, Taixu Three Sects, only the unified, “Three Mountains” Great Sect—Taixu Gate.","Inside the Heavenly Right Pavilion."]},{"number":1769,"title":"Chapter 1769 - 890: Greeting Junior Brother (3)","paragraphs":["Chapter 1769 -890: Greeting Junior Brother (3)","A few supervisors are chatting in the pavilion.","In front of them, there are numerous scrolls and heaps of Jade Slips.","These almost encompass the dossiers of all the Tao cultivation influences within the Nine State that have reached a certain magnitude, have a certain scale, been formally recognized by the Taoist Court, and undergone assessment.","All matters regarding the assessment of these influences, demotion, promotion, naming, renaming, and delisting are decided by discussion among the cultivators of the Heavenly Right Pavilion.","Therefore, the cultivators of the Heavenly Right Pavilion hold great power, but their affairs are equally busy.","At this time, several supervisors of the Heavenly Right Pavilion are discussing the matter of the “Three Sects Unification” of Taixu Gate.","And in the middle of the pavilion, sits an “elder.”","This elder has a wooden face, a rigid expression, and skin like rotten wood, resembling a living puppet mechanically stamping various scrolls.","The seated supervisors chat among themselves, ignoring the “elder.”","...","“Qian Learning State Boundary, Tai’a, Chongxu, Taixu Three Gates merge, using ‘Taixu Gate’ as the name, combined into one sect...”","“This matter has dragged on for quite some time, the Pavilion Elder has spoken, it needs to be finished today.”","“But it’s just some follow-up work, the higher-ups have already nodded, we don’t need to take charge.”","“We are just supervisors, even if we want to make decisions, we aren’t qualified...”","“At least, we need to become Supervisor.”","“What are you thinking? Supervisor is not something you can do at will. Honestly, typical cultivators reaching the level of supervisor is the end of the road, don’t even think about Supervisor, even if you manage to reach there, without the ability, you won’t sit firmly.”","“Our Heavenly Right Pavilion’s Supervisor is relatively decent, unlike the Heaven Shu Pavilion, they handle formations and even involve heavenly secrets, without some capability, even if given the Supervisor position, you wouldn’t dare sit, or else you’d have bad luck.”","“Heavenly Right Pavilion isn’t simple either...”","“Alright, let’s not talk about this, focus on work.”","The pavilion falls silent for a while.","But as the work is tedious, after some time, someone speaks up:","“Taixu Gate... How come, in these times, there are sects willing to reunite after separation? For what purpose?”","“Couldn’t survive otherwise...”","“I heard there have been reforms in the Qian Learning State Boundary lately, frequent changes, fierce sect competition, probably about to drop out of the Eight Great Gates, thus forced to merge for survival.”","“No wonder...”","“What’s the point of reforms when everything was fine, causing so much unnecessary trouble.”","“People die for money, birds perish for food, sects are the same, outsiders like us can’t figure out the games inside.”","“That’s true as well...”","“However, since it’s the Three Sects Unification, why specifically use ‘Taixu Gate’ as the name?”","“It’s simple, Taixu Gate currently holds the greatest influence, is ranked higher, and haven’t you heard, Taixu Gate produced an Array Demon...”","“Demon?”","“You’ve never heard?”","One supervisor shakes his head, “Been working overtime, busy with the battles in the Southern Wilderness, haven’t heard.”","And someone asked, “What demon?”","“Ignorant, right,” the previous supervisor said, “Qian Learning State Boundary, Array Discussion Conference, a Taixu Sect disciple suddenly appeared, mid Foundation Establishment, yet drew the peak of the Nineteen-Pattern array, won the Array Leader.”","“This event even reached my Taoist State...”","“Mid Foundation Establishment, Nineteen-Pattern Array? Fake, right?”","“Impossible...”","“Divine Sense can’t be cultivated, even if born with it, it can’t exceed this much; there must be a trick. I don’t believe it...”","“Even in my Taoist State, the central hub of the Nine State, with remarkable talent, I haven’t seen such a genius...”","“Exaggerating too much.”","“Is the Qian Learning State Boundary so inexperienced? Don’t they know what surpassing Three Rank in Divine Sense means? Believing such absurdity?”","“Is the Qian Learning Sect trying to create momentum for a genius, boasting too much?”","“Indeed, I also don’t believe.”","Several supervisors shake their heads.","Someone says, “But the chief examiner of the Array Discussion Conference is from the Heaven Shu Pavilion of Taoist State, questioning Qianxue Sect is something, but surely you can’t doubt Heaven Shu Pavilion?”","“That’s true...”","“Misjudged?”","“What are you thinking? Fourth-grade Array Master, can they misjudge? They are more proficient in formations than the number of dossiers we’ve reviewed...”","“So could it be... there really is such a genius?”","“Hard to say...”","“Speaking of which,” a supervisor asked, “this Array Demon... what’s the name?”","A steward pondered and said: “Seems like, with the surname Mo, called... Mo Hua?”","As soon as the words fell, the steward shivered violently, turning pale.","Everyone still wanted to ask him other things, but seeing his appearance, they were a bit stunned, “What’s wrong?”","“Why is your face so pale?”","The steward, still shaken, pointed upwards, “I feel, just now that puppet, seem... like it looked at me?”","Everyone followed his gaze and saw the “elder” in the center, with a wooden expression, still using awkward movements, stamping one document after another.","“What are you saying? This is a puppet, not a person...”","Another steward said: “Be careful with your words, what puppet? Following our Heavenly Right Pavilion’s rules, we respectfully call him ‘Lord Gui’...”","“There are no outsiders here, why bother being so particular?”","“Alright, even if we call him Lord Gui, isn’t he still just a puppet?”","“No, I really felt just now that this Lord... Lord Gui, seemed to glance at me...”","“Don’t talk nonsense, out of thin air, why would Lord Gui look at you?”","“I, well...”","“Alright, alright,” an elderly steward spoke, “let’s stop the idle chatter, quickly get to the real business, handle the matter of the Qian Learning State Boundary, Three Sects Unification.”","“Over there in Southern Wilderness, the war is getting intense, Sect movements happen frequently. In a few days, there might be even more issues, where is there any leisure?”","“Yes...”","“Chief Xia is right.”","“Finish these trivial matters as early as possible...”","Thus, everyone quieted down, starting to expedite the processing of documents, and only finished by dusk.","The elderly Chief Xia respectfully handed over the Three Tai Xu Sects Unification documents to the central puppet elder.","The elder treated all equally and stamped them with a seal.","However, no one noticed, his mouth slightly moved, emitting a faint “creaking” sound, like... the sound of cracking pine nuts.","...","After the Heavenly Right Pavilion sealed the discussion.","The Three Sects Unification was finally implemented.","Taixu Gate was now teeming with people.","Disciples of Tai’a Sect and Rushing Void Sect, now should be called Tai’a Mountain and Mount Chongxu, gathered at the Great Dojo on Taixu Mountain to attend the first sect opening assembly after the Three Sects Unification.","Because after the unification of the Three Sects, Taixu Gate is the leader, so such assemblies are all held at Taixu Mountain.","This assembly was very grand.","Disciples in golden Taoist Robes from Tai’a Mountain, disciples in azure blue Taoist Robes from Mount Chongxu, as well as disciples in black and white Taoist Robes from Taixu Mountain, gathered together tightly, a spectacle of a Great Sect atmosphere.","Afterwards, the leaders of the Three Sects each routinely spoke, urging disciples to unite and diligently cultivate.","As the sect-opening ceremony ended, encompassing the Three Mountains, embracing tens of thousands of disciples, the newly established and grand Taixu Gate also officially formed.","The next day was the Formation large lesson.","Elder Master Xun gathered all disciples from the middle phase of Foundation Establishment from the Three Mountains at the Taoist Field on Taixu Mountain.","“From now on, your Formation studies will be taught by me.”","Elder Master Xun said with an ancient voice, “However, I am very busy with affairs, therefore on usual days, Formation studies of Tai’a, Chongxu, and Taixu Three Mountains disciples will be taught by Mo Hua.”","“Mo Hua, you come.” Elder Master Xun gestured.","Mo Hua nodded and walked to the center of the Taoist Field.","Elder Master Xun spoke to the disciples below:","“This is Mo Hua, henceforth, he is your Formation ‘Junior Brother’, teaching Formations on my behalf.”","“Come, pay your respects to your Junior Brother...”","All disciples from Tai’a Mountain and Mount Chongxu paused.","Most of them were unfamiliar with Mo Hua, but they were not unaware of Mo Hua’s fame.","Many disciples had even witnessed Mo Hua’s stunning, overwhelming performance at the Array Discussion Conference, suppressing all sides and winning first in Formations.","Although Mo Hua looks young, not seeming like a “Brother,” no one dared to question.","Especially as it was Elder Master Xun’s command.","Thus, in the vast Taoist Field, from the three Sects, thousands of disciples, simultaneously, in unison, bowed and said:","“Greetings, Junior Brother!”","“Greetings, Junior Brother...”","The chorus of “Junior Brother” converged like countless streams forming a river, grand and overwhelming, echoing through Lin Yue, reaching the clouds, and resounding through the ancient Taixu Mountain, endlessly.","Mo Hua thus became the shared “Junior Brother” of Three Mountains One Line after the Three Sects Unification."]},{"number":1770,"title":"Chapter 1770 - 891: Demon Sect","paragraphs":["Taixu Gate, Back Hill.","Elder Master Xun carried a jug of wine, slowly walking into the Back Hill Forbidden Area, stepping into the Sword Tomb where killing intent faded and Sword Qi wilted.","Within the Sword Tomb, Patriarch Dugu still sat firmly as an isolated rock atop a cliff, unmoved by wind and rain.","Elder Master Xun placed the jug of wine before Patriarch Dugu and spoke:","\"Senior Brother, today is a joyous day, have a sip of wine.\"","Patriarch Dugu slowly opened his eyes, his gaze slightly condensed, somewhat incredulously said:","\"The Three Sects... have really united again?\"","\"Indeed...\" Elder Master Xun replied contentedly, \"They have reunited, we are one family once more... It’s a pity, though, that name carries such great fortune, it can’t be used again.\"","Afterwards, he appeared a bit melancholic.","These old-timers still held deep sentiments for the names given by their ancestors.","Patriarch Dugu’s expression grew complex, then silently glanced at Elder Master Xun, his voice hoarse:","\"Junior Brother, you’ve worked hard...\"","The unification of the Three Sects was a significant matter, fraught with difficulties.","To truly conceal the heavenly secret, seek opportunities, and overcome countless challenges, to drive the Three Sects into one line, openly and secretly, who knows how much effort and sacrifice it might take.","But he, plagued by the Heavenly Demon, could only remain confined to the Sword Tomb Forbidden Area.","If not for the disorder of heavenly secrets, and anomalies in cause and effect, he would not even release his Divine Sense to adhere to his true heart.","Completely, he was like a \"blind man\" and \"deaf man,\" knowing nothing outside the Sword Tomb, unable to help in any way.","All these burdens naturally fell entirely upon his Junior Brother’s shoulders.","This Junior Xun, who in youthful days was taciturn and of average Sword Dao talent, had now, as times changed, become the true support of Taixu Gate.","Yet himself, with extraordinary Sword Dao talent and high expectations as a Sword Dao prodigy, was now living like a cripple, entombed alive within the Sword Tomb.","He had failed Taixu Gate’s nurturing and burdened his Junior Brother.","Patriarch Dugu’s mind was heavy with emotions, but all were hidden in his heart, never spoken.","He glanced again at the wine jug before him, shook his head:","\"The Heavenly Demon confounds the mind, I cannot drink wine...\"","\"Rest assured, I diluted it with water; a sip will do no harm,\" Elder Master Xun replied, \"consider it celebrating the Three Sects’ rekindled reunion.\"","Patriarch Dugu remained silent.","Elder Master Xun sighed, his expression reminiscent: \"This is clear wine, it was... brewed by the master in the past, I have kept it until now.\"","Hearing this, Patriarch Dugu was slightly moved, trembling slightly, picked up the wine jug, and took a sip.","After drinking, he frowned, \"You’re deceiving me? This isn’t the master’s brew.\"","Elder Master Xun nodded, \"The master left some wine, I continued to brew it afterwards.\"","\"Indeed, your wine is inferior; it’s better not to drink.\"","\"I don’t truly want you to drink, today’s Three Sects unification is for you to celebrate a bit, savor the taste...\"","Patriarch Dugu set down the wine jug, pondered for a moment, then suddenly asked:","\"Regarding this matter, how did those two youngsters, Ouyang and Linghu, come to agree?\"","The \"youngsters\" in Patriarch Dugu’s mouth referred to Elder Ouyang of Tai’a Sect and Linghu Ancestor of Rushing Void Sect.","Both had junior seniority compared to him and reached Heaven Void later than he.","Elder Master Xun said: \"The heavenly secret is obscure, cause and effect are tumultuous, the future uncertain, coupled with their two sects, struggling to protect themselves, they could only seek transformation for survival, hence the timing for the Three Sects unification naturally arose...\"","\"Of course, there is another crucial reason that made Tai’a and Rushing Void willing for Taixu to lead in rebuilding the Mountain Gate.\"","Elder Master Xun spoke with emphasis, \"This Dao comprehension conference, our Taixu Gate, won First Place in Array Competition!\"","\"First Place in Array Competition?\"","Patriarch Dugu was stunned, somewhat amazed, \"Our Taixu Gate, can the formation really achieve first place?\"","First Place in Debating Sword, he could somewhat believe.","But first place in formation?","On what basis could Taixu Gate achieve this?","The ancestors fundamentally lacked this foundation...","\"Who won it?\" Patriarch Dugu asked.","Elder Master Xun responded with gratification, \"This child, Senior Brother, you likely don’t know him. He wasn’t originally from our Taixu Gate, nor from any distinguished family, but was forced into Tai Xu Mountain Gate by connections, named Mo Hua...\"","Patriarch Dugu was stupefied, almost doubting his hearing.","\"Who?\"","\"Mo Hua.\"","Elder Master Xun repeated, his expression sentimental, \"Speaking of which, it’s truly ancestor’s blessing, if not for this child falling from the heavens into our Taixu Gate, let alone the Three Sects’ unification, even this Dao conference checkpoint would have been hard to pass...\"","As he spoke, he suddenly saw something unusual in Patriarch Dugu’s expression, and his heart stirred, his gaze slightly tightened:","\"Senior Brother, do you know this child...?\"","Patriarch Dugu’s heart skipped a beat.","Not only does he know, he even taught him swordsmanship...","Words he couldn’t speak openly, yet he disdain to lie, thus remained indifferent, silent.","Elder Master Xun was slightly taken aback, after a brief thought, he shook his head first.","\"How could Senior Brother know Mo Hua?\"","\"Senior Brother was wounded by the Heavenly Demon, and also sealed by Taixu’s Confining God Lock, confined in the Sword Tomb Forbidden Area for so many years, not stepping outside even once.\"","\"Mo Hua, that child, could not possibly come to the Back Hill; this is a forbidden area, even if he wanted to, he could not come.\"","\"Moreover, Mo Hua spends every day under his own nose drawing formation, coupled with cultivation and classes, where does he have the time to run to the Back Hill?\"","An ancestor, a young disciple.","The two had no blood relation, no familial ties.","No causal connection whatsoever, how could they possibly know each other?","Elder Master Xun pondered in his heart.","Patriarch Dugu also felt perplexed within.","Mo Hua... is it a duplicate name?","This \"Mo Hua,\" perhaps it’s not the Mo Hua he knows?","Otherwise, how could it be such a coincidence..."]},{"number":1771,"title":"Chapter 1771 - 891: Demon Sect_2","paragraphs":["Moreover, the \"Mo Hua\" he knew, although possessing strong Divine Sense, only had the cultivation level of the Foundation Building Middle Stage. With a naïve and cheerful demeanor, he didn’t quite resemble a \"Formation Master.\"","Patriarch Dugu’s eyes flickered slightly, and he asked, \"This Mo Hua, what does he look like, what is his background...\"","Elder Master Xun, without any doubt, began to lavish praise, depicting the image of Mo Hua in his mind:","\"Young in age, Foundation Building Middle Phase, handsome appearance, the more you look, the more likable he becomes. Though his Spiritual Root is lacking, his comprehension is high, diligent, hardworking, striving to improve, with an extraordinary Taoist Heart, neither arrogant nor discouraged, polite, and understanding...\"","Elder Master Xun praised Mo Hua as if he were a blossoming flower.","Patriarch Dugu fell silent.","He could confirm that this Mo Hua was the very one he had brought to the Sword Tomb.","Yet, this Mo Hua seemed somewhat different.","At least, in the eyes of his junior brother, the Mo Hua he saw was quite different from the one in his own eyes...","\"Are you saying, he, at the Foundation Building Middle Phase, could seize the title of Leader in discourse?\"","\"Yes.\"","Patriarch Dugu frowned, \"Doesn’t this mean that at the Foundation Building Middle Phase, he can already draw a Nineteen-Pattern Array?\"","Elder Master Xun nodded, looking gratified.","This time he had broadened the horizons of the Qian Learning State Boundary. Now, he considered this as having broadened the horizons of this senior brother as well.","\"Indeed,\" Elder Master Xun nodded, \"Foundation Building Middle Phase, Nineteen-Pattern Peak Divine Sense, and this Divine Sense, honed through countless Formation Paintings, is extremely profound and extraordinarily solid...\"","Patriarch Dugu’s pupils contracted slightly.","He knew Mo Hua had a profound Divine Sense and was aware his Divine Sense was of Super Rank.","But for a Super Divine Sense to master complex Formations meant not only did he have good talent and willingness to strive, it also indicated he had a very proficient use of Divine Sense.","And the foundation of his Divine Sense was much more profound than he imagined.","\"So does this imply he might truly find another path and master the Divine Thought into sword True Jue?\"","Patriarch Dugu’s heart trembled slightly, a glint flashing through his eyes.","Elder Master Xun had more to say but upon seeing Patriarch Dugu’s expression, especially that gleam in his eyes.","Elder Master Xun fell silent, his gaze also became calm.","He quietly looked at Patriarch Dugu, speaking solemnly:","\"Senior Brother, you wouldn’t be thinking... of teaching this child the Divine Thought into sword, would you?\"","The bond of being disciples from the same sect and years of friendship, how could Elder Master Xun not know the obsession of this senior brother, how could he not grasp his intentions.","Patriarch Dugu remained silent.","What could he say?","He couldn’t possibly admit that he had already taught it...","Elder Master Xun’s expression turned stern, \"Senior Brother, don’t forget, Taixu Mind Transforming Sword True Jue has already been classified as a Forbidden Technique by the Sect, and no one is allowed to teach it, nor can any disciple learn it.\"","\"Have not enough disciples been injured or wasted lives due to this Divine Thought Sword Dao heritage?\"","\"Senior Brother, I understand your obsession, this unparalleled Sword technique being in obscurity unsettles your heart, but this Swordsmanship truly cannot be transmitted any longer.\"","\"Especially not to Mo Hua...\"","Elder Master Xun’s face was extremely serious, \"No matter how strong his Divine Sense is, no matter how good his aptitude for Divine Thought is, he cannot be taught the Divine Thought into sword True Jue!\"","\"His path is that of the Formation Master! This child’s future, destined to be a Formation Grandmaster with unparalleled knowledge in the Nine State!\"","\"This concerns the future of our Taixu Gate.\"","\"Should he, out of curiosity, learn the Divine Thought into sword, crippling his Sea of Consciousness, harming his Divine Soul, it would be an immense loss!\"","\"There can’t be any mishap to this promising sprout!\" Elder Master Xun stated resolutely.","Patriarch Dugu responded casually, \"Understood.\"","Elder Master Xun frowned, \"Senior Brother, do you truly understand?\"","Patriarch Dugu raised an eyebrow, \"Do I really need to say it twice?\"","Elder Master Xun did not bring it up again but pondered to himself, feeling slightly relieved.","The Senior Brother wasn’t one to disregard priorities.","Besides, with the senior brother’s pride and discerning eyes, wouldn’t it be unfounded to think he would teach a Foundation Stage junior disciple the Divine Thought Sword technique without even seeing Mo Hua?","It seems he had been overthinking...","Of course, perhaps because it concerned Mo Hua, he was a bit too anxious.","Elder Master Xun put away the wine flask in front of Patriarch Dugu, \"Alright, just a sip is enough, I won’t disturb your peace any longer.\"","\"Go on, go on.\" Patriarch Dugu waved his hand.","Elder Master Xun rose to leave, but after taking a few steps, he frowned and turned to stare at Patriarch Dugu.","Patriarch Dugu asked, \"Anything else?\"","Elder Master Xun shook his head, \"No, it’s just that...\" he scrutinized Patriarch Dugu for a while, \"Senior Brother, you seem to have changed a bit.\"","\"Changed?\" Patriarch Dugu hesitated.","\"Yes.\" Elder Master Xun pondered, \"You’ve become more open...\"","And... a bit more \"lively?\"","Talking more than before, more emotional too.","As if he had been \"infected\" by something, vaguely, with a hint of familiarity...","Patriarch Dugu’s face turned black, coldly he said, \"Anything else? If not, please leave, I need to rest.\"","Elder Master Xun shook his head, \"Then Senior Brother, take care.\"","The Three Sects had just merged, with quite a lot of matters to deal with, he indeed had little free time.","Elder Master Xun then took his leave.","In the solemn silence of the Sword Tomb, Patriarch Dugu sat alone and desolate.","After a while, he frowned and silently mouthed a name:","\"Mo Hua...\"","...","When the next seven-day period arrived.","Patriarch Dugu broke through the void, grabbed Mo Hua to his side, imparting Swordsmanship to him and testing his sword skills assignment, eyes reminiscent of swords hidden in Kushan Mountain, could not help but focus on Mo Hua.","Mo Hua, feeling uncomfortable from being stared at, softly asked:"]},{"number":1772,"title":"Chapter 1772 - 891: Demon Sect_3","paragraphs":["\"Ancestor, why do you keep staring at me?\"","Patriarch Dugu looked indifferent and hesitated, then decided against speaking, saying only, \"Focus on your swordsmanship.\"","\"Oh.\"","Mo Hua silently resumed swinging the bamboo sword in his hand, chopping at the wood on the back mountain.","The wood on the back mountain, its grade unknown, was harder than stone, making his wrists numb with each cut.","However, Patriarch Dugu said that this was an essential course for a Sword Cultivator.","The important thing wasn’t chopping wood, but cultivating a rapport between man and sword during the process, achieving a unity of body and sword, a fusion of man and sword, thus when using the Divine Thought into sword, a mere thought would birth Sword Intent, melding the sword into the soul, having the sword roam the Taixu, and wielded like a divine emissary, invincible.","Mo Hua found it quite reasonable.","He considered that although these sword moves he practiced were not powerful in reality and hardly useful.","But in the Divine Thought World like the Sea of Consciousness, nightmares, and Illusionary Realm, with his Transforming Sword Skill, he could excel.","Mo Hua understood his situation.","His swordsmanship was lacking, and previously in the Sea of Consciousness, using the Transforming Sword Skill was merely relying on the sharpness of Divine Thought to haphazardly slash around.","Because his Divine Thought was so strong, even a simple Transforming Sword Skill could usually take down most Demon Wraiths in one strike.","But such sword moves were indeed crude.","If given the chance, he should still research and refine them, striving to reach new heights in skill.","In reality, this was acceptable as his physical body was weak and couldn’t become a Sword Cultivator master.","But in the Sea of Consciousness, it was different. With Divine Thought incarnating, wielding a Sword of Divine Thought, the sword moves he learned could surely be put to great use.","Thus, even though Mo Hua could not harm the wood in the back mountain at all, he still practiced chopping seriously.","Without accumulating tiny steps, one won’t reach a thousand miles.","Seemingly grand Sword Dao is hidden within these simple sword moves.","Mo Hua’s expression was focused and concentrated.","The sword moves he executed were indeed inferior, not harming anyone at all.","But in each move and style, he poured all his heart and soul.","Patriarch Dugu silently watched Mo Hua, sighing lightly in his heart:","\"Sword moves like decayed wood, but a Sword Heart like uncut jade...\"","\"Plus, mastering Formation and exceeding in Divine Thought...\"","Patriarch Dugu looked at Mo Hua, his eyes slightly narrowing, pondering something unknown...","...","Days passed one by one.","Taixu Gate changed a lot after the Three Sects Unification.","But for Mo Hua, it seemed as if nothing had changed.","He still cultivated as usual, attended classes, learned Formation, learned Swordsmanship, continued to teach Formation classes as a substitute, and there was still a crowd of people calling him Junior Brother.","It’s just that the number of disciples he taught increased.","The disciples calling him Junior Brother also increased.","As time passed, more than a month went by, and after this month’s cultivation, Mo Hua was essentially certain of one thing:","This year, he definitely wouldn’t break through to the Foundation Establishment Late Stage.","Even now, he hadn’t even touched the bottleneck.","Mo Hua’s suspended heart finally died down steadily.","He could only take the back door.","Elder Master Xun also kept his promise, not letting him repeat a grade.","Although this decision broke the sect’s rules, rules were meant to be broken anyway, not to mention, this was Mo Hua.","The only Array Leader Taixu Gate ever had up to now.","Even if Mo Hua didn’t mention it, Elder Master Xun couldn’t possibly let him repeat a grade for real.","After more than another month, it was time for the year-end assessment.","Mo Hua, with his eyes closed, calmly took the test and scored one Grade A, six Grade Cs, marking the end of the year.","And then it was the New Year.","During this New Year, Mo Hua’s treatment was quite grand.","The Family Heads of the Shangguan Family, Wenren Family, and Gu Family personally sent invitations inviting Mo Hua to the New Year banquet.","The invitation was handwritten by the heads of the three families and sent to Taixu Gate by Wenren Wan.","Due to Mo Hua’s influence, Wenren Wan’s status at Taixu Gate was rapidly elevated, and all Elders treated her as hospitably and warmly as encountering a ’Goddess of Fortune.’","Taixu Gate even made an exception, granting her a \"Guest Elder\" status.","Of course, this was just a title without actual power and no need for toil.","But this was the \"Taixu Gate\" after the Three Sects Unification, whose influence enlarged over twice.","This honorable \"status\" was immensely valuable.","Thus, Wenren Wan found it much more convenient to enter Taixu Gate.","She handed the gilded and jade-embedded, exquisitely precious invitation to Mo Hua, saying:","\"No need to take it to heart, go if you have time, but if really busy, there’s no need to force social interactions. These New Year banquets are quite boring.\"","Even though born in Wenren Family, married into the Shangguan Family, and had deep connections with the Gu Family.","But Wenren Wan knew well that family relationships were shallow, filled with materialism and intrigue.","She didn’t want Mo Hua to be tainted with these too early.","Nor did she want these things to affect his cultivation and learning of Formations.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and asked: \"Are there many delicious foods?\"","Wenren Wan was taken aback, then smiled and said:","\"This is the three families’ New Year banquet, grander than before, guests more honorable, delicious foods more than enough...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up, nodding: \"Then I’ll go.\"","Wenren Wan smiled: \"Good.\"","...","During the New Year festivities, Mo Hua went to the Gu Family’s New Year banquet.","Elder Master Xun also approved of this.","He didn’t want Mo Hua to make too many public appearances, fearing he might be targeted.","But the Gu Family was different; they were upright and had relatively deep ties with Mo Hua.","The Shangguan Family and Wenren Family also had some connections with Mo Hua.","This New Year banquet could be attended.","It also allowed Mo Hua to experience the treatment the Array Leader, who overpowered countless genius disciples at the Qianxue State Boundary, should have."]},{"number":1773,"title":"Chapter 1773 - 891: Demon Sect_4","paragraphs":["As for the Gu Family, they were indeed exceedingly gracious to Mo Hua.","Previously, when Mo Hua came to join meals, he would sit at the same table as Aunt Wan, in a slightly peripheral position at the banquet.","Now, he was still at the same table with Aunt Wan and Yu Er.","But this time, their seats were right next to the Gu Family Master.","Even during the banquet, the usually stern and rigid Gu Family Master, Gu Shouyan, would smile at Mo Hua and kindly ask him what he wanted to eat.","The Shangguan Family Master, Shang Che, and the Wenren Family Master, Wenren Jingxuan, also sat not far away, in seats slightly higher than Mo Hua’s.","Whenever there was a chance, they would engage Mo Hua in conversation.","The topics of discussion were evidently carefully considered.","Often, after a few words, the conversation would turn to Formation, naturally praising Mo Hua’s exceptional talent and profound knowledge in Formation, predicting a boundless future for him.","They were all family masters, and adept individuals, deliberately trying to \"flatter\" a young disciple with masterful conversational skills, truly reaching the pinnacle of perfection.","A gentle breeze and subtle rain, yet meticulous in execution.","Maintaining dignity, not appearing abrupt, and exuding a quiet and attentive care.","Even Mo Hua’s mood greatly improved, eating a few more chicken legs.","Wenren Wan’s eyes were filled with smiles.","Yu Er was also very happy, following Mo Hua’s lead, grasping and nibbling on chicken legs with her hands.","Now, no one dared to criticize him anymore.","Nor would anyone dare to say Yu Er had \"learned badly\"—because the person she learned from was the Leader of the Formation competition at the Qian Learning State Boundary’s Taoist Conference.","As long as you were an absolute genius, everything you did was right.","And so, at this banquet, both host and guest enjoyed themselves to the fullest.","However, by Mo Hua’s side, there was an Elder of the Shangguan Family with a visibly high status whose face was gloomy throughout, much like the pig knuckle on the table.","Mo Hua quietly inquired about this Elder’s name from Wenren Wan:","Shangguan Wang.","\"Shangguan Wang...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment and silently memorized this name.","...","After the annual banquet, Mo Hua felt stuffed and then routinely wandered in the Gu Family’s backyard to aid digestion.","As expected, many Elders eagerly approached him to give gifts.","They were gifts that weren’t too expensive but filled with sincere intentions.","Mo Hua said, \"How could I accept?\" but ultimately, he \"couldn’t resist the kindness\" and accepted them all.","As he walked, Mo Hua thought of Gu Changhuai.","During the banquet, he seemed not to have seen much of Uncle Gu.","Mo Hua thought for a while, then found the study, and indeed saw Gu Changhuai alone, sitting at the desk, still reading through Jade Slips.","Gu Changhuai, surprised to see Mo Hua, said, \"You actually have time to run around everywhere?\"","The Gu Family’s annual banquet was basically organized for Mo Hua.","The family masters of Shangguan and Wenren also had ulterior motives, wanting to establish some connections and good ties with Mo Hua ahead of time.","Mo Hua replied casually, \"I’m just here for a meal.\"","His gaze swept over the Jade Slips on Gu Changhuai’s desk, and he curiously asked, \"Is the Taoist Court busy lately?\"","\"Not too bad...\" Gu Changhuai responded dismissively.","But Mo Hua didn’t believe him.","Uncle Gu’s expression clearly indicated he was hiding something important.","Moreover, being busy even during the annual banquet suggested something crucial was afoot.","Mo Hua asked, \"Are there cases again?\"","Gu Changhuai didn’t want to disclose anything and attempted to be evasive, but suddenly realized that Mo Hua was no longer the same as before.","There were many things that Mo Hua already knew, perhaps even more than himself.","And given Mo Hua’s inquisitive nature and habit of digging to the bottom...","Gu Changhuai felt a bit of a headache.","After a while, he sighed, looked around, secured the doors and windows, sealed the Formation to ensure no information would leak, then solemnly said:","\"There’s another extermination case, and this time, the action was quicker and the killings more decisive. The Taoist Court investigated and found... it’s organized by the Demon Sect.\"","\"Demon Sect?\"","Mo Hua’s gaze sharpened."]},{"number":1774,"title":"Chapter 1774 - 892: Demon Path","paragraphs":["The nature of the Demon Sect is completely different.","Ever since Mo Hua entered the Qian Learning State Boundary, he often followed the Taoist Court to mix reward hunts, and now he distinguishes these monstrous evil demons more clearly than before.","Sin Cultivators refer to cultivators who have violated Taoist Law.","These cultivators might be righteous cultivators themselves, practicing righteous cultivation techniques, but due to selfish acts, or impulsive actions, committed crimes like murder, theft, pillaging, defilement, or replenishing from others, thus becoming wanted by the Taoist Court.","Sin Cultivators roam in gray areas, mostly indistinguishable between righteous and evil by their cultivation techniques.","There are even some Sin Cultivators who have committed murder or broken the law, as long as they find ways to deceive others and put themselves under a pretentious identity, they can still live glamorously in front of people.","The premise is that their crimes remain undiscovered.","And the Taoist Court cannot trace them.","The nature of Evil Demon Cultivators is even worse, and they can be distinguished by cultivation techniques and Taoist skills.","Evil Cultivators refer to those who in their cultivation have strayed or fallen into deviation, learning certain Demon Path Skills and spells.","Evil Cultivators transform from righteous to evil, mostly acting alone.","Occasionally gathering, they still act independently, only temporarily coming together, as their cultivation technique and Taoist skill systems differ.","Demon Cultivators are different.","They gather with a clear purpose, a unified head, and commit evil acts systematically and with organization.","And the inheritance of these Demon Cultivators is also systematic, practicing the same kind of demon skills, nurturing the same evil artifacts, employing the same origin Taoist skills.","The inheritance system of the Demon Path is the clearest difference between Demon Cultivators and Evil Cultivators.","Mo Hua didn’t initially take this to heart, but later on, after more contact, he found Demon Path cultivation techniques somewhat peculiar.","He then consulted Gu Changhuai as well as some enforcement leaders from the Taoist Court who were at the frontline capturing Demon Cultivators, only then understanding the sinister and terrifying aspects of the Demon Path inheritance system...","No matter righteous or evil, Tao Cultivation requires \"resources\".","The cultivation resources for righteous cultivators are Spirit Stones.","The cultivation resources for Demon Cultivators are people.","Or rather, \"people\" are the Demon Cultivators’ \"Spirit Stones\".","Righteous cultivators rely on their own efforts to extract and refine spiritual energy from Spirit Stones; although slow, it steadily progresses towards the Great Dao, one step at a time in cultivation.","This process is righteous, but dull, laborious, and too slow.","Thus, Demon Cultivators tread another path, to kill, to rob, to seize the blood qi and spiritual power arduously cultivated by others.","This cultivation method is faster, and the killing power is stronger.","But once reaching a certain extent in Demon cultivation, there will be a bottleneck.","That is, relying on one’s own power for killing, robbing, and seizing, the progress is still too slow.","Hence, some powerful Demon Heads develop \"downlines\".","These Demon Heads pass their cultivation techniques to several disciples, sending these disciples out to kill, rob, and absorb blood qi and spiritual power for them.","The absorbed blood qi and spiritual power are partially digested by the disciples, but most are \"offered\" upward to the Demon Head.","Because the demon cultivation techniques of demon disciples are bestowed by the Demon Head, the progression of their cultivation, the strength of their Taoist skills, even their life and death, are all controlled by the Demon Head.","They have no choice but to submit.","And if the Demon Path disciples under the Demon Head wish to become stronger, they must independently develop \"downlines\" again.","They must take disciples, transmit skills, then absorb spiritual power and blood qi from their disciples, gradually becoming stronger.","The disciples’ disciples again pass down...","Layer after layer below, the wider the transmission of demon skills, the more numerous the Demon Sect disciples, the greater the influence, the more \"blood qi\" and \"spiritual power\" absorbed from righteous cultivators.","Thus, the original Demon Head Ancestor, receives more offerings, and his cultivation naturally becomes stronger.","This is the \"skill transmission\" system of the Demon Sect.","There might be exceptions in this system, but it generally remains unchanged.","Layer upon layer of exploitation and oppression, layer by layer blood-sucking, spiritual energy absorption, layer upon layer of offerings upward.","The endpoint of Evil Cultivators is the skill-transmitting Demon Cultivators.","The endpoint of Demon Cultivators is the skill-transmitting Demon Sect.","And the endpoint of the Demon Sect is the Great Demon Hall, commanded by the Demon Monarch, reigning over billions, nurturing countless \"blood slaves\" and \"spirit slaves\", consuming people to their marrow, monopolizing everything...","This is the secret Mo Hua discovered through combining sect classics and asking around everywhere.","Of course, now the Taoist Court is united, promoting righteousness, slaughtering Demon Cultivators, and burning all demon path cultivation techniques and classics.","\"Great Demon Hall\" such a thing has already been obliterated in the long river of Cultivation World history, rarely mentioned anymore.","But as long as human nature has greed, anger, and obsession, there will be demons.","Demon Cultivators are hard to eliminate completely.","The skill transmission style of the Demon Sect has naturally survived.","Moreover, compared to the gray Sin Cultivators, the solitary Evil Cultivators, and the ordinary Demon Cultivators who are a mixed bag.","The Demon Sect with a certain scale, inheriting the same origin, structured closely, like a plague, capable of spreading through \"skill transmission\"—","Even a small Demon Sect has stronger organizational power, greater destructive force, and higher danger...","\"Recently emerging in the Qian Learning State Boundary is a Demon Sect practicing blood-related demon skills.\"","\"The Demon Cultivators in the Demon Sect will consume cultivators’ flesh and blood, and have already committed three major crimes: exterminated a second-grade small family, a small village outside of Immortal City, and during a cultivator gathering, nearly a thousand cultivators...\"","Gu Changhuai’s expression was solemn.","Mo Hua also frowned.","\"Not only that,\" Gu Changhuai said, \"these Demon Sects are also developing ’downlines’, spreading demon skills, further expanding influence. The difficulty for the Taoist Court to handle also continually increases...\""]},{"number":1775,"title":"Chapter 1775 - 892: Demon Path_2","paragraphs":["\"The leader is a Great Demon Cultivator at the Golden Core Stage?\" Mo Hua asked.","\"Yes,\" Gu Changhuai nodded, his expression grave, \"and it’s not just one; there are probably more than ten Golden Core Elders in the Demon Sect...\"","More than ten Golden Cores...","Mo Hua took a deep breath.","On the outskirts of the Qian Learning State Boundary, more than ten Golden Core Demon Cultivators are truly remarkable.","Among the various forces cultivating the Dao, Heaven Void guards one side. He is an ancestor-level figure, not easily taking action and rarely traveling.","Those traveling outside, the top figures, have merely reached Feather Transformation.","Back then, at Li Mountain City within the Dali Mountain State Boundary, when both the Demon Path and Righteous Dao cultivators besieged his master, the highest cultivation level mobilized was also Feather Transformation.","At that time, he was still young, with low cultivation and narrow insight, and did not feel it deeply.","Reflecting on it now, so many True Men at the Feather Transformation Realm are basically the \"top\" combat power that a general large force can mobilize.","Mo Hua even guessed that among the believers of the Great Wilderness Evil God, the mysterious \"Mr. Tu\" lurking in the background was probably also merely at the Feather Transformation stage.","True Men at the Feather Transformation Realm, Mo Hua has encountered quite a few. It may not feel like much, but he is still at Foundation Establishment.","If he really had to cultivate by himself, it would be like a long and distant journey without an end in sight.","Below the Feather Transformation is the Golden Core.","Even in some great families, the Golden Core is considered the backbone of the family.","Not to mention, in these second and third grade Little Immortal Cities surrounding the Qian Learning State Boundary.","In these regions, a Foundation Establishment Peak Fire Buddha and Water Yama can run rampant.","These demon heads of the Golden Core Realm from the Demon Sect, with their inheritance, organization, and plans, are undoubtedly a great \"calamity.\"","Mo Hua sighed.","But this is a situation for the Golden Core, and as a Foundation Establishment, he can only be powerless.","If he dared to involve himself, he would be crushed at any moment.","He struggled for a long time even with a Foundation Establishment Peak Fire Buddha, let alone these ten or so Golden Core Demon Cultivators from the Demon Sect.","\"Will the Taoist Court Official deploy more people?\" Mo Hua asked.","Gu Changhuai said, \"I can’t tell you the specifics, but the Taoist Court Official has already started drawing Golden Core Realm Supervisors from nearby state boundaries to come to help. After all, the emergence of the Demon Sect is a major event no matter where it happens, not to mention in the Qian Learning State Boundary where sects are everywhere...\"","Mo Hua nodded, then looked at Gu Changhuai with concern.","\"Uncle Gu, be careful as well.\"","This matter with the Demon Sect is no joke.","\"It’s alright, I know what I’m doing,\" Gu Changhuai said.","Even though he said so, his expression was very solemn, clearly indicating that this matter was not easy.","Mo Hua slightly sighed in his heart.","Uncle Gu is the type of person who is somewhat proud at heart, bearing his hardships alone, telling as little as he can.","\"Alright then, just take care of yourself,\" Mo Hua said.","With the blood-sucking Demon Sect and more than ten Golden Cores, there was indeed nothing he could do to help.","Gu Changhuai nodded, \"Don’t worry.\"","...","After the annual banquet, the Gu Family Master personally sent Mo Hua back to the Taixu Gate by carriage.","Several days later, the festival ended.","And thus, a new year began.","This was Mo Hua’s seventh year at the Taixu Gate.","Starting this year, it’s the academic year of the Foundation Establishment Late Stage.","But only Mo Hua remained at the Foundation Building Middle Stage.","He officially became the first and, to date, the only disciple in the Taixu Gate to directly enter the Foundation Establishment Late Stage academic year while still at the Foundation Building Middle Stage.","This made Mo Hua feel somewhat \"out of place.\"","Even more \"out of place,\" was having a group of Foundation Establishment Late Stage disciples call him \"Junior Brother,\" which pressured him greatly.","Being this Junior Brother, he not only failed to \"set an example,\" but actually dragged behind, ending up as the \"back marker.\"","He only stayed because of connections without having to repeat a year.","More importantly, all the disciples Mo Hua knew, whether it was Cheng Mo, Situ Jian, Hao Xuan, Yang Qianjun, or Ling Huxiao, Little Wood, all successfully advanced to the Foundation Establishment Late Stage.","Only he remained at the Foundation Building Middle Stage.","Mo Hua felt quite uncomfortable.","Therefore, his primary task was to break through to Foundation Establishment Late Stage as soon as possible, the faster the better.","Mo Hua focused on cultivation thereafter.","Finally, one early morning a month later.","Mo Hua performed his routine cultivation.","One Spirit Stone after another was refined into pure spiritual energy, circulating along the meridians, experiencing a Grand Circulation, converging into the Qi Sea, and precipitating into spiritual power like mercury.","Time and again, Mo Hua cultivated steadily, neither impatient nor anxious.","And finally, water drops penetrate stone.","A tremor occurred in Mo Hua’s Qi Sea, spiritual power boiled, and his entire body’s meridians and acupoints felt somewhat hot.","This was a sign of encountering a bottleneck in cultivation.","Mo Hua’s spirits lifted.","But the breakthrough of Heaven Yan Jue differs from other cultivation techniques.","After all, this is an ancient cultivation technique, strange, obscure, and unconventional.","After the spiritual power boiled throughout his body, it did not break through; instead, some small threads overflowed from the meridians, along small pathways, gradually gathering at Mo Hua’s Bahui Meridian.","When it reached the Heavenly Gate Point, these threads of spiritual power formed into a screen-like veil, breaking the barrier with flesh and bones, infiltrating into the inner Sea of Consciousness.","Ultimately, the spiritual power interwove with the Sea of Consciousness, revealing intricate formation patterns, forming obscure formations, continuously merging and weaving, resembling rivers converging into the sea, or a dragon spider weaving silk, transforming into a vast Spirit Screen-like Mystery Formation.","This scene, Mo Hua had seen since his Qi-refining Realm, having witnessed it many times.","Upon viewing it now, the entire process was largely the same.","However, there was something different about this bottleneck.","The formation patterns were more advanced, the Mystery Formation more complex, and the scale larger."]},{"number":1776,"title":"Chapter 1776 - 892: Demon Path_3","paragraphs":["These are not the most critical aspects; the most crucial is that the color of the Mystery Formation is pure gold.","It’s the color of Divine Marrow.","In other words, it represents the color of ’Divine Sense Sublimation.’","Mo Hua approached the Mystery Formation, comparing the color of his Divine Thought transformation with the color of the Mystery Formation, realizing that the ’gold gleaming’ on himself was far less pure than the gold of the Mystery Formation.","This also means that his level of ’Divine Sense Sublimation’ does not meet the requirements of the Heaven Yan Jue.","Mo Hua attempted to communicate with the thought power of the Mystery Formation to break the formation.","But the Mystery Formation, floating in the Sea of Consciousness and interwoven with spiritual power and thought power, was like having gold injected into it, weighing as heavy as an immeasurable force.","Mo Hua went all out, but with his divine thought, he couldn’t mobilize it at all.","Which means he doesn’t even have the qualification to ’break the Mystery Formation.’","Mo Hua took a deep breath.","Even though he had prepared himself mentally, the ’peculiarity’ of the Heaven Yan Jue still exceeded his expectations.","With his current realm of Divine Sense Sublimation, does he lack the qualifications for cultivation?","In the Ancient Era, who were the ones actually learning this ancient cultivation technique?","Are such high thresholds truly reasonable?","Surely it couldn’t have been made for divine beasts or deities to learn?","Or were ancient cultivators beings with incredibly strong divine senses?","Mo Hua was speechless.","He sat down, looked at the sky-spanning golden Mystery Formation, and couldn’t help but sigh, feeling a sense of powerlessness.","Yet, difficulties are difficulties; he must think of ways to overcome them; sighing is of no use.","Moreover, this is the bottleneck at the Foundation Establishment Late Stage, the last big hurdle before the Golden Core. Once past it, the next step is Core Formation.","Core Formation!","Mo Hua’s spirit was rejuvenated; he began to calm down and consider how to break through the bottleneck.","At present, the bottleneck of the Heaven Yan Jue has two requirements:","One is the degree of divine sense transformation, which is the realm of Divine Sense ’Sublimation’ as Lord Yellow Mountain calls it.","This realm is represented by the color of divine marrow.","The other is the spirit screen of the sky-spanning Mystery Formation that is woven from spiritual power and divine thought.","But for Mo Hua now, the Mystery Formation is rather manageable.","His second-grade array skills, especially in the Five Elements and Eight Trigrams domain, have reached a masterful level, even praised highly by Elder Master Xun.","So he can solve the Mystery Formation, although it may take some time.","The only issue is the realm of Divine Sense Sublimation; Mo Hua still has a considerable gap.","To elevate the realm of Divine Sense Sublimation and enhance the degree of divine sense transformation, he must devour ’Divine Marrow.’","And it seems that a tiny amount of ’mosquito-leg’ Divine Marrow won’t do.","He needs to consume a large quantity of Divine Marrow.","Divine Marrow again...","Mo Hua rubbed his temples.","He pondered slightly; if he wanted to consume Divine Marrow, the first method was as usual, starting with the Great Wilderness Evil God.","Find the altar, kill divine remains, refine Divine Marrow, and, after swallowing it, proceed with Divine Sense Sublimation.","But now the situation has turned a bit dire.","He used the identity of the ’Evil Embryo’ and the mantle of authority at the Dragon King Temple altar to erase the Blood Oath List, extinguishing the life souls of all Evil God henchmen on it.","Mr. Tu, cornered and furious, since all second-grade henchmen are dead, simply resorted directly to the third-grade Golden Core.","The Golden Core game is something he can’t win.","Plus, the hidden danger of the evil embryo still exists within him.","Of course, even without the evil embryo, now isn’t the time to run around.","Because he is now ’Qianxue’s first, Array Leader,’ considered something of a ’celebrity.’","Fame brings trouble, just like a pig grows fat.","He is now ridiculously ’bulky,’ being closely watched by many people in both overt and covert ways.","Mo Hua never anticipated that one day he, an obscure little disciple, would be so burdened by fame, struggling to move freely.","And precisely because of this, in the upcoming period, he must stay holed up in the Taixu Gate, avoid going out as much as possible.","Thus, having calculated everything, it seems there’s only one way out:","Kill the evil embryo.","He must cut off the evil embryo in his life soul, refine its Divine Marrow, to further sublime his Divine Sense, break the Heaven Yan Jue’s bottleneck and reach the Foundation Establishment Late Stage.","Yet, Mo Hua has thought about the idea of ’killing the evil embryo’ many times already.","It’s not a matter of wanting to slay it; it’s that his God Slaying Technique hasn’t formed, and by his methods, he simply cannot kill the evil embryo.","He’s been consistently cultivating the Tai Xu God-Slaying Sword.","Every day, he slashes once at his divine soul.","With each slash, the evil embryo weakens a bit.","But despite slashing it for so long, the evil embryo still sticks like glue, showing tenacious vitality.","Mo Hua isn’t sure how many more times he needs to slash before he can finally slaughter the evil embryo.","He can also increase the frequency, slashing several times a day.","But this would increase the load on his divine soul, requiring ’Divine Marrow’ for repair.","This leads to a dead end.","He needs Divine Marrow to cultivate the God-Slaying Sword and kill the evil embryo.","But only by killing the evil embryo can he obtain Divine Marrow.","Without Divine Marrow, he can’t kill the evil embryo, and without killing the evil embryo, he can’t get Divine Marrow...","This is almost a ’dead knot.’","Mo Hua sighed; for several days, he continuously pondered over this issue.","But this ’dead knot’ wasn’t something easily untangled.","...","Several days later, it’s the next seven-day cycle.","Mo Hua drew the formation, revised his swordsmanship lessons, then sat at the Disciple’s Residence waiting for Patriarch Dugu to come and take him over.","A moment later, a flash of void rents open.","Mo Hua’s sight blurred; when he opened his eyes again, he found himself at the Back Hill Forbidden Area, surrounded by old and decaying Sword Tombs.","As always, Patriarch Dugu was teaching him sword techniques and then tested Mo Hua on his swordsmanship lessons, finally handing him a bamboo sword to chop at wood as hard as stone.","Mo Hua also adhered to the routine without protest.","While Mo Hua chopped wood, Patriarch Dugu slightly frowned, watching him the whole time.","After about an hour, Patriarch Dugu suddenly shook his head and said: \"Not right...\"","Mo Hua paused, turned his head, and asked: \"Ancestor, am I chopping incorrectly?\"","\"You’re chopping correctly,\" Patriarch Dugu said, \"but it’s too slow. At this pace, achieving success in swordsmanship would take forever.\"","\"And by the time you achieve in swordsmanship, and can learn Divine Thought into sword, I might be dead from waiting.\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","\"Ancestor, you are Heaven Void, you surely can live for thousands upon thousands of years,\" Mo Hua said.","Patriarch Dugu remained indifferent: \"Don’t waste your breath flattering; I see my life and death quite clearly.\"","\"Then...\" Mo Hua scratched his head, \"Should I stop practicing?\"","Patriarch Dugu shook his head, \"I’ve thought it over, you must train differently.\"","\"Train differently?\"","\"Yes,\" Patriarch Dugu’s eyes were sharp and insightful, \"you are different from others; you must walk a unique path, or else your talent will be obscured, buried.\""]},{"number":1777,"title":"Chapter 1777 - 893: Formation and Sword","paragraphs":["Mo Hua was somewhat embarrassed by the praise from Patriarch Dugu.","Regarding his talent in Sword Dao, he was well aware of his own abilities.","Patriarch Dugu said indifferently: \"If I’m not mistaken, you’ve already learned the Transforming Sword Skill, haven’t you?\"","Mo Hua felt a chill in his heart, quietly raised his head, glanced at Patriarch Dugu, and saw his expression like a barren grave, unfathomable, revealing no joy or anger, feeling somewhat anxious.","Yet he dared not conceal, whispering: \"I’ve learned a little...\"","\"How did you learn?\" Patriarch Dugu asked.","\"On Senior Xuan’s broken sword, there was a bit of causality, I accidentally perceived it, and understood a little...\" Mo Hua said.","Patriarch Dugu’s eyelid twitched.","Causality?","Already able to perceive causality at the Foundation Establishment Realm?","\"Only the Transforming Sword Skill?\" Patriarch Dugu asked again.","Mo Hua honestly replied: \"I’ve learned a little of the Soul-Shocking Sword too...\"","Patriarch Dugu’s expression remained unchanged, yet in his heart arose a tempestuous wave.","He had seen traces on Mo Hua indicating he had learned Divine Thought into Sword, but hadn’t expected he learned it this way...","Perceiving causality, recapitulating sword techniques, learning Divine Thought into Sword?","Are these means suitable for a Foundation Building Cultivator?","Patriarch Dugu frowned, \"Have you learned the method of Heavenly Mechanism Causality?\"","Mo Hua shook his head, \"Only occasionally, I can perceive a bit of causality...\"","His words were not lies.","He indeed hadn’t learned the orthodox Heavenly Mechanism Causality Skill.","What he learned were the Heavenly secret Calculation and the Heavenly secret Tricky Calculation.","These two are Divine Thought Algorithms, should be categorized under Formations or the methods of Divine Thought.","Patriarch Dugu nodded slightly, secretly amazed.","Without learning the Heavenly Mechanism Causality Skill but able to occasionally perceive causality, it must be due to a strong Divine Sense and profound formation accomplishments.","Patriarch Dugu asked again: \"Did you win first place in the Array Competition?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded.","This was not worth hiding, as the entire Taixu Gate knows.","Patriarch Dugu didn’t speak for a while, after a moment sighed in his heart:","\"Misjudged again...\"","Judging a person by appearance can be misleading.","This child, at such a young age, possesses unbelievably profound formation accomplishments and a peculiar talent of blazing a new trail.","But just the right timing...","Patriarch Dugu’s eyes slightly brightened, revealing a trace of hope.","\"Maybe, there is truly hope...\"","Mo Hua secretly observed Patriarch Dugu, feeling a bit uneasy, wondering if the ancestor was angry with him.","He wasn’t intentionally concealing.","The main issue is the numerous secrets he holds, pulling one can trigger everything, so it’s best not to speak if possible.","Patriarch Dugu silently observed Mo Hua a few times, yet didn’t pursue the inquiry, after a while, he slowly spoke:","\"I’ll teach you sword techniques.\"","Mo Hua breathed a sigh of relief, yet asked doubtfully: \"Patriarch, haven’t you always been teaching me sword techniques?\"","\"This time it’s different.\" Patriarch Dugu said solemnly, \"Ordinarily, Sword Cultivators learn swordsmanship from shallow to deep, from Sword Moves, to Sword Qi, to Sword Intent, eventually Divine Thought into Sword.\"","\"You don’t need to learn like this anymore, learning superficial Sword Moves you aren’t good at would waste your time, hindering your progress...\"","\"You should learn from a different perspective.\"","Mo Hua paused, \"Different perspective?\"","Patriarch Dugu nodded, \"From Formations, into Sword Dao!\"","\"From Formations into Sword Dao...\" Mo Hua’s heart resonated, then softly asked: \"Patriarch, are you also a Fifth Grade Array Master?\"","Patriarch Dugu shook his head, \"I haven’t researched formations extensively, but having reached my level of cultivation, my understanding of Tao Cultivation wouldn’t be confined to a single approach, seeking the principle of unity and returning to simplicity...\"","\"Of course, I’ve devoted my efforts entirely to Sword Dao, formations are used merely for contemplation, connecting disparate ideas. They are not my forte.\"","\"Therefore, I can only provide you with some inspiration.\"","\"I can only roughly tell you what Sword Dao is, what Formations are, but how specifically to do it, how to merge them, you need to comprehend it yourself...\"","Mo Hua solemnly performed a salutation, earnestly saying: \"Thank you for the guidance, Ancestor.\"","Listening to Heaven Void speak Dao, this is great fortune.","This is Heaven Void Ancestor’s understanding of the \"Dao\", an insightful recognition of the Great Dao, if truly comprehended, it will benefit future cultivation greatly.","Mo Hua was aware.","Patriarch Dugu saw that Mo Hua understood, nodded slightly, then solemnly said:","\"In this world, there are countless Great Dao, different paths lead to the same goal.\"","\"Formations, Swordsmanship, Alchemy Skill, talismanic magic, Artifact Refining Technique, Spells, and Martial Arts Dao... All of these are methods of Great Dao evolution.\"","\"Among them, formations are especially significant, for formations inherently mirror the cosmos, sketch the patterns of all things, more closely approaching the manifestation of Great Dao rules.\"","\"Yet this does not mean that walking other paths will result in an inability to comprehend the Dao.\"","\"Once you cultivate to a certain degree, you’ll find that all phenomena, though they appear myriad in form, fundamentally are manifestations of the Great Dao.\"","\"It’s merely because cultivators have limited lifespans, they can only choose one or two methods of Great Dao evolution to delve into deeply. Using the method as a raft, to seek the Great Dao.\"","\"Once gained, the Great Dao can lead to a state where there is no raft or method, all things follow the heart, boundless and unrestrained, the Great Dao resides within, transforming heaven and earth, this is called... Immortal!\"","Mo Hua’s expression was shaken.","The Great Dao resides within, transforming heaven and earth, called Immortal...","He etched each word deep in his mind.","Patriarch Dugu discussed Dao for a while before turning back to talk about formations and Sword Dao, he first asked Mo Hua:","\"What is Sword Qi?\"","Mo Hua pondered and said: \"The killing aura of a sword?\"","Patriarch Dugu was not quite satisfied, \"Think again.\"","Mo Hua slightly frowned, recalling the teachings of Patriarch Dugu just now, slowly saying:","\"All things have spirit, the universe is unified, Spiritual Energy is the root of all things...\"","\"Great Dao, though different, lead to the same destination, thus Sword Qi itself isn’t really ’sword’, but rather a form of Spiritual Power, merely manifesting in the form of a ’sword’?\""]},{"number":1778,"title":"Chapter 1778 - 893: Formation and Sword_2","paragraphs":["Patriarch Dugu raised an eyebrow, signaling Mo Hua to continue.","Mo Hua said, \"Sword Dao, Formations, Spells, Martial Arts, are all forms of the Dao.\"","\"Spiritual Power condenses into Skill Patterns, which is a spell; Spiritual Power generates Formation Patterns, which is a formation; Spiritual Power is driven by Blood Qi, transforming into the Strength of fists and feet; naturally, Spiritual Power is driven by Sword Techniques and Spirit Sword, turning into Sword Qi...\"","\"The form of the power changes, but the power itself remains unchanged.\"","Mo Hua spoke with clarity and eloquence.","Patriarch Dugu’s gaze was filled with surprise.","He finally understood why his usually stern junior brother unexpectedly praised this child like a blooming flower.","This insight is truly astonishing.","In swordsmanship, he might be a bit slow, but that is due to a lack of foundation.","Once it involves the realm of Divine Sense, areas he is familiar with, and even the comprehension of the \"Dao\", this child’s insight is so lively it doesn’t seem human...","Patriarch Dugu asked another question, \"How does Spiritual Power form a spell?\"","\"Through the meridians, forming Skill Patterns, condensing into spells...\" Mo Hua replied.","But after speaking, he paused for a moment.","The Patriarch wouldn’t ask such a simple question.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then said slowly:","\"Spiritual Power passes through the Skill Patterns in the meridians, condensing into spells; through the patterns of formations, generating formations... In other words, it is transformed through certain Dao ’Laws’...\"","\"Skill Patterns, Sword Forms, and Formation Formations are all some sort of ’incarnation’ of Dao Laws, using these laws, causing the Spiritual Power itself to produce different Power of Killing...\"","Mo Hua faintly felt as though he had grasped something.","Patriarch Dugu further hinted, \"Your sword cultivation’s weakest point is the inability to condense powerful Sword Qi.\"","\"In other words, your understanding of the law that transforms Spiritual Power into ’Sword Qi’ is too shallow.\"","\"Therefore...\"","\"Therefore,\" Mo Hua suddenly realized, \"use the Dao of Formation to replace the Dao of swordsmanship, use Formation to ’simulate Sword Qi’! Just like I use Sword Control...\"","Patriarch Dugu was taken aback, \"You can also control swords?\"","\"Not really...\" Mo Hua said softly, \"I just practiced it messily by myself for fun.\"","In a certain sense, it is purely \"crooked ways and evil paths.\"","Patriarch Dugu thought for a moment, then understood what Mo Hua had done, nodding in approval:","\"Although it’s not mainstream, your idea is still good, but it cannot be considered orthodox Sword Dao.\"","Mo Hua took it as a compliment from the Patriarch, and smiled shyly.","Patriarch Dugu nodded, then said: \"The principle is such, using Formation to transform into sword, within Divine Thought, it should also be feasible, but I, after all, am not a Formation Master, I don’t know how to exactly make this transformation.\"","\"You can go back and ponder it yourself, if there’s anything unclear, come ask me later.\"","\"Also...\"","Patriarch Dugu took out a jade slip, the jade slip was ancient, with no engravings or markings on its surface, obviously recorded by himself.","Patriarch Dugu said, \"The original scroll of Taixu Mind Transforming Sword True Jue, most have been destroyed, this is what I recorded down, it contains the most complete spell point of Transforming Sword Skill.\"","\"You cannot take this out, just view it here, as much as you can.\"","\"Don’t underestimate ’Transforming Sword Skill’...\"","Patriarch Dugu spoke in a deep voice:","\"In Divine Sword True Sword Art, Transforming Sword Skill is fundamental, the power of all Sword Moves depends on your foundation in Transforming Sword Skill.\"","\"Strong Transforming Sword, then all sword moves are strong.\"","Mo Hua could hardly contain the excitement in his expression, nodding, \"Yes, Patriarch, I will definitely study well!\"","Then he respectfully received the jade slip of \"Transforming Sword Skill\" from Patriarch Dugu.","This is the orthodox canon of Taixu Mind Transforming Sword True Jue.","With a heart full of excitement, Mo Hua caressed the jade slip for a moment, then submerged his Divine Sense into it, row after row of vividly etched words emerged in his mind:","\"Taixu Mind Transforming Sword True Jue · Transforming Sword Skill...\"","\"Sword Qi condensed, with sword manifesting intent, transformed into sword form...\"","\"Transform the sword in hand into the sword in heart.\"","\"High swordsmanship, exquisite Sword Qi, manifest into sword forms, becoming increasingly resplendent...\"","\"Different swordsmanship results in different Divine Thought Sword Forms...\"","\"Different cultivators have different insights into Sword Dao, leading to variations in Sword Transformation...\"","...","Mo Hua quickly skimmed it once, then gradually came to a realization:","\"Sword Dao is also Dao, formations are also Dao...\"","\"First research the outward form, then through the outward form, understand the essence of Sword Qi, which is the law of Spiritual Power transformation.\"","\"The ’laws’ of swordsmanship, my understanding is too shallow, then find ways to use the ’laws’ of Formations to replace Sword Dao, derive Sword Qi.\"","\"This means...\"","Mo Hua only felt he had vaguely realized something, lowered his head in contemplation, to capture the inspiration passing through his mind, after a moment, his thoughts suddenly became clear:","Sword Array!","Use Sword Array as the law!","\"The Sword Array itself, uses formations to derive or amplify Sword Qi, in itself is the presentation of Sword Dao rules in the form of formations.\"","\"This way, comprehending the Sword Array, analyzing the mystery of Sword Array deriving Sword Qi, to a certain extent can also comprehend Sword Intent, thereby compensating for the weaknesses in his own Sword Dao.\"","\"From the perspective of formations, dissect Sword Dao, thus integrating them into one, and Sword Array is the best medium...\"","Mo Hua’s eyes grew brighter and brighter.","Patriarch Dugu also nodded slightly.","This child is indeed wise, basically understanding it with just a hint.","Patriarch Dugu thought for a moment, finally said: \"Sword Cultivators don’t study formations, even if they do, it’s hard to master them. Generally, Formation Masters are not Sword Cultivators.\"","\"Therefore, ordinary cultivators either study swordsmanship or formations, the two are distinct and each learns their own.\"","\"It is rare to find a cultivator who is proficient in swordsmanship and has reached the pinnacle in formations, involving the deeper layers of ’Dao’.\""]},{"number":1779,"title":"Chapter 1779 - 893: Formation and Sword_3","paragraphs":["\"But you are different...\" Patriarch Dugu glanced at Mo Hua, \"Your talent in Formations is rare in the world, and you wish to skip the basic sword studies to learn Divine Thought into Sword.\"","\"In this case, integrating Formation into Sword seems most suitable.\"","\"This path, almost no one has taken it before, and others cannot follow it, so you can only rely on yourself to explore...\"","\"As for how far you will learn, that only depends on you.\" Patriarch Dugu gave Mo Hua a deep look.","Mo Hua nodded seriously: \"Patriarch, rest assured, I will definitely learn well!\"","He seized the time and carefully reviewed the \"Transforming Sword Skill\" from the Taixu Divine Thought into Sword True Technique, memorizing the core contents.","When the time came, Patriarch Dugu tore open the void and sent Mo Hua back to the Disciple’s Residence.","Returning to the Disciple’s Residence, there was still some time before dawn, and Mo Hua couldn’t wait to delve his Divine Sense into the Sea of Consciousness.","He began pondering Patriarch Dugu’s words and also contemplated the iteration of the \"Transforming Sword Skill.\"","Using Sword Array to derive Sword Qi.","He had tried this when controlling the sword.","But before, he only accidentally, through \"tricky calculation,\" altered the form of Sword Control and did not understand the deep principles within.","Now with Patriarch’s guidance, he understood and realized the principles of the Great Dao and the changes of Law, so there was no need to be restricted by external forms.","Divine Thought into Sword can also follow this thinking.","The power of Sword Transformation depends on the cultivator’s foundation and comprehension of Sword Dao.","His Sword Dao is weak, but his Formations are extremely strong.","Thus \"compensate weaknesses with strengths,\" use Formations to substitute Sword Dao, simulate Sword Qi with \"Formation,\" transform Sword Intent.","His foundation in Formations, pointed out by Elder Master Xun, is as solid as a rock.","And Patriarch Dugu’s enlightenment will further transform his Sword Transformation.","Formation and Swordsmanship, fusion on the plane of Divine Thought...","Mo Hua nodded, deciding to give it a try.","In the Sea of Consciousness, Mo Hua sat calmly, beginning to reconstruct his \"Transforming Sword Skill\" based on Patriarch Dugu’s guided approach and his initial realizations.","He first manifested the Gold-Cutting Sword Formation.","This is the core Formation of the Sever Gold Sect’s Sword Dao heritage, currently the only Sword Array he has proficiently mastered.","After manifesting the Sword Array, Mo Hua began to manifest the Sword of Divine Thought, attempting to merge the two.","But after several attempts, he failed.","It seemed easy to say, but actual operation was a completely different matter.","Formation is Formation, Divine Thought into Sword is Divine Thought into Sword, these are entirely two different spell points, not so simple to fuse.","Mo Hua tried many times but still couldn’t do it.","Formation and Swordsmanship are distinctly separate.","Mo Hua did not give up, continuously attempting, but until dawn, there was no progress at all.","The next day, Mo Hua went to study and cultivate, giving up practicing Formation even in his spare time, focusing solely on researching the fusion of Divine Thought Formation and Divine Thought Sword Skill.","Yet, after trying several days, there was still no success.","\"Could this path be unfeasible?\"","Mo Hua frowned, then shook his head, \"Impossible, Patriarch has already guided me, which means, from his Heaven Void insight, the Laws are interconnected, the reasoning is plausible.\"","\"I can’t figure it out, it’s not that Patriarch is wrong, it must be that my approach is problematic...\"","Mo Hua calmed down, then continued his effort, during which he also tried other methods, but without exception, all failed.","Failed too many times, Mo Hua finally stopped and began to reflect.","Fortunately, his experience with Divine Thought and Formation application was extremely rich, after pondering for several days, he gradually became enlightened.","Mo Hua realized he was thinking wrongly before.","It’s not about manifesting Formation and Divine Thought into Sword and then attempting the fusion of the two.","Instead, it should be fused from the very beginning.","As Patriarch Dugu said, the Great Dao is the origin of all things, the myriad techniques in the world, diverse yet converging.","If one wants to fuse Formation and Swordsmanship, one must start from the very beginning.","Fuse from the origin.","But doing so involves \"Divine Soul.\"","And in his Divine Soul, there are still \"hidden dangers.\"","Mo Hua deliberated for a moment and felt he should give it a try.","He took out a bamboo slip, using the Sword Intent on the bamboo slip, and slashed his Divine Soul to \"warn\" the Evil Embryo to behave itself.","Afterward, he summoned the Taoist Stele, utilizing the pressure of the Stele along with the terror of the Robbery Thunder, to intimidate the Evil Embryo.","Only then did Mo Hua feel reassured enough to invoke his Divine Soul.","But he only called upon one part of it and avoided the parasite-infested arrow rest of the Evil Embryo.","After everything was prepared, Mo Hua held his breath and focused his mind to begin integrating the Sword Array into his Divine Soul’s \"Heart Image,\" fundamentally reconstructing his \"Divine Thought into Sword.\"","However, this process was equally mystical and extraordinarily elusive.","The profundity of Formations and the sharpness of Swordsmanship were not easy to unify.","Mo Hua calmed his mind, following Patriarch Dugu’s interpretation of the \"Dao,\" beginning to \"discard the tangible for the intangible\" and \"return to simplicity.\"","He forgot all spell points, sensing the true nature of the \"Dao,\" using Swordsmanship and Formation as rafts, crossing the river with the rafts, achieving the Dao and integrating the techniques.","With this thought, his mind instantly cleared.","In his mind, all sorts of Formation Patterns and Sword Qi rampaged, each acting independently, yet their origins seemed to have a faintly interwoven stance.","Mo Hua’s spirit lifted, using Heavenly Secret Calculation and Tricky Calculation, to constantly derive the integration trajectory of Formation and Swordsmanship in his mind, seeking that trace of \"opportunity\" for fusion.","After what seemed like an eternity, Mo Hua pondered, calculated, and tried numerous times, finally grasping the fleeting opportunity.","This trace of opportunity was like a key that opened a pathway to the Great Dao.","Using the \"Sword Array\" as a medium, Mo Hua began to attempt the initial fusion of Formation with Sword Dao.","His Divine Thought into Sword also started to reconstruct from the ground up...","After a long time, Mo Hua opened his eyes.","In the depths of his eyes, Sword Light flowed, and within this Sword Light, Formation Patterns emerged, intertwining as one.","Mo Hua slowly extended his palm.","A thread of Divine Thought condensed in his hand, forming the Gold-Cutting Sword Formation, then using Sword Pattern as the blade, Sword Core as the bone, gradually manifesting into a Sword of Divine Thought.","This Sword of Divine Thought was a complete Longsword, no longer the previous crude form, and the Golden Light flowed, the Sword Qi razor-sharp to an alarming degree.","This was a complete Divine Thought into Sword!","Moreover, it included the \"Gold-Cutting Sword Formation,\" a Sword of Divine Thought built with Formation as the foundation.","Just looking at it, one would feel the dazzling brilliance of the Golden Light.","The Taixu Divine Thought Sword, the Sword Technique was the same.","Yet different Sword Cultivators who cultivated the same Sword Transformation Technique manifested the Sword of Divine Thought that was an exhibition of their own Sword Dao, each unique.","And Mo Hua’s Sword of Divine Thought was even more unparalleled.","Because in this sword, he infused his own \"Formation Dao.\"","This was a Sword of Formation manifested through Divine Thought!","Mo Hua was ecstatic.","Several days later, in the Sword Tomb.","Patriarch Dugu looked at the golden hue in Mo Hua’s eyes and involuntarily felt astonished and lost in thought.","\"Did this child really figure it out?\"","\"Moreover, it’s only been seven days...\"","Seven days...","Patriarch Dugu’s gaze trembled slightly.","Once dealing with Formations, this child’s perception was surprisingly fearsome to this extent...","Patriarch Dugu found it hard to believe, yet within his heart, that flicker of hope, like a candle in the wind, also began to burn brightly.","Patriarch Dugu gave Mo Hua a few pointers, indicating some shortcomings, and encouraged Mo Hua to ponder more on his own.","Afterward, he sent the jubilant Mo Hua away.","After Mo Hua left, only Patriarch Dugu remained in the Sword Tomb once again.","He sat silently, like a proud yet broken Severed Sword.","After an unknown period, he unwaveringly murmured:","\"Apologies, my dear junior brother...\"","\"I can only pass all this skill to this child. Even if it means he might tread an unrecoverable path, becoming like me, forever haunted by evil spirits, plagued by demon monsters, never having a moment of peace throughout his life...\"","\"Yet, only he alone can be the one to inherit it...\"","\"If not passing it on, then there will never be another opportunity...\"","Patriarch Dugu looked up and sighed.","The chilling moonlight shone, illusionary light and shadow played across his face, blurring his features, as if a \"faceless\" Heavenly Demon devoid of desire, Thought, benevolence or malevolence..."]},{"number":1780,"title":"Chapter 1780 - 894: Sword Dao Transformation","paragraphs":["Back at the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua was still contemplating the matter of using the Sword Array as a medium to fuse Formation and Swordsmanship.","The Laws of fusion between Formation and Sword, he had already begun to grasp.","At this moment, he needed to strike while the iron was hot, and gather various types of Sword Arrays. Through understanding these arrays, he could transform more types of Sword Qi to deepen his understanding of Sword Dao, enhancing the techniques and power of his Divine Thought into Sword.","\"More Sword Arrays...\"","Mo Hua thought for a while, took out the White Bone Broken Sword from the Storage Ring, tapped it on the table and awakened the Sword Bone within it.","\"Sword Bone, which Sword Arrays do you know? Tell me everything!\"","The Sword Bone’s previous identity was the Evil Sword Master within Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, having forged countless Evil Swords in his lifetime. Naturally, he had gathered quite a few Sword Formation Diagrams.","Mo Hua remembered he had once used a Sword Array to tempt Little Wood.","\"This...\" The Sword Bone hesitated.","It didn’t want to agree so quickly; otherwise, it would have no Face. At least it wanted to wait a bit, hesitate for a moment, in order to maintain some control...","Mo Hua saw its hesitation and instantly his face darkened:","\"If you don’t tell me, I’ll feed you to the dogs!\"","The Sword Bone shivered and quickly replied:","\"I have! I have! I have Sword Arrays!\"","It silently scolded itself:","\"Truly a Sword Bone!\"","These days, this little ancestor hadn’t paid attention to it, hadn’t exerted pressure upon it. After a period of peace, it had healed its scars and forgotten the pain, almost forgetting what a tough character this little ancestor was.","Indeed, born from adversity, dying from comfort.","This principle holds for Evil Spirits just the same.","The Sword Bone eagerly said, \"Please wait, let me recall, I will tell you very soon.\"","Mo Hua coldly said, \"Thirty minutes.\"","The Sword Bone nodded repeatedly, \"Yes, yes, thirty minutes is enough.\"","Subsequently, the Sword Bone dared not slack off, and immediately recalled what he had learned all his life, and sent several of the most proficient Sword Formation Diagrams, accurately to Mo Hua’s mind in the form of Evil Thoughts.","Mo Hua then transcribed these diagrams one by one.","These diagrams were all considered \"wool,\" that he had saved according to the plan.","Because he hadn’t used them before, he hadn’t thought of them at the time. Now that the time was right, he went to gather them.","The Sword Bone transmitted them, Mo Hua noted them down.","After a while, Mo Hua stopped writing, and several Sword Formation Diagrams with sharp Sword Patterns and imposing Sword Qi were laid out before him.","The Sword Formation Diagrams consisted of three.","The first one was Taia Sect’s Taia Mountain Opening Sword Formation.","Although named \"Mountain Opening,\" it is not of the same origin as Eight Trigrams Gen Formation, it is actually a Five Elements Earth Element Sword Array.","The Earth is thick and carries things with virtue, endlessly regenerating.","This Sword Array emphasizes the continuity of Sword Qi, being heavy and peaceful, neither fast nor slow, skilled at facing the enemy head-on and exhausting in circular combat.","With this Sword Array, forging Spirit Swords is suitable for the close combat of Sword Cultivators, for close-quarter slaughter.","This counts as one of the orthodox Sword Array heritages of Taia Sect.","Sword Bone once was a disciple of Taia Sect, this Sword Array was also transmitted to him personally by the Elder of the tribe during his cultivation in the Sect.","And Sword Arrays are Sect secrets.","The Elder personally transmitting him the Sword Array must have had high hopes for him.","However, fate played a trick; Sword Bone mistakenly entered the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons and became an Evil Sword Master, helping the tyrant, and now is no longer human, reduced to merely a Sword Demon.","The second one was the Gui Water Sword Formation.","Gui Water Sect colluded secretly with Evil Cultivators, likely this Sword Array was leaked by a cultivator from Gui Water Sect to the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, and then ended up in the hands of the only Evil Sword Master in the valley.","Gui Water Sword Formation is one of the core Sword Arrays of Gui Water Sect, obscure, somewhat sinister, but its power is quite extraordinary.","In Dragon King Temple, when Xiao Zhenhai wielded the Gui Water Sword, it was quite formidable, leaving a deep impression on Mo Hua.","And Gui Water Sect is part of Twelve Streams. Although it committed various unseemly deeds, it is despised by people, but its heritage does have the foundation from Water Prison Sect within it, clearly not ordinary.","This Gui Water Sword Formation, if measured by its intricacy, indeed is a bit inferior to Taia Sect’s Taia Mountain Opening Sword Formation.","But truthfully, it is also considered a top-notch Sword Array.","In Qian Learning State Boundary itself, the Four Great Sects, Eight Great Gates, as well as Twelve Streams, all count as \"elite\" schools. The things that can be passed down, none of them are bad.","This Sword Array, if dropped into Tongxian City, which is full of loose cultivators in a second-grade Small Immortal City, if exposed, it would covet everyone’s desire, immediately causing a storm of bloodshed.","After all, the Fifth Grade Qian Learning State Boundary full of noble families, and second-grade Small Immortal City mixed with loose cultivators, in terms of the foundation of heritage, they cannot be compared at all.","If not for having a master to guide him and coincidentally joining Taixu Gate.","Then even something like the Gui Water Sword Formation would be beyond his reach.","Mo Hua felt a bit emotional, then meticulously kept the Gui Water Sword Formation.","The last one was an unknown Li Fire Sword Formation.","Even worse than Gui Water Array, but still barely usable.","According to Sword Bone, this was during his time in Valley of Ten Thousand Demons when a Monster cultivator unknowingly provoked him, and he killed that Monster cultivator, and from his Storage Bag, retrieved this Li Fire Sword Formation.","It appeared to be from the heritage of a small family outside Qianxue State Boundary.","Sword Arrays themselves are rare, and this Li Fire Sword Formation, with decent quality, was saved by Sword Bone.","\"Altogether three, Taia Mountain Opening Sword Formation, Gui Water Sword Formation, Li Fire Sword Formation...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then asked the Sword Bone: \"Just this little?\"","\"Just this little...\" Sword Bone’s scalp tingled, complaining, \"My little ancestor, do you realize how rare these Sword Arrays are? I spent hundreds of years in Valley of Ten Thousand Demons casting swords, without knowing day and night, and accumulated only these three pieces of the family’s wealth...\""]},{"number":1781,"title":"Chapter 1781 - 894: Sword Dao Transformation_2","paragraphs":["Mo Hua asked, \"Is it truly so rare?\"","\"Naturally,\" Sword Bone remarked wistfully, \"The inheritance of the Sword Dao lies in three aspects: swordsmanship, Sword Qi cultivation, and spirit sword forging.\"","\"Sword Qi and swordsmanship need to be complemented by a spirit sword to achieve maximum power. Without becoming a sword cultivator, one does not yearn for a fine sword.\"","\"Sword forging is also linked with a vast Tao cultivation industry, and at times, the method of forging swords can be even more important than the inheritance of Sword Qi and swordsmanship.\"","\"And the core secret of sword forging is the sword array within the sword weapon. How could it be easily leaked?\"","\"If the sword array falls into outsiders’ hands, extreme sects would issue a pursuit order.\"","Sword Bone spoke with a heavy tone.","Mo Hua was secretly taken aback in his heart.","He had underestimated the complexities involved with the \"sword array.\"","\"Since the sword array is so important, the origins of the sword arrays on myself...\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment...","The Gold-Cutting Sword Formation was something he had secretly learned.","But in the matter involving the Valley of Ten Thousand Demons, Sever Gold Sect \"ceded territory and paid compensation,\" opening a small portion of the Gold-Cutting Sword Formation’s heritage to Taixu Gate.","This way, the Gold-Cutting Sword Formation he possessed now had a \"legitimate path,\" unafraid of being discovered by others.","And the few formations obtained from Sword Bone...","The Taia Mountain Opening Sword Formation, this one belongs to Tai’a Sect.","Now Tai’a Sect has merged into Taixu Gate, so what belongs to Tai’a Sect also belongs to Taixu Gate.","Being all one family, he thinks there’s no harm in studying it.","Even if discovered, at most he would need to pay some merit points, which should resolve the issue.","According to the Sect Leader, he has already reached the limit of merit points for Foundation Establishment disciples, making it more than enough to buy this sword formation.","Of course, this is the worst-case scenario.","With his status as \"Array Leader,\" he likely wouldn’t even have to spend those merit points.","The Gui Water Sword Formation... is also no big deal.","After the Rouge Boat incident, Gui Water Sect underwent a regime change. The sect’s system, as well as its elders and disciples, were thoroughly overhauled by the Central Dao Court.","At this moment, they are too preoccupied to concern themselves with him.","If push comes to shove, he can have Uncle Gu from Taoist Court vouch for him.","Because according to Wang Chen, the overhaul of Gui Water Sect was orchestrated with the help of Uncle Gu and Xia Canonical Official.","Uncle Gu still holds some sway in Gui Water Sect.","The final formation is the Li Fire Sword Formation.","This one matters even less. This sword formation might not even be a heritage within the Qian Learning State Boundary, so learning it should be of no consequence...","Mo Hua sorted through the cause and effect of these sword formations from start to finish, and only then felt at ease.","There’s no other way; matters of heritage can be both trivial and significant.","If no one cares, you can learn as you please, but if someone chooses to pursue it and make things difficult, it could be a massive burden.","It’s best to be cautious.","Mo Hua nodded in agreement, shedding his worries, and planned to continue his studies.","But a moment later, he suddenly recalled something and asked Sword Bone:","\"You were once a disciple of Tai’a Sect, weren’t you?\"","Sword Bone nodded.","Mo Hua continued, \"Is there any unfulfilled wish you have with Tai’a Sect? Now that the Three Sects are unified, with Tai’a Sect and Taixu Gate merged together, if you have any unfulfilled wishes, I might be able to help you fulfill them.\"","In that instant, Sword Bone felt a bit moved.","This little ancestor actually has some humanity...","But it remained silent for a moment, looking at its body forged entirely from white bones, with its dark, hollow eyes revealing a complex expression.","\"There’s no need for that. As the person I once was, I am already dead.\"","\"Let the dead rest peacefully in death; it’s for the best...\"","Mo Hua did not insist, saying, \"Alright!\"","He was merely being polite.","He was so busy, where would he find the time to resolve any cause and effect or grudges for this Sword Bone?","Subsequently, he needed to focus wholeheartedly on cultivating Sword of Divine Thought, wasting not a moment.","Mo Hua resealed Sword Bone, tossed it into his storage bag, and then began to study the three sword formations gathered from Sword Bone.","The sword formations were all second-grade.","Mo Hua was now at the peak of nineteen patterns with his divine sense, possessing profound mastery of second-grade arrays, so learning these sword formations wasn’t too difficult.","After spending two days comprehending, and practicing on the Taoist Stele hundreds of times, he basically mastered it.","After mastering the sword formations, he could further reconstruct the Sword of Divine Thought based on the sword arrays.","In his Sea of Consciousness, Mo Hua closed his eyes, calmed his mind, and internally viewed his divine soul. A strange calculation shadow appeared on his body, and using the vast computational power of his divine sense, he captured the opportunity for the fusion of formations and Sword Dao, beginning to evolve the Sword of Divine Thought using the sword formations he just learned.","After an indeterminate period, Mo Hua opened his eyes and extended his palm.","Strands of dark earthen patterns spread out, intertwining and solidifying into a heavy, endlessly continuous Sword of Divine Thought.","This was the Taia Mountain Opening Sword.","Mo Hua flipped his hand, making the Mountain Opening Sword of the earth series disappear.","A hidden yet sharp Sword Qi emerged, comprised of formation patterns, transforming into a water-blue longsword.","Gui Water Sword!","Then the Gui Water Sword vanished; Mo Hua made a grasping motion, igniting fierce flames in his palm. These flames solidified into explosive patterns, ultimately manifesting into a raging Li Fire Sword.","With a swing of the sword, a bright red flame trail was drawn.","Within moments, Mo Hua had manifested swords of divine thought of the earth, water, and fire series.","Within each sword, a sword array was constructed, containing powerful divine thought power, and adhering to different laws, it wielded divergent killing power of the Dao.","With the Sword of Divine Thought in hand, Mo Hua’s gaze was enlightened and radiant.","Each sword formation could manifest a sword.","Others’ Sword of Divine Thought could only transform into one sword.","But his Sword of Divine Thought could change in myriad ways.","```"]},{"number":1782,"title":"Chapter 1782 - 894: Sword Dao Transformation_3","paragraphs":["The more sword arrays one comprehends, the more mysterious the transformations of the Sword Skill...","\"Patriarch Dugu truly deserves to be the Sword Dao Ancestor of Taixu Gate; his swordsmanship has reached the pinnacle. Just offering me a slight guidance made my Divine Thought into sword become so formidable...\"","Mo Hua was both sighing and admiring.","In his heart, his reverence for Patriarch Dugu was as continuous as the boundless river, unending.","But what he didn’t know was that there was a slight discrepancy with what Patriarch Dugu had envisioned.","Patriarch Dugu himself hadn’t expected that Mo Hua could practice this way, let alone reach such a level...","Several days later, when Mo Hua was in the Sword Tomb, demonstrating to Patriarch Dugu the various \"Sword Transformations\" he had just learned.","Patriarch Dugu’s pupils contracted, his whole person was stunned.","\"One sword array is one sword transformation...\"","Through Mo Hua’s star-like eyes, Patriarch Dugu perceived the Five Elements circulating in his Divine Thought, the ever-changing Sword Intent, and felt a vague sense of trepidation.","He thought of letting Mo Hua merge Formations with Sword Dao, pioneering a new path, hoping he would learn quickly and the resulting Sword of Divine Thought would have significant power.","But he hadn’t expected Mo Hua to learn in such a way.","And now, it wasn’t merely a matter of whether this Sword of Divine Thought was strong; it was an unprecedented, bewildering Sword Transformation.","Divine Thought into sword is the lifetime embodiment of a sword cultivator’s Sword Dao.","A sword cultivator, in his lifetime, integrates only one Sword Dao.","Mo Hua is not a sword cultivator; he doesn’t have a Sword Dao but has created a Sword Dao from the Sword Array and transformed a Sword of Divine Thought.","But precisely because of this, he tends to have \"endless\" Sword Dao.","Using it as an advantage, and utilizing void...","If one day, this boy Mo Hua comprehends enough sword arrays, understands Sword Dao deeply enough, and thoroughly fuses Formations and Sword Dao, then his Divine Thought into sword will be unbelievably powerful.","Just like formations, encompassing countless techniques, embodying infinite Great Daos, with limitless transformations...","This... how can others compete?","Patriarch Dugu, who comes from traditional sword cultivation, frowned deeply.","He pondered again carefully...","This process seems simple, but the intricacies within are as deep as the sea.","It requires top-notch law comprehension, profound formation foundations, strong Divine Sense, and exceptional Divine Sense Control Power, Divine Sense Calculation Power, Divine Sense Perception...","And extremely skillful means of manifesting formations through Divine Sense.","Only then can one manifest a sword array through Divine Thought, and use the sword array as bone to manifest diverse law-based Swords of Divine Thought.","Patriarch Dugu’s eyebrows trembled.","He never thought that the fusion of formations and sword techniques, in Mo Hua’s case, could evolve into such a terrifying existence...","It was just like he performed a small experiment, made a minor change.","Within days, this disciple with mediocre sword talent suddenly transformed into a \"monstrous\" sword Dao entity.","This entity happens to be \"growth-type\".","To transform sword arrays into swords, the bottleneck is not the sword but the \"array\".","The more fearsome the formation is, the more terrifying the Divine Thought into sword becomes.","Speaking of formations, this boy in front of me is the Array Leader towering above all formation geniuses in the Qian Learning State Boundary...","If he truly becomes an Array Formation Master in the future, mastering all techniques, how would his Divine Thought into sword evolve...","One array returning to unity?","Ten thousand swords... return to the sect?","Patriarch Dugu felt his body, stopping itself from trembling.","Only then did he truly realize his junior fellow’s words were correct.","Indeed, the ancestor manifested, and his Taixu Gate picked up a treasure, also picking up a \"monster\"...","Patriarch Dugu’s emotions began to stir violently.","To the extent that his mind started to fluctuate, his Divine Sense became somewhat chaotic.","Patriarch Dugu shifted his Divine Sense, quickly covering his face with his hand.","No one saw that his face, veiled by his hand, turned pale as paper, and his features began fading...","Mo Hua was frightened, quickly asking:","\"Patriarch, what happened to you?\"","Patriarch Dugu’s voice was hoarse, as if cut by a knife, \"Old injuries acting up, let’s call it a day, I’ll send you back first...\"","Mo Hua looked worried, \"Patriarch...\"","\"It’s fine, sitting for a while will do.\" Patriarch Dugu replied.","\"Um...\" Mo Hua nodded.","Then without letting Mo Hua say anything further, Patriarch Dugu reached out to tear through the void, sending Mo Hua away.","A moment of illumination in the pitch-black void.","Mo Hua’s vision flickered, and he returned to the Disciple’s Residence.","Yet his mind was unsettled, with much anxiety in his heart.","\"Ancestor... what really happened to him?\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brow.","\"Old wounds resurfaced?\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, then shook his head helplessly.","Regarding the Ancestor’s matters, even if he wanted to help, he couldn’t.","Heaven Void and Foundation Establishment, worlds apart.","The difference in cultivation between him and the Ancestor was too vast.","Moreover, he didn’t know what exactly was happening with Patriarch Dugu. \"Old wounds\"—what were they...","The more he cultivated, the more he felt his own insignificance.","Mo Hua sighed.","\"Better to focus on what I can do, earnestly practicing swordsmanship...\"","Mo Hua buried this matter deep in his heart, then practiced his sword transformation within the sea of consciousness several times.","Several days later, within the sea of consciousness.","Watching the Sever Gold Sword, Mountain Opening Sword, Gui Water Sword, and Li Fire Sword flowing in his hands, Mo Hua couldn’t help but entertain a thought:","\"Should find something to chop... otherwise, all this sword training would be in vain.\"","Chop what?","Mo Hua immediately thought of the Evil Embryo.","No choice, the Evil Embryo possessed the soul, like a fishbone stuck in the throat, unsatisfied without cutting.","Furthermore, Mo Hua now felt his Divine Thought into sword was much stronger than before, likely posing a certain threat to the Evil Embryo.","Mo Hua clasped his hand, sword patterns spread like spider silk, and then condensed into a sharp Sever Gold Sword of fierce golden aura.","He gritted his teeth, steeled his resolve, and lashed out directly at his Life Soul.","As the sword descended, brilliant golden light cleaved the soul.","A shrill scream echoed.","The voice of the Evil Embryo reverberated in his sea of consciousness again.","\"Damn brat, what the heck are you up to again?!\"","Mo Hua’s eyes brightened.","This Evil Embryo actually spoke after such a long time?","Ever since it was last slashed by the ancient sword intent within the bamboo sword and later schemed against, the Evil Embryo had behaved quite obediently, retreating like a tortoise without showing itself or making any noise.","But now, after being struck by this sword, it finally cried out.","This indicated it felt pain.","Which also indicated his sword had grown stronger!","Mo Hua rejoiced greatly, then hacked at it a few more times.","The Evil Embryo shrieked, \"Damn brat, stop now!\"","How could Mo Hua heed its words? He thrust another sword in return.","The Evil Embryo, helpless, could only resentfully say, \"You ignorant fool, you’ll regret this...\"","Its voice became sinister before retreating back into the divine soul, as before, making no further sound.","The Evil Embryo didn’t scream.","Mo Hua struck several times, without feedback, gradually losing interest.","Afterwards, he pondered further and gradually felt something was amiss.","His current \"Transforming Sword Skill\" indeed fused formations and swordsmanship, becoming stronger, and hurting the Evil Embryo more, but somehow, its damage seemed limited...","Otherwise, this Evil Embryo would’ve long gone desperate.","Mo Hua sensed inwardly, realizing that though striking his divine soul was painful, the injuries on the soul weren’t as severe as that ominous sword intent within the bamboo sword.","In essence, his Transforming Sword Skill, though powerful, was only strong in a general sense.","Strong in the \"Divine Sense\" sense, not \"Divine Soul\" sense.","Damage to the \"origin\" remained negligible, unable to completely eradicate the Evil Embryo.","This won’t do...","At least for him, it’s far from enough.","Mo Hua frowned.","\"I must find a way to become stronger, strong enough to slay this Evil Embryo...\""]},{"number":1783,"title":"Chapter 1783 - 895: God-slaying Dao","paragraphs":["The path I walk is the road of Divine Sense Proving the Dao, as a cultivator of Divine Thought Taoism.","I must strictly demand of myself.","I need to become stronger.","Use the Evil Embryo as a touchstone.","Consider the Evil God as the ultimate opponent.","Slaying the Evil Embryo is a minor achievement, but slaying the Evil God is a major success.","If these standards are not met, it is not considered qualified.","Mo Hua nodded.","Now it seems, with the myriad Sword Array, the Sword of Divine Thought transformed, the iterative \"Transforming Sword Skill\", though powerful, involves a rather weak Origin Power.","Against ordinary Evil Spirits, its killing power is immense.","Yet facing entities like the Evil God, even if victorious, might not necessarily end in death.","Thus, further learning is needed, to acquire advanced sword moves, enhancing the power of the Divine Thought into sword.","And among the Divine Thought into sword True Jue, the most lethal move is ultimately the Divine Thought Sword Form...","Godslaying Sword.","\"Yet...\"","Mo Hua furrowed his brow, took out the Sword Dao Bamboo Scroll given by Patriarch Dugu, observed the ancient Sword Pattern on it, sensed the Sword Intent within, and murmured softly:","\"Using the sword to temper the god, self-slay the Life Soul...\"","Indeed, this is how he practiced.","Using the Sword Intent on the bamboo scroll to temper his Divine Thought, to slay his own Life Soul.","Every day a slay, one sword a day, never stopping.","But after all this slaying, aside from turning the Evil Embryo into a \"shrinking turtle\", and slashing his Life Soul with scars aplenty, there was no other special realization.","Mo Hua just had a vague feeling that he was practicing \"Godslaying Sword\".","But whether this method was correct, effective, or held the essence of the God Slaying Technique, he still was quite unclear...","This problem, Mo Hua studied for a few more days.","But had no additional thoughts for the time being.","Eventually Mo Hua had to admit, that this unknown, profound Sword Dao Skill is definitely not something he could understand by just shutting himself off from others.","He should honestly consult Patriarch Dugu.","Lest he accidentally veers off track again.","Previously, the ancestor didn’t tell him the exact method of the Godslaying Sword, because his Divine Thought into sword wasn’t well controlled.","But now it’s different.","His Transforming Sword Skill, with Sword Array as the foundational structure, has undergone a transformation.","Going to consult the ancestor again, he should teach him a bit more...","...","A few days later, at Taixu Back Mountain.","Sword Tomb Forbidden Land.","Patriarch Dugu was as usual, in good spirits, which allowed Mo Hua to relax slightly.","Then Patriarch Dugu, as usual, explained the Sword Dao to Mo Hua.","After explaining the Sword Dao, Mo Hua seized the opportunity to quietly ask:","\"Ancestor, how is the Godslaying Sword... actually practiced?\"","Patriarch Dugu hesitated slightly, then calmly looked at Mo Hua with eyes full of contemplation.","He knew that before Mo Hua’s questioning might stem from curiosity.","But now with Mo Hua asking again, he couldn’t help but realize that this child had already begun learning the God Slaying Sword Style.","Patriarch Dugu sighed internally.","In all his years, it was the first time he saw someone who could advance so swiftly in learning the Divine Thought into sword True Jue, almost progressing at a rate of a thousand miles in one day...","This is the Taixu Divine Thought Sword.","The deepest Divine Thought Sword Skill of Taixu Gate, and more importantly, a Forbidden Sword Skill...","Patriarch Dugu shook his head.","Oh well...","Evil Monsters are perhaps just like this.","He had begun trying to get used to it.","At this point, there’s no need to hide the ultimate sword move.","Patriarch Dugu’s gaze slightly focused, and he asked: \"Have you looked at the bamboo scroll I gave you?\"","\"I have.\" Mo Hua nodded.","\"What have you discerned?\"","\"There are Sword Patterns on the bamboo scroll, within which there is Sword Intent.\"","\"Do you know what Sword Intent it is?\"","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, shook his head, \"Disciple only knows, this Sword Intent is very ancient, very profound, not overtly powerful, but it seems to contain... a kind of Sword Dao Origin?\"","Otherwise, how could it injure the origin of the Evil Embryo.","Patriarch Dugu furrowed his brows slightly.","Even the Sword Dao Origin can be seen...","Whom exactly did this child learn from to have such deep understanding?","Patriarch Dugu pondered for a moment, slowly nodded, and asked again: \"Do you know what kind of Sword Dao Origin this is?\"","Mo Hua shook his head.","That he did not know.","He was originally a \"Sword Blind\", though he learned quite some Sword Dao knowledge from hanging around Patriarch Dugu these days.","Yet far from reaching the level of discerning the Sword Dao Origin...","Patriarch Dugu nodded solemnly and began speaking slowly:","\"This Sword Dao Origin has a remarkable background, from our Taixu Gate, before the Three Sects divided, extracted from an ancient ’Divine Sword’, a strand of a Sword Technique-like Taoist Meaning.\"","\"Thereafter the ancestors and predecessors of Taixu Gate poured their lifelong Sword Dao knowledge into this Taoist Meaning.\"","\"Dozens of generations of cultivators, thousands of years of painstaking effort, only then did they successfully nurture this extremely precious ’Sword Dao Origin’.\"","Patriarch Dugu spoke solemnly, \"And this Sword Dao Origin can also be called...\"","Mo Hua, hearing this, felt his heart tremble, a term inadvertently surfaced in his mind:","\"Sword Stream?\"","Patriarch Dugu raised his eyes to glance at Mo Hua, his gaze slightly trembling, then nodded approvingly:","\"Correct, it is the Sword Stream, the culmination of Sword Dao within our sect... the source flow of Sword Techniques!\"","Mo Hua felt his heart surging.","Sword Stream...","The thing he was pondering daily and using to slash his Divine Soul was unexpectedly a priceless... Sword Stream?","No wonder this thing was ancient and obscure, exceptionally mystical, could even damage the origin of the Evil Embryo.","And such a valuable Sword Stream was given by Patriarch Dugu to him.","Naturally, not passed down, but accurately ’lent’, temporarily lent for his pondering — but also enough to see the ancestor’s regard for him."]},{"number":1784,"title":"Chapter 1784 - 895: Divine Way of God-slaying (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua was deeply moved in his heart.","At the same time, his emotions were somewhat complex.","He was a Formation Master, but so far, he hadn’t learned \"Formation Flow\" yet, instead, he had first learned \"Sword Flow.\"","It was somewhat like \"doing things backwards.\"","\"Then what is the relationship between this Sword Flow and the ’God Slaying Technique’?\" Mo Hua asked.","Patriarch Dugu asked, \"You walk the path of Divine Sense Proving the Dao, so you should know about evil spirits and ghosts, but do you know about ’deities’?\"","Mo Hua nodded slowly.","He was very familiar with deities.","To count them, he had several \"friends\" who were deities:","An \"old friend,\" Lord Yellow Mountain, a young friend, Little Silver Fish, and a \"bad friend,\" the Great Wilderness Evil God.","Now, the evil embryo of that bad friend was parasitic in his Life Soul.","Patriarch Dugu had no idea that Mo Hua’s network with deities was so extensive.","He simply nodded slightly and said:","\"As long as you understand, there’s no need for me to explain further. In this world, the objects of Divine Thought, evil spirits and specters, are numerous, and above the evil spirits, there are even higher existences, such as deities of heaven and earth, instances of deities falling into evil, ancient Taoist meanings, and domains...\"","Patriarch Dugu paused, didn’t continue, and after a moment of silence, continued:","\"Demon monsters, ghosts, and specters disturb human minds and consume people’s Divine Sense.\"","\"Such evil spirits are formed by Thought, and blood qi and spiritual power cannot harm them in the slightest.\"","\"Cultivating Divine Thought into sword can cut them down.\"","\"But above the evil spirits are heavens and deities. Deities can also degenerate, leaving harm in the human world.\"","\"Humans can slay demons, slay evil, slay ghosts... but can they kill deities?\"","Patriarch Dugu looked at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua hesitated and said, \"They should... be able to slay them, right?\"","Patriarch Dugu shook his head and said, \"Humans are humans, and gods are gods. The power of human Divine Thought cannot slay deities.\"","Mo Hua was stunned.","He pondered for a while and felt something was wrong.","If the power of human Divine Thought cannot slay deities, then how did Lord Yellow Mountain get slain?","If that’s really the case, then aren’t the Evil Gods in the world invincible?","No matter how much they harm the human world, cultivators would be unable to resist.","The patriarch couldn’t possibly not know this...","Mo Hua pondered Patriarch Dugu’s words again and slowly said:","\"The power of human Divine Thought cannot slay deities, so... one needs to use certain spells to surpass the limits of ’humans,’ and thus... be able to slay deities?\"","Patriarch Dugu raised his eyebrows, took a deep look at Mo Hua, and nodded:","\"Exactly!\"","\"Humans are humans, gods are gods; the Divine Thought between them has a vast difference.\"","\"But a gentleman’s nature is not different; good is in using things well.\"","\"Since humans cannot slay gods, then go and learn, comprehend, borrow the Dao of heaven and earth, borrow the laws of all things, create a spell to change one’s Divine Thought, and slay deities!\"","\"This is the God Slaying Technique!\"","Patriarch Dugu’s tone was sonorous.","Mo Hua silently contemplated.","Deities are blessed, born with the Dao.","Cultivators, however, are innately lacking, but through acquired learning of the Dao, enlightenment, and borrowing the Dao, they are capable of slaying deities.","In a sense, this is truly using the weak to overcome the strong, humans slaying gods, humans triumphing over heaven...","Mo Hua’s mind was shaken.","But how exactly to \"enlighten and slay gods,\" Mo Hua was still somewhat confused.","Comprehend the Tai Xu Sword Flow, borrow the Origin Sword Dao, to slay fallen deities?","How to comprehend? How to borrow?","Seeing this, Patriarch Dugu said, \"Do you remember the secret I told you about cultivating the Godslaying Sword?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Refining spirits with the sword, slashing one’s Life Soul.\"","\"These eight words are the key.\" Patriarch Dugu said, \"The power of human Divine Thought cannot slay gods, so one must ’borrow,’ ’borrow’ the Dao Laws, ’borrow’ the powerful Origin Power.\"","\"But the origin of Sword Dao is supremely profound, it is not something that just exists at once.\"","\"The ’Sword Flow’ of Taixu Gate uses a fragment of Taoist meaning within the ancient Divine Sword as the foundation. After generations of cultivators infusing Sword Dao insights, they finally nurtured the Sword Dao Origin with the ’power to slay deities!\"","\"With this Origin, the divine way sword cultivators of Taixu Gate can ’borrow’ the Origin Sword Dao to slay some deities whom human power originally couldn’t harm in the slightest.\"","\"And the form in which this Origin is presented is the Tai Xu Sword Flow.\"","\"Taixu Gate’s cultivators comprehend the Tai Xu Sword Flow, borrow the Sword Dao Origin, and refine their Divine Souls, this is called ’refining spirits with the sword’...\"","Mo Hua suddenly understood and nodded, then asked, \"What about slashing one’s Life Soul?\"","Patriarch Dugu asked, \"Have you comprehended anything about the Tai Xu Sword Flow?\"","Mo Hua was somewhat embarrassed, \"No...\"","He had only sensed a trace of ancient Sword Intent. If the patriarch hadn’t mentioned it, he wouldn’t have realized that this was the sword Dao’s origin stream at all.","And he had comprehended for a long time, actually without understanding any Sword Dao.","\"It’s not your fault...\" Patriarch Dugu sighed, \"Don’t say it’s you; even when I was your age, or even when I reached the Golden Core Realm, I couldn’t comprehend it.\"","\"It’s not just that I couldn’t comprehend it, rather I couldn’t understand it at all...\"","Patriarch Dugu remarked with emotion, \"This is the ancient Sword Flow of Taixu Gate, the sword Dao Origin that is close to the Dao...\"","\"The creation and nurturing of this Origin are at least by ancestors of Taixu Gate’s past who were above the Heaven Void Realm.\"","\"With such profound Sword Dao, how could ordinary disciples possibly learn it?\"","\"Even a Sword Dao genius, if young, without enough time invested in Sword Dao, low realm, and limited perspective, it is fundamentally impossible to grasp the true Sword Flow’s mystical meaning.\"","\"A heritage, if all disciples under it can’t learn it, and only those with the foundation of Feather Transformation or Heaven Void can understand it, no matter how exquisite, no matter how powerful, will eventually be lost.\"","\"Thus, the predecessors of Taixu Gate pioneered an alternative solution, thinking of a method akin to ’cheating’... slashing one’s Life Soul!\""]},{"number":1785,"title":"Chapter 1785 - 895: Divine Way of God-slaying (3)","paragraphs":["Mo Hua’s heart shook.","Patriarch Dugu continued slowly in an ancient voice:","\"An ordinary person wishes to learn from a Saint. But Saints are virtuous, with farsighted vision, while ordinary people have shallow minds, entangled in worldly desires, with impaired understanding. No matter how much they learn, they cannot become a Saint; what will they do?\"","Patriarch Dugu said, \"The only way is to sever oneself to become a Saint!\"","\"Sever the small self, achieve the great self.\"","\"Completely forget oneself, cut off one’s shallowness and pettiness, abandon desires, discard prejudice, and directly transform into a ’Saint’.\"","\"Think as the Saint thinks, act as the Saint acts, and naturally, one can become a Saint.\"","\"This is to sever the small self to achieve the great self.\"","\"The severing of the Life Soul in Sword Dao is the same...\"","\"You are a Sword Dao ’ordinary person’ wishing to achieve the Sword Dao of a ’Saint’.\"","\"But your insight is too shallow, entangled in distractions, your Taoist Heart not strong, and you have various erroneous obsessions with Sword Dao. If you wish to ’become a Saint’, it is as difficult as ascending to heaven. Even once a mistake is made, one will completely deviate onto the wrong path, never to reach the peak of Sword Dao again.\"","\"Therefore, the only way is to sever oneself!\"","\"Sever distractions, sever obsessions, sever errors, sever ignorance, sever the small self’s narrow way, to imitate the ’Saint’, to envision the ’Sword Stream’, to draw near to the Sword Dao’s origin, imprint this origin into the Divine Soul, achieving the true unification of human and sword, soul and Dao, allowing the Divine Soul to complete the transformation in Sword Dao.\"","\"Sever the small self, become the Saint.\"","\"Sever the inferior Dao, achieve the Great Dao of Swordsmanship!\"","\"Sever oneself to become a Saint, sever the soul to achieve the Dao!\"","Patriarch Dugu’s words reverberated in his ears, powerfully resonant.","Mo Hua realized, as if suddenly enlightened, his heart shaken indescribably, unable to calm for a long time.","He remembered Patriarch Dugu’s words in his heart, pondering them carefully.","Yet before he could think deeply, he heard sudden intense coughing.","Mo Hua looked up and saw Patriarch Dugu, with withered hands covering his mouth and nose, brows furrowed, coughing severely.","Mo Hua immediately realized something, worriedly said:","\"Patriarch, your old injury...\"","Patriarch Dugu waved his hand, gradually calming, but his gaze darkened considerably, his voice faded, \"It’s no matter, this happens often...\"","He said it’s common, but Mo Hua had never seen Patriarch cough as tiredly as today before.","It was like... a weary elderly person deeply afflicted by illness.","Mo Hua felt a pang in his heart.","Even as Heaven Void Ancestor, possessing vast cultivation, yet for the Sect, he exhausts himself, alive yet as if buried alive among these countless broken swords, interred in the Sword Tomb...","Mo Hua felt unpleasant.","Patriarch Dugu sensed Mo Hua’s emotions, his gaze gradually softening, and said softly, \"It’s fine.\"","Mo Hua looked somewhat worried.","Patriarch Dugu paused slightly, then asked, \"Do you understand what I just said?\"","Mo Hua finally shifted his thoughts, gently nodding, but moments later, a doubt emerged in his heart.","Mo Hua frowned and asked: \"Patriarch, sever oneself to become a Saint, sever the soul to achieve the Dao, the ’small self’ must be severed, the insignificant swordsmanship must be severed, then all previous sword techniques were learned in vain?\"","Patriarch Dugu shook his head and said: \"Without the small self, there’s nothing to sever, then where does the great self come from?\"","\"Similarly, without learning swordsmanship, even the smallest Sword Dao is absent, naturally there’s nothing to sever, and it’s impossible to advance and comprehend the Sword Dao origin.\"","\"In other words, without the small self, there’s no great self; without one’s own meager Sword Dao, one cannot comprehend the Sword Stream.\"","\"Though the small self is shallow and petty, hindered by demons, desires overflow, full of ignorance and prejudice, it is nevertheless the premise of ’becoming a Saint’.\"","\"Although one’s cultivated Sword Dao is insignificant and shallow, it remains the ladder to achieve the Sword Dao Origin...\"","\"Indeed, all the foundational Sword Dao of Taixu Gate was meant for disciples to cultivate ’small self’, ultimately to cut it off, to draw nearer to the Sword Dao Origin, and achieve the Great Dao...\"","\"So that’s how it is...\" Mo Hua’s heart trembled, realizing suddenly.","If it weren’t for the patriarch telling him, he would never have understood this on his own.","The practice of one’s own Sword Dao is meant to be cut off...","The ancestor’s wisdom is indeed profound and extensive.","Mo Hua pondered for a moment, but then his expression changed, suddenly realizing:","No!","Self-severing of Life Soul, is this the way to ’sever’?","Then I...","Mo Hua weakly asked: \"Patriarch, self-severing of Life Soul isn’t... directly using Sword Intent to ’sever’ one’s Life Soul?\"","\"Use Sword Intent to sever one’s Life Soul?\"","Patriarch Dugu was taken aback, then frowned and said, \"A person’s Life Soul is extremely fragile, how could it bear severing?\"","\"Where is there an idiot who would really ’sever’ their own Life Soul?\"","Mo Hua: \"...\"","He did not want to admit he was that \"idiot.\"","After all this time, he found he had practiced wrong.","Self-severing of Life Soul isn’t truly to \"sever\" the Life Soul.","He misunderstood due to literal interpretation...","Mo Hua couldn’t help but sigh.","Patriarch Dugu observed Mo Hua’s demeanor, thought for a moment, then was stunned, incredulously said: \"You wouldn’t...\"","\"No!\"","Mo Hua denied flatly, resolutely refusing to admit being a \"fool.\"","Patriarch Dugu silently watched Mo Hua, not speaking.","Mo Hua weakly asked again: \"Patriarch, if truly, self ’severed’ the Life Soul, what would happen?\"","\"Truly self-severed Life Soul...\"","Patriarch Dugu drew a sharp breath, frowning, just about to speak, but suddenly his expression froze.","On his ancient face, the features instantaneously transformed into void, as if it was a sheet of white paper.","Multiple shadows of human faces continuously manifested.","Yet this change was silent, and its appearance very brief, lasting only a moment, quickly returning to normal."]},{"number":1786,"title":"Chapter 1786 - 895: Divine Way of God-slaying (Part 4)","paragraphs":["When Mo Hua noticed something strange and looked up, Patriarch Dugu still had the same countenance, even his expression had not changed at all.","\"Self-slaying the Life Soul, it’s no big deal...\" Patriarch Dugu said.","Mo Hua was startled, \"Is it okay?\"","Patriarch Dugu nodded, \"I’ve said it before, you are different from others. Some things others cannot learn, but you can; some paths others cannot traverse, but you can; similarly, self-slaying the Life Soul, others cannot do, but you can...\"","\"The only issue is, self-slaying the Life Soul is not easy, it requires the comprehension of certain special spell points.\"","\"Special spell points?\"","\"Indeed,\" Patriarch Dugu nodded, \"You must comprehend a kind of Dao.\"","\"Comprehend Dao?\" Mo Hua asked curiously, \"What Dao?\"","Patriarch Dugu’s gaze was heavy, and he spoke slowly: \"’Heartless’ Path.\"","\"Heartless Path?\"","Mo Hua’s brow gradually furrowed, the more he listened, the more confused he became.","Patriarch Dugu’s expression was indifferent, without sorrow or joy:","\"Tai Xu God-Slaying Sword, the most important thing is the word ’Slay’, the reason it can slay deities is because it contains Origin Power, infused with the ’Slay and Extinguish’ Dao.\"","\"The Dao of Slay and Extinguish, as the name implies, is to cut off emotions and extinguish desires.\"","\"To sever all worldly sentiments, reaching a state of heartlessness and desirelessness, selflessness and thoughtlessness, without attachment or obsession. Only thus can one truly slay everything, comprehend the supreme Sword Dao, and with mortal thoughts, slay deities.\"","\"This is called, the Supreme Emotion-cutting Dao...\"","Mo Hua was shaken in his heart.","Supreme Emotion-cutting Dao...","Before he could think deeply, Patriarch Dugu continued:","\"This is a great ’Dao’ Law. If you truly cultivate it and integrate this Dao into the Sword Dao, with a heart void, cutting off the self, you can unify with the Human Dao, merge with the ’Slay and Extinguish’ Law, make your body a sword, your soul a sword, with unparalleled edge, nothing in this world can escape your slay!\"","Patriarch Dugu looked at Mo Hua: \"Do you want to learn it?\"","Mo Hua’s emotions surged, and he nodded slowly.","\"Good!\" Patriarch Dugu’s eyes shone, praising, \"Your talent is extraordinary and must not be wasted. I will now teach you the Supreme Emotion-cutting Dao, instruct you on how to comprehend this supreme Dao Law...\"","Patriarch Dugu extended his withered finger and tapped Mo Hua’s forehead.","Instantly, a profound insight, mixed with the transformations of the Dao, accompanied by external realm chants, poured into Mo Hua’s mind.","Among them were various incredible methods of Dao enlightenment.","Mo Hua only felt his heart and mind were clear, experiencing an almost origin-like, merging with the Dao, profoundly mysterious insight.","A spell point of infinite mystery was imprinted in his heart.","Mo Hua immersed himself in comprehension, lost track of time, and slowly opened his eyes, with a moment of void in his gaze before gradually returning to awareness.","\"Did you remember everything?\" Patriarch Dugu asked.","Mo Hua nodded, \"I remembered everything.\"","From the depths of Patriarch Dugu’s eyes, he had high hopes for Mo Hua, and said solemnly, \"Study well, comprehend well. What I have imparted to you is the supreme Dao. Understanding this Dao, transforming the Dao to sword, your Swordsmanship will reach the Pinnacle, slaying all things in the world!\"","Mo Hua’s spirit was invigorated, he bowed thrice to Patriarch Dugu, and respectfully said: \"Thank you, Ancestor, for your kindness in transmitting the Dao.\"","Patriarch Dugu nodded, and then with a comforting expression, sighed: \"Besides you, I have no one else to transmit this to...\"","Mo Hua then bowed to Patriarch Dugu again.","Patriarch Dugu said, \"Alright, go back and comprehend well.\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua said.","Patriarch Dugu tore the void and sent Mo Hua back to the Disciple’s Residence.","After Mo Hua left, within the Forbidden Land.","The night was deep, moonlight bleak, Sword Tomb desolate.","Patriarch Dugu still sat alone, motionless, like a clay sculpture or stone statue.","A moment later, Patriarch Dugu suddenly came to his senses, glanced around, looked at the sky, realized Mo Hua had been sent away, and his pupils suddenly shrank.","\"What exactly did I just... teach him?\"","\"No... It’s those ’things’, what exactly did they teach this child...\"","Patriarch Dugu’s countenance trembled, a chill lurking in the depths of his heart."]},{"number":1787,"title":"Chapter 1787 - 896: Supreme Emotion Cutting","paragraphs":["After returning to the Disciple’s Residence, Mo Hua didn’t rush to cultivation, but instead went over the guidance from Patriarch Dugu in his mind.","He transcribed the key points into a Jade Slip, so he could review them regularly in the future and avoid forgetting.","Afterwards, he formally attempted to practice the \"Godslaying Sword\".","With the guidance from Patriarch Dugu, Mo Hua finally understood:","This Godslaying Sword Style, he had indeed practiced it incorrectly!","The Godslaying Sword is not practiced in the way he had been doing it.","The so-called self-slashing of the Life Soul does not mean actually cutting oneself. This \"slash\" implies abandoning, signifies transformation.","It requires embodying a heart seeking the Dao, abandoning the ego, achieving the greater self, comprehending the Sword Dao origin, and achieving a transformation in Divine Thought and Sword Dao.","Mo Hua felt a complex mix of emotions, and then took out an ancient and simple Sword Dao Bamboo Scroll.","On the bamboo scroll, the Sword Pattern was simple yet profound.","The ancient Sword Intent roamed amidst the Sword Pattern.","This is the Sword Stream...","Mo Hua held his breath, focused his mind, sat in meditation, fully concentrated, and then began to formally visualize the \"Tai Xu Sword Flow\" engraved on the bamboo scroll.","By abandoning self, forgetting his own Sword Dao, with a heart of emptiness, he visualized the Tai Xu Sword Flow, comprehending the Sword Dao origin, thus approaching the source flow of the sword, fully understanding the Tai Xu Sword Dao.","After fully understanding the Sword Dao, he could follow the ancestor’s words, integrating the Sword Dao origin into his Divine Soul, executing the true, powerful, and god-slaying \"Tai Xu God-Slaying Sword\"!","Mo Hua’s Divine Sense sublimation was extremely deep-rooted, proficient in Formation and various Divine Thought Skills, having also absorbed a large number of Evil Spirits, through meditation, purged a massive amount of cluttered thoughts.","He had even dabbled a little in \"Planting Devil in Taoist Heart\".","Therefore, in terms of \"Cultivating Heart\" foundation, Mo Hua was stronger than many Golden Core Cultivators hundreds of years old.","\"Abandoning ego, forgetting the Sword Dao, heart in emptiness, visualizing Tai Xu Sword Flow,\" he did all this with ease.","But the problem lay in what came next.","Mo Hua visualized for a long time...","Within the Tai Xu Sword Flow, the ancient Sword Intent remained exactly as it was, without the slightest change.","Mo Hua did not feel the sensation of \"Sudden Enlightenment\".","His Sword Dao level was still as shallow as ever.","His comprehension of swordsmanship hadn’t improved in the slightest.","Mo Hua focused intently, staring at the bamboo scroll for a long time, finally having to admit that he had done it all for nothing...","He couldn’t understand the Sword Stream.","Nor did he gain insight into Sword Dao.","Mo Hua assumed it was because he hadn’t put in enough effort.","On the next day, after class, Mo Hua returned to the Disciple’s Residence and stared at the bamboo scroll for a full three hours.","Yet he still couldn’t make anything out.","The so-called Sword Stream’s profound meaning, Sword Dao origin, Swordsmanship Great Dao... there wasn’t a bit of shadow of them.","Mo Hua furrowed his brow, then, after some reflection, gradually understood.","The problem lay in this \"self\".","Slay the self, achieve the Sword Dao.","But Mo Hua didn’t even have a \"self\".","The \"self\" in Sword Dao is the foundation accumulated by a Sword Cultivator from childhood, nurturing the Spirit Sword, practicing swordsmanship, comprehending the Sword Dao, and so on, forming the \"foundation\" of Sword Dao.","This is what Heaven Void Ancestor called the \"self\", but in reality, it is not small at all!","Mo Hua put himself in the shoes of Patriarch Dugu, roughly gauged that starting from scratch, to cultivate the Sword Dao to the \"self\" realm in the ancestor’s eyes...","That would require a genius like Linghu Xiao, starting Sword Cultivation from a young age, practicing for several decades, even up to a hundred years, reaching Golden Core, Sword Dao reaching a minor accomplishment, only then could one cultivate the \"self\" of Sword Dao.","This kind of \"self\" is qualified to be slashed.","And using such a realm of \"self\" as a foundation, as a stepping stone, after slashing it, one can climb further up, to comprehend the Sword Stream, to ascend to the Sword Dao origin.","Mo Hua felt his heart chill.","He finally understood why the ancestor had always told him to cultivate the sword, and said that his Sword Dao foundation was insufficient, thus unable to learn Divine Thought into Sword.","The ancestor was actually not wrong.","The Divine Thought into sword True Jue is fundamentally built upon the \"Sword Dao\" foundation.","If the Sword Dao foundation is insufficient, the sword cannot be formed.","If the Sword Dao attainment isn’t deep, if the swordsmanship hasn’t reached a minor accomplishment, then one cannot slash the self at all, cannot comprehend the Sword Stream, and cannot learn the final \"God Slaying Technique\".","And currently, he didn’t even have the \"self\" in Sword Dao to be slashed.","Nor could he dream of comprehending the Sword Stream, the origin, or the Great Dao...","\"After all this effort, still can’t learn it...\"","Mo Hua sighed, somewhat disappointed.","On further thought, it’s actually quite reasonable.","The Tai Xu Divine Thought Sword True Jue is the highest sword technique in the Taixu Gate’s Sword Dao, if it were truly so easy to learn, it wouldn’t be worthy of being considered a \"supreme\" heritage.","Moreover, he wasn’t even a Sword Cultivator.","To attempt learning a supreme Sword Dao heritage without any Sword Dao foundation was indeed a bit fanciful.","But Mo Hua didn’t want to give up.","He pondered repeatedly, discovering yet another \"deadlock\".","To cultivate the Godslaying Sword, one must self-slash the Life Soul;","To self-slash the Life Soul, one needs to slash the self;","And to slash the self, one must cultivate a realm of Sword Dao \"self\" to slash...","He didn’t have this realm of Sword Dao \"self\", thus there was nothing to slash, unable to proceed from the very start.","Mo Hua felt a complex and indescribable emotion.","This Godslaying Sword, he had practiced into a complete mess.","The legitimate way, he couldn’t manage.","The way he practiced, not only was it incorrect, but it also injured his Divine Soul.","Every day self-slashing a sword, the injuries in the Divine Soul accumulated quietly, eventually requiring \"Divine Marrow\" for repair.","And \"Divine Marrow\" is now exceedingly scarce, needed not only for Divine Soul repair but also for breaking through the Foundation Establishment Late Stage.","All things considered, it’s a vicious cycle.","Without learning the Godslaying Sword, the day to slay the Evil Embryo seemed indefinitely distant."]},{"number":1788,"title":"Chapter 1788 - 896: Supreme Emotion Cutting_2","paragraphs":["Unable to eliminate the Evil Embryo, unable to convert calamity into Divine Marrow, unable to further Dao Hua the Divine Thought, it’s uncertain when I can break through the Foundation Establishment Late Stage...","Mo Hua felt slightly numb on his scalp, couldn’t help but sigh.","But merely sighing is useless, the Dao must still be cultivated, the Sword must still be practiced, and life must still go on.","\"Next time I go to the Forbidden Land, I’ll consult the Ancestor again...\"","Mo Hua forcibly put this matter aside, calmed his mind, and continued his cultivation lessons.","Two days passed like this.","Mo Hua got up in the morning, followed the routine of cultivation, and after finishing his training, he took out the bamboo slip as usual. Using the Sword Intent on the bamboo slip, he slashed at his own Life Soul, to suppress the Evil Embryo and refresh his mind.","This set of actions was entirely due to inertia.","But after slashing, Mo Hua suddenly realized that he no longer needed to slash.","The God-slaying Sword isn’t practiced like this.","It’s not about truly slashing the Life Soul.","Mo Hua sighed again, feeling somewhat agitated, then submerged his Divine Sense into the Sea of Consciousness to check the injuries on his Divine Soul.","Fortunately, his Divine Soul, having been slashed for so long, was accustomed to it. Though there were injuries, they weren’t too severe.","Mo Hua breathed a sigh of relief, then inwardly viewed with his Divine Sense, and glanced at his Divine Soul.","On the soul, sword marks remained, mottled like fish scales.","These were all Mo Hua’s own \"masterpieces,\" left from daily self-slashing.","\"Sometimes being too diligent seems not to be a good thing...\"","Mo Hua muttered in his heart, and then intended to exit the Sea of Consciousness.","But just at this moment, Mo Hua caught a glimpse, suddenly froze.","He saw that on the wound of his Divine Soul, Sword Intent remained.","This was nothing unusual.","Using Tai Xu Sword Intent to slash his own Divine Soul, while leaving a wound, would naturally also leave some Sword Intent on the wound.","This was originally a normal thing.","However, looking at it now, Mo Hua felt his heart tremble violently, as if an astonishing thought slowly hovered in his mind...","\"Using the Sword to quench the soul, self-slashing of the Life Soul... Slash the ego, observe the Sword Stream, comprehend the origin, integrate the Sword Dao...\"","\"Self-slashing of the Life Soul is a means; the ultimate result is to integrate the Sword Dao origin into the Divine Soul...\"","\"If that’s the case...\"","Like a bolt from the blue, Mo Hua’s expression shook:","\"Then using the Tai Xu Sword Intent to slash my own Divine Soul, doesn’t it mean... I’ve engraved the Sword Intent in the Divine Soul?\"","\"Sword Intent contains the Sword Dao origin.\"","\"This also means, am I engraving the Sword Dao origin... into my Divine Soul through the sword marks and wounds?\"","\"Afterwards, as long as I thoroughly integrate this origin with the Divine Soul, won’t the final effect be the same?\"","The difference is, the orthodox practice of the God-slaying Sword is to first cultivate the \"ego\" Sword Dao, then slash the ego, to comprehend the Sword Stream, integrate the Sword Dao.","While I skipped all the steps from cultivating the \"ego\" to comprehending the Sword Stream, directly reaching the integration of the Sword Dao!","The absence of the ego’s Sword Dao, doesn’t matter.","Not understanding the Sword Stream, has no impact.","The inability to comprehend the Sword Dao origin, doesn’t matter either.","All these steps are discarded, directly using Sword Intent to self-slash.","Sword Intent self-slashing engraves sword marks on the Divine Soul, leaving wounds.","Thus, the Sword Dao origin in the Tai Xu Sword Flow can naturally integrate with your Divine Soul along with the wounds!","This is a form of \"cheating\" even more thorough than \"slashing the self to become a saint!\"","And this \"cheat,\" only I can do...","Others can’t withstand the slashing of Tai Xu Sword Intent.","But I can.","Others can’t repair the injuries of the Divine Soul.","But I can.","And the Tai Xu Sword Flow, I don’t need to comprehend it, as long as I integrate the Intent into my Divine Soul, I can directly use it.","The Ancestor himself said, \"The gentleman’s nature is not different, he is adept at utilizing external things.\"","To seek the Great Dao with the method as a raft.","Having gained the Great Dao, discard the method and raft.","Form matters not.","Mo Hua’s heart beat rapidly.","Until now, he truly sensed that the gate to the secret of the God-slaying Sword was gradually opening to him.","With the decision made, Mo Hua immediately concentrated, visualizing himself.","With Divine Thought introspection, perceiving the wounds on the Divine Soul, while also perceiving the Sword Intent within the wounds.","The wounds were fragmented, with stabbing pains.","The Sword Intent was profound, hard to erase, within which the Sword Dao origin persistently circulated.","Mo Hua endured the severe pain, directly integrating the Sword Intent through the wounds into his Divine Soul.","This process was extremely painful, but Mo Hua gritted his teeth.","The ancient Sword Intent seeped into the wounds of the Divine Soul, bringing pain, but gradually merged with Mo Hua’s Divine Soul.","Like blades flowing into flesh, circulating internally.","But these \"blades\" also resembled ancient Immortal Pill; with each circulation, a strand of Sword Intent transformed, blending seamlessly with Mo Hua’s Divine Soul.","This was the ancient Sword Dao origin of Taixu Gate, after Dao Hua with Mo Hua, comparable to the deity’s Divine Soul fusion.","Mo Hua’s Divine Thought into sword True Jue also finally began to truly step into the Realm of \"God-slaying.\"","Afterwards, only one sword needs to be slashed every day, tempering a portion of the origin, accumulating over time.","Integrating the Sword Dao origin into the flesh of the Divine Soul, tempering the God-slaying Sword.","Tempering until the true \"God-slaying Sword\" is born...","That day will also be the deadline for the Evil Embryo.","Mo Hua was mentally invigorated, eyes shining brightly.","Then according to the method he summarized, he tempered his Divine Soul for a while more, then temporarily stopped.","Because it was truly too painful.","Using Tai Xu Sword Intent to slash his own Divine Soul is painful enough.","Now having to integrate the Sword Intent fragments into the \"flesh\" of the Divine Soul, felt somewhat like \"lingering death.\"","Therefore, it can only be done step by step, not too hastily."]},{"number":1789,"title":"Chapter 1789 - 896: Supreme Emotion Cutting_3","paragraphs":["Mo Hua rested for a while, recovering his Divine Sense.","Now the cultivation of the Godslaying Sword had entered the right path, and only then did Mo Hua have time to consider another issue...","\"Supreme Emotion-cutting Dao...\"","Mo Hua murmured softly with furrowed brows.","This was the other \"Supreme Great Dao method\" passed to him by the Heaven Void Ancestor that night in the Sword Tomb Forbidden Land.","Mo Hua didn’t really dare to learn it.","He felt there was something wrong.","The Tai Xu God-Slaying Sword and Supreme Emotion Cutting Dao seemed somewhat similar, but upon further reflection, they were completely different styles.","One was a profound and upright Sword Dao.","The other was an emotionless, detached and peculiar spell point.","In the current Sword Dao Profound Meaning of Taixu Gate, Mo Hua had never seen any record similar to \"Emotion Cutting\".","\"And why did the Patriarch Dugu suddenly teach me this thing?\"","Mo Hua knitted his brows in recollection.","The Ancestor seemed normal that night, but his speech always carried a sense of discord.","On the Ancestor’s part... has something happened?","The person who \"preached\" to him that night, was it actually the Ancestor himself?","Could something, not a mere person, circumvent the powerful Heaven Void Ancestor to preach to him?","Mo Hua’s brows furrowed tighter and tighter.","Things were becoming more mysterious...","But the method was already taught, so now the question is whether he should learn this \"Supreme Emotion Cutting Dao\".","Mo Hua recalled the spell point of \"Emotion Cutting\", one by one, and finally had to admit it was an extremely profound, extremely rare, and extremely powerful \"Law\".","After cultivating it and comprehending its Dao, maybe he can truly sever emotions with one Thought, cleave mortal bonds with One Sword, and \"cut\" anything.","But Mo Hua always felt there was something wrong with this spell point.","The problem lies in the words \"Emotion Cutting\".","Humans have emotions, which is what makes them human; if emotions are cut, and one becomes emotionless and desireless, is one still considered human?","Not being human anymore, what’s the use in comprehending Dao?","Even if Dao is comprehended, what sort of Dao would it be to comprehend it in a \"Non-Human\" state?","\"Could the Ancestor... be deceiving me?\"","\"Or is there something malevolent secretly tricking me?\"","\"Should I still learn it?\"","...","Mo Hua stroked his chin, pondered for a moment, and felt he should... try to learn it first, as this is a method of \"comprehending Dao\".","But he couldn’t learn it in its entirety, because there’s surely some mystery in it.","Take its essence, discard its dregs.","Simply put, it’s learning by observation.","The \"Emotion Cutting\" profound meaning taught by \"Patriarch Dugu\" echoed in Mo Hua’s ears:","\"Empty the heart, sever the self; integrate Human Dao and unify with the Law of ’Elimination’, use the body as a Sword, the soul as a Sword, unmatched sharpness, there’s nothing in this world that can’t be cut!\"","This sounds very strong, it can be learned.","But \"cut off all worldly emotions, achieve a state of emotionless and desireless, selfless and Thoughtless, free from imagination and attachment...\"","This phrase is a bit peculiar, can be learned by observation.","Mo Hua then tried to cultivate the \"Supreme Emotion Cutting Dao\" based on these spell points.","He began to cut away his emotions.","No thoughts, no imagination; no attachment, no Thought; no heart, no ego...","Cutting emotions...","His expression gradually changed from gentle to indifferent, even containing a hint of icy ferocity.","It seemed that everything in this world was a hindrance to his pursuit of Dao, and everyone had to be cut.","He himself, his relatives, his friends, his mentors, the one he loved, all had to be cut and killed...","Only by cutting and killing everything could he attain Dao.","Mo Hua couldn’t help but murmur softly:","\"Only by cutting and killing everything... can I attain Dao...\"","\"Cutting and killing everything...\"","\"Cut...\"","Mo Hua’s mind blanked, his expression twisted momentarily, then began to blur, his features dissolving like makeup being washed away...","\"No!\"","Moments later, Mo Hua suddenly awoke.","He covered his face, cutting off all Thoughts, and forcibly stabilized his mind with Meditation Technique.","It took a full 30 minutes to recover from the mindset of \"Emotion Cutting comprehend Dao\".","Mo Hua felt lingering fear.","\"This thing is powerful, but also terrifying...\"","He almost really cut away all his emotions.","Mo Hua furrowed his brow.","Once emotions are cut, self-perishes, and Divine Thought loses control, he dared not imagine what he would become.","\"Emotion-Cutting...\"","Mo Hua pondered deeply.","Emotions can be cut a little, but not entirely.","\"Emotion Cutting\" is for comprehending Dao, not truly for cutting emotions.","If truly all are cut, and one doesn’t remain a person, the problem would definitely be greater.","He grasped this understanding during the fusion of Divine Marrow, Divine Sense Sublimation, integrating Divinity and humanity.","Since Divinity and humanity can be integrated, the \"Emotion Cutting\" Dao should also be integrable.","\"Can’t cut everything, some emotions must be kept...\"","\"Remember the nurturing grace of parents...\"","\"Never forget the teaching grace of the mentor...\"","\"The uncles and aunts in Tongxian City and friends met along the way, the senior brothers and sisters and Junior Brother of Taixu Gate, Sect Elders, Elder Master Xun and Heaven Void Ancestor...\"","\"And Aunt Wan, Yu Er, Uncle Gu...\"","After considering all this, Mo Hua realized there truly were many people he needed to remember...","Interacting with people, generating affection, these are also the foundation of a person’s emotional existence.","If forsaken, one would sooner or later lose their original heart, becoming hollow and numb.","\"Need to find an anchor point...\"","But, along this way, there are too many people he needs to remember, Mo Hua couldn’t quite find an \"anchor point\" to determine the extent of \"Emotion-Cutting\".","The bonds with parents and mentors are too deep.","Because the ties are too deep, even if emotions are cut, they would be the last \"cut\", not so easily forgotten."]},{"number":1790,"title":"Chapter 1790 - 896: Supreme Emotion Cutting_4","paragraphs":["But once truly forgotten, it also means that, unconsciously, one has cut through to the origin.","It means one’s human nature is beyond salvation, and by the time they wish to turn back, it will be too late.","Others can also serve as ’anchor points’ for emotionless cutting, but Mo Hua is always afraid that being too busy, he might inadvertently truly ’cut’ them.","Once cut, the ties of affection are severed, and they are completely forgotten.","If they meet again by chance, while others recognize him, he would feel awkward for having secretly cut the ’affection’ and completely forgotten them.","\"Who should I use as the ’anchor point’ for emotionless cutting...\"","Mo Hua felt conflicted, pondered for a long time, then suddenly thought of a good idea:","\"Senior Sister!\"","Using Senior Sister as the anchor point for cultivating the ’Supreme Emotion-cutting Dao.’","While cultivating, occasionally think of Senior Sister.","If the feelings dwindle, it indicates something went wrong with the practice.","If the feelings remain, it means that one’s ’human nature’ still exists, and the human bond has not been extinguished.","As long as human nature and the heart to pursue the Dao remain, there is no problem.","Among other aspects of human nature, there is indeed a lot of ’chaff’ that can be cut.","Greed, anger, foolishness, grievances.","The heart flutters like a mayfly, desires surge like the sea.","Other various distracting thoughts about fame and fortune can all be cut.","After cutting these miscellaneous desires, washing away the dust, seeing through the surface, the Taoist heart becomes clear and the resolve grows firmer.","By cutting emotions this way, one could cultivate the ’Supreme Emotion-cutting Dao’ that appears emotionless but is not.","Mo Hua felt joy in his heart, but then his brow furrowed.","But then, does this mean I’ve practiced wrongly again?","Mo Hua considered it for a moment, deciding it didn’t matter.","\"As long as I can practice, it’s fine...\"","After all, it’s not like it’s the first or second time.","After going astray so many times, one gets used to it.","With this thought, Mo Hua felt at ease.","Then he began to seriously cut emotions and comprehend the Dao, cutting his own emotions according to the method passed on by Patriarch Dugu.","After cutting for a while, he would meditate on Senior Sister.","If the emotions haven’t faded, it means the cutting was correct.","If the emotions felt faded, he’d pause and reflect on the recently used ’emotion-cutting’ method to see if something was wrong.","Until the image of Senior Sister’s pure and peerless beauty appeared clearly in his mind, then he would continue to cut emotions and comprehend the Dao.","Seeking natural law, preserving human nature.","In this way, with ’Senior Sister’ as the anchor point, Mo Hua’s cultivation of the ’Supreme Emotion-cutting Dao’ deepened bit by bit...","Of course, he hadn’t forgotten the Tai Xu God-Slaying Style either.","Every morning, he would first use the Tai Xu Sword Flow to cut his Life Soul, allowing the Sword Dao Origin to deeply merge with his Divine Soul.","At night, he would then cultivate the ’Supreme Emotion-cutting Dao.’","Following this supreme ’enlightenment’ method, he comprehended the Dao of ’emotion-cutting,’ and then merged this Dao of emotion-cutting into Divine Thought into sword.","In this way, he simultaneously cultivated the ’Tai Xu God-Slaying Sword’ and the ’Supreme Emotion-cutting Dao.’","Both of these methods he stumbled upon by chance, and now mixed together in cultivation, Mo Hua wasn’t quite sure what the outcome would be. But after thinking it over, he believed it shouldn’t be too weak.","At least there was hope in cutting an evil embryo.","Mo Hua slightly nodded.","His requirements weren’t too high; as long as he could cut the evil embryo, it would be fine...","...","In Tao Cultivation, there is no concept of time.","With the addition of two new ’cultivation’ methods, Mo Hua’s time each day became more strained, and his tasks heavier.","He had to cultivate, attend classes, and teach formation classes to the lineage of Three Mountains with thousands of Junior Brothers and Sisters.","During breaks, he had to study formations, learn the Godslaying Sword, and cultivate the Emotionless Path.","Mo Hua, with no distractions, focused on cultivation, momentarily unaware of other matters.","But on this day, as Mo Hua was cultivating the Supreme Emotion-cutting Dao, suddenly, in the boundless void, cause and effect stirred.","The pale and bloodstained face of Gu Changhuai suddenly floated into his mind.","Mo Hua was stunned.","\"...Uncle Gu?\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment, felt something was off, then took out a Letter Token and sent a message to Gu Changhuai:","\"Uncle Gu, are you alright...\"","There was no response.","Mo Hua patiently waited for a long time, but Gu Changhuai still didn’t reply.","\"What’s going on...\"","Mo Hua frowned, remembering during the festival at the Gu family when Uncle Gu mentioned the blood-sucking Demon Sect, a dozen Golden Core Demon Cultivators, and the matter of the Taoist Court gathering people to encircle and suppress demon cultivators.","\"Is he carrying out a Taoist Court mission, unable to use the Letter Token, or...\"","\"Uncle Gu, he won’t be in any trouble, will he...\"","A sliver of unease grew in Mo Hua’s heart.","...","Nightfall descended.","In Qingzhou City.","Several cultivators of the Gu family, driving a carriage, hurriedly rushed towards their destination, covered in blood, eyes filled with anxiety, foreheads beaded with cold sweat.","Once the carriage entered the city, it raced all the way to the Gu family residence. One person immediately jumped off the horse, disregarded everything else, and hurriedly called out:","\"Quick! Someone! Go fetch the Elder Dan Dao!\"","The previously tranquil Gu family immediately became a scene of uproar.","Moments later, the Gu family’s Danshi Elder arrived, lifted the blood-reeking carriage curtain, and was met with a sight full of bloodstains.","And lying in the carriage, the half-soaked in blood Taoist Robe, pale-faced and unconscious Gu Changhuai.","His forehead was deathly black.","\"Evil Qi has entered the brain, the forehead is pitch black...\"","The pupils of several Gu family Elders trembled instantly, their hearts chilled to the core.","\"This is... Death Omen...\""]},{"number":1791,"title":"Chapter 1791 - 897: Dispelling Evil Qi","paragraphs":["In the study of the Gu Family Master, Gu Shouyan.","Gu Shouyan sat like a mountain, with a frown on his brow.","Gu An and Gu Quan bowed their heads and said:","\"... The Taoist Court was executing a mission, encircling a Demon Sect stronghold on a desolate mountain three hundred miles west of the Third Grade Maling City, but fell into an ambush...\"","\"Fortunately, the young master was cautious, laid out a meticulous plan in advance, and during the battle, led by example. Together with Xia Canonical Official, they suppressed the Golden Core Great Demon Cultivator on the opposite side, thus stabilizing the situation.\"","\"Later, reinforcements arrived, and after a fierce battle, they managed to completely annihilate this branch of the Demon Sect. But before dying, that Golden Core Great Demon Cultivator unexpectedly...\"","Gu An paused, gritted his teeth and said, \"Unexpectedly threw himself at the young master, even detonated his Golden Core to perish together with the young master...\"","\"The explosion of the Golden Core was extremely powerful.\"","\"The young master did not retreat, directly withstood the self-destruction of this Golden Core Demon Cultivator, protecting the Gu Family disciples and most of the Taoist Court cultivators, but he...\"","Gu An and Gu Quan looked guilty and pained.","Gu Shouyan, after listening, remained expressionless and only nodded, saying, \"I understand, you may leave now, take good care of your injuries.\"","Gu An hesitated and said, \"What about the young master...\"","Gu Shouyan waved his hand.","Gu An and Gu Quan did not dare to say more, paid their respects, and then withdrew.","In the study, only Gu Shouyan remained.","With no one around, he finally let out a deep sigh.","\"A good seedling... but, unfortunately, so many calamities. Whether he lives or dies depends on his own fortune...\"","...","Inside the Gu Family Pill Pavilion.","The door to the inner room was tightly closed, and several Danshi Elders were inside urgently saving the severely injured Gu Changhuai.","Elder Gu Hong waited outside.","She was not a Pill Master and couldn’t help, so she could only wait outside at this time.","After a while, a gentle woman in palace attire hurried over, her expression anxious. Upon seeing Gu Hong, she clutched her sleeve, her face pale, and said:","\"Aunt, where is Changhuai?\"","Elder Gu Hong sighed and said, \"The elders are already treating him.\"","\"How is he then...\"","Wenren Wan’s face was full of worry.","Elder Gu Hong wanted to say some comforting words, but remembering Gu Changhuai’s injuries and the dark deathly color between his brows, she ultimately shook her head and sighed, \"We’ll see what the heavens decide...\"","Wenren Wan’s face turned pale, her heart felt as if it was being cut by a knife.","This younger brother, she had raised by her side since childhood, she watched him grow up.","After a moment, she looked at Elder Gu Hong almost pleadingly, her voice trembling, \"Aunt, Changhuai, he won’t...\"","Elder Gu Hong patted her hand, her heart a bit sorrowful, and said with reflection:","\"The disciples of the Gu Family all share this fate.\"","\"Our Gu Family has served in the Taoist Court for generations, capturing Sin Cultivators, eradicating Evil, exterminating the Demon Path, all of it is licking blood off the knife’s edge, injuries and even sacrifices are common.\"","\"As a child of the Gu Family, one must have this awareness, Changhuai is no different.\"","\"Now that things have happened, no words are useful, it depends on Changhuai and his own blessings...\"","Wenren Wan pressed her lips tightly, her fingers turning white.","Elder Gu Hong felt equally heartache.","Despite her words, when it comes to her own nephew, suffering such serious injuries, bleeding on the bed, life or death unknown.","As an aunt, she still felt physical pain.","Time passed, Gu Hong and Wenren Wan waited outside all along.","The atmosphere became more oppressive, their hearts more anxious, and time increasingly difficult to endure.","Finally, after an unknown period, the door to the inner room opened, and several Danshi Elders came out.","Elder Gu Hong immediately stood up, her voice slightly trembling, \"How is it?\"","The several Danshi Elders frowned, but for a moment, couldn’t express clearly.","Elder Gu Hong was a bit angry and said, \"Speak!\"","A Danshi Elder gave a bitter smile and said, \"It’s hard to say... the bleeding is stopped, and life is temporarily sustained, but the root of the ailment cannot be addressed...\"","Elder Gu Hong frowned, \"What do you mean?\"","Another Danshi sighed, \"Young Master Changhuai’s injuries are twofold, in the flesh and in the brain. For the flesh wounds, one needs to replenish blood, repair meridians, strengthen the roots, and eliminate the Demonic Qi... these have ways to address.\"","\"But in the young master’s mind, it seems to have been invaded by an unknown Evil Qi, this Qi is extremely fierce, polluting the Young Master’s Sea of Consciousness. We Pill Masters are powerless...\"","\"For now, we can only use some methods to temporarily sustain the young master’s life.\"","\"But even if the external wounds were healed, without removing the Qi, it would...\"","This Danshi paused, hesitant to continue out of consideration.","Impatient, Elder Gu Hong said, \"Don’t hide the diagnosis, speak up!\"","The Danshi hesitated for a moment, then sighed, \"If the Qi is not removed... once the Evil Qi completely pollutes the Sea of Consciousness, even if life is sustained, it would be useless, he won’t survive more than two to three days...\"","Upon hearing this, both Elder Gu Hong and Wenren Wan turned utterly pale.","Elder Gu Hong quickly asked, \"Then how can we expel the Qi?\"","The Danshi said, \"Expelling this sort of Qi is a bit mystical, beyond the realm of flesh and Spiritual Power, nor does it belong to the way of Alchemy Doctor.\"","\"We Pill Masters can at best refine some pills for calming the mind.\"","\"These pills can only calm and soothe the mind, not address the root cause. They are useless against true malevolent Qi.\"","\"Then who can cure it?\" Elder Gu Hong asked.","The Danshi frowned and said, \"I’ve only heard, to deal with this kind of ’Evil Qi’ in the Divine Thought, one needs cultivators specializing in Divine Thought, like some Alchemists, Heavenly Mechanism Cultivators, wandering hermits, etc...\"","\"But all these are ’minor paths’ in Tao Cultivation, inherently varying in quality, with few practitioners, and true experts are elusive.\"","\"And the Divine Thought is obscure and profound, with many branches: Heavenly Inquiry, Causal Tracing, Calculation, Divination, Path Inquiry, Fortune Judgement, Calamity Diagnosis, Witchcraft, Curse Killing, Summoning God, Exorcism, and so on...\""]},{"number":1792,"title":"Chapter 1792 - 897: Exorcising Evil Spirits (Part 2)","paragraphs":["\"If there are such connections, we could seek help, and maybe there would be someone who can exorcise the evil and save Changhuai.\"","Elder Gu Hong frowned upon hearing this.","In her impression, the Gu Family had very few cultivators they knew in this regard, with basically no connections.","Even wanting to ask someone now, she didn’t know where to start.","\"Is there any sect influence that specializes in the path of ’repelling evil’?\"","The Pill Master said, \"As far as I know, there is no cultivation technique for divine sense, so the influences that cultivate the Divine Sense skill have either declined, gone into seclusion, or disappeared entirely from ancient times to now. Those who are still somewhat famous now should be... Mystery Valley...\"","\"Mystery Valley?\" Elder Gu Hong’s brow remained furrowed, \"Our Gu Family has no connections with Mystery Valley...\"","Wenren Wan’s eyes brightened, and she said thoughtfully, \"The Shangguan Family knows people from Mystery Valley. I’ll take the Shangguan Family’s route to ask and see if I can invite them...\"","\"The Shangguan Family?\"","\"Yes,\" Wenren Wan replied, \"A few years ago, when Yu Er went missing, we invited someone from Mystery Valley, I believe he was called Master Mei, to do a calculation. But this Master Mei couldn’t find anything and ended up going insane...\"","\"Went insane?\" Elder Gu Hong was taken aback.","The Pill Master sighed, \"This line of work is like that, fraught with danger, and many terrible causes and effects hide in the shadows. Just a touch can drive someone mad. Sudden deaths are not out of the question...\"","Elder Gu Hong and Wenren Wan nodded skeptically.","The Pill Master continued, \"Of course, these are just things I’ve heard from various Taoist friends over the years. I can’t say for sure whether it’s true or not.\"","\"Also...\" The Pill Master hesitated for a moment, sighed heavily, and said with some gravity, \"I must say upfront, cultivators of the Path of Divine Thought have different areas of expertise. Not everyone knows the methods of ’repelling evil, calming the spirit, dispelling ghosts, and saving people’.","\"Though Mystery Valley follows the Path of Divine Sense, what they might excel in should be the calculations of Heavenly Mechanism and Causality. Whether they can ’repel evil’ is hard to say...\"","Elder Gu Hong looked at Gu Changhuai, who was lying in the inner chamber, unsure of life or death, frowned and pondered for a moment, then sighed:","\"At this point, there’s no choice...\"","They could only pin their hopes on Mystery Valley.","Elder Gu Hong turned around, gripping Wenren Wan’s hand tightly, and said solemnly:","\"Time is of the essence, Wan’er, this matter is troubling you.\"","\"I will also go find the Family Head and have him write a letter that you’ll take with you, hoping to invite cultivators from Mystery Valley and hoping they have a way to save Changhuai...\"","Wenren Wan nodded earnestly.","Subsequently, Wenren Wan, carrying a letter from the Gu Family Master, Gu Shouyan, personally went back to the Shangguan Family and used their channels to contact a few Mystery Valley cultivators who were serving as Guest Elders near the Qian Learning State Boundary.","These cultivators had practiced Causality Skill and also learned some parts of the ’repelling evil’ methods.","Due to the urgency of the situation and the matter of life and death, everyone traveled day and night, and within a day, they all arrived at the Gu Family.","The Gu Family Pill Pavilion.","Several Golden Core Cultivators from Mystery Valley gathered and greeted each other.","There were also two other Golden Core cultivators who had practiced some Divine Thought Skill, who were invited by the Gu Family and came along.","The path of Divine Thought is mysterious. One more person adds more insight and power.","Seeing Gu Changhuai’s injuries, the expressions of the group turned grave.","\"His forehead is as dark as ink... it must not be ordinary evil evil...\"","\"I’ve never seen such a thing before...\"","\"A Golden Core Demon Cultivator self-destructing, perishing together... truly cruel-hearted, a bit strange... perhaps enchanted by some evil object, driven to fanaticism, dare to sever their own Dao path and self-destruct their Golden Core.\"","\"Even a Golden Core can be enchanted? Looking at it this way, this evil evil is quite terrifying... its original form... is it a corpse, a ghost, a monster, or a demon?\"","\"No matter what, it’s a ’hard bone’, probably needs careful scheming, taking it slow...\"","\"No time to take it slow,\" someone sighed, \"Look at Young Master Gu’s appearance, the evil has entered the mind, his forehead sunken, these are signs of divine sense being devoured...\"","\"In such a situation, he won’t last, probably... only a few days left...\"","\"If not acted upon, it will be too late.\"","\"Indeed, cannot delay...\"","\"Entrusted with a task, loyal to the mission, everyone work together, think of a way. If we can truly save Young Master Gu, it would also be an act of good karma.\"","\"That would be best...\"","Afterward, the group had a secret discussion, exchanged their own Divine Sense skills, avoided some taboos, set the ’repelling evil’ process, and elected one, a Golden Core Cultivator from Mystery Valley with the deepest understanding of the Path of Divine Sense, to preside over the repelling evil.","This Golden Core cultivator bore the surname Mei, known as \"Mr. Mei,\" at the mid-stage Golden Core cultivation, was the clan brother of the \"Master Mei\" who served as a Guest Elder in the Shangguan Family back then, quite connected in terms of lineage.","This time, it was \"Mr. Mei\" who would repel the evil.","Several other Divine Thought Cultivators also did their best.","Some offered advice, some lent treasures, some provided pills and liquors, and finally, all were handed over to Mr. Mei.","With everything arranged, Mr. Mei donned the Taoist robe for repelling evil, wore the Spirit Tool Heart Protecting Mirror, took out the copper coin sword, laid out the Eight Trigrams charm, lit the protective divine lamp, and burned the Clear Heart Incense, then poured a cup of extremely potent and fierce realgar wine to dispel evil and filth.","This realgar wine was extremely strong and fierce-tasting.","Mr. Mei drank it in one gulp, feeling as if he had swallowed a cup of blazing fire. His throat and tongue burned like fire, followed by the spread of Yang energy through his body, filling his chest with courage.","Others had beforehand laid some repelling formations in the inner chamber.","The formation protected Gu Changhuai’s body and also prevented the overflow of evil Qi.","Mr. Mei set up the altar, then held the copper coin sword, stepped on the Eight Trigrams charm, wore the repelling evil robe, driven by the drunken courage from the realgar wine, and stepped into the inner chamber."]},{"number":1793,"title":"Chapter 1793 - 897: Exorcising Evil Spirits (Part 3)","paragraphs":["The inner chamber doors were tightly shut afterwards.","The matter of \"expelling the evil\" was secretive and dangerous, not to be witnessed by outsiders.","It was meant to prevent the leakage of Divine Sense Skills and to guard against the Evil Evil harming anyone.","Outside the chamber, Elder Gu Hong, along with the elders of Gu Changhuai’s line, were gathered, their expressions tense.","Wenren Wan held Yu Er, equally anxious at heart.","Yu Er looked up at his mother and worriedly asked, \"Mother, will Uncle Gu be alright...\"","Though he felt Uncle Gu usually had a cold, stern face, he was actually quite kind to him, always thinking of him with good food and play. He didn’t want anything to happen to Uncle Gu.","Wenren Wan gently stroked Yu Er’s head and said with a warm smile, \"He will be fine...\"","But her smile was somewhat forced.","Yu Er felt a little sad.","Wenren Wan softly said, \"The rest period is over. You still need to cultivate. I’ll ask Uncle Wei to take you back to Taixu Gate.\"","Yu Er gently shook his head, \"I’m worried about Uncle Gu...\"","Wenren Wan felt gratified yet a bit bitter, softly sighing, \"Alright, then we’ll wait here.\"","After that, Yu Er said nothing more.","His big, black eyes were fixed on the door of the inner chamber, looking worried, yet, for some reason, a little scared...","As if something inside the room was terrifying him.","Just like the demon in his nightmares, only... even scarier...","Yu Er pressed his lips tightly together. He was hesitant to stay here, but thinking of Uncle Gu lying inside, he was unwilling to leave.","Thus, silence enveloped the surroundings, so quiet that even a falling needle could be heard.","Everyone’s expressions were solemn and grave.","The passing of time became slow and oppressive...","Suddenly, a bizarre fluctuation surged, followed by a scream from inside the chamber, then a sound of something breaking, mixed with indistinct howls of vengeful spirits, a cacophony.","Those outside turned pale at the sound.","The other two Golden Core cultivators from Mystery Valley, horrified, immediately stood up, exclaimed:","\"Not good, the expulsion failed, quick, save them!\"","They attempted to force the door open, but it broke before they could.","Amid flying wood chips, Mr. Mei stumbled out, unable to suppress the evil qi any longer, blood pouring from his mouth.","He looked horrifyingly miserable.","The Spirit Tool Heart Protecting Mirror had shattered, a black-red burn mark visible on his repelling evil robe, his forehead faintly glowing green, the color slowly turning black.","At this moment, a shrill scream, neither human nor demon, burst from Mr. Mei’s mouth. Grasping the ground with his hands, he struggled wildly, seemingly losing control.","The other two Mystery Valley cultivators darkened their expressions and immediately leapt forward, taking out a yellow cloth with red patterns, binding him tightly.","Then they covered the frenzied Mr. Mei’s heart with a Bagua Plate.","The other took out a jade and placed it on Mr. Mei’s forehead, forcing realgar wine into his mouth to repel the evil with its strength.","After much fuss when the jade finally absorbed the evil qi.","Only then did Mr. Mei stop struggling, and the blackness on his forehead slowly dissipated, his breathing gradually steadied.","Everyone let out a slow sigh of relief, then all turned their attention towards the inner chamber.","Inside, Gu Changhuai still lay there, his fate uncertain.","The surroundings were in complete disarray.","The setup altar exploded, the incense burned out, the spirit-protecting lamp extinguished, the copper coin sword broken, copper coins scattered everywhere, and the formation media was completely cracked, losing effectiveness.","The scene just seemed chaotic to others.","But the Mystery Valley cultivators, skilled in the art, when exchanging glances, felt a chill run straight up to the crown of their heads.","\"A greatly ominous evil spirit!\"","\"How... did it provoke such a thing?\"","Their voices were cold, still shocked as the mutant event suddenly occurred.","Gu Changhuai, who lay on the bed uncertain of life or death, seemed to sense something and suddenly opened his eyes, sitting up slowly like a \"walking corpse.\"","His eyes, soaked in evil qi, turned the whites black and the pupils blood-red, his gaze coldly scanning over everyone, finally fixing on the young Yu Er.","\"Gu Changhuai\" wore a deathly pale face, slowly revealing a grim smile, his voice grating and hoarse:","\"Found... you, my...\"","Gu Changhuai didn’t finish his sentence.","Such a change left everyone astonished.","No one understood what his words meant, but they knew things were strange and couldn’t go on like this; otherwise, great disaster might ensue.","A Golden Core from Mystery Valley immediately shot several golden needles to block the \"Gu Changhuai’s\" meridians.","Another Golden Core, gritting his teeth, summoned a Jade Ruyi, tapping it on Gu Changhuai’s forehead while his actions were restrained, suppressing the evil qi.","Fortunately, though the evil thoughts of \"Gu Changhuai\" were intense, his physical body was gravely injured.","And this Jade Ruyi seemed to be an extraordinary treasure.","\"Gu Changhuai\" was quickly subdued, his physical body unable to move, and his evil thoughts ceased to surge. He took a deep look at Yu Er and slowly lay down again, reverting to the appearance of being \"unconscious\".","Only then did everyone finally relax their tense hearts.","But Yu Er’s little face turned deathly pale.","He was startled by a glance from \"Gu Changhuai\", and his entire body trembled, instantly becoming cold as ice.","In that glance, he seemed to see a certain \"destiny\".","In that destiny, he was merely an \"empty shell\", with nothing left—no mother, and all those he cared about and missed were nowhere to be found.","Only boundless void and fear...","Yu Er’s body began to shiver, cold sweat pouring out.","Wenren Wan immediately noticed Yu Er’s abnormality, and gently touched his forehead, asking:","\"Yu Er, Yu Er, what’s wrong, are you feeling unwell?\"","Yu Er weakly nodded.","A cultivator from Mystery Valley saw this and quickly approached, pointing at Yu Er’s forehead, but sensing nothing, he frowned and said:","\"Perhaps it’s due to the evil presence changing just now, startling this young master, which led to his disorientation.\"","Wenren Wan felt a pang of heartache.","Elder Gu Hong spoke warmly: \"You should take Yu Er to the side room to rest. Yu Er is weak, and there are too many noisy people here—it might frighten him again.\"","Wenren Wan looked at Gu Changhuai, then at Yu Er in her arms, and nodded. But just as she was about to stand, Yu Er lightly shook his head.","\"Mother, I will stay here.\"","There are more people here, more lively.","The side room, despite being quiet, is also desolate and easily breeds fear.","Wenren Wan understood Yu Er’s meaning, felt a bit sorry, kissed his forehead gently, and whispered:","\"Then close your eyes and sleep for a while. You’ll feel better when you wake up...\"","\"Hmm...\"","Yu Er slowly nodded and soon, feeling exhausted, drooped his eyelids and gradually fell asleep.","Wenren Wan watched over him closely.","With Yu Er comforted, the commotion gradually subsided, and only then did everyone, with somber expressions, begin to discuss the next course of action.","A cultivator from Mystery Valley frowned and asked: \"Now what do we do?\"","\"This evil presence is too strong; even Mr. Mei is no match.\"","\"With our skills, we’re even less capable.\"","\"The Spirit Tool Heart Protecting Mirror is shattered, the Bagua Plate is cracked, even the repelling evil robe can’t hold...\"","\"Mr. Mei also got caught up, who knows how much sanity he retained...\"","\"The situation is dire, how about... we send a letter back to Mystery Valley, asking the Chief Elder and True Man Situ to come?\"","\"It’s too far, by the time True Man Situ arrives, it will be too late.\"","\"Moreover, ever since the bloody incident in Li State City years ago, the Chief Elder has been traveling far and wide and rarely returns to the valley—could he be hiding something...\"","\"What could the Chief Elder be hiding?\"","\"How could I know what the Chief Elder is plotting?\"","\"What do we do now then?\"","\"Let’s wait for Mr. Mei to wake up...\"","\"And if he doesn’t wake up? Even if he does, what can he do? Such a formidable evil presence, who can handle it?\"","\"This...\"","Everyone paused, frowning in silence.","At this moment, Yu Er, who had been sleeping soundly, began showing an increasingly pained expression, his face growing paler, and cold sweat pouring out even more.","\"Could it be... another nightmare?\"","Wenren Wan watched Yu Er, feeling deeply distressed.","She wanted to wake him, but Yu Er was trapped in the nightmare, unreachable.","Wenren Wan didn’t know what to do.","Just then, amidst his pain and fear, Yu Er struggled and murmured: \"Brother Mo...\"","Wenren Wan started, then snapped back to reality, hurriedly saying to Wenren Wei:","\"Brother Wei, quickly, send Yu Er back to Taixu Gate, to Mo Hua’s side.\"","Only by Mo Hua’s side would Yu Er not have nightmares.","Wenren Wei cupped his hands and said solemnly: \"Yes!\"","But a moment later, he hesitated, deliberating: \"Or, should I go to Taixu Gate and invite Young Master Mo to the Gu Family?\"","Wenren Wan shook her head, \"How could that work? Mo Hua is so busy, he can’t be delayed from his cultivation. Just send Yu Er back to Taixu Gate.\"","\"No,\" Wenren Wei thought for a moment, then finally said what he had been thinking all along, \"Invite Young Master Mo over, have a look at Young Master Yu and also let him check... on Young Master Gu’s condition.\"","Wenren Wan was stunned.","Others present were also taken aback."]},{"number":1794,"title":"Chapter 1794 - 898: Slaying the Evil Spirit","paragraphs":["\"Mo Hua?\"","\"Yes,\" Wenren Wei nodded, pointing to the chaotic inner chamber, he solemnly said, \"I’ve seen Young Master Mo paint similar formations, and I’ve also seen Young Master Mo dispel the sinister evil energy. Although I don’t know how exactly Young Master Mo does it, it seems he has some methods, or perhaps he knows some secrets; maybe he can save Young Master Changhuai...\"","There were some words Wenren Wei didn’t say much of.","But he remembered it very clearly.","Previously, when Mo Hua was keeping watch for Young Master Yu and dispelling evil spirits, the cold sinister evil energy he sensed was even more intense than today.","Moreover, it wasn’t just a single aura.","Endless waves of evil energy, like a tide, made one’s heart palpitate.","Yet Young Master Mo, with his frail figure, stood steadfast in front of Young Master Yu, unwavering.","Standing alone against countless evils.","This scene seemed engraved in his mind.","Wenren Wan frowned.","Elder Gu Hong was also puzzled, \"Mo Hua... this child is only at Foundation Establishment, right? And isn’t he a Formation Master? When did he also cultivate a method to dispel evil and ward off spirits?\"","The cultivators of Mystery Valley looked at one another in dismay.","\"Mo Hua, could he possibly be... the Array Leader, first in the Array Competition?\"","\"Is he also proficient in the Divine Thought Skill?\"","\"Impossible, the path of Divine Thought takes years of dedicated cultivation to reach even a basic level. He’s only in his twenties, hasn’t even graduated from the Sect, how could he possibly find enough time to both cultivate and study formations extensively enough to also master the path of Divine Thought?\"","\"Moreover, he’s just at Foundation Establishment...\"","Wenren Wei looked steadily at Wenren Wan.","Wenren Wan hesitated slightly, then nodded, \"I’ll go with you to Taixu Gate to bring Mo Hua, and let him take a look.\"","She was also unsure if Mo Hua could indeed \"dispel evil.\"","But she knew Mo Hua was a prodigy, possessed exceptional skills, and had many clever ideas. Even if he couldn’t resolve it himself, he might have other solutions; trying wouldn’t hurt.","Elder Gu Hong was momentarily stunned, but did not obstruct them.","The situation with Changhuai was critical, and they had no choice but to take a chance.","Thus, Wenren Wan entrusted Yu Er to Elder Gu Hong, and personally went with Wenren Wei to Taixu Gate.","Inside Taixu Gate.","Mo Hua was drawing a formation, still feeling uneasy, contemplating whether to visit the Gu Family when he heard the Elder say someone was looking for him.","When Mo Hua arrived at the mountain gate, he saw the anxious expression of Wenren Wan.","\"Mo Hua...\"","Wenren Wan hesitated on how to start, but Mo Hua asked, \"Is it about Uncle Gu? Has he encountered something evil?\"","Wenren Wan was taken aback, \"How did you know?\"","When cultivating the Emotionless Path, I had a premonition... Mo Hua thought to himself.","Of course, he wouldn’t say it out loud, merely saying, \"I sent a message to Uncle Gu, and since he didn’t reply, I guessed something might have happened.\"","Wenren Wan nodded, \"Then...\"","\"Don’t worry, I’ll go and take a look.\" Mo Hua said calmly.","Wenren Wan, seeing Mo Hua’s composed demeanor, for some reason felt much at ease herself.","\"Alright, sorry for the trouble.\" Wenren Wan said.","Then Mo Hua took the Gu family’s carriage, driven by Wenren Wei, and rushed towards Qingzhou City like the wind.","However, Tai Xu City was still half a day’s journey from Qingzhou City.","This trip back and forth took a whole day.","During this time, in Qingzhou City, the Gu Family remained deeply worried.","They didn’t just wait passively but instead contacted various acquaintances, inviting numerous extraordinary individuals to take a look, yet all to little avail.","The path of Divine Thought is inherently obscure.","There are very few cultivators who practice the Divine Thought Skill.","With such limited time, finding a Divine Thought cultivator capable of \"dispelling evil\" in just a day or two was practically impossible.","The people called upon who were \"inadequate\" could leave unscathed.","But those with some capability ended up in the same state as \"Mr. Mei.\"","After a few more Divine Thought cultivators went \"mad,\" the hearts of the people became somewhat intimidated.","And Mr. Mei also awakened.","Upon waking, he opened his eyes wide, revealing an expression of horror:","\"Quick, send a message back to Mystery Valley, ask the Valley Master to send a few Elders, no, several Feather Transformation uncles!\"","Everyone’s expressions changed dramatically.","A cultivator frowned, \"Mr. Mei, what exactly did you encounter? What kind of sinister evil is inside Young Master Gu?\"","Mr. Mei was dripping with cold sweat.","A terrifying image appeared in his mind. It was far beyond ordinary evil spirits, or rather, couldn’t even be considered an evil spirit.","Horns, black blood, a colossal entity...","Such \"evil spirits\" could not even be compared to it.","It might even be...","Cold sweat started to gather in Mr. Mei’s palms.","The other two Mystery Valley cultivators also furrowed their brows, \"Mr. Mei, did you engage with this entity? What are its capabilities?\"","Mr. Mei shook his head with a bitter smile, \"Not really engaged... just a glimpse, and my divine soul was in turmoil, evil thoughts overwhelmed me, and I was defeated.\"","\"If I hadn’t realized something was amiss and prepared beforehand, with the protection of Mystery Valley’s treasures, plus the courage from the realgar wine, I might not have returned at all...\"","\"As for what this evil object is truly capable of...\" Mr. Mei’s expression became increasingly bitter, \"I am simply not qualified to find out.\"","On hearing this, everyone was somewhat alarmed.","\"Then what grade is this thing?\"","\"It’s not a matter of grade,\" Mr. Mei said, \"An existence like this is fundamentally different from typical evil spirits and cannot be measured by grades.\"","\"This...\"","Several others frowned.","\"So what should we do now?\"","Mr. Mei contemplated for a long time, and finding no solution, he sighed:","\"First figure out how to stabilize Young Master Gu’s condition, I’ll send a message back to Mystery Valley and see if we can make it in time...\""]},{"number":1795,"title":"Chapter 1795 - 898: Slaying Evil Spirits (Part 2)","paragraphs":["Several Mystery Valley cultivators began to take out various divine artifacts, placing them gently on Gu Changhuai’s seven orifices, then affixing Heart-clearing Jade to his forehead to absorb the overflowing evil filth.","But aside from this, they were temporarily at a loss for what to do.","The other people present were equally subdued, their expressions dejected.","This continued for roughly four hours, and just as the situation grew increasingly tense.","A carriage coming from the direction of Taixu Mountain entered Qingzhou City, heading straight for the Gu Family.","A bright young man jumped off from the carriage.","Wearing a Taixu Sect disciple’s Taoist robe, his eyes held depth, his face handsome, yet carrying a touch of innocence.","The young man walked into the Pill Pavilion; the members of the Gu Family noticed and promptly stood, some nodding in greeting, others bowing and saluting as they greeted:","\"Mo...\"","\"Young Master Mo.\"","\"Good day, Young Master Mo.\"","...","Mo Hua returned their greetings one by one, then walked to Elder Gu Hong’s side and looked at Yu Er.","Yu Er seemed to be having a nightmare; his little face was stark white, his pale forehead covered in beads of sweat.","\"Scared by an evil spirit, hasn’t woken up, still calling your name...\" Elder Gu Hong felt a bit distressed.","\"Hmm.\" Mo Hua nodded lightly and said, \"Don’t worry, Elder Hong, it’s nothing serious.\"","Mo Hua extended his palm and placed it on Yu Er’s forehead.","The struggling Yu Er sensed a familiar presence along with a harmonious and tranquil divine thought, immediately calming down; his inner fear and unease also gradually faded away.","Those demon spirits wandering in the nightmares seemed to encounter a terrible \"nemesis,\" fleeing in terror and disappearing without a trace.","Yu Er opened his eyes, murmuring, \"Brother Mo...\"","Mo Hua patted his head, \"It’s alright, just sleep well for a while, and everything will be better when you wake up.\"","\"Hmm...\"","Yu Er slowly closed his eyes and fell into a deep sleep; now his dreams were free from evil spirits’ interference, allowing him a peaceful rest.","Seeing this, Wenren Wan, who had walked into the room, showed a grateful expression.","The other people also gradually heaved a sigh of relief.","Since Mo Hua entered the room, Mr. Mei’s gaze had been on him, and now seeing the previously terrified Yu Er able to sleep peacefully in just moments, his pupils contracted as he couldn’t help but ask:","\"This gentleman is...\"","Mo Hua also saw the miserable looking Mr. Mei and politely replied, \"My name is Mo Hua.\"","Mo Hua?","Mr. Mei felt somewhat familiar with the name, then asked, \"Could it be... the Array Leader from Qian Learning State Boundary?\"","Mo Hua nodded, but still modestly said, \"I was lucky to get first place, you praise me too much.\"","Mr. Mei gasped slightly.","It was really him... and he appeared so young.","At first glance, he seemed merely a disciple who had just commenced schooling. Who could have imagined that he was a Foundation Building Middle Stage genius able to draw formations at the Peak of Nineteen-Pattern?","Moreover...","Mr. Mei furrowed his brow.","Though they had never met, Mo Hua was not unfamiliar to him.","Previously entrusted by a family, he personally foresaw Mo Hua’s cause and effect, even glimpsing the mist-shrouded Tai Xu Heavenly Mechanism Lock.","At that time, he stopped himself, not daring to delve further.","Others might not be aware, but he knew clearly that the Tai Xu Sect’s Heavenly Mechanism Lock was established using the ancient Heavenly Mechanism Treasure, the Tai Xu Yin Yang Lock.","This treasure was quite extraordinary.","The secrets surrounding this young man were undoubtedly complex.","Otherwise, the Tai Xu Sect wouldn’t exert such effort to protect his cause and effect.","Mr. Mei’s attitude immediately became respectful.","Though he was a Golden Core Cultivator and Mo Hua merely in the Foundation Building Middle Stage, he still respectfully bowed in greeting to Mo Hua:","\"Young Master Mo, pleased to meet you. I hail from Mystery Valley, the surname is Mei, Golden Core Cultivator, have some knowledge of Divine Thought Skill.\"","Mo Hua’s eyes lit up.","Mystery Valley?","He asked, \"Mystery Valley, is there a Senior Situ?\"","\"Senior Situ?\" Mr. Mei appeared puzzled, \"Are you referring to the Chief Elder True Man Situ?\"","\"Yes.\" Mo Hua nodded.","Mr. Mei was taken aback, surprised, \"Young Master Mo, do you... know Elder Situ?\"","Mo Hua nodded and replied, \"We had a brief encounter once, when I was establishing my foundation, Senior Situ offered guidance.\"","\"So that’s it... such deep roots.\"","Mr. Mei was stunned, then felt a burst of joy.","Taixu Sect’s Array Leader, such a talented genius, unexpectedly had such connections with Mystery Valley.","This was indeed fortunate.","\"Later, I must instruct that none of the sect’s disciples offend Young Master Mo...\"","\"Regarding Young Master Mo’s cause and effect, avoid examining it to prevent transforming this \"positive connection\" into a \"negative consequence.\"","Mr. Mei thought to himself, now treating Mo Hua even more courteously.","Mo Hua remained polite.","The members of the Gu Family, however, were left mostly bewildered, especially Elder Gu Hong and Wenren Wan, appearing somewhat confused.","How did this child Mo Hua manage to associate himself with people from Mystery Valley?","And from their words, this Mystery Valley Golden Core Cultivator \"Mr. Mei\" seemed to show great respect for Mo Hua?","Elder Gu Hong and Wenren Wan exchanged glances, both feeling surprised.","After exchanging a few words with Mo Hua, Mr. Mei suddenly recalled something and asked, \"What brings Young Master Mo here this time, if I may ask...\"","Mo Hua did not hesitate to reply, \"I came to see Uncle Gu.\"","\"Young Master Gu?\"","\"Yes.\"","Mr. Mei considered for a moment, then suddenly showed surprise, \"Young Master Mo, do you also understand the magic of ’evil expulsion’?\"","Mo Hua modestly replied, \"I know a little.\"","Mr. Mei was somewhat astonished, \"Truly?\"","\"Hmm.\" Mo Hua replied, \"Yes, just a bit of understanding...\"","Mr. Mei observed him for a moment, then shook his head and sighed, \"Young Master Mo, indeed your talent is astonishing.\""]},{"number":1796,"title":"Chapter 1796 - 898: Slaying Evil Spirits (Part 3)","paragraphs":["So young, yet proficient in Formation, with a Super Divine Sense, and even involving in the Dao of Divine Thought and Evil Removal Method.","Elder Situ, perhaps also recognizing this young master’s extraordinary nature, was eager to help cultivate his talent and offered some guidance.","\"It’s just...\"","After all, he was too young and his cultivation was too shallow.","Mr. Mei appeared solemn, contemplated for a moment, and sincerely said:","\"The Evil Qi on Young Master Gu, the causality is great and exceptionally vicious, I’m afraid it’s not something a cultivator can withstand...\"","\"As the saying goes, a thousand-gold child does not sit under eaves. Young Master Mo is of noble status, entrusted with high hopes by the sect, his future is boundless, it is better not to take risks...\"","In other words, the Evil Qi is too strong, and you are too weak.","For the sake of your own life, it’s better not to take action.","However, Mr. Mei spoke very tactfully, and his concern for Mo Hua was also from the heart.","Mo Hua smiled and said: \"Thank you, Mr. Mei, for your concern. I’ll just take a look, it won’t take long.\"","\"Just take a look?\"","\"Yes.\"","Mo Hua’s expression was calm and kind, yet it carried an unyielding firmness that could not be resisted.","Mr. Mei advised him a few more sentences, but seeing that Mo Hua had made up his mind, he could not say much, only sighed and cautioned: \"Young Master Mo, please be extremely careful.\"","\"Rest assured, Mr. Mei,\" Mo Hua replied.","And then Mo Hua walked towards the inner chamber.","But after just a few steps, Mr. Mei was startled, stopping Mo Hua: \"Young Master Mo, are you just... going in like this?\"","Mo Hua was taken aback, \"Otherwise?\"","Mr. Mei seriously said: \"The matter of expelling evil is no joke. If you are counter-attacked by the Evil Qi, at worst the sea of consciousness gets damaged, at worst the divine soul gets obliterated, you must be extremely cautious.\"","Seeing Mo Hua still looked confused, not understanding his meaning,","Mr. Mei said: \"At least take some equipment in with you.\"","\"Equipment?\"","\"With causality copper coins, form a sword to cut off causality; the Spirit Tool Heart Protecting Mirror can protect the heart meridian; the Protective Robe wards off evil spirits; the Calming Incense stabilizes the mind...\"","Mr. Mei advised, \"These are all precautions, in a critical moment, they can truly save a life.\"","Mo Hua was eye-opened.","He never knew that to slay an evil spirit, these are necessary...","He had never used them.","Mo Hua shook his head, \"No need.\"","Mr. Mei thought he was just young and reckless, ignorant and fearless, and felt a bit anxious, \"Little brother, the Dao of Divine Thought is treacherous, you cannot be unprepared...\"","\"At least, take a sip of realgar wine before you go in.\"","\"Realgar wine?\"","Mr. Mei said: \"This wine is yang and fierce, it can bolster courage, suppress Evil Qi, and for a time, protect the divine thought.\"","Mr. Mei turned and ordered, \"Heat a cup of wine for the young master.\"","Not long after, someone specifically heated a cup of realgar wine and handed it to Mo Hua.","Mo Hua sniffed it, shaking his head.","The smell was too pungent, just smelling it made his nose feel fiery, let alone drinking it.","Besides, he had always disliked strong spirits.","\"No need, I’ll be quick,\"","Mo Hua said calmly, and then alone, carrying nothing, swaggered into the inner chamber, closing the door with a backhand.","Mr. Mei saw him acting so headstrong, unable to stop him, his heart filled with worry, he couldn’t help but shake his head and sigh.","This child is too reckless...","If he ventures too far into the Dao of Divine Thought and goes too deep, sooner or later he will be devoured by evil spirits.","...","Inside the inner chamber.","Mo Hua walked to the bedside, glanced at Gu Changhuai’s complexion, lifted his eyelids, and shook his head.","\"Poor Uncle Gu...\"","Mo Hua sat cross-legged, then took out the Bone Sword, whispering: \"Sword Bone, whatever I say later, you do.\"","Sword Bone felt a little nervous inside.","But he dared not disobey Mo Hua’s words, so he nodded: \"You say, young master.\"","\"In Uncle Gu’s sea of consciousness, there’s a ’little evil spirit’, later you go inside, lure it out, and draw it into your own Bone Sword.\"","\"Then after, you pull me in too.\"","\"Your task will be complete.\"","Sword Bone felt there was a bitter story untold, confirming: \"Little ancestor, are you sure that’s really a ’little evil spirit’?\"","Mo Hua was unhappy, \"You don’t believe my words?\"","Sword Bone’s face was all sinister white bones, otherwise he would definitely let Mo Hua know what it meant to have an expression grimmer than crying.","\"But,\" Sword Bone continued, \"with my little strength, I’m afraid I can’t lure that little... that evil spirit out...\"","\"It’s fine, I’ll teach you,\" Mo Hua confidently said, \"You just need to do as I say, go in and curse it out, it will definitely chase you out.\"","\"...Curse it?!\" Sword Bone trembled.","\"Yes,\" Mo Hua nodded.","He then casually selected a few lines from his, no, from Elder Yu’s repertoire of insults and taught them to Sword Bone...","\"Just curse it like this, unless the other side is really a grandson, a turtle counter, otherwise even if you run to the ends of the earth, it will chase you relentlessly.\"","Sword Bone was so scared, all his bones were trembling, \"Young master, isn’t this... not very polite?\"","Mo Hua frowned, \"You, a demon, who are you being polite to? Go quickly, or I’ll feed you to the dogs.\"","Sword Bone had no choice.","Once, he wanted to be a good person, but there was no opportunity.","Now he really wanted to be a civilized and courteous good ’demon’, but Mo Hua wouldn’t allow it.","Seeing Mo Hua’s expression growing more unfriendly, Sword Bone had no way out, steeling his resolve, clenching his teeth, dispersing a scarlet blood mist, he drilled into Gu Changhuai’s sea of consciousness.","After that came chaos.","Even on the face of the unconscious Gu Changhuai, a thick evil presence appeared.","A little later, a weak, almost imperceptible divine thought transmitted.","It was Sword Bone.","Mo Hua’s eyes gleamed slightly, then he released his Divine Sense, allowing Sword Bone to pull him into the Bone Sword’s blood pool nightmare."]},{"number":1797,"title":"Chapter 1797 - 898: Slaying the Evil Spirit (Part 4)","paragraphs":["When he opened his eyes again, he found himself already in the Blood Pool, surrounded by Sword-like White Bones, all connected, full of a bloody scene.","Precisely the \"lair\" of the Sword Bone.","Mo Hua turned his head to look and saw a gigantic Divine Body, dripping with Black Blood, with ram horns atop its head, \"ravaging\" the Sword Bone.","Poor Sword Bone, disassembled into broken bones by this Evil Object, scattered all over the ground, its spine being gnawed in the mouth of the ram-horned Evil Object.","Seeing Mo Hua, the massive Evil Object \"spat\" out the Sword Bone from its mouth casually, its voice as dull and hoarse as a Monster Beast:","\"I said, how could a mere little Evil Demon dare to speak such arrogant words and touch my sore spot?\"","\"So that’s it, intended to lure me here?\"","The Evil Object’s eyes were scarlet and cruel, looking down from above.","As the Divine Thought Taoism during Foundation Establishment, the embodiment of Divine Thought remained in the likeness of a teenager, looking like a child, Mo Hua also gazed at the Evil Object.","The Evil Object sneered, \"Could it be...you, such a tiny thing not even fit to fill the gap in my teeth, want to subdue me?\"","Mo Hua’s expression was calm.","He tolerated the \"food\"’s disrespect and lightly licked his lips, unable to suppress the desire in his heart.","The massive Evil Object blinked its eyes, only now sensing something amiss.","This little thing seemed not afraid upon seeing me?","Something is off...","Moreover, the aura on him was deliberately concealed, unknown to me. I could not perceive anything. Yet, faintly, there seemed to be a trace of aura similar to my own origin, very strange.","The ram-horned Evil Object frowned hideously.","\"You...\"","It wanted to ask something.","But Mo Hua could not resist.","He had not encountered a decent Evil Spirit for a very long time.","The Sword of Divine Thought, honed through countless trials, also had not \"seen blood\" for a very long time.","Mo Hua’s white tender palm grasped, and the momentum suddenly changed, waves spread out, using Sword Pattern as bones, Divine Thought as iron, forming a brilliantly gleaming, incredibly sharp \"Sever Gold Sword.\"","Divine Thought into Sword!","The Evil Object’s pupils suddenly trembled, \"You...?!\"","Without giving it any chance to react, Mo Hua grasped with his left hand, conjuring a Water Prison out of thin air, transforming it into a cage, trapping the Evil Object firmly.","Then, with a flicker of his figure, he reached the top of the ram-horned Evil Object. In his hand was an immensely sharp, golden Sword of Divine Thought, infused with the Power of Laws of the Sword Array, raised high.","The ram-horned Evil Object struggled desperately, unable to escape, at this moment awakening as if from a dream, its expression changed greatly, and it exclaimed in fear:","\"Stop! I...\"","But it was already too late, as Mo Hua slashed down with one sword.","The Sword of Divine Thought, formed by the Gold-Cutting Sword Formation, condensed into a beam of Golden Light, within which Formation Patterns densely covered, Sword Qi arose, breaking gold and cutting jade, extremely sharp.","With just this one sword, it cleaved the gigantic Evil Object in two halves.","The remaining Sword Array, containing a faint Power of Laws, continued to slice through the ram-horned Evil Object’s flesh, preventing its resurrection, eradicating its vitality.","The Evil Object’s shocked and bewildered expression still lingered on its face.","It could not comprehend why this inconspicuous little thing was such a \"terrifying\" existence.","Even, it was not its match in a single move.","What kind of monster is this?!","But it no longer had a chance to find out.","In the next instant, Mo Hua, with a grasp of his hand, manifested the Fire Formation, slightly roasted the ram-horned Evil Object, simply refining it into a mass of black gas, and swallowed it into his abdomen.","Under Mo Hua’s current Divine Thought into Sword, this \"powerful\" ram-horned Evil Object had no power to resist from beginning to end."]},{"number":1798,"title":"Chapter 1798 - 899: Taoist State","paragraphs":["Mo Hua felt a little unsatisfied, and also a bit disappointed.","\"Only Second Grade, probably just a divine remains...\"","Now, his Divine Thought into sword was starting to take form. With array to sword, array sword integration, it was already quite mystical.","He couldn’t cut down an evil embryo, but he could effortlessly cut down the evil objects beneath these evil embryos—even if they were somewhat related to the Great Wilderness Evil God.","Though this Second Grade divine remains was close to the peak of Second Grade, it still couldn’t fully test the power of his Divine Thought Sword Skill.","\"I wonder if I can cut down a Third Grade evil spirit...\"","Mo Hua muttered to himself.","However, his main purpose for this trip was to rescue Uncle Gu; everything else was incidental.","As for this \"divine remains,\" he would first swallow it and slowly refine it when he returned.","Mo Hua turned his head and glanced at the scattered bones on the ground, saying:","\"Stop pretending, get up.\"","The bones on the ground wobbled as they gathered together again, forming the shape of a sword bone, and chuckled sheepishly.","Mo Hua tossed a ram’s horn to the sword bone, \"You did well, here’s something to replenish you.\"","This was what he had intentionally left behind earlier, as a \"reward\" for the sword bone.","The sword bone looked at the ram’s horn, its body trembled, thinking: Is this really something I’m worthy of \"eating\"?","Then it looked at Mo Hua again.","Recalling how it was effortlessly captured and ruthlessly abused by that powerful evil ram object, without any resistance.","And that powerful evil ram object was similarly struck dead with one sword by this little ancestor, without any resistance...","The sword bone felt a cold chill in its heart.","After not seeing for a while, this little ancestor’s strength had become increasingly terrifying...","Following such a terrifying little ancestor, it too needed to muster some courage, can’t act like someone who hasn’t seen the world, nothing is uneatable.","The sword bone thanked profusely: \"Thank you, Young Master, for the reward!\"","Mo Hua nodded, instructing: \"Send me out.\"","The sword bone dared not delay, hurriedly replied: \"Yes, yes!\"","Then a mist of blood spread, and when Mo Hua reopened his eyes, he was in the Pill Pavilion of the Gu Family.","Gu Changhuai lay right in front of him.","Mo Hua stood up, checked Gu Changhuai’s forehead, lifted his eyelids, and nodded.","Fortunately, Uncle Gu was blessed with great fortune, able to meet him; otherwise, this hurdle wouldn’t have been easily crossed.","Mo Hua sighed inwardly, then looked around, confirmed there was nothing serious, turned, and left, pushing the door open.","Mo Hua’s quick in and out, swift and resolved, cutting everything down quickly, didn’t take long.","The people outside felt that Mo Hua had just gone in, after a few cups of tea time, he came out, looking at each other in dismay.","Mr. Mei hesitated: \"Young Master Mo, do you still need anything to dispel evil?\"","Mo Hua shook his head: \"It’s already dispelled.\"","\"Dispelled...?\"","Mr. Mei opened his mouth, looking a bit changed.","No, it’s already done?","No sword, no incense, no robe, no Spirit Tool Heart Protecting Mirror, nothing, just walked in empty-handed, in such a little time, and...done?","Even...the realgar wine, warmed shortly before, was still warm.","The others also showed surprise.","\"Young Master Mo, surely you’re joking?\"","\"How could it be so fast...\"","The other two cultivators from Mystery Valley looked a bit uneasy.","They couldn’t believe that such brutal and frightening evil spirits could be removed by this small boy in a few cups of tea time.","If so, it would make their previous rituals, with copper coin swords, repelling evil robes, Spirit Tool Heart Protecting Mirrors, incense burning, calming the soul...all look like a joke.","How could they possibly believe it?","Mr. Mei also didn’t believe it, but in front of so many \"experts,\" the little boy wouldn’t have a reason to lie.","He got up, went inside to check Gu Changhuai’s injuries, and immediately looked shocked:","\"It’s truly healed...\"","The other cultivators from Mystery Valley also came forward to check, showing disbelief.","\"It unexpectedly...dispelled the evil spirit?\"","They couldn’t help but turn their heads to look at Mo Hua.","Mo Hua remained calm, as before, but at this moment, in everyone’s eyes, this thin boy suddenly seemed unfathomable...","Mr. Mei hesitated for a long time, wanting to ask Mo Hua about the method he used to remove the evil spirit, but ultimately held back, not asking.","The method to dispel evil is a cultivation secret skill.","Outsiders shouldn’t inquire rashly.","But...","Mr. Mei couldn’t comprehend it.","What method did a little cultivator in the Foundation Building Middle Stage use to remove a powerful and fearsome evil spirit that even scared and stumped himself?","It seemed entirely illogical...","Could it be...that he used some treasure from the Taixu Gate?","Mr. Mei frowned.","Elder Gu Hong, waiting on the side, couldn’t help but confirm: \"Mr. Mei, about Changhuai...\"","Mr. Mei came back to his senses, sighed, and said seriously:","\"Young Master Mo is truly divine and Gu Changhuai should be fine now...\"","These words made the Gu Family feel a weight lifted, but also a deep sense of unreality, as they all turned to look at Mo Hua.","This child, becoming more enigmatic, beyond understanding...","Mo Hua was humble, saying:","\"I was just lucky, this evil spirit was actually strong on the outside but weak on the inside, not as strong as it seemed. It was already injured by Mr. Mei earlier, that’s why I dealt with it so easily, it’s not that I’m really that capable.\"","\"Oh...\"","The people nodded, confused, half-believing.","Mr. Mei’s face turned red.","He knew Mo Hua was saving his face."]},{"number":1799,"title":"Chapter 1799 - 899: Taoist State (2)","paragraphs":["Is this Evil Evil just \"strong on the outside but weak on the inside\"? He surely knows it well in his heart.","However, while walking the path of cultivation, one must maintain face. Mo Hua offered him this step, and he gratefully accepted it.","Mr. Mei cupped his hands, saying: \"Not at all, Young Master Mo is being courteous. It’s the Young Lord who is truly impressive...\"","The two exchanged formal pleasantries, lifting each other’s spirits.","Mo Hua then remembered something, and said to Wenren Wan:","\"Aunt Wan, the Evil Evil is gone now, and Uncle Gu’s injury to his divine thought is not too serious. However, his Blood Qi and Spiritual Power are depleted, especially his meridians where the Spiritual Power is obstructed. He needs timely recuperation.\"","Wenren Wan nodded, \"I understand.\" Then she sighed with relief and said: \"It’s all thanks to you...\"","Mo Hua smiled slightly.","Afterwards, it was no longer his concern, as several Danshi Elders from the Gu family were there to heal and tend to Uncle Gu.","Mo Hua glanced at Yu Er to ensure she was sleeping soundly, and then he left the room, went into the courtyard, found a stone table, and sat down to drink tea.","The Gu family’s elders specially sent over some delicate and delicious snacks to accompany Mo Hua’s tea.","Mo Hua did not stand on ceremony, thanked them, and accepted the offerings.","After drinking tea for a while, Mr. Mei and a few others came over, formally greeted Mo Hua, and then each took their seats.","They had been busy for quite some time, and now was just the time to take a break.","Naturally, the group began to discuss some matters on the Divine Thought path.","Because he has \"friends\" among the deities, Mo Hua’s understanding of Divine Dao Knowledge is much deeper than that of the average cultivator.","And Mr. Mei and the others, although they have cognitive obstacles regarding the existence of \"deities,\" have done considerable research into Divine Thought schools, hidden inheritances, and related taboos among cultivators.","They drank tea and chatted.","Mr. Mei and the others were amazed by Mo Hua’s vision and insight.","Mo Hua also learned many \"fancy\" things, like the copper coin sword, Eight Trigrams charm, Spirit Tool Heart Protecting Mirror, calming incense, repelling evil robe, etc...","For average cultivators, these things are indeed useful.","To a certain extent, they can use these external objects to help cultivators dispel evil and protect themselves.","It’s just that Mo Hua’s situation is relatively special, so he doesn’t really need them.","However...","Even if he doesn’t need them himself, if in the future the Taixu Gate faces a formidable Evil Demon, and needs to create some inheritance capable of \"dispelling evil and cutting down misfortune,\" these things can certainly be referenced.","Mo Hua quietly noted this matter in his heart.","Indeed, you live and learn; among three people, there must be one who can teach me.","Mo Hua felt he had learned something new again.","Mr. Mei and the others, seeing that Mo Hua was talented and kind, also felt very happy.","Everyone had a pleasant conversation, then after about an hour, Mr. Mei stood up to take his leave, \"Now that the matter here is settled, we won’t disturb you any longer, my young friend. On another day when you have time, we can discuss the learnings on the Divine Dao further.\"","Mo Hua readily said: \"Certainly.\"","After Mr. Mei left, Mo Hua drank tea for a while longer, wanting to see if Uncle Gu would wake up.","But after waiting for a little while, a woman wearing a Taoist Court robe walked in.","Mo Hua was taken aback, \"Sister Xia?\"","Xia Canonical Official was also a bit surprised to see Mo Hua, but she still looked anxious and asked: \"Mo Hua, how is Gu Changhuai...\"","Mo Hua said: \"Sister Xia, rest assured, there’s no more mortal danger. The elders of the Gu family are nursing Uncle Gu back to health.\"","Xia Canonical Official finally breathed a sigh of relief, her eyes flickering.","Mo Hua, observant of her expression, asked secretly: \"Sister Xia, are you that worried about Uncle Gu?\"","Xia Canonical Official stiffened, her face tense, and said: \"We are both Supervisors, performing tasks together, and since he’s seriously injured, I should naturally come to see him as a colleague’s duty.\"","\"Oh, a colleague...\" Mo Hua said meaningfully.","Xia Canonical Official, for some reason, felt very uneasy under Mo Hua’s gaze, so she left a bottle of pills and said: \"These are the Xia family’s Great Cultivating Origin Pills. Please pass them on to Gu Changhuai for me. I have official business to attend to and must return first.\"","Just as Xia Canonical Official turned to leave.","Mo Hua quickly called out: \"Sister Xia, wait a moment, I have something else.\"","Xia Canonical Official turned back to look at Mo Hua, \"Really?\"","Mo Hua nodded, \"Really.\"","Xia Canonical Official hesitated slightly.","Mo Hua then said, \"It’s unrelated to Uncle Gu, it’s serious business.\"","This finally put Xia Canonical Official at ease, and she sat beside Mo Hua, saying: \"Go ahead, what’s the matter.\"","Mo Hua looked around, then whispered: \"Sister Xia, has my place of birth had its access restricted by the Taoist Court?\"","Xia Canonical Official was somewhat surprised, \"How did you know?\"","\"I heard about it,\" Mo Hua replied.","\"From Gu Changhuai?\" Xia Canonical Official raised an eyebrow.","Mo Hua smiled without saying a word.","Xia Canonical Official thought for a moment, then nodded, \"It was ordered by my uncle.\"","Mo Hua was startled, \"Master Xia?\"","Xia Canonical Official nodded.","\"Why?\"","\"I’m not sure... maybe he was advised by someone, or perhaps he simply wanted to show goodwill to you as the Array Leader?\"","Mo Hua was puzzled, \"Do I have such face?\"","Xia Canonical Official sighed, \"You’re the Array Leader, and only at the Foundation Building Middle Stage. If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes, I wouldn’t have believed it either.\"","\"Of course, my uncle might also be acting according to the usual practice. In various regions of Nine State, whenever some extraordinarily talented genius appears, the Taoist Court’s rules dictate that their birthplace must be immediately sealed.\"","\"Firstly, it’s to protect these talented disciples, preventing them from being targeted by some heretical demons...\"","\"In the past, there have been many cases where heretical demons threatened genius cultivators by using their parents and relatives, forcing these talented disciples to fall from grace and join the Demon Sect.\"","\"Secondly, the Taoist Court also competes with families for talent. Therefore, the birthplace certainly needs to be sealed, and the fewer people who know, the better.\""]},{"number":1800,"title":"Chapter 1800 - 899: Taoist State_3","paragraphs":["\"Just like you, a genius Formation Master with exceptional talent, the Taoist Court must have been secretly keeping an eye on you early on.\"","Mo Hua slowly nodded.","Xia Canonical Official pondered for a moment and continued:","\"Your formations are excellent. If I’m not mistaken, there must be an expert from the Heavenly Mechanism Pavilion who has taken an interest in you.\"","\"Heavenly Mechanism Pavilion?\"","\"Yes,\" Xia Canonical Official said, \"Your cultivation level is still low for now, it’s still too early. When your cultivation level increases in the future, reaching above the Golden Core Realm, and you maintain this talent, making achievements in formations, the Heavenly Mechanism Pavilion should directly recruit you. The specific position will depend on your own abilities...\"","\"So,\" Xia Canonical Official looked at Mo Hua with expectations in her eyes, \"you must work hard, as long as you diligently cultivate and avoid going astray, your future will be boundless...\"","\"You may even ascend to heaven in one step and be directly recruited to the Taoist Court, working in the Heavenly Mechanism Pavilion, settling in the Taoist State, and henceforth become part of the central hub of the Cultivation World, where generations of Tao cultivation would continue.\"","\"This is an opportunity that countless cultivators in the Nine State desire but can never obtain in their lifetime.\"","Xia Canonical Official exclaimed with a sigh.","Mo Hua nodded in realization, unknowingly a bit longing in his heart.","\"Taoist State...\"","It is the place where the Taoist Court is entrenched, surrounded by the Nine State, the center of the Cultivation World, having thrived for over twenty thousand years, a flourishing era of prosperity.","It is also the Nine State’s place with the richest spirit stones, the deepest foundation, the most Taoist Repositories, the longest heritage, and the heaviest authority.","However, Mo Hua pondered and felt that the Taoist State should still be very far from him.","Thinking about it now is futile.","There is a more important matter at hand.","Mo Hua asked, \"Sister Xia, was Uncle Gu injured by a Golden Core Demon Cultivator during the siege of the Demon Sect? What exactly happened at that time?\"","\"That’s a matter for the Taoist Court...\" Xia Canonical Official said.","Mo Hua sighed.","This Sister Xia, why does she have the same temperament as Uncle Gu, always making excuses using the Taoist Court as a pretext?","Mo Hua said, \"Moving forward, if the Taoist Court continues to engage with these Demon Sects, what if Uncle Gu falls into their trap again? He was saved this time, but next time may not be certain.\"","\"And, even if it’s not Uncle Gu, the Taoist Court has other people. If they die at the hands of the Demon Sect, it would be a significant loss...\"","Xia Canonical Official was stumped by the question.","She hesitated for a moment, then nodded, sighing, \"You’re right...\"","Moreover, Gu Changhuai had told her that Mo Hua holds an unofficial bronze token from the Taoist Court, so strictly speaking, he’s not \"an outsider.\"","In addition, due to the previous experience at the Dragon King Temple, Xia Canonical Official still has a lot of trust in Mo Hua.","After thinking for a moment, she told Mo Hua about the general affairs of the Demon Sect:","\"This Demon Sect hides its name very deeply and never discloses it to outsiders, only knowing that they worship a ’Demonic Creature’ and venerate an idol carved from Mountain Stone.\"","\"The demonic creature feeds on flesh. These Demon Sect cultivators also have a bloodthirsty habit.\"","\"They may seem no different from ordinary cultivators on the surface, but secretly, they raise ’blood slaves’ and drink fresh blood. Every seven or fourteen days, they hold a ’Blood Banquet’ where they gather to slaughter and engage in mass bloodsucking...\"","\"If they don’t consume blood for a long time, they become furious and insane.\"","\"There are about ten Golden Core Demon Cultivators, ranging from Early Stage to Late Golden Core Stage, each cruel and sinister, with blood on their hands.\"","\"But in the Late Golden Core Stage Demon Cultivator, there seems to be only one, who is the ’Leader’ of this Demon Sect.\"","\"A month ago, the Taoist Court joined forces to eliminate an Early Stage Golden Core Demon Cultivator.\"","\"This time’s plan was to kill the second one. Although there were some setbacks and ambushes, fortunately, it went relatively smoothly. However, in the end, this Golden Core Demon Cultivator suddenly went into a fury, eyes blood-red, lost his mind, and charged at Gu Changhuai, self-destructing his Golden Core...\"","Xia Canonical Official’s expression was grave.","Mo Hua also furrowed his brows.","Worshipping a demonic creature, feeding on blood, self-destructing the Golden Core, and targeting Uncle Gu, wanting to perish together with him...","Mo Hua then asked, \"Sister Xia, is there something peculiar about those Golden Core Demon Cultivators?\"","Xia Canonical Official was puzzled, \"Peculiar?\"","Mo Hua thought for a moment and described, \"It’s like Xiao Zhenhai, they seem somewhat sinister. Gazing directly at them gives a sense of pressure on the Divine Sense, and occasionally, a formless blood aura can be seen...\"","Xia Canonical Official frowned, recalled briefly, then nodded, \"That’s right.\"","\"I see...\"","Mo Hua pondered.","He wanted to ask more questions, but suddenly, a commotion came from within the Pill Pavilion, followed by a cheerful voice, it seemed Gu Changhuai had awoken.","Xia Canonical Official suddenly felt a bit uneasy, stood up, and said, \"I’m leaving.\"","\"Sister Xia,\" Mo Hua quickly called to her, \"Uncle Gu is awake, aren’t you going to see him?\"","\"No need, it’s just Gu Changhuai, nothing worth seeing.\" Xia Canonical Official turned to leave, then turned back to Mo Hua after a few steps, \"If you need anything regarding the Taoist Court, you can ask for my help.\"","Mo Hua smiled, \"Thank you, Sister Xia.\"","Xia Canonical Official smiled gently, then left.","Mo Hua stood up and went inside.","Gu Changhuai was already awake, but still very weak, unable to speak, only casting a forlorn yet complex glance at Mo Hua through the crowd.","Mo Hua nodded, indicating he understood, no need for courtesy.","Gu Changhuai then fell back into sleep.","Elder Gu Hong finally relaxed completely, expressing gratitude to Mo Hua:","\"I don’t know how to thank you... In the future, should there be anything I can assist with, I certainly won’t refuse.\"","Mo Hua smiled, \"Uncle Gu has taken care of me greatly; this is what I should do, Elder Gu Hong, no need for formality.\"","Elder Gu Hong looked at Mo Hua, feeling more and more fond of him, thinking to himself that if an opportunity arises in the future, he must find a good match for Mo Hua."]}]);
